window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS=(window.FWN_ALCHEMY_EMPEROR_HEAD_CHAPTERS||[]).concat([{"number":2201,"title":"Chapter 2201: Accidentally Killing Won’t Be Fun!","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As for the other Tang Siyu, he was very clear that she was related to Chu Yunfan, whom he had killed before. She was Chu Yunfan’s fiancee.","Previously, he had also targeted Tang Siyu. Although he had severely injured her, he had not been able to kill her. Now was undoubtedly the best opportunity to kill her and end everything once and for all.","No matter which one of them was, there was no doubt that they had the strength and talent to threaten Jun Tianci. Any one of them was enough to make him unable to sleep and eat in peace. Now was the time to end everything.","“Hurry up and make a quick move. We don’t have that much time. Once we exceed the time limit, we’ll be trapped here forever!” Lu Yixian began to show a somewhat impatient expression.","He looked up at the sky. At this moment, the Karma Chains in the sky fell like a heavy rain. From time to time, one or two Karma Chains would fall into everyone’s bodies.","This made him anxious!","He originally didn’t want to interfere in this matter, but Chu Yunfan had attacked the Destiny Alliance many times. Obviously, his target wasn’t just Jun Tianci. To him, he was a huge threat.","“Don’t worry, it won’t take long!” Jun Tianci’s eyes were cold as he spoke. “I’ll take care of Jian Wuchen first. Help me stall Tang Siyu, and then I’ll help you take care of her!”","Jun Tianci’s train of thought was very clear. Without a doubt, he wanted to stall Tang Siyu first and then deal with Chu Yunfan, who was obviously weaker in his eyes.","“Set up the formation!”","As soon as he finished speaking, the dozen or so peak Major Arcanes all made their moves and began to set up a formation around them. Looking down from above, one could see that the formation was divided into two parts, Yin and Yang, instantly separating Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu.","Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci were on the Yang side, while Tang Siyu and Lu Yixian were on the Yin side.","Chu Yunfan could feel that after the array was set up, moving was much more difficult than before. It was as if he was in a swamp. Even breathing was much more difficult than before.","Chu Yunfan didn’t move at all. He didn’t seem to be too interested in Jun Tianci and the rest’s little tricks. He only said loudly, ‘You hold Lu Yixian back for now. I’ll help you after I kill Jun Tianci!’","“Okay.” Tang Siyu nodded.","The others had treated Chu Yunfan as a pushover, but only she knew how terrifying Chu Yunfan was after his breakthrough. He was no longer the ignorant person from a few months ago.","“Hahahaha, how arrogant!” Jun Tianci laughed coldly. His expression became extremely ferocious. He looked at Chu Yunfan and said, “This is the first time I’ve seen someone more arrogant than me! You want to kill me? Then let’s see if you have the ability!’","Jun Tianci was like a comet, he burst out with a dazzling light and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Jun Tianci’s punch was like a small sun, and it sounded like thunder.","Chu Yunfan finally made his move. With a backhand, he struck out a palm that was filled with lightning, tearing apart the light formed by the fist force, and collided with Jun Tianci in the sky.","Boom!","In an instant, the two sides collided in mid-air. It was as if it was not two people colliding in mid-air, but two incomparably huge mountains colliding in mid-air. The world rumbled, and the mana fluctuations were incomparably intense.","However, these fluctuations were all absorbed by the array formation and did not leak out.","This attack turned the world upside down. Dust billowed, and divine light surged, as vast as the ocean.","The terrifying collision caused the peak Major Arcanes who were maintaining the formation to grimace.","They could feel that they would not be able to escape death if they were hit by these fluctuations.","Their combat strength was terrifying. If it were them, they would probably die immediately.","They couldn’t block even a single attack.","“Hmm?” Seeing that Chu Yunfan seemed to be able to block his attack, Jun Tianci’s eyes flickered slightly, and a terrifying destructive power flashed through them. “l didn’t expect you to be able to block my attack. How interesting. No wonder you dared to chase after me. However, if you want to kill me with just this level, I think you’re still far from it!”","“Hahahaha, if you think that this is my full strength, then you are underestimating me. I advise you to use your full strength too. Otherwise, I’m afraid that I will accidentally kill you. That won’t be fun!” Chu Yunfan laughed and casually defended against Jun Tianci’s attack.","To him, it was nothing. He did not even move.","“What an arrogant person!” Jun Tianci’s expression became colder and colder.","At this moment, he closed his palms together and formed a shocking saber. A terrifying saber intent soared into the sky, bringing with it an overwhelming aura as it slashed down toward Chu Yunfan. It was extremely terrifying.","“Destiny Saber, Divide Destiny!’","The saber light that Jun Tianci displayed was the top martial art of the Destiny Sect, the Destiny Saber. Every saber had cut off destiny, and one’s fate was in one’s control.","Although it was called the Destiny Sect, the cultivation of the Destiny Sect was to break through Heaven’s control and take control of one’s fate.","“Interesting!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Of course, he was very familiar with the Destiny Blade. In fact, Jun Tianci had used it more than ten years ago.","However, the current Jun Tianci was more than ten times stronger than before.","His cultivation was unfathomable, and he was completely different from before.","The power displayed by the Destiny’s Saber was incomparable. Unfortunately, he met Chu Yunfan, whose growth speed was faster than he had imagined.","Jun Tianci was no longer the same person as he was ten years ago, and Chu Yunfan was no longer the same person as he was ten years ago, the junior who couldn’t perish together with Jun Tianci.","As the saber light fell, Jun Tianci was like a god in the sky. He was awe-inspiring and unstoppable. Even the experts who had set up the formation were dazzled.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally moved. His big hand grabbed at the void and caught a bolt of lightning.","This bolt of lightning power transformed into a treasure sword. The sword emitted a dazzling light that flickered with astonishing lightning.","Boom!","The sword light was nurtured to the extreme in an instant. Then, the sword fell down and landed on the saber light.","Boom!","The two rays of light collided, and like the light of creation, they instantly exploded.."]},{"number":2202,"title":"Chapter 2202: There’s Not Much Time Left, Pll Send You on Your Way","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The battle formation fluctuated violently. Two top-notch Supreme Youths were fighting. It was like an eagle soaring through the sky, and its speed was extremely fast. It was shocking!","Boom!","Boom!","Boom!","In the sky, the two sides exchanged hundreds of moves in a short time. It was difficult to determine who was stronger. The fierce attacks made the native experts who were watching the array tremble.","“Jun Tianci, aren’t you known as the number one prodigy? Is that all you got?!” Chu Yunfan said loudly.","“Humph!” Jun Tianci’s gaze grew sharper. He had never expected Chu Yunfan to possess such astonishing strength. It was clearly far beyond his expectations. He could actually fight evenly with him.","In Jun Tianci’s hand, a faint purple light was gradually emitted. It was hazy and the entire sky was dyed blurry.","His movements were extremely fast. In an instant, he rushed toward Chu Yunfan. His arm slashed down like a long knife. The purple light was so sharp that it could not be blocked. It tore the entire sky apart.","Its power was ten times more terrifying than what Jun Tianci had just displayed.","People seemed to hear the terrifying sound of the entire world being split into two halves.","Chu Yunfan was fearless. He clenched his five fingers into a fist, and golden light burst out from the gaps between his fingers. It illuminated his entire body like a golden god, and all kinds of terrifying astral winds surged.","Boom!","The golden light and the purple mist collided, creating a light that was even more terrifying than before. It turned into a sky full of multicolored light.","Everyone who was setting up the array was dazzled and extremely shocked. These two people were undoubtedly worthy of being the Supreme Youths.","On the other side of the array, Tang Siyu and Lu Yixian were confronting each other.","“There’s not much time left. I’ll send you on your way!” Lu Yixian looked coldly at Tang Siyu. “I’ve met the Elder Princess once before. We’ve fought on this battlefield. 1 didn’t want to lay hands on her successor, but since you don’t know what’s good for you, I’ll kill you!’","When Lu Yixian mentioned the Elder Princess, he felt a little fearful. It was easy to imagine how deep the impression the Elder Princess had left on him. The Elder Princess had grown up in a short time, leaping to become one of the top Supreme Youth figures on the Prodigy Battlefield.","Even now, Lu Yixian couldn’t forget the pressure that the Elder Princess had given him back then. However, after all these years, he had sealed himself up until now, and the Elder Princess had never stopped cultivating in the outside world. It was completely imaginable how amazing the woman who had never stopped cultivating was now.","If it wasn’t necessary, he didn’t want to completely fall out with the Elder Princess. After all, things were different now. Back then, his cultivation level was about the same as the Elder Princess. Although there was pressure, he wasn’t afraid of the Elder Princess.","However, he now understood that without the protection of the Destiny Sect, he might not even be able to withstand a single finger from the Elder Princess.","This was one of the costs of self-sealing till this era. Back then, everyone who was similar to him or even inferior to him was far above him.","However, the good thing was that every time he woke up from his self-sealing, he could see the news of the death of the once brilliant figures.","And now, even the Elder Princess’ disciples had grown to a level comparable to the Elder Princess.","Time truly flew!","“You want to kill me? I don’t think you can do it,” Tang Siyu said, “l heard my master mention you before. You were one of her enemies back then. Now it’s my turn!”","“You have a sharp tongue!” Lu Yixian said coldly. His eyes were cold as his feet stomped on the air. Suddenly, the entire battle formation shook violently. From under his feet, endless symbols spread out. They were his understanding of the Great Dao, all condensed into symbols.","These symbols were on the verge of shattering. It was extremely terrifying.","Lu Yixian was getting impatient. In that short time, a few more Karma Chains had entered his body. He could already feel that the karma between him and this world was getting deeper and deeper. If this continued, he might not be able to leave this world.","Boom!","Lu Yixian soared into the sky and rushed over like a great roc spreading its wings.","Meanwhile, Tang Siyu’s expression was ice-cold. She grabbed at the air with her palm and a treasure sword appeared in her hand. In an instant, sword lights filled the sky. These sword lights turned into a sword curtain that filled the sky, enveloping the sky and stabbing at Lu Yixian.","But in the next moment, Lu Yixian tore apart the sword curtain that filled the sky with both hands, and a fierce confrontation erupted in an instant.","The two of them were like two huge stars colliding. It was extremely terrifying.","“These two people over here are also very terrifying. Is this what a battle between Supreme Youths is like?” At this moment, the native experts who were watching from afar paled. The battle between the four of them had clearly exceeded their imaginations.","They were invincible existences within the same level. Although their cultivation levels were similar to these Supreme Youths, if they really fought, they would probably be seriously injured by a slap or even killed.","The gap between them was so great that it couldn’t be made up for by numbers. No wonder even Supreme Youths like Jun Tianci and Lu Yixian had to personally fight against such strong enemies.","At this moment, the array was operating faster and faster. Tang Siyu could feel that moving was becoming more and more difficult. The lethality of this array was secondary. Its main function was to trap people.","Originally, with her strength, she could compete with Lu Yixian, but now, she could feel that every time she attacked, she would consume twice as much divine power as before. As time passed, the divine power consumed would only increase.","In that case, she would be exhausted to death.","Now, all their hopes could only be placed on Chu Yunfan!","While Tang Siyu was gradually getting into trouble, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci entered a white-hot stage.","A treasure saber appeared in Jun Tianci’s hand. It was no longer condensed from mana and was naturally more powerful than before.","He slashed out with his saber, and an overwhelming saber light spread out. In the sky, it formed a terrifying phantom. This slash split Yin and Yang, shattering the world and destiny.","Every slash turned into countless symbols, and the symbols turned into a shocking saber light that slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","Under this attack, it was as if all paths of retreat were instantly submerged, leaving Chu Yunfan with no way to escape or retreat.."]},{"number":2203,"title":"Chapter 2203: Disaster Star Eyes","paragraphs":["U?dɑted by B?XN?VEL.cοm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan let out a loud roar, but he didn’t move. When the saber fell, the sky was about to shatter. It began to fluctuate violently as if it was about to cut through the void.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He looked indifferent as if he was facing a breeze.","In the next moment, every pore on Chu Yunfan’s body was spewing out shocking sword light. The sword light gathered above his head and turned into a terrifying sword light. The sword light swept through the sky and rushed into the sky. In an instant, it shattered the sky.","He faced the shocking saber light head-on.","Boom!","The saber light and sword light collided, and the dissipating fluctuations shook the entire sky.","“What move is this? Why does this sword light look so familiar?” Jun Tianci’s eyes flashed with horror. At this moment, he finally remembered that this sword light seemed familiar.","This Chu Yunfan must be someone he had met before and not someone he had never met before as he had imagined.","However, at this moment, he had no time to carefully think about where he had seen this shocking sword light before.","Because of the collision between the two sides, the entire array shook violently. Terrifying waves directly entered the array, causing the faces of many top-notch experts who set up the array to turn red, and they spat out a mouthful of blood.","These experts all sucked in a breath of cold air. The collision between the two sides was too shocking. To be precise, Chu Yunfan was too terrifying.","His sword shattered the saber light that Jun Tianci had slashed out. It even pierced through the terrifying phantom behind Jun Tianci, shattering it into a rain of light that scattered in all directions.","“There’s not much time left. I won’t play with you anymore. It’s better to kill you!” Chu Yunfan thundered.","Even he could feel that the closing time of the Prodigy Battlefield was getting closer and closer. There wasn’t much time left for him. He had other things to do and couldn’t continue to stay here and tangle with Jun Tianci.","Swoosh!","Chu Yunfan’s figure disappeared. He used the Prismatic Traveller and arrived in front of Jun Tianci in an instant.","He clenched his fist and punched out. The terrifying fist force was like a shocking rainbow that seemed to penetrate the entire sky and array.","Behind Chu Yunfan, eight deities appeared and surrounded him. Terrifying golden light filled the sky and earth, making him look like a legendary god. These eight deities were his support.","“You’re Chu Yunfan!” Jun Tianci reacted in an instant. At this point, he finally understood why he felt a sense of familiarity. Wasn’t it because he had fought with Chu Yunfan before?","It was because of this that he felt a sense of familiarity when Chu Yunfan attacked.","At this moment, he understood why Jian Wuchen had appeared out of nowhere. Previously, no one had been able to find out anything about him, and he was not a peerless genius of any era.","That was because he was a prodigy of the current generation and not an ancient prodigy as many people had guessed.","Since Jian Wuchen had been targeting him and the Destiny Sect ever since he started cultivating, there was a reasonable explanation.","Because this was none other than Chu Yunfan, who had a deep hatred for him.","“Impossible!”","Jun Tianci still couldn’t believe it, because he clearly remembered that he had extracted all the blood essence from Chu Yunfan’s heart. No one could survive after all their blood essence was extracted.","That did not exist!","However, Chu Yunfan did it. One could imagine how great the impact was on him.","What was even more unbelievable was how Chu Yunfan had done it. He had entered the Prodigy Battlefield so many years later than him, but he had been able to catch up with him and be on equal footing with him.","At this moment, he finally remembered what he had said before. He had thought that those people were ignorant and that Chu Yunfan could compete with him in the future.","But now, it seemed that Chu Yunfan could not only compete with him, but it was also difficult to determine who was better. In fact, the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed far exceeded many people’s previous estimates.","Everything was now clear. There was a complete answer to everything.","The person in front of him was his mortal enemy, Chu Yunfan!","Jun Tianci, who had originally looked down on Chu Yunfan, could only admit that he was indeed his mortal enemy.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch hit Jun Tianci, but Jun Tianci didn’t take half a step back. On the contrary, his clothes fluttered in the wind as if a terrifying wave of air was released from his body.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you’re the only special one?” Jun Tianci roared. His eyes opened abruptly, and his aura suddenly became much stronger.","His eyes had changed. They were no longer the eyes of an ordinary person. On the contrary, they looked like stars. However, these stars did not bring auspicious signs, but stars that brought terrifying disasters.","“The Disaster Star Eyes! You actually awakened this bloodline!” Chu Yunfan finally understood what Jun Tianci’s special constitution was.","He had once seen these special eyes in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. It was called The Disaster Star Eyes. It once belonged to a supreme sovereign. The Disaster Sovereign possessed a special physique that evolved a supreme divine power.","This divine power condensed countless calamities. Just looking at someone would cause disasters to happen.","It was Disaster Star Eyes that blocked Chu Yunfan’s punch at the critical moment!","“Not bad. I didn’t expect you to recognize this divine ability. I’ve never used this move in front of anyone. You should consider yourself lucky to be able to die under this move!” Jun Tianci sneered.","“You stole my heart blood back then to activate the Disaster Star Eyes, didn’t you?” Chu Yunfan said, “Other than my heart blood, there were others who were also stolen by you. It’s just that you relied on the powerful Destiny Sect, so the others didn’t dare to say anything!’","“That’s right, hahahahaha. Back then, I was only one step away from awakening the Disaster Star Eyes. This last step was your painstaking effort, and I have to thank you for the quality of your effort. Otherwise, 1 wouldn’t have been able to awaken the Disaster Star Eyes!” Jun Tianci burst into laughter and revealed the real reason why he had targeted Chu Yunfan.","It wasn’t because Maiden Donghua was humiliated by Chu Yunfan as outsiders thought.."]},{"number":2204,"title":"Chapter 2204: And How Long Can You Live?","paragraphs":["U?dɑted by B?XN?VEL.cοm","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He knew that it was definitely not because of Maiden Donghua. With Jun Tianci’s cold and heartless performance, it was impossible for him to rashly attack Chu Yunfan because of Maiden Donghua.","Moreover, he had deliberately taken away Chu Yunfan’s most precious heart blood. There must be another purpose.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t know what his goal was before, but now, it was very clear. It wasn’t because of anything else, but because he wanted to awaken the Disaster Star Eyes.","To awaken the Disaster Star Eyes, not only did one need to have the same physique as the Disaster Emperor, but they also needed a certain amount of blood and sweat to awaken.","The best effect was naturally to use the blood and sweat of an emperor physique possessor to promote the awakening, and the lowest were king physique possessors to have a certain chance of awakening.","All throughout the Prodigy Battlefield, king physique possessors were everywhere. Even peak emperor physiques were quite common. Even Supreme Youths weren’t rare.","But in the outside world, any king physique possessor was the hope of the sect’s revival. It could be said that they were all heavily protected.","Just like Hua Xianyuan, who was about the same age as Chu Yunfan, he was valued by the Flying Celestials because of his king physique.","The Prodigy Battlefield was an exception. Only by gathering the top prodigies in countless years could there be so many prodigies.","Under normal circumstances, even for a behemoth like the Flying Celestials, it would be good if they had two or three king physique possessors in a generation.","It was not easy for Jun Tianci to gather enough emperor bloodlines. After hearing about him, he guessed that Chu Yunfan was not a king but an emperor.","That was why he had specially appeared to kill Chu Yunfan.","Everything had been perfect. Even if Chu Yunfan was killed, no one would know that he was the one who did it.","However, no one expected that Chu Yunfan would not die. Instead, he spread the news about him, causing the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect to become enemies all these years.","During this process, the losses of the Destiny Sect were simply immeasurable.","If it wasn’t for the fact that there were higher-ups in the Destiny Sect who thought highly of his future and believed that he would lead the Destiny Sect to further progress and achieve extreme glory in the future, even he would have been implicated.","However, Jun Tianci didn’t expect the quality of Chu Yunfan’s heart blood to be so high. It far exceeded the heart blood of the emperor physiques he had obtained before. He thought he would have to kill a few more emperor physiques, but he didn’t expect to succeed in one try.","It could be said that Chu Yunfan had contributed a lot to his eyes.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re the first one to force me to use this move. But I might as well. I thought it was a pity that you died before because if I had your heart blood, my Disaster Star Eyes would have improved. Now that you’re not dead, it’s great. Make another contribution for me, hahahaha!” Jun Tianci smiled coldly.","The native experts who had set up the array were confused. They did not understand what was going on.","Jian Wuchen was not Jian Wuchen, but Chu Yunfan?","In other words, he used a fake identity to deceive everyone?","“This Disaster Star Eyes is too terrifying. I feel like my entire body is","trembling when he looks at me!”","“No wonder Jun Tianci dares to say that he’s ancient or not. With his strength, he can indeed be said to be ancient or not. Among those Supreme Youths, there aren’t many who compare to him!”","“Even I’ve only read about the Disaster Star Eyes in a remnant ancient book. It’s rumored that it’s a special ability of the Disaster Emperor that brings endless disasters to the world. Ever since the fall of the Disaster Emperor, no one has been able to condense the Disaster Star Eyes!’","“Jun Tianci is indeed impressive. No wonder he dared to establish the Monarch Alliance independently of our Destiny Alliance! ”","“The Disaster Star Eyes is the symbol of disaster. It’s rumored that it has the ability to shake the heavens and earth. It can casually bring about a terrifying power of disaster. No one on the same level can withstand it!”","The native experts of the battlefield who had set up the array communicated with each other through their divine wills. They were all shocked by Jun Tianci’s trump card.","After Jun Tianci opened his Disaster Star Eyes, the mana in his body burst out. This was his true trump card, which allowed him to face all powerful enemies.","There was no one on the battlefield that he could not deal with.","The divine power on his body was dense. He was not like a human. He was a legendary god. With every step he took, the disaster energy in the world became denser.","The disaster energy spread out, and even Tang Siyu and Lu Yixian, who were fighting in the array beside them, could feel it.","Especially Lu Yixian, his pupils constricted and his expression changed slightly.","Although he had chosen to help Jun Tianci this time, in his heart, Jun Tianci was his destined opponent. The two of them had been competitors for countless years, and they represented different eras of the Destiny Sect.","Even he didn’t expect Jun Tianci to be able to perform such an amazing divine power. He secretly remembered this.","He then turned to look at Tang Siyu, who had a calm expression on her face. A cold smile appeared on his face. “Why? Aren’t you worried about him?”","“Do you think Jun Tianci can turn the tables?” Tang Siyu smiled faintly. “No, he doesn’t have a chance. I’m just wondering how long Jun Tianci can last, and how long you can live!”","Tang Siyu had great confidence in Chu Yunfan. She had felt Chu Yunfan’s aura when he used all his strength, and it was far more than what he had now.","“It’s useless to be stubborn at this time!” Lu Yixian said coldly.","In the blink of an eye, the battle between the two of them erupted again.","On the other side, after Jun Tianci used his Disaster Star Eyes, the entire array was filled with disaster energy, controlled by his Disaster Star Eyes.","At this moment, he was the only king in the world—the only god in the universe.","Boom!","In the next moment, Jun Tianci moved. His eyes turned rapidly. In an instant, the color of the world changed, and countless disasters swept out. Volcano eruptions, tsunamis, earthquakes, comets, and floods drowned everything.","The endless disaster energy turned into a terrifying disaster. These disasters were like a tidal wave that swept toward Chu Yunfan.","This was the most terrifying ability of the Disaster Emperor, turning everything into a disaster.","Disasters were happening all over the world at all times. There was no place in the world that was not hit.."]},{"number":2205,"title":"Chapter 2205: Heavily Injuring Him and Snatching His Eyes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2205: Heavily Injuring Him and Snatching His Eyes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the world, the endless disaster energy turned into an endless power of disaster and swept toward Chu Yunfan.","Using natural disasters as a means of attack, this was rising to the level of laws.","Of course, this was not a level that the current Supreme Youths and prodigies could come into contact with. It was impossible for them to come into contact with the level of laws.","However, Jun Tianci was able to use the power of the Disaster Star Eyes to achieve this ability.","“This Disaster Star Eyes is indeed an incredible ability, but it’s too wasteful on you!” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan moved. His hands burst out with light that filled the sky, and he tore the endless power of disaster into pieces.","“You’re going to resist my disaster energy with just your hands?!” Jun Tianci roared.","The disaster energy that had been torn apart was instantly reassembled.","Disaster energy itself was formless. It was just refined by his Disaster Star Eyes.","An even more terrifying power of disaster instantly drowned Chu Yunfan.","“What a pity. The Disaster Star Eyes are wasted on you!” Chu Yunfan said as he resisted the disaster energy.","“Deva, Ryu, Asura, Gandharva, Garuda, Jinnara, Mahoraga!” Chu Yunfan let out a loud and clear voice.","Around him, the legendary eight deities appeared and surrounded him.","At this moment, he transformed into an ancient god, and endless power gathered in his punch.","Before Chu Yunfan could make a move, the terrifying fist force had already swept out. With a terrifying power, it instantly tore apart the disaster energy that was spreading out from Jun Tianci’s body.","“How is this possible? The power of this fist technique is too shocking!’","Jun Tianci was forced to take a few steps back by this terrifying fist force. He could feel the power contained in this astonishing fist force.","It wasn’t that he didn’t know about Chu Yunfan’s Eight Astonishing Punches. He had even fought with him before. Although he had been a little surprised at that time, it was just a little surprise.","At that time, Chu Yunfan was too weak for him. Even if he used the Eight Astonishing Punches, it would be difficult to cause any fundamental threat to him, so he naturally did not think much of it.","But now, Chu Yunfan’s strength had undergone an earth-shattering change. His cultivation level was higher than before, and his combat strength far exceeded his current level.","Of course, Jun Tianci naturally felt that he could not breathe. He even felt that almost every pore of his was blocked by a terrifying force. He could not even sense the energy of Heaven and Earth.","He knew that Chu Yunfan was accumulating his fist intent. He immediately reacted. ‘l can’t let him continue. Otherwise, 1 won’t be able to survive!’","Thinking of this, he opened his eyes. A destructive power burst out from his eyes. This terrifying destructive power swept toward Chu Yunfan, trying to break through the fist force that Chu Yunfan was accumulating.","But in the next moment, Chu Yunfan moved. His fist intent had already condensed to the extreme. He punched out, and a huge hole was blasted out in the sky. Then, suddenly, his fist shattered the disaster energy that Jun Tianci had unleashed.","“Impossible!” Jun Tianci bellowed.","He was helpless against Chu Yunfan’s punch and was forced to retreat.","It had to be known that with his strength, he could contend with the top Supreme Youths. If he added the Disaster Star Eyes, he would be even more powerful. He was confident that he could even defeat a Supreme Youth of the same level.","But now, he realized that he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan after using the Disaster Star Eyes. His disaster energy was terrifying, but Chu Yunfan’s cultivation technique and divine power had clearly surpassed his disaster energy.","“What a terrifying confrontation!","“Am I seeing things? Jun Tianci isn’t his match!”","“Who is this Jian Wuchen? Why is he so terrifying?”","“Not good, they’re about to collide. Let’s hurry up and strengthen the array.","Otherwise, it will be shattered by the power overflowing from both sides!”","At this moment, even those native experts from the Destiny Alliance who had absolute confidence in Jun Tianci had their confidence shaken.","Even they could see that Jun Tianci was on the verge of defeat. However, they couldn’t help him even if they wanted to because the level of the collision between the two sides was not something they could interfere with.","Boom!","It was another terrifying collision. Everyone saw Chu Yunfan’s punch cut through the sky like a rainbow. In an instant, it shattered everything and tore apart the power of disaster released by Jun Tianci.","The punch landed on Jun Tianci’s chest, causing it to cave in and become deformed.","Spurt!","Jun Tianci coughed up a mouthful of blood. His entire body flew out in an instant and crashed into the array wall. The array wall kept shaking and was almost shattered.","One could imagine how powerful Jun Tianci’s impact was.","Jun Tianci almost collapsed from this attack.","The native experts outside the array were extremely anxious, but they couldn’t go save him because they couldn’t do it. If they released the array, Chu Yunfan might escape, and then their efforts today would be in vain.","At this point, even if they were unwilling to admit it, they had to admit that with the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, their previous ambush plan was undoubtedly extremely stupid.","What right did they have to deal with such a top-notch expert?","However, they were extremely shocked and incredulous.","“With Jun Tianci’s strength and the power of his Disaster Star Eyes, he should be able to take a few moves even if it was against an expert above the Arcana Stage. How could he be so weak?” someone said in disbelief.","However, before they could think further, Chu Yunfan had already moved. He activated the Prismatic Traveller and instantly arrived before Jun Tianci. He struck out like lightning and in an instant, he pulled out Jun Tianci’s eyes.","There were only two bloody holes left in Jun Tianci’s eyes.","“These Disaster Star Eyes were activated with my blood essence, so it’s time to return them to their original owner!” Chu Yunfan felt that the eyeball on his palm was connected to him by blood.."]},{"number":2206,"title":"Chapter 2206: Jun Tianci Dies","paragraphs":["Chapter 2206: Jun Tianci Dies","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Disaster Star Eyes had been activated and awakened with the blood essence of many emperor physiques and Chu Yunfan’s blood essence.","However, no matter how many emperor physiques there were, they couldn’t compare to Chu Yunfan’s physique in terms of quality. Naturally, Chu Yunfan’s bloodline was the main source.","As soon as he got the eyes, Chu Yunfan could feel that they were connected by blood.","When he thought about how he had almost been killed because of this pair of eyes, the killing intent in his heart grew stronger.","People like Jun Tianci were cold and emotionless. They only cared about cultivation. Everything else, in his eyes, could be sacrificed. Even other competitors, in Jun Tianci’s eyes, were just resources.","This was because the Disaster Star Eyes not only required a large amount of heart blood from special physiques to awaken, but it also required a large amount of heart blood from special physiques to advance in the future.","Therefore, in Jun Tianci’s eyes, all his competitors were his resources. During this period, to cultivate this pair of Disaster Star Eyes, he had slaughtered countless prodigies.","Compared to Chu Yunfan, he was even more cold and heartless. Although Chu Yunfan was heartless, he only targeted his enemies. He had a lower limit in his actions and carried righteousness in his heart.","However, Jun Tianci was different. The laws of the world were meaningless to him. In a sense, he was the innate demon god in many myths and legends.","He was inhumane, so of course, he did not have human emotions.","Jun Tianci’s fiancee was beaten up by Chu Yunfan, and Jun Tianci didn’t even move a muscle for her. If it wasn’t for the heart blood in Chu Yunfan’s body, he probably wouldn’t have cared about this.","He was too arrogant. Or rather, with his strength, he was indeed qualified.","However, what he did not expect was that even though he was very special, Chu Yunfan was a hundred times more special than him. He was talented, but Chu Yunfan was a hundred times more talented than him.","“You took my eyes!” Jun Tianci stared at Chu Yunfan with his empty eye sockets.","Although he had lost his eyes, he still had his divine will, so it did not affect his vision. In a sense, this was a kind of divine art.","It was just a pair of eyes. It was nothing. He could completely use his divine power to create another pair. This was nothing to him.","However, these weren’t ordinary eyes, but the Disaster Star Eyes. After being taken away once, it would be hundreds of times more difficult to awaken a second time.","“This can be considered as returning it to its original owner. It was originally fed with my heart blood!” Chu Yunfan said, “When you attacked me, you probably didn’t expect that you would have this day, right?”","Jun Tianci’s face was twisted and ugly. He finally revealed the expression of a","human. He was no longer like an innate demon god who was born to pursue the Dao and didn’t care about the people in the secular world.","“Even if you take it away, it’s useless. Those eyes can’t be used unless it’s with my physique. It will only become a burden for you. You will suffer the backlash of the disaster energy!” Jun Tianci roared, his entire body was trembling.","“Is that so?” Chu Yunfan grinned. Endless divine power gathered on his palm. In the time it took to speak, the eyes on his palm turned into a rain of light that filled the sky and then poured into Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","When Chu Yunfan opened his eyes again, his pupils had turned into stars. They were the pupils of the Disaster Star Eyes.","“How is this possible? How did you do it?” Jun Tianci couldn’t believe it. He had “seen” the scene through his divine will and was scared to death.","He was so certain that Chu Yunfan would not be able to use his eyes after taking them away and instead would only become a burden to him.","He might even be counterattacked by the disaster energy.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to refine the Disaster Star Eyes so easily? Moreover, the fusion was very good, and there was no burden at all.","Chu Yunfan simply grinned. Jun Tianci was making a fuss over nothing. It was just a pair of special eyes, and he was carrying three different physiques at the same time. They were compatible with each other and didn’t affect him at all.","Instead, they complemented each other.","There was no problem between the three emperor physiques, let alone a pair of Disaster Star Eyes.","Moreover, the Disaster Star Eyes was fed with his heart blood, so it was naturally connected to his bloodline, making it even easier to fuse.","“You... You’re not a good person. You’re a monster...” Jun Tianci’s entire body was trembling. At this point, he finally realized what kind of person he was facing.","Chu Yunfan was not like what he had initially thought, an insignificant person.","Since ancient times, it was not uncommon for such a counterattack to fail. However, he had never thought that one day, he would become the protagonist of it.","“A monster? You’re talking about yourself, aren’t you? People like you don’t have any human emotions. You’re the true monster here!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","As his eyes opened and closed, a terrifying disaster energy spread around him.","He wasn’t in a hurry to make a move. Instead, he was refining the Disaster","Star Eyes. The Disaster Star Eyes was a special ability that evolved from the Disaster Emperor’s special physique. It was impossible to understand it unless one had a special physique, let alone refine it.","However, Chu Yunfan had the help of the godhead. The moment he fused with the Disaster Star Eyes, he had been constantly deducing the mysteries within.","The endless mysteries of the Disaster Star Eyes surged into Chu Yunfan’s mind at an astonishing speed. His understanding of the Disaster Star Eyes increased at an astonishing speed. In fact, in just a moment, he had already surpassed Jun Tianci, the original owner.","He even faintly touched the shadow of the disaster laws. Although it was only a trace, Chu Yunfan still felt the information was extremely difficult to understand. Even with the help of the godhead, it was still too difficult for the current Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan stopped. Although he had only touched the shadow of the disaster laws, that was enough.","In the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. His pupils spun rapidly and turned into terrifying stars. In an instant, they turned into a boundless disaster that swept toward Jun Tianci.","It was like a replica of Jun Tianci’s attack on Chu Yunfan.","However, Jun Tianci wasn’t as strong as Chu Yunfan, and he couldn’t fight back.","Instantly, Jun Tianci was torn into pieces by this terrifying disaster energy.","Before he died, he was still in disbelief. Chu Yunfan’s disaster energy was","actually more profound than his?","How was this possible?"]},{"number":2207,"title":"Chapter 2207: You’re the One Who Needs to Fight to Stay Alive","paragraphs":["Chapter 2207: You’re the One Who Needs to Fight to Stay Alive","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan had just started, but his Disaster Star Eyes had already far surpassed Jun Tianci’s. This was what made Jun Tianci die with regrets.","It was clearly his trump card, but now it had become one of Chu Yunfan’s abilities!","‘He’s a monster!’ This thought popped up in Jun Tianci’s mind!","Chu Yunfan’s expression was calm. To him, this was normal. He had three completely different emperor physiques. How could he have cultivated until now without some skill?","Not to mention the help of the godhead. In a short time, Chu Yunfan had dug out even more of the Disaster Star Eyes’ inner secrets.","After being torn apart by the Disaster Star Eyes, Jun Tianci’s corpse turned into rays of light that filled the sky and surged into Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","Chu Yunfan could feel that his eyes had improved, and their power was even stronger.","At this moment, when the native experts outside the array saw this scene, they were scared to death. Some of them wanted to escape and abandon the array.","The current Chu Yunfan was too terrifying for them. He was simply like a legendary demon god.","On the other side, the battle between Tang Siyu and Lu Yixian had also entered a white-hot stage.","Lu Yixian had already noticed that Jun Tianci was beaten up by Chu Yunfan. He wanted to go to support him but was stopped by Tang Siyu.","If he thought he was the one who had stopped Tang Siyu from helping Jun Tianci, then the tables had turned. Tang Siyu had stopped him from helping","Jun Tianci.","As time passed, he felt a chill in his heart.","With his many years of experience as a Supreme Youth, he did not have much of an advantage when facing Tang Siyu, this new Supreme Youth.","Both of them were peak Major Arcanes, and they were both emperors. It could be said that they were on the same level in all aspects. His cultivation was indeed stronger than Tang Siyu’s.","However, he was only slightly stronger. He had the upper hand in the battle with Tang Siyu, but he could not turn this advantage into an opportunity for victory.","If the two sides continued to fight, they would only be able to maintain a level of undefeatable.","He even felt that Tang Siyu was improving while fighting. At the same time, she was learning his combat style during the battle. She was growing at an astonishing speed.","If it was just Tang Siyu, he would have been able to escape. But now, with Chu Yunfan, things were completely different.","When he saw how Chu Yunfan killed Jun Tianci, his face changed as if he had seen a monster.","“We have to retreat!” Lu Yixian already had the intention to retreat. “When I get out, I must get the sect to kill these two people at all costs. Otherwise, they will definitely become a huge threat to the Destiny Sect. We must delay them!”","At this moment, Lu Yixian made up his mind to let these native experts stall for him. Although they were the foundation that the Destiny Sect had accumulated over countless years, it could be said that it was not easy.","Once all of them died, the strength of the Destiny Sect in the Prodigy Battlefield would completely disappear. It would take countless years to rebuild it.","However, he had no other choice. Moreover, he believed that the higher-ups of the Destiny Sect would not object to using the lives of these natives in exchange for the life of a Supreme Youth like him.","These native experts should have the determination to die for him at any time.","However, before he could give the order to have these people die for him and bring up the rear for him, on the other side of the array, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes and transformed them into the Disaster Star Eyes. The terrifying disaster energy instantly tore the array.","The array that was originally separated into two parts was torn apart at this time.","Chu Yunfan’s figure flashed, and in an instant, he had already rushed into the battlefield between Lu Yixian and Tang Siyu.","“Chu Yunfan, you dare to kill me?! I’m a Supreme Youth of the Destiny Sect, and you will be finished! There’s no place for you to live!” Lu Yi Xian’s eyes were wide with anger. At this point, he already knew who the person he was","chasing was.","This was the first time he had heard of Chu Yunfan’s name, but it didn’t stop him from knowing some basic information.","This was a disciple from the Flying Celestials.","In the past, he only cared about Huangfu Longhao of the Flying Celestials. He did not care about the other prodigies or top-notch prodigies.","Now, there was another name in his heart.","The moment Chu Yunfan barged in, Lu Yixian blasted a huge golden palm print at Chu Yunfan, trying to kill him in one fell swoop while Chu Yunfan had just entered and was still unsteady on his feet.","“Nowhere for me to live? You’re the one who needs to fight to stay alive!” Chu Yunfan sneered and clenched his fist.","He threw a punch and instantly, eight deities appeared. The eight deities condensed into a shadow and slammed into the huge palm print.","Boom!","The huge golden handprint was shaken into nothingness.","“Jun Tianci is already dead. Now, it’s your turn. Jun Tianci tried to kill me, and your Destiny Sect protected him. Now, it’s time for you to pay the price!” Chu Yunfan opened his Disaster Star Eyes.","Endless disasters swept out like a gale.","Volcanic eruptions, tsunamis, earthquakes, comets, and comets crashed into the earth. All kinds of natural disasters were integrated into it and enveloped Lu Yixian, wanting to tear him apart.","“You want to kill me? Impossible!” Lu Yixian had already gone mad. A shocking saber light appeared around him. The saber light flashed past. In an instant, everyone did not have time to see what was happening.","However, the saber light cut through Chu Yunfan’s disaster energy and turned into a rain of light that dissipated between heaven and earth.","A moment later, the rain of light dissipated. At this moment, everyone finally saw what that shocking saber light was. It was a saber light that looked like a crescent moon. The saber light kept flashing in the void, swallowing and spitting.","Endless saber light spread out like mist and transformed into all kinds of symbols. This was condensing his saber intent into symbols.."]},{"number":2208,"title":"Chapter 2208: Who’s the One Who’s Panicking Now?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2208: Who’s the One Who’s Panicking Now?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was Lu Yixian condensing his saber intent into symbols, doubling the power of his saber light out of nowhere.","It was this crescent moon-like saber that tore apart Chu Yunfan’s disaster energy.","“Chu Yunfan, do you think you can kill me just because you killed Jun Tianci?” Lu Yixian thundered, “I’m different from him. He’s just a Supreme Youth who has just stepped into the peak Major Arcana Stage recently. As for me, I’ve already been a peak Major Arcane Supreme Youth a thousand years ago, and I’ve dominated the Prodigy Battlefield!”","Lu Yixian’s expression carried a bit of arrogance. In essence, he and Jun Tianci were different. Although the status of the two sides was similar, the difference in their foundations was too great.","Jun Tianci had just stepped into this level, but he had been at this level for a long time. Although he had been in a state of self-sealing most of the time, in terms of foundation, he was not an existence that Jun Tianci could compare to.","“You want to kill me? You can’t do it!” Lu Yixian said loudly, but his eyes were filled with extreme fear.","“You’re just an arrow at the end of its flight. You’re just bluffing!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Of course, Chu Yunfan could tell that Lu Yixian was just bluffing and trying to scare him off. This level alone was not enough to scare him off.","If his original target was Jun Tianci, then now that they knew his identity, he couldn’t let them go.","Chu Yunfan had used Jian Wuchen’s identity and had done many earth- shattering things without any scruples. He knew that this identity would no longer be used in the future. No matter how they searched for it, it would be useless.","However, if he was exposed, the consequences would be unimaginable.","“Yunfan, there’s not much time left. We have to end this quickly!” Tang Siyu said.","As she spoke, another Karma Chain fell on her body. Even in the battle array, there was no way to isolate these Karma Chains.","In such a long time, more and more Karma Chains had gathered in her body. As more and more Karma Chains gathered, they became stronger and stronger.","She wasn’t Chu Yunfan, who could tear the Karma Chains apart at the first","possible moment. After a long time, even she wouldn’t be able to leave the Prodigy Battlefield.","“Okay.” Chu Yunfan nodded.","Suddenly, just as the two of them were talking, Lu Yixian made his move. A shocking saber light swept across the sky and appeared above Chu Yunfan’s head out of thin air. The saber light was condensed from countless saber light symbols. This saber cut down and cut the sky in half.","“Be careful!” Tang Siyu quickly called out.","Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He just looked at Lu Yixian with a cold smile and then slapped out, actually using his palm to receive this shocking knife.","“You dare to use your hands to catch it? You’re courting death!”","When Lu Yixian saw that Chu Yunfan dared to catch it with his hand, he was furious at first, but then he was overjoyed. He could almost foresee that Chu Yunfan’s entire arm would be cut off.","In an instant, he could severely injure this peerless enemy that he was extremely afraid of.","He increased the output of his divine power, making this saber light even more suffocating, carrying an aura of destruction.","One slash to cut the heavens!","Even the heavens would be cut off. There was nothing in the world that could not be cut off.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan grabbed onto the saber light. The saber light kept flickering with a shocking light. Every time it flashed, it would slice apart. Every time it slashed, a peak Major Arcane Supreme Youth would be severely injured, or even killed.","However, when the sword landed on Chu Yunfan’s palm, it only produced a metallic sound. It was unable to cut through Chu Yunfan’s palm.","“It can’t move?!” Lu Yixian roared, ” 1 don’t believe it! Sever Heaven, sever Earth, sever destiny!’","In an instant, Lu Yixian poured all his divine power into it. In an instant, the saber light was rampant, and the saber light doubled, with a terrifying power that wanted to cut Chu Yunfan apart.","Chu Yunfan was still expressionless. He kept pulling back his palm. The terrifying saber light was caught inch by inch by his hand, and then the saber light shattered inch by inch.","Bam!","Everyone could only see the saber light being crushed inch by inch by Chu Yunfan, revealing the true appearance of the treasure saber. It was a treasure saber refined from an unknown metal. The saber was like a crescent moon, and the saber’s surface flickered with an incomparably sharp light. It could even reflect Chu Yunfan’s figure.","Bam!","In the next moment, the body of the treasure saber was crushed by Chu Yunfan’s palm. It turned into countless fragments and scattered in all directions.","Spurt!","Lu Yixian spurted out a mouthful of blood. The magic tool connected to his mind was crushed by Chu Yunfan, and he was seriously injured.","Lu Yixian retreated repeatedly, heavily injured.","Almost instantly, Lu Yixian fled to the back, trying to escape from the array.","Seeing that Lu Yixian was about to escape, Chu Yunfan sneered and said, “Lu Yixian, didn’t you just say that I would find nowhere to live? Who’s the one who’s panicking now?”","When Lu Yixian heard this, he was so angry that he almost vomited blood. He was born with the constitution of an emperor and was different from the rest. Moreover, he had already entered the top sect in the world like the Destiny Sect when he was a baby. He was taken care of and looked forward to.","It could be said that he had never suffered a loss before and had always had a smooth sailing journey. Even in the Prodigy Battlefield, he was one of the few people who stood at the peak and was the top figure who led the huge Destiny Alliance.","It could be said that he had been a protagonist all his life. He had never suffered a loss, but now he had suffered a huge loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","However, at this moment, he knew that he couldn’t fight Chu Yunfan head-on. He had to find an opportunity to use the resources of the Destiny Sect to kill Chu Yunfan. Otherwise, he would probably die today.","It was the first time he had been forced to such a state by other young prodigies. It was a heavy blow to his pride, but none of this was more important than surviving.","“Stop him!” Lu Yixian roared.","At this time, the native experts outside the array gave up on maintaining the array and flew toward Chu Yunfan.","One by one, they tried to stop Chu Yunfan and buy time for Lu Yixian to escape.","Lu Yixian took this opportunity to turn into a streak of light and escape.."]},{"number":2209,"title":"Chapter 2209: The End of the Prodigy Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2209: The End of the Prodigy Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Tens of peak Major Arcanes attacking at the same time? How terrifying was that? This was especially so for these natives. There were some geniuses and top prodigies among them.","Any one of these geniuses and top-notch prodigies was comparable to ten or even dozens of experts of the same level.","These forces gathered into a torrent and rushed toward Chu Yunfan. The entire sky shook.","But at this moment, Chu Yunfan didn’t care. He let these people attack him. These people couldn’t break through his defense.","He was like a supreme demon god that had existed since ancient times.","It was impossible for them to break through.","Even a peak Major Arcane Supreme Youth would not be a match for Chu Yunfan. They would be easily defeated by him.","Not to mention these ordinary prodigies, or even ordinary experts, they were not even Supreme Youths. With so many of them working together, it did not matter to Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan punched out. His fist force went against the current and collapsed the torrent. In an instant, these experts were beaten back and spat out blood.","Spurt!","Everyone spat out a mouthful of blood.","“Hurry up and leave. This person is too strong!’","“We just need to buy some time. A little time is enough!’","“Set up the array and delay him!”","For a moment, these experts were in chaos. They did not expect that with so many of them working together, they were actually not a match at all.","They were beaten back!","The rhythm was disrupted by Chu Yunfan, and everyone was thrown into chaos. Some wanted to stop Chu Yunfan, some wanted to set up a array, and some wanted to save Lu Yixian.","The entire scene was a mess.","However, Chu Yunfan’s expression did not change. He charged forward like a dinosaur. Those native experts who tried to stop Chu Yunfan were instantly pierced through and exploded.","The air was trembling and explosions were happening everywhere.","Chu Yunfan caught up to Lu Yixian in an instant.","Although Lu Yixian was fast, Chu Yunfan’s speed was obviously even more astonishing. He caught up with Lu Yixian in an instant. As Chu Yunfan swung his palm, a bolt of lightning turned into a whip and grabbed Lu Yixian.","Just like the legendary immortal binding rope, it grabbed him firmly.","“Chu Yunfan, you and I are irreconcilable!” Lu Yixian roared angrily, “If you kill me, the Destiny Sect will not let you off!”","“You?” Chu Yunfan sneered. “So what if I kill you? How would your Destiny Sect know it was me?”","Chu Yunfan’s palm turned into a terrifying hand knife and chopped off Lu Yixian’s head with one slash.","Slice!","Lu Yixian’s head was cut off and sent flying, fresh blood spurting out.","Immediately after, the disaster energy wrapped around him. In an instant, Lu Yixian’s corpse turned into a ball of light and surged into Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","Chu Yunfan was pleasantly surprised to find that his cultivation had increased a little, and the power of his Disaster Star Eyes had increased a little.","Although its effects were not as good as the Brahma Fruit, it was very shocking.","In the past, after Chu Yunfan killed those experts, he had turned their blood essence into nutrients for the Brahma Fruit. However, he had now discovered another path that could be used. He could let the Disaster Star Eyes absorb it and turn it into his strength.","Compared to Jun Tianci, Lu Yixian was stronger. After all, his foundation was much stronger than Jun Tianci’s.","However, it was a pity that he had met Chu Yunfan. They could be called Supreme Youths with just one emperor physique. Chu Yunfan, who had three special physiques, was an existence that completely exceeded their imagination.","After killing Lu Yixian, Chu Yunfan returned.","At this time, the battlefield was in a state of chaos. However, the native experts who had surrounded Chu Yunfan were now surrounding Tang Siyu and fighting crazily.","Even though Tang Siyu was still a far cry from Chu Yunfan, she was a peak Major Arcane and a Supreme Youth with an emperor physique.","Even though she couldn’t charge around recklessly like Chu Yunfan, killing peak Major Arcanes as she pleased, she could still fight against these top-tier geniuses without a single winner.","Facing the combined attacks of tens of peak Major Arcanes, Tang Sivu was not afraid. On the contrary, she was stalling these people, preventing them from leaving the battlefield.","Tang Siyu knew very well that once these people escaped and Chu Yunfan’s identity was exposed, the consequences would be unimaginable. The Destiny Sect would definitely not let this go.","If the Destiny Sect suffered such a huge loss, even if the Flying Celestials protected Chu Yunfan, he would still be in trouble.","The only way was to kill all these people and not let any of them escape. Only then would it be possible to seal all the news.","Therefore, at this point, even when facing dozens of top-notch experts, she did not give in.","Chu Yunfan watched as Tang Siyu’s aura became more and more mellow. If she continued at this speed, she would gain a lot.","After all, not everyone had the opportunity to fight against dozens of top-notch experts.","However, Chu Yunfan still intervened on the battlefield and interrupted Tang","Siyu’s battle.","Tang Siyu would definitely be able to make a greater breakthrough after fighting for three days and three nights like this. However, the Prodigy","Battlefield was about to close, and there was not much time left for them.","Originally, Tang Siyu and the dozens of native experts were fighting hard, but after Chu Yunfan intervened, the whole situation was immediately turned around.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch pierced through the entire sky and landed on the body of a peak Major Arcane, causing his body to crack.","Immediately after, Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate to attack one after another. He rushed into the ranks of these experts and casually punched and kicked them until their bodies shattered.","In just the time it took to brew a cup of tea, with Tang Siyu’s help, Chu Yunfan had killed all of these Major Arcanes.","“No one escaped!” Tang Siyu said as she glanced around the battlefield.","As she spoke, she heaved a sigh of relief. She was afraid that these people would escape and spread the news of Chu Yunfan. If that happened, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Chu Yunfan nodded and then grabbed the corpses of these experts. A portion of them became nourishment for the Disaster Star Eyes, and a portion became nourishment for the Brahma Tree.","“Let’s go. We’ll leave immediately. If we don’t leave now, it’ll be too late!” Chu","Yunfan said.","After the two of them finished speaking, their figures disappeared from where they were.."]},{"number":2210,"title":"Chapter 2210: The End, Shocking the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2210: The End, Shocking the World","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the blink of an eye, a month had passed since the end of the Prodigy Battlefield.","However, the aftermath of the end of the Prodigy Battlefield had only just begun to ferment.","Other than the older generation of experts, many of the new and middle-generation experts did not know about the Prodigy Battlefield.","Even if they knew, they were not qualified to participate.","Every time the Prodigy Battlefield began, only the top 20 to 30 people on the Prodigy List were qualified to participate.","As for the other prodigies on the Prodigy List, it was almost impossible for them to participate. They might not have king physiques, and even if they did, they would only be cannon fodder on the battlefield.","It was impossible for them to gallop freely on the Prodigy Battlefield.","Therefore, to many people, what happened on the Prodigy Battlefield was a matter of myths and legends.","The current prodigies were often only supporting roles on the Prodigy Battlefield, cannon fodder.","Although their talent and strength were not inferior to those ancient prodigies, their cultivation time was too short. If they did not have enough cultivation time, they would naturally not be strong enough.","In the past, even if the Prodigy Battlefield ended, all the aftershocks would calm down within a month. This was because those who were qualified to participate in the Prodigy Battlefield were ultimately only a rare portion.","It had nothing to do with the majority of the general public.","However, it was different this time. Even though a month had passed, the matters regarding the Prodigy Battlefield were still in an uproar and did not stop.","This was because after the previous Prodigy Battlefields ended, the prodigies, top prodigies, and Supreme Youths who participated in the Prodigy Battlefields would often find a place to seal themselves. Then, they would wait for the next time the Prodigy Battlefields opened before they would revive.","However, it was different this time because the prodigies who left the Prodigy Battlefield did not enter a state of self-sealing like in the past. Instead, they appeared in the main world one after another.","One could imagine that a stone would cause a thousand ripples.","Even those who did not have any concept of the Prodigy Battlefield and the prodigies on the Prodigy Battlefield knew who the prodigies were after a month of exposure.","It could be said that each of them was a top prodigy since ancient times. Even the best among them could be found in many ancient books and records that recorded their great achievements even after countless years.","It could be said that every one of them had a reputation, and every one of them was an existence with a great background.","The era in which many people were active was far more distant than the era when Grand Xia was founded.","The oldest could even be traced back to the legendary ancient times, a terrifying era where innate demon gods were everywhere and emperors stood side by side.","The reason why those prodigies sealed themselves from the distant era to the current era was naturally to find an opportunity to vindicate the Dao and become a god.","As these prodigies moved, a shocking piece of news spread. The opportunity to vindicate the Dao and become a god was not in any other era but in this life.","It could be said that the moment this news came out, the entire world was in the limelight.","All the experts in the world were attracted by this news. Even though in the current world, emperors were already legends and had not been heard of for many years, let alone gods who lived for a long time.","Even in the legends passed down by the elders, there was no such thing as someone who could become a god. Everything was just a myth. No one had really seen anyone who could become a god.","However, the emperors had vowed to pursue it tirelessly. In the end, they fought at the end of the ancient era, causing the world to collapse and an era to be drowned.","This made people believe that there was a way to live forever. Otherwise, the emperors would not fight to the death for a godhead.","After all, those emperors were far smarter than ordinary people.","As a result, when the news first spread, it caused a sensation throughout the world. Many people wanted to find out why such news was spread and who spread it.","However, there was no way to find any clues. Everything pointed to the end of the ancient era. At that time, news had already spread.","However, after the earth-shattering battle at the end of the ancient era, many of the secrets of the ancient era had been lost in the river of time.","However, this legend was passed down from generation to generation, and many prodigies believed in it. As a result, they chose to seal themselves. As time passed, they slowly arrived at this world.","Rumor had it that the godhead was about to reappear, and this world would welcome its last chance to become a god.","As for many veteran experts, they were even more restless. Although those young prodigies and Supreme Youths had shocking backgrounds and heaven-shaking talents, they had not grown up yet. It was not their turn to call the shots in this world.","Moreover, the rumors only said that the godhead was about to appear in this world. They did not say who would end up with it, nor did they say that the godhead was prepared for these prodigies.","Compared to the many prodigies and Supreme Youths, they had a complete advantage at this moment.","With their strength, even those prodigies and Supreme Youths who roamed the battlefield had to retreat.","Not only these veteran experts but the rest of the people were also tempted.","Wasn’t the ultimate goal of cultivation to transcend heaven and earth and live for a long time without being worn down by the power of time and turning into dust?","Now, with the appearance of the godhead, they had such an opportunity. Even though they knew that their chances were not high, they were still unwilling to let go of such an opportunity.","It could be said that as time passed, more and more experts learned of this news, and more and more experts participated in the search for the whereabouts of the godhead.","However, no matter how hard they searched, they could not find any clues about the godhead.","Even the ancient legend only said that the godhead would appear in this world. It did not specify when it would appear.","Therefore, everyone was blind.","However, because of the return of these ancient prodigies, many conflicts had been stirred up, and they were endless.","It could be said that it was not uncommon for prodigies of the present age to clash with ancient prodigies.","This was especially true for many of the ancient prodigies. Although they were considered to be of the younger generation, in terms of strength, they were more powerful than many sect leaders and grand elders.","From time to time, they could hear that older experts had fallen at their hands.."]},{"number":2211,"title":"Chapter 2211: The World Shook Because of Jian Wuchen","paragraphs":["Chapter 2211: The World Shook Because of Jian Wuchen","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even many veteran experts who had been famous for a long time did not have an advantage against these ancient freaks.","These experts had been famous for a long time, and each of them was a powerful expert in the eyes of many people.","However, when faced with these terrifying ancient freaks, they had no strength to fight back.","Until now, many people did not take the so-called prodigies seriously. In fact, many people even felt that the so-called prodigies were no different from the prodigies of the current era.","Even the ancient freaks who were the best among the prodigies were not much stronger.","This was because many people would never see any of them in their entire lives.","Those who stood out among ordinary people could only be considered talents, and those who stood out among talents could be considered prodigies. Only those who stood out among prodigies were qualified to be called prodigies.","These ancient freaks were all outstanding prodigies. At the very least, they were existences that could dominate among prodigies.","It was not until these prodigies fought over all sorts of things that everyone understood what a prodigy was and what a monster was.","Many of the famous prodigies in the world had no way to fight back when they encountered these freaks. It was common for dozens of people of the same level to be beaten up by one person.","It was even very common for veteran experts to be defeated.","Many unresigned prodigies wanted to challenge these freaks after they were born. In the end, they were naturally beaten up, and many of them lost their lives.","Even if their masters personally came out, they would not be able to resist these terrifying freaks.","Among the prodigies of the present age, there were very few who could enter the Arcana Stage. However, for these ancient freaks, the Arcana Stage was a basic operation.","One had to know that many of the sect’s grand elders only had such cultivation. The ten great sects had such a strong foundation.","It was not that there were no experts who could not stand it and personally dealt with these ancient freaks. However, they discovered that even if their cultivation was far superior to these ancient freaks, each of these people had a lot of trump cards. It was difficult to catch the weak points.","When an old expert finally paid a huge price to kill an ancient freak, the current experts did not have time to cheer, but they provoked the peerless expert behind this ancient freak.","A second-rate sect was massacred in a single night.","At this point, everyone finally understood that these ancient freaks dared to run amok in the modern world. They were not crazy, but behind them stood an extremely terrifying super ancient expert.","These experts had also survived to the present day through self-sealing methods. They clearly wanted to protect these ancient freaks. These ancient freaks and prodigies were the only hope for their sects and families to revive.","Once they targeted these ancient freaks, there was no doubt that they wanted to cut off the hope of these people’s revival. Naturally, they would have to face these people’s thunderous attacks.","For a time, the world went silent. Everyone was shocked by this terrifying strength.","Just one prodigy was backed by such a terrifying expert. Tens of thousands of prodigies had appeared together, and behind them stood at least tens of thousands of terrifying experts that far surpassed these prodigies.","What kind of terrifying power was this? To put it bluntly, even existences at the level of the ten great sects would not be able to escape death when faced with such a force.","Only by joining forces with all the forces in the world could they possibly resist the return of these ancient forces.","Although these ancient forces had been destroyed, even if each sect only had three to five monster-level experts left, it was enough to destroy the current world.","Even Grand Xia, which had always been extremely powerful, could only remain silent in the face of these super-ancient powers that had returned.","They were unwilling to fight with these super-ancient powers to the death.","Once the two sides started a large-scale war, it would be the end of the world.","It would be even more terrifying than the struggle between the emperors at","the end of ancient times.","Ever since the great war of the emperors at the end of ancient times, the people of the world had spent a lot of time and effort to explore the path of cultivation. Even so, there was a huge gap compared to the situation when the emperors stood side by side and the masters were everywhere.","If they were to collapse in this life, almost the entire human civilization would collapse.","For a time, the discussion between the heavens and the earth about the ancient prodigies did not end with the end of the Prodigy Battlefield. Instead, it became even more noisy with the end of the Prodigy Battlefield.","While everyone was discussing the prodigies on the battlefield, a name began to spread—Jian Wuchen.","The appearance of this name was accompanied by a storm of blood. Many of the old monsters of the super-ancient forces went crazy as they searched for this person. Even the strongest sect in the world, the Destiny Sect, joined the search for Jian Wuchen.","As time passed, everyone finally understood why these old monsters were looking for Jian Wuchen.","It was because their successors on the battlefield had all died at the hands of Jian Wuchen. It would not have been a big deal if only their successors had died. After all, even the top prodigies were everywhere on the battlefield, not to mention ordinary prodigies who were worse than ants.","However, Jian Wuchen had killed and robbed too many prodigies. At least hundreds of people had been killed by him.","It could be said to be a peerless disaster!","Many people didn’t believe it at first. How powerful were these prodigies? During this period of time, they understood that prodigies of the same level were completely beaten up in front of them. They couldn’t even block a finger.","To them, it was an extravagant hope to be able to kill a prodigy, let alone someone who could kill and rob hundreds of prodigies. It was simply a legendary battle record.","However, as the Destiny Sect joined the hunt for Jian Wuchen, everyone finally confirmed that there was indeed such a person who had achieved such a legendary battle record.","Many pieces of news quickly spread out from the Destiny Sect. The Destiny Sect had suffered heavy losses in the Prodigy Battlefield this time. Countless experts had died, and many top-notch prodigies had died at Jian Wuchen’s","hands.","Even the two Supreme Youths who were regarded as their greatest hope had fallen in the Prodigy Battlefield.","This was the first time many people knew that there was a level above the Supreme Youths.."]},{"number":2212,"title":"Chapter 2212: Slapping the Ancient Forces and Boosting Morale!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2212: Slapping the Ancient Forces and Boosting Morale!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the eyes of many people, prodigies were top-notch experts. Among them, the top-notch prodigies were the top three on the Prodigy List every year. They were top-notch prodigies who suppressed an entire era.","It was not something that ordinary people could compare to!","Only now did they know that above the top prodigies, there were Supreme Youths who suppressed the terrifying freak of several eras on their won.","Compared to ordinary prodigies, these Supreme Youths were the true freaks and monsters.","Even so, there were still several Supreme Youths who had died at Jian Wuchen’s hands. Although the two Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect did not have direct evidence, the Destiny Sect had obtained enough information to confirm that the two Supreme Youths had died at Jian Wuchen’s hands.","For a time, the world was in an uproar.","“l was wondering why those old monsters are so desperate to find Jian","Wuchen. It turns out that Supreme Youths died at Jian Wuchen’s hands!”","“So there’s still the saying of ‘Supreme Youth’ above the top prodigies. No wonder those old monsters are going crazy. No wonder the Destiny Sect is going crazy!","“That’s right. If these Supreme Youths were to be placed outside, any one of them would be able to suppress their peers. They would definitely be the number one person in their generation. When he was alive, it would be difficult for him to even meet a match. In the future, he might even have a chance to become an emperor!”","“In ancient times, this would be the seed of an emperor. If an emperor could appear, even a small sect could develop into a giant!”","Everyone was shocked. Although this was the first time many people knew the concept of Supreme Youths, it was obvious that they could understand how important these Supreme Youths were to the forces behind them.","Any one of them dying could cause a huge uproar, not to mention that so many people had died, and they had all died at the hands of Chu Yunfan alone. “Who is this Jian Wuchen? Why is he so terrifying?”","“l wonder if he has the inheritance of an emperor behind him. He’s definitely not an ordinary person!”","“I heard that he provoked the Destiny Sect before. I thought that this was already very impressive. 1 didn’t expect that this was just the beginning!’","These furious old monsters turned the entire world upside down. All the forces and people who were suspected to be related to Jian Wuchen would be found by them.","A few forces were even uprooted by these angry old monsters because they gave wrong answers.","In the end, all the evidence pointed to two people. One was Chu Hongcai, who had been saved by Jian Wuchen, and the other was Tang Siyu, who had appeared with Jian Wuchen and fought alongside him.","As a result, these terrifying old monsters finally found an outlet to vent their anger and attacked.","“Are we going to let these ancient monsters be so arrogant?” Many people felt extremely aggrieved and furious.","Very quickly, the tables turned. The old monsters went to the door in anger and demanded for the two of them to be handed over. Finally, they kicked a hornet’s nest after they ran amok.","Outside the Flying Celestials, they were blocked by the array set up by several grand elders of the Flying Celestials for ten days and ten nights. They could not advance an inch. In the end, these old monsters retreated.","The other wave of old monsters who had fought their way to the Serene Immortal Mountain in the sea encountered the Elder Princess who had just returned from outer space.","The Elder Princess, who could only be considered a young person when the Prodigy Battlefield opened last time, had displayed her amazing strength. She killed several ancient old monsters in a row. In the end, she had even severely injured these ancient old monsters in one go. She chased these old monsters for 30,000 miles and chased them into the endless sea before giving up. Moreover, the Elder Princess even said, “If there are any more troublemakers, kill them all!”","For a time, the world was in an uproar. Too many people in the current world had suffered in front of these ancient factions. They were even unable to resist these ancient factions.","Even the ancient factions that had been destroyed were much stronger than the current sects.","But now, with the Elder Princess and the Flying Celestials taking action one after another, they had completely slapped the faces of these ancient forces.","They let them know that although these ancient forces were very strong, there were still people in the current era who could deal with them.","This was especially so for the Elder Princess. Before this, many people knew that the Elder Princess was very powerful. Even the imperial family of Grand Xia couldn’t do anything to her.","However, there was no clear concept of how strong she was. They only knew that she was one of the top experts in the world.","But now, after comparing with these old monsters, everyone realized that the Elder Princess’ strength was truly terrifying.","The sect leaders of ordinary first-rate sects couldn’t even withstand a single blow from these old monsters, but these old monsters had joined forces and were almost wiped out by the Elder Princess single-handedly.","They were chased for 30,000 miles.","What could be more exciting than this? Even the forces that had previously been enemies with the Elder Princess applauded.","It was because they had been suppressed by the ancient forces during this period.","Not only the humans, but also the marine folks, the demons, and many other races had to face theses ancient experts.","All the tribes in the current era were suppressed to the point of suffocation. Under such circumstances, the Elder Princess’ attack undoubtedly made countless people feel excited.","In contrast, the Flying Celestials’ foundation was even more unfathomable. This time, the sect master of the Flying Celestials did not make a move. Only a few grand elders, who many people had never heard of before, set up a formation to stop these old monsters for ten days and ten nights.","This was a form of deterrence. It was different from the simple and direct deterrence of the Elder Princess. This kind of deterrence reflected the strength and unfathomable power of the Flying Celestials. No one knew how many masters there were in the Flying Celestials.","However, no matter what, with the Flying Celestials’ foundation, they were not afraid of falling out with these ancient forces.","However, everyone in the world was still worried. After all, there were very few people who had the foundation of the Flying Celestials and the strength of the Elder Princess. Most people were completely helpless against the aggressiveness of these ancient forces.","With the return of these tens of thousands of prodigies and the factions behind them, the world was in chaos. The resources needed for the cultivation of these prodigies and the old monsters behind them were astronomical.","For a time, the forces of the current era and the forces of the ancient era kept clashing because of various conflicts of interest. Most of the time, it ended with the forces of the current era giving in.","Facing these ancient forces, the current forces were like a volcano that was about to erupt.."]},{"number":2213,"title":"Chapter 2213: The Exchange of Old and New, the Entanglement of Benefits","paragraphs":["Chapter 2213: The Exchange of Old and New, the Entanglement of Benefits","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The world had already been divided into two major forces. The conflicts between the Ancients Alliance and the major forces in the present world were becoming more and more frequent.","Especially when some ancient factions started to openly demand their original encampments and resources, the conflict between the current factions and the ancient factions could no longer be concealed and erupted.","These ancient forces had been active for a very long time before they retired, and many of them were not inferior to the current ten great forces.","They were once the masters of this world. Now, many sacred caves and blessed lands, and even the territories occupied by the ten great factions, were once their places.","In the past, these forces had never appeared on a large scale. Therefore, even if there was a need in this area, it would only be a small portion and would not become a large-scale topic.","However, now that the various large factions had returned, they needed various resources for cultivation and various sacred caves and blessed lands.","For a time, the conflict between the two sides intensified to the point where it was like a volcanic eruption.","The ancient factions had to obtain enough resources to gain a foothold, and the current factions could not give in because of this.","In the world, anyone with eyes could see that the world was in a state of turmoil. Both sides were at daggers drawn and a war might not be avoided.","After this war, there would be a huge reshuffle. Only the last surviving faction would be qualified to participate in the fight for the godhead that was about to be born.","In the eyes of many people, this was a way to eliminate many factions that were not qualified to participate in the final battle.","Outside, a storm was brewing. Inside the Flying Celestials, the atmosphere","was equally heavy.","Startling Cloud Peak was once the center of attention. Ever since Chu Yunfan disappeared, it no longer attracted attention and gradually became one of the ordinary main peaks.","However, on this day, an uninvited guest came, and it attracted the attention of many people in the Flying Celestials.","A young man in a golden robe with a resolute and arrogant face floated in front of Startling Cloud Peak. Some stood in front of him, and many gazes fell on this person.","The owners of these gazes were all disciples of the Flying Celestials. At this moment, they were holding their breaths as they watched the confrontation between the two people in front of them.","They weren’t unfamiliar with these two people. Although they were unfamiliar with the man in the golden robe before, his reputation had risen recently.","It was recorded in the ancient records that a great senior, Wu Wenbin, from thousands of years ago had once suppressed a disciple of the same generation of the Flying Celestials, but he had later disappeared.","He had a prodigy seal him up until this era. After the end of the Prodigy Battlefield, he returned to the Flying Celestials. However, he did not choose to seal himself up. Instead, he planned to develop in the present era.","That terrifying existence that was like a god made it difficult for everyone present to even breathe. Whether it was the fringe disciples, inner disciples, elite disciples, or even the true disciples, they were powerless against Wu Wenbin.","They couldn’t even resist the aura that he was emitting.","The person in front of Wu Wenbin was no stranger to them. He was the core disciple who had once followed Chu Yunfan and became famous in the Flying Celestials, You Chuyun.","Compared to 20 years ago, You Chuyun’s cultivation had improved tremendously. He had long stepped into the Abstract Interpretation Stage and became one of the best among the true disciples.","It was he who had held up the banner of Chu Yunfan’s faction over the years that had nurtured Chu Hongcai, this rising star.","Among the many disciples of the Flying Celestials, he was quite famous. Many people believed that he should be one of the core figures of the next generation of the Flying Celestials’ higher-ups.","At the very least, he would gain the position of a grand elder.","However, at this moment, no one was optimistic about You Chuyun. Even though You Chuyun had already stepped into the Abstract Interpretation Stage, he was no different from a child in front of Wu Wenbin.","“It’s really unwise of You Chuyun to stand in front of Wu Wenbin right now! ”","In the distance, a disciple of the Flying Celestials whispered.","“That’s right. Although his strength is not bad and he’s also one of the best among the true disciples, he’s facing an ancient freak. In the same level, who is a match for these ancient freaks? Even if Chu Yunfan is still here, I’m afraid he’s not Wu Wenbin’s match!”","“He doesn’t know what’s good for him. What’s the use of him protecting Startling Cloud Peak? Who knows if Chu Yunfan is still alive or dead? Not to mention, even if he’s still alive, so what? I’m afraid he can’t beat Wu Wenbin. He’s an Arcane, not inferior to many people in the grand elder group!’","In the distance, everyone was discussing animatedly, but none of them dared to speak loudly, afraid of alarming the two of them.","Wu Wenbin looked at You Chuyun, who was blocking his way. He had a smile on his face as he said, “You dare to block me? You’re quite bold!”","“Senior Wu, Startling Cloud Peak is Senior Chu’s fief. It was personally bestowed by the sect master. You can’t do anything rash!” You Chuyun said as he smiled bitterly in his heart.","Although he had been on guard, this day had come.","During this time, the return of these ancient freaks had caused an uproar within the sect.","Unlike those ancient freaks and old freaks outside who had no belonging, these ancient freaks who had once dominated an era were all former disciples of the Flying Celestials. They were people with roots, so they naturally couldn’t be ignored.","However, the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials had never thought that these ancient freaks would choose to return at the same time. Therefore, these floating peaks that were specially provided for the true disciples to live in were no longer enough.","The competition between the ancient powers and the current powers was not limited to the outside world. It was also going on like a raging fire within the Flying Celestials and the other major sects.","After these ancient prodigies returned, they discovered that their original encampment had been occupied by others and began to snatch it back.","Even the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials could not stop them. They were true disciples of the modern era and prodigies of the ancient era.","Even if they wanted to stop it, they could not do anything. Without the intervention of the higher-ups of the sect, ordinary true disciples were naturally not a match for these ancient prodigies. They were defeated.","They couldn’t even resist for a bit. Even though some of the true disciples had entered the Arcana Stage, they were still facing the ancient prodigies who could beat them up.","These veteran true disciples could not even protect themselves. They could only give up their floating peaks one by one.","And now, it was finally Startling Cloud Peak’s turn.."]},{"number":2214,"title":"Chapter 2214: Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2214: Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many of the old core disciples had their floating peaks taken away. They had no choice but to live together with the other inner and elite disciples. They were very aggrieved.","However, they could not show any dissatisfaction because they knew very well that if these ancient prodigies chose to seal themselves, it would be fine. Once they chose to grow up in the present world, any one of them would be able to beat them up.","In fact, as long as these people were willing to grow in this world, they would definitely be able to become the absolute higher-ups of the next generation of the Flying Celestials.","They might become a king in the future!","Even Yang Dengxian, the current chief disciple of the Flying Celestials, could only protect himself.","Yang Dengxian, who had once been awe-inspiring and led many core disciples, could only protect himself against these ancient prodigies. As for peerless prodigies like Chu Hongcai and Hua Xianyuan, they could not protect themselves.","Without the intervention of the higher-ups, the disciples of the current era were defeated. It would probably not be long before all kinds of resources would be occupied by them.","When many people thought of this, they could not help but feel indignant.","However, no one dared to stop them. These ancient prodigies were too strong. If they wanted to grow, they would need many resources. It was not something that ordinary people could provide.","“That Chu Yunfan? I’ve heard about him recently. He’s not bad, but I heard that he’s already dead. Moreover, even if he’s not dead, so what? How many years has he cultivated? Can you compare to me?” Wu Wenbin sneered. His golden robe shone brightly under the sunlight, making him look like a god cast in gold.","He had heard about Chu Yunfan and thought that if Chu Yunfan was still alive, he might become one of them in the future, but that was all.","After all, what kind of people were they? Each of them was an outstanding figure of their era. Ordinary experts on the Prodigy List could not even withstand a single move from them.","Such an evaluation was the highest evaluation. Even if Chu Yunfan was still alive, so what? Under the situation where his cultivation time was far inferior to his, he could only eat dust behind him forever.","“Senior Chu isn’t dead. He will come back, so I must guard Startling Cloud Peak for him!” You Chuyun shouted as he frowned slightly.","The others thought that You Chuyun was just forcing himself, but only he knew that he was not forcing himself. He had really seen Chu Yunfan and was sure that Chu Yunfan was not dead.","“What a loyal follower!” Wu Wenbin was not angry. He just said with a smile, “l like you, so I’ll give you a chance. If you become my follower, you can follow me to conquer the world in the future and become famous. Isn’t it much better than following a dead man?”","Wu Wenbin, on the other hand, had a heart of love for talents. He had woken up from his long sleep. The followers from back then had long died of old age, and now was the time to recruit new followers.","In fact, he was not the first to do so. In the past few days, many core disciples of the current era had become the followers of these ancient prodigies.","There was no need to force them. Everyone knew very well that the future of following these ancient prodigies was limitless. Even if they could only share some benefits, it was something they could not imagine.","In his view, this was a fortuitous encounter that he had given out, and You Chuyun would not reject it.","“Not in a million years!” You Chuyun shook his head, his expression a little complicated.","When he was still a nobody, it was Chu Yunfan who single-handedly promoted him to this position. Even if Chu Yunfan was dead, he would not follow anyone else.","If it weren’t for his character, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t have placed so much importance on him and entrusted him with such a heavy responsibility.","He was secretly grateful to Chu Yunfan for his appreciation.","“A wise man will die for his confidant. Since I’ve resolverd to follow Senior Chu, I won’t follow anyone else. Give up!” You Chuyun shook his head.","“Humph!” Wu Wenbin!s expression darkened slightly. He said, “Stubborn. Since you’re not willing to be my follower, then move aside. Bring your people and Chu Yunfan out. Startling Cloud Peak is now mine!”","“Senior Wu, even if you’re an old senior from thousands of years ago, you can’t do as you please!” You Chuyun said.","“Stubborn!” Wu Wenbin snorted coldly again, and a terrifying aura swept out.","He attacked, and You Chuyun was severely injured, spat out blood, and was thrown backward.","“Sigh, he’s no match at all. The gap between the Abstract Stage and the Arcana Stage is too big!’","“Indeed. Although he can’t withstand a single blow, at least he dared to stop Wu Wenbin. The others have already lost their courage!’","“l can’t accept this. Could it be that there’s already a difference in strength among the remaining people? Even after working so hard, we can’t compare to their king physiques. They are destined to be high and mighty from birth!”","For a moment, many people sighed. Even though they had already guessed it, they were still shocked.","Wu Wenbin did not even take a second glance. You Chuyun was only at the Abstract Interpretation Stage. In the eyes of ordinary core disciples, he was considered a top expert.","However, in the eyes of someone who had already stepped into the Middle Arcana Stage, that was nothing.","They were just slightly stronger ants. Those below the Arcana Stage were all ants.","Wu Wenbin took a step forward and grabbed out with one hand. In an instant, it transformed into a monstrous hand that wanted to crush Startling Cloud Peaks defensive array.","Although the defensive array of Startling Cloud Peak was reinforced by Chu Yunfan, his cultivation was not strong back then. The defensive array that he set up was obviously far inferior now. It was crushed in an instant.","In the tartling Cloud Peak, many disciples of Startling Cloud Peak spat out blood as they were injured.","They were almost killed by the palm strike.","The number of people seemed to have lost its meaning in front of him.","“From today onwards, Startling Cloud Peak belongs to me!” Wu Wenbin smiled faintly. He did not take the disciples of the Shocking Cloud Peak seriously. “Now, I’ll open the mountain gate and recruit followers. All the true disciples who think they’re strong can come and see me!”","Everyone sighed with emotion. A true disciple was the peak among disciples, but according to Wu Wenbin, they only met the basic conditions to become his follower.","“Hmph, you want to take over Startling Cloud Peak? Have you asked for my opinion?”","Suddenly, a cold snort came from the sky.","With this cold snort, a figure stepped on the light and came over.."]},{"number":2215,"title":"Chapter 2215: Slapping Someone Till They Came Around","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In an instant, this figure had already appeared in front of Startling Cloud Peak.","“It’s Senior Chu!”","Looking at the black-robed figure, many people’s eyes lit up as they immediately remembered who this was.","It was Chu Yunfan, whom they had not seen for many years.","Many people rubbed their eyes as if they couldn’t believe it. Many people’s impression of Chu Yunfan was still from many years ago. Back then, Chu Yunfan could be said to be a famous figure.","Many people still remembered that he had single-handedly stirred up the world and became the first on the Prodigy List. It was also at that time that Chu Yunfan became the pride of the Flying Celestials. In the eyes of many people, this was the key to the revival of the Flying Celestials.","Although Chu Yunfan was later rumored to have been killed by Jun Tianci and disappeared from everyone’s eyes for 20 years, when he reappeared, it instantly ignited the memories of him in everyone’s minds.","Even if it was just a glimpse of that once talented figure, no one would be able to forget him.","However, no one expected Chu Yunfan to reappear in front of everyone after disappearing for 20 years.","It really is Senior Chu. That’s right. After not seeing him for twenty years, he has become even more unfathomable!”","“If he returns at this time, I’m afraid that he will start a confrontation between the old and the new. Although he is very powerful, I’m afraid he is not Wu Wenbin’s match!”","“Although Senior Chu is a prodigy, I don’t think he’s inferior to these ancient prodigies, but his cultivation time is too short!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. Even the Flying Celestial disciples who had originally disliked Chu Yunfan placed their hopes on him.","In their opinion, apart from Yang Dengxian, only Chu Yunfan could compete with these ancient prodigies.","As for Hua Xianyuan, Chu Hongcai, and the others, there was no doubt that","they were too young and had cultivated for too short a time. It was impossible for them to catch up with these ancient prodigies in a short time.","Even Chu Yunfan, in their opinion, had cultivated for too short a time. He was at a disadvantage when facing these top prodigies.","Time. Everything was due to the short amount of time.","“You’re Chu Yunfan?” Wu Wenbin also heard the discussion of the crowd and naturally knew who had come. It was the original owner of Start].ing Cloud Peak, Chu Yunfan.","However, he smiled faintly and did not take Chu Yunfan seriously because he had absolute confidence.","Before he came, he had already understood that Chu Yunfan was just a top prodigy of the younger generation. Although he had potential, that was something that would happen many years later.","“Yes, I’m Chu Yunfan. Who are you?” Chu Yunfan raised his eyebrows. “Forget it. I don’t care who you are. Go back to where you came from. If you compensate me with one million high-grade spirit stones for the medical fees, this matter will be over!”","“Hahahaha, Chu Yunfan! What an arrogant fellow you are. It seems that you have already become arrogant to a certain extent by being the hero of the world. You don’t know how many people like you who can only be the hero of the world!” Wu Wenbin laughed coldly. “I’ll teach you a lesson today. I’ll show you that you’re nothing in the eyes of us ancient prodigies!’","In an instant, Wu Wenbin attacked. His entire body burst out with waves of golden light, shaking the world. These waves of golden light turned into a terrifying golden halo, which went toward Chu Yunfan, wanting to trap him.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me with your insignificant skills?” Chu Yunfan sneered, then flew up and kicked out with lightning speed.","Although there was no fluctuation of divine power in this kick, nor was there any divine might, there was a terrifying power that tore through the night like lightning.","In an instant, the golden halo was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s kick. Then, Chu Yunfan stomped on Wu Wenbin’s face.","“You’re only a Middle Arcane, yet you dare to be so arrogant and despotic. If I let you grow up, what would happen?”","Bam!","Everyone heard a loud noise, and then they saw Chu Yunfan stomp Wu Wenbin to the ground.","Everyone was petrified and completely dumbfounded. It was as if they had seen the most unbelievable thing in the world.","What did they just see?","The terrifying existence that they had thought was simply impossible to resist was now stomped to the ground by Chu Yunfan, creating a huge hole in the ground of the Flying Celestials.","“How dare you...” Wu Wenbin was dizzy from the kick, but he was still furious. However, before he could react, Chu Yunfan grabbed Wu Wenbin by the collar and pulled him out of the big pit in the ground. Then, he slapped him a few times.","They were just simple slaps, but Wu Wenbin could not resist, nor could he escape. He was slapped until he saw stars, his ears buzzed, and he was bleeding porfusely.","“Do you look down on us, the people of the future? I want to tell you now that it’s the common sense of the development of the Heavenly Dao that each generation is stronger than the previous. If you have the ability, go to the","Prodigy Battlefield. What’s the matter with bullying your own people?” Chu Yunfan said while slapping Wu Wenbin.","Wu Wenbin was slapped until blood flowed out of his seven orifices. He almost fainted. Two of his front teeth had been slapped off. All of this looked as miserable as it could be.","Wu Wenbin was furious. As a top prodigy with a king physique, when had he ever suffered such a huge loss? When had he ever been taught a lesson like this?","This was no longer a physical trampling, but a merciless mental trampling.","He had never thought that he would end up like this one day. This was even more unbearable than killing him.","“You’ll regret provoking us! The strength of the Ancients Alliance is beyond your imagination! You’re just a prodigy! Do you think you’re invincible?!” Wu Wenbin roared like a wounded beast.","He did not think of begging for mercy because he knew that Chu Yunfan would not kill him. After all, he was also a disciple of the Flying Celestials. In terms of seniority, he might even be higher than the highest level of the Flying Celestials.","He was like an injured beast, looking at Chu Yunfan with bloodshot eyes, wanting to get back at him.","What greeted him was another big slap from Chu Yunfan, which caused him to cough up blood continuously. He almost collapsed from the slap.."]},{"number":2216,"title":"Chapter 2216: Beating up an Ancient Prodigy","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the face of such a stubborn existence, Chu Yunfan’s policy was simple. He would continue to slap the person until they were convinced. This was probably how he would convince people with virtue.","However, when they heard the incessant slapping sounds, everyone was dumbfounded and almost scared to death.","Why did it feel like the battle between these top prodigies was not as high and mighty as they had imagined? Now, it seemed like it was not much different from a street brawl.","When many people saw Wu Wenbin, who was as miserable as a beaten dog, they could not associate him with the high-spirited ancient prodigy who treated the world as nothing.","How was this the same person? It was clearly two different people. It was impossible for it to be the same person.","Many people mourned for him. However, they still felt that this was good.","After these ancient prodigies returned, they relied on their high seniority and strong strength. It could be said that they could get whatever they wanted in the sect.","Even the higher-ups of the sect had to retreat when facing these ancient prodigies and would not easily interfere.","They had endured it for a long time. Everyone felt that this threat was like a knife on their back, robbing them of their benefits and resources.","This forced them to have no other choice. It was just that they were too weak and had no other choice. They could only swallow their anger.","Now that Chu Yunfan was standing up for them, they were naturally willing to see him do so.","However, they were still extremely shocked in their hearts. They simply could not believe it!","Before this, no matter how confident they were in Chu Yunfan, they only thought that Chu Yunfan could at most compete with these ancient prodigies. That would already be very impressive.","Chu Yunfan hadn’t been seen for 20 years. These disciples were all smart people, so they naturally guessed that although Chu Yunfan wasn’t killed by Jun Tianci as the rumors said, he was probably severely injured. That was why he hadn’t appeared for 20 years. He must have been hiding somewhere to recuperate.","After all, Chu Yunfan had too many enemies. Even in the Flying Celestials, he had many enemies. It was normal for him to choose to recuperate outside because he was worried.","Therefore, in many people’s eyes, Chu Yunfan’s strength should have been greatly delayed after twenty years. It was already very impressive that he could cultivate to the Arcana Stage.","Who would have thought that as soon as they met, Chu Yunfan would give them a huge surprise. He would teach Wu Wenbin, a top-notch expert who had already entered the Middle Arcana Stage, a lesson.","Moreover, it was not an ordinary beating. It was as if he was dealing with a dead dog.","What made many people even more shocked and scared was that Wu Wenbin simply did not have the strength to fight back when facing Chu Yunfan.","“What level has he cultivated to? It’s simply unfathomable. I can’t even sense a little bit of it now!”","There were some true disciples present. They had long known about Chu Yunfan. It was just that 20 years ago, Chu Yunfan gave them the feeling that he was as majestic as a mountain. Now, Chu Yunfan gave them the feeling that he was like an ocean, unfathomable.","This feeling was getting more and more different and terrifying.","After slapping Wu Wenbin for 15 minutes and almost giving him a concussion, Chu Yunfan said, “I’ll give you a choice now. Either you hand over a million high-grade spirit stones as medical fees, or I’ll strip you naked and hang you on the flagpole of my Startling Cloud Peak. I’ll let the whole sect see what the ancient prodigies look like! ”","“You...” Wu Wenbin almost could not breathe. He was so angry that he almost died of anger.","If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have dared to imagine how someone could be so daring.","He had only caused a small amount of damage, and now he was being asked to compensate a million high-grade spirit stones. This was simply too much.","He had never suffered such a big loss before, let alone being forced to this extent.","However, the thought of being stripped naked by Chu Yunfan and hung on the flagpole for others to admire made him shudder even more.","“I’ll give it to you,” Wu Wenbin said fiercely, “But you’ll regret this. Do you think I’m the only one you’ve offended?”","Wu Wenbin wanted to cry. This time, he failed to steal a chicken and suffered a loss. He wanted to find the leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Huangfu Longhao, to help him. The newcomers these days were really too arrogant.","“Cut the crap. If you have the ability, come and settle scores with me. Then I’ll teach you a lesson again!” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","Wu Wenbin’s level was similar to his, but in terms of combat strength, even ten of him would not be Chu Yunfan’s match.","Moreover, as time passed, this gap would only get worse. Of course, he was","not afraid of Wu Wenbin’s revenge.","Chu Yunfan took a spatial bag from Wu Wenbin’s hand that contained millions of high-grade spirit stones. He suddenly felt like he was robbing the prodigies on the battlefield.","Those days were truly enjoyable. There was no need to think too much. He would target whoever targeted him. It was that simple and crude.","“If you’re not willing to accept this, then find some more people and come find trouble with me. It’s best if you can find a few more. Middle Arcanes, Major Arcanes, whatever. Find them all. The more, the better!” Chu Yunfan grinned as if he had thought of something.","He thought about how if these ancient prodigies came to find trouble with him, he could just take advantage of the situation and rob them all. At that time, if he wanted to cultivate to the Major Arcana Stage, he wouldn’t lack cultivation resources.","How could slowly accumulating money be faster than making a windfall? It was just nice that he could also warn them to be pure and not think about fighting and killing all day long.","Chu Yunfan’s words made Wu Wenbin a little confused. Looking at Chu Yunfan’s sincere expression, it didn’t seem like he was bluffing. It seemed like he really hoped that those ancient prodigies would come and find trouble with him?","Everyone was also stunned as if they could not understand the situation.","But soon, many people reacted and thought of how he had extorted Wu Wenbin. Chu Yunfan was encouraging these ancient prodigies to find trouble with him. He was clearly encouraging these ancient prodigies to give their wealth to Chu Yunfan.","“Pfffft!’","Finally, someone couldn’t help but laugh. It had been decades since they last met, but why did it feel like Senior Chu was a hooligan extorting them?","It was as if some kind of emotion had been ignited. The disciples of the Flying Celestials burst into laughter, and their laughter resounded throughout the world.","Wu Wenbin, who was already in an extremely sorry state, turned pale. In the end, he rolled and crawled away on his flying light.."]},{"number":2217,"title":"Chapter 2217: Discussions","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The news of Chu Yunfan’s return and his beating of an ancient prodigy spread throughout the Flying Celestials overnight. For a time, the Flying Celestials, which was already filled with undercurrents, became even more agitated.","The storm that had originally calmed down because of the weakness of the current disciples began to sway again.","The grudges between the new and old disciples resurfaced, especially when they learned that Chu Yunfan had crushed Wu Wenbin. It made many disciples feel even more excited.","One had to know that with Wu Wenbin’s strength, even the current chief disciple, Yang Dengxian, could not compete with him.","After many years of training in the Prodigy Battlefield, it was rumored that","Yang Dengxian was only on the verge of breaking through to peak Minor Arcana Stage. He was still quite a distance away from the Middle Arcana Stage, and was currently in seclusion.","Therefore, even Yang Dengxian could only protect himself and had no way to interfere with these ancient prodigies.","In everyone’s opinion, even if Yang Dengxian had broken through to the","Middle Arcana Stage, he was probably only at the middle or lower level among these ancient prodigies.","As for the deterrence of the chief disciple, it was almost non-existent to them. The vast majority of these ancient prodigies had been the chief disciple when they were active.","Naturally, they wouldn’t take this chief disciple to heart.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. He easily defeated Wu Wenbin, who had already entered the Middle Arcana Stage.","For a time, speculations about Chu Yunfan’s strength flew everywhere.","“Major Arcane! I think Senior Chu has definitely broken through to the Major Arcana Stage! Otherwise, he wouldn’t have been able to defeat Wu Wenbin so easily! ‘","“That’s not right. There are elders who are saying that Senior Chu hasn’t broken through to Major Arcana Stage. Without the unique fluctuations of a","Major Arcane, he should still be at Middle Arcane!”","“He’s only at the Middle Arcana Stage? How can he be so terrifying?”","“l heard that there are different levels among the prodigies. There are normal prodigies, top-notch prodigies, and even the legendary Supreme Youths who have the potential to become emperors. It is said that our recently returned Senior Huangfu Longhao is a legendary Supreme Youth!”","“It seems that Senior Chu’s strength is at least at the top of the Prodigy List. That’s right. Twenty years ago, Senior Chu dominated the world. Li Qianyuan, who was ranked first on the Prodigy List, couldn’t compete with him. Among the Middle Arcanes, Senior Chu should be the strongest!’","Everyone discussed animatedly, but soon, everyone came to a conclusion.","They all leaned toward Chu Yunfan’s strength, which was only in the Middle","Arcana Stage. He was probably the best existence in the Middle Arcana Stage.","However, no one dared to list Chu Yunfan as a Supreme Youth. After all, among the many prodigies that the Flying Celestials had accumulated over the years, only Huangfu Longhao was a Supreme Youth.","The others were at most top-notch prodigies.","However, even if he was just a top-notch prodigy, he was still an existence that they could only dream of. Just a top-notch prodigy could suppress an era. This was exactly the same as the cultivation base that Chu Yunfan had displayed decades ago.","When Yang Dengxian was in seclusion, unable to uphold justice for the current disciples, these disciples united to Chu Yunfan’s side at an astonishing speed.","Other than the disciples who had already been subdued by the ancient prodigies and became their followers, all the true disciples went to Startling Cloud Peak to meet Chu Yunfan.","At the same time, in the main hall of Startling Cloud Peak.","Chu Yunfan sat on the main seat in the hall. Below him was Chu Hongcai, who had just received news of Chu Yunfan and rushed back to the Flying Celestials.","On Chu Yunfan’s shoulder, there was a golden divine bird that looked like it was made of gold.","Chu Hongcai took a glance and recognized it. Of course, he recognized this golden divine bird. If this news spread to the outside world, it would definitely shock the eyeballs on the ground.","It was a Golden Roc. According to legends, it could fight dragons and was one of the terrifying existences of the Ten Ferocities.","Because this roc had protected him more than once, Chu Hongcai knew that it was one of Chu Yunfan’s followers.","However, it had now transformed into a divine bird that perched on Chu","Yunfan’s shoulder. It was just that its divine aura was restrained very well. Other than Chu Yunfan, no one else knew that this Golden Roc had actually stepped into the Major Arcana Stage, In terms of strength, even the strongest of the Major Arcanes would not be able to do anything to it.","Unless it encountered a Supreme Youth whose level was even higher than the Golden Roc, it was possible to defeat it.","This was especially true for the Golden Roc, who could travel tens of thousands of miles with a single flap of its wings. There was almost no one who could catch him if he wanted to escape.","This Golden Roc was naturally the Black-scaled Horned Eagle that Chu Yunfan had tamed. After such a long time, he had eliminated all other bloodlines and reverted to his ancestor, becoming a Golden Roc. The purification journey had been difficult.","If it wasn’t for Chu Yunfan’s Great Celestial Demon Art, it would have been impossible.","However, with Chu Yunfan’s help, even the impossible would become possible.","Originally, it was impossible for the Golden Roc to leave the battlefield. At the last moment, Chu Yunfan helped to cut off all the Karma Chains in his body, and that allowed him to leave.","However, this method was limited to a few people. Chu Yunfan could not bring a large number of people away from the Prodigy Battlefield.","He did not have that much time to cut them off one by one, and the Karma Chains would only appear in one’s body when the Prodigy Battlefield was about to close.","Therefore, the time left for Chu Yunfan was limited. It was already impressive that Chu Yunfan could take three to five people. The only thing Chu Yunfan really needed to take away was the Golden Roc.","No one else had the right to be taken away by him. His other followers were prodigy from the outside world, so there was no need for him to take them with him.","Chu Yunfan did not contact the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and the others. He did not want to expose his identity yet.","As for the Sky Devourer Flaming Sparrow and the others, they all had their own homes in the outside world. If he were to contact them rashly, it was very likely that they would attract the attention of many people.","After all, the ancient forces, the Destiny Sect, the Blood-Clothes Tower, and other forces were all looking for Jian Wuchen.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan temporarily abandoned Jian Wuchen’s identity and only took the Golden Roc with him. He did not contact anyone else.","Of course, Chu Yunfan had already sent them a message before he left, asking them to wait to hear from him and develop freely while he was away.","With the protection of the various factions behind them, even the furious Destiny Sect couldn’t do anything to them.."]},{"number":2218,"title":"Chapter 2218: The True Disciples Come to Seek Refuge","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Therefore, Chu Yunfan had naturally regained his original identity. Many people had forgotten about the once-famous number one on the Prodigy List over the last twenty years. Most of the rookies did not know that such a person existed in the past.","Now it was time to let them know that he was back!","“It’s really you, Brother Fan. That Jian Wuchen must have been you!” Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan excitedly.","“You’re already so old, yet you’re still so immature!” Chu Yunfan smiled.","Chu Yunfan didn’t deny it, but he looked at Chu Hongcai with some gratification in his eyes. When he gave Chu Hongcai the cultivation method of the Indestructible Sword Physique, he didn’t expect Chu Hongcai to complete it. It was a gradual cultivation method.","Even if Chu Hongcai gave up halfway and only cultivated to an average level, he would be able to completely transform into a king physique possesser. At that time, Chu Hongcai would truly be able to fly up high mountains and jump across vast seas.","Although many people were unwilling, were special physiques really that powerful?","However, Chu Yunfan understood that special physiques were just that awesome, especially those with emperor physiques. They were the best among special physiques. Whether they had a special physique or not, in a sense, determined the upper limit of their future.","However, he had not expected Chu Hongcai to be able to endure the endless pain of cultivation and complete the cultivation of the Indestructible Sword","Physique.","In the end, he had not misjudged him.","Chu Hongcai finally got Chu Yunfan’s confirmation, and a satisfied smile appeared on his face. Although he had guessed it long ago, he hadn’t gotten Chu Yunfan’s confirmation.","He was moved. When he was in danger, it was all thanks to Brother Fan that he was able to escape. Over the past few decades, his progress had been earth-shattering. It was something that could not be compared to the small Chu family back then.","At this moment, he finally understood why Chu Yunfan had no interest in the position of the head of the Chu family.","For Chu Yunfan, a true dragon, the position of the head of the Chu family was just a muddy pool. It could only accommodate a loach, not a true dragon.","The wealth of the Chu family had already become a fleeting cloud. It was meaningless.","Chu Honcagi had also gone from an ordinary descendant of the Chu family to the number one on the Prodigy List that was now the focus of the world. Ever since he killed Xiang Feiyun, his title as the number one in the world had been consolidated.","He had even participated in the Prodigy Battlefield. It could be said that he had pulled apart a huge gap from the other prodigies of his generation.","They were existences that were not in the same world.","However, he had completely forgotten that Chu Yunfan was not much older than him. In fact, both Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu should be considered the prodigies of Chu Hongcai’s generation.","However, the two of them were now so famous that people habitually ignored their age and treated them as old prodigies.","“It’s not bad that you managed to cultivate into a Minor Arcane. However, this alone is far from enough. You should know the situation outside right now. It’s like a storm is brewing. Even with my strength, I might not be able to protect myself, let alone you,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Hongcai’s face was stern. Of course, he knew what Chu Yunfan was talking about. The grudges between the ancient forces and the current forces were about to erupt.","It was only one step away from a true explosion.","These ancient forces had joined forces and their power was shocking. It was unimaginable.","The current factions were not bad either. Ever since the Great Zhou Dynasty was established, the ten great factions had grown for countless years. The foundation they had accumulated was unimaginable to ordinary people.","Once a conflict broke out, it would be a terrifying collision like Mars colliding with Earth. At that time, it was possible that the world would collapse.","There was even a pessimistic saying that this battle might very well be the end of their era.","It was just like the great war between the emperors in ancient times. It brought about the collapse of an era and shattered the entire martial arts civilization.","Many people were worried that this might happen in the future, and many people had even begun to prepare backup plans.","It was to leave behind enough seeds for the revival of the martial arts civilization in the future, just like what the ancestors of the ancient era had done.","This idea was recognized by more and more people. One could imagine how tense the situation outside was.","In times of peace, one’s strength was enough to dominate the world. When Chu Yunfan’s strength was similar to Chu Hongcai’s, he had already swept the world and was known as the number one person in the world.","However, now, in the face of countless top prodigies and Supreme Youths, Chu Yunfan was nothing. He was looked down upon by many top prodigies, let alone Chu Hongcai, who was even younger.","“For now, don’t go out. Regardless of whether it’s a mission given to you by the Imperial Court or the Flying Celestials, reject them all. Follow me and I’ll guide you in your cultivation. You have to break through to the Middle Arcana Stage as quickly as possible, or even touch the Major Arcana Stage. Only then will you have some ability to protect yourself!” Chu Yunfan said.","Facing Chu Yunfan’s peerless talent, Chu Hongcai hurriedly nodded. He knew how powerful Chu Yunfan was. In the past, he had received guidance from Chu Yunfan and easily stood out from so many candidates for the position of crown prince.","Every time, Chu Yunfan would say something shocking. He could raise all kinds of problems he encountered from a strategic point of view. In his heart, no one in the world could be compared to Chu Yunfan in this aspect.","Suddenly, a series of footsteps came from outside, followed by a familiar figure appearing outside the hall.","Chu Yunfan raised his head and saw that it was You Chuyun.","“Come in!”","“Master!” You Chuyun hurriedly walked in when he heard this. After greeting Chu Yunfan, he said, “Master, there are many true disciples outside who want to pay their respects to you. Congratulations on defeating Wu Wenbin!”","“Hmm?” Chu Yunfan frowned, but he immediately understood why these people came to visit him. They probably wanted him to stand up against those ancient prodigies.","Chu Yunfan sneered. These people were really desperate. At the most critical moment, they had no choice but to rely on him.","If Chu Yunfan wanted to recruit people, he would be able to get everyone’s support with a wave of his hand. However, Chu Yunfan was not interested in becoming the sect master or the chief disciple.","“Let’s go out and meet them!”","However, Chu Yunfan agreed to meet these people.."]},{"number":2219,"title":"Chapter 2219: Establishing Rules","paragraphs":["Chapter 2219: Establishing Rules","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the square in front of the Startling Cloud Peak where many disciples had their morning cultivation lessons, many true disciples had gathered to pay their respects.","Even though only true disciples had come, there were hundreds of them. There were new true disciples and veteran true disciples. The foundation of the Flying Celestials could be seen from this.","Not every one of these people could reach the peak, but they were the backbone of the Flying Celestials’ strength to become one of the top ten sects.","“Greetings, Senior Chu!”","Seeing Chu Yunfan walk out, these true disciples all came forward to greet him. Even though most of them had entered the sect earlier than Chu Yunfan, it was normal for those who had reached the top to take the lead on the road of cultivation.","“Everyone, please excuse me,” Chu Yunfan said, “May I know why everyone is here?”","Hearing Chu Yunfan’s words, the group of true disciples looked at each other. Then, a tall true disciple walked out and cupped his hands. “Senior Chu, the first thing we came here to do is to congratulate you for coming out of seclusion. The second thing is to ask you to help us!’","“Oh? What do you want me to do for you?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“Senior Chu, after these ancient seniors returned, they occupied all the floating peaks where we lived. They pressed on step by step and went too far!” the true disciple said indignantly, “Right now, the higher-ups of the sect can’t act, and Senior Yang is in seclusion. Only you can step in for us, Brother Chu!”","These true disciples revealed indignant expressions. These people were the highest-ranking disciples of the Flying Celestials, and their status was comparable to the elders.","When had they ever suffered such a huge loss? However, many of the experts who had returned were their seniors. There were even some from thousands of years ago.","Not only were these people of high seniority, but their cultivation levels were also powerful. Even they were helpless.","Chu Yunfan paused, then said, “Alright! It’s indeed time to take care of the chaos in the sect.’","“That sounds like a good idea, but I’d like to see how you plan to manage that!”","Suddenly, a cold snort came from outside the Startling Cloud Peak.","In the blink of an eye, dozens of figures appeared above the Startling Cloud Peak Square.","The true disciples looked up and immediately felt their scalps go numb. These dozens of figures were the ancient prodigies who had returned.","Other than a small number of prodigies who were not around, most of the ancient prodigies who had returned had gathered here.","Clearly, these ancient prodigies had heard that these true disciples had gathered together. It was obvious that they wanted to join forces and fight against them.","Although the number of people was only a fraction of these true disciples, in terms of aura, they completely suppressed these true disciples.","Among the true disciples, there were a few who had cultivated for a long time and had already entered the Arcana Stage.","However, even they were almost powerless against the suppression of these ancient prodigies.","These ancient prodigies smiled. In their eyes, these people were just a motley crew.","Among the many prodigies, one of the leaders walked out.","“Chu Yunfan, what do you want to do?”","This person was about thirty years old. He had a resolute expression and was dressed in armor. He had the smell of a horse. He also emitted a powerful pressure. Just his pressure alone was enough to make everyone unable to breathe.","“l wasn’t to set the rules,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan looked at the person before him and recognized who he was. He had seen this person before on the Prodigy Battlefield. He was the deputy chief of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Sima Longyun. He was the deputy leader to the Flying Celestial Alliance leader, Huangfu Longhao. He was also a top expert in the Flying Celestials whose status was second only to Huangfu","Longhao,","No wonder he could command so many top-notch experts. These people were members of the Flying Celestial Alliance and had long been used to acting under him.","Many true disciples thought that they belonged to different eras, so they could defeat them one by one. That was just wishful thinking.","“Set rules, hahahaha! You set the rules for us?” An ancient prodigy laughed.","This ancient prodigy looked slender and handsome. As he laughed wildly, the entire Startling Cloud Peak shook.","“You? You only defeated Wu Wenbin. What right do you have to set rules for","LIS? n","This ancient prodigy’s strength was clearly above Wu Wenbin’s. He had already stepped into the Major Arcan Stage. It could be said that he was at least several times stronger than Wu Wenbin.","In the blink of an eye, he made a move. A big hand grabbed Chu Yunfan. In almost an instant, it was about to pierce through the entire sky and grab Chu","Yunfan.","However, at this moment, a golden light soared into the sky and instantly shattered that large hand. Then, it blasted onto the prodigy.","Spurt!","This prodigy grunted and spat out a mouthful of blood. He instantly fell to the ground of the Startling Cloud Peak like a kite with a broken string.","Everyone sucked in a breath of cold air. Many of them did not even see what had happened. In just an instant, the Major Arcane prodigy had been defeated.","Silence, deathly silence.","Everyone was stunned as if they had seen something completely unbelievable!","All of the true disciples were completely dumbfounded. The power of the Major Arcane’s attack earlier had suffocated them. They couldn’t even focus on themselves, so naturally, they had no way of seeing what had happened.","As for the other prodigies, they had seen the Major Arcane prodigy being defeated the moment the golden light appeared. They also didn’t know what it was.","Only Sima Longyun saw what it was. His pupils constricted slightly. It was a golden divine bird on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder.","The others quickly realized that it was not Chu Yunfan who had attacked. Soon, they understood who had attacked.","It was the divine bird on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder.","They had seen the divine bird, but they could not tell what it was. It was only about the size of a palm and looked very handsome.","To them, that was all. After all, they had seen many divine birds, and many of them were very handsome.","However, they did not expect this divine bird to be so powerful.","That was a Major Arcane, not a cabbage. Even among the ancient prodigies, he was still considered an elite. Yet, he was defeated by this golden bird so easily.."]},{"number":2220,"title":"Chapter 2220: Do I Have the Right to Set Rules?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2220: Do I Have the Right to Set Rules?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","For a moment, everyone’s eyes were focused on the palm-sized divine bird on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder.","“What kind of divine bird is that?” Some people secretly speculated, but they did not remember where this kind of divine bird existed.","The true disciples quickly reacted. They could tell from the gazes of the prodigies that the one who really attacked was not Chu Yunfan, but the divine bird on his shoulder.","“What a divine bird!” Sima Longyun commented, “However, a divine bird like this is not qualified to set rules for me!”","“Can you decide the matters of the Flying Celestial Alliance? It’s better if you invite Senior Huangfu out here,” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan did not have a good impression of these ancient prodigies, but he respected Huangfu Longhao.","This was a person with great spirit and a big heart.","Ever since Huangfu Longhao became the alliance leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance, he led many factions of the Flying Celestials. It could be said that everyone was convinced by him.","Back then, because of Chu Yunfan’s matter, he had been at odds with Jun","Tianci many times. Jun Tianci disregarded the rules and attacked Chu Yunfan.","Huangfu Longhao had also protected Chu Hongcai and was a truly talented and bold person.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan could look down on these top prodigies, but he could not look down on Huangfu Longhao.","“There’s no need. Senior Huangfu is currently in secluded cultivation. I will handle the matters of the Flying Celestial Alliance!” Sima Longyun looked at Chu Yunfan in surprise. Even the majority of the true disciples in the Flying Celestials did not know of the existence of the Flying Celestial Alliance.","This organization only existed on the Prodigy Battlefield. In addition, they sealed themselves all year round. No one else knew that these ancient prodigies belonged to the same organization.","Therefore, Sima Longyun was a little curious.","“In that case, it’s the same if I tell you,” Chu Yunfan said, “All the ancient prodigies return together in this life. Naturally, you also need cultivation resources. However, you cannot ask for too much. Otherwise, it will be a situation where both sides will suffer!”","Chu Yunfan knew that in the past, there had been ancient prodigies who had appeared. When the Flying Celestials were in a state where no one could suppress the disciples of this generation, there would also be ancient prodigies who had appeared out of nowhere.","After all, there were only a few prodigies in the world, and there were many forces competing for them. Coupled with all kinds of accidents, even the Flying Celestials had faced more than one situation in its long history.","However, at that time, only one or two prodigies returned. It did not affect the overall situation. It was the first time that so many top prodigies returned together.","Even the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials had never dealt with such a situation before, which was why they were silent on this issue.","“Then how do you want to split it?” Sima Longyun smiled at Chu Yunfan.","“Half,” Chu Yunfan said, ‘You can take half of the resources, but you have to leave half of the resources for us. Otherwise, once we fall out with each other, it will be ugly. After all, we are all fellow disciples, right?”","Chu Yunfan’s words made the true disciples nod. They naturally understood that they couldn’t ask for more. Although the number of ancient prodigies was far less than theirs, each of them was a big shot among big shots. The resources they needed were astronomical. Although half wasn’t enough for them, it was better than both sides suffering.","“Not a chance. You guys can only take a quarter at most.” Sima Longyun shook his head. “We’re not the only ones who have returned. The ancient prodigies of the other major powers are also returning. This is a world of great competition. In the Golden Era, we must have enough resources to fight bravely. If we’re strong, then the Flying Celestials is strong. The world in the future is not something you can understand!”","Sima Longyun’s words caused many of the true disciples to feel indignant. They had always been known as the pillars of the sect, when had they ever been looked down upon by others like this?","He simply did not take them seriously and belittled them as worthless. He said that they would be eliminated by the future great era war and the Golden Era.","Although they were far inferior to these ancient prodigies, they were not trash and could be bullied by others.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but shake his head when he heard this. He knew that Sima Longyun had his reasons, but he couldn’t accept it.","“Since you can’t convince me, then let’s see the truth. If you can defeat me, then we’ll do as you say. If I defeat you, then we’ll do as I say. How about it?”","Chu Yunfan said.","“Sure!” Sima Longyun nodded, but his eyes were filled with confidence. He did not believe that Chu Yunfan could defeat him.","In the Flying Celestial Alliance, his status and strength were second only to","Huangfu Longhao. Even if Chu Yunfan was rumored to be talented, he was still far from it.","Boom!","In an instant, the entire world shook violently as an incomparably terrifying fist blasted out. It was Sima Longyun who had taken the initiative to attack.","The moment he attacked, it was terrifying and peerless. It shook the entire Startling Cloud Peak. The fist force swept across, and the blood and energy in his body surged like a river, sweeping out like a tidal wave.","He didn’t hold back with this punch. He wanted to establish his might and let everyone know that the Flying Celestial Alliance couldn’t be disobeyed.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t move. He just flew into the air. His divine power surged like a dense immortal aura. His slender and strong figure stood in the air. His true appearance couldn’t be seen. Only his sharp eyes could be seen.","Bam!","Sima Longyun’s punch reached about three feet away from Chu Yunfan, but it was unable to penetrate any further. The entire sky was trembling, and the divine might was unmatched.","However, Chu Yunfan easily blocked this punch with his extremely dense divine power.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and punched out. His fist landed on Sima Lingyun’s fist.","Crack!","Accompanied by a crisp cracking sound, fresh blood splattered out. Sima Longyun’s entire arm, starting from his fist, exploded. In an instant, fresh blood splattered out, and bone flew everywhere.","Everything looked so bloody.","Sima Longyun kept retreating. He covered his wound and stared at Chu","Yunfan in disbelief. “l lost! I actually lost!”","With just one punch, he was crippled by Chu Yunfan. That terrifying fist force could tear everything apart. That feeling made him feel as if he had met Huangfu Longhao.","“How about it? Am I qualified to set rules?” Chu Yunfan said calmly.."]},{"number":2221,"title":"Chapter 2221: Who Agree, Who Opposes?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2221: Who Agree, Who Opposes?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s words echoed across Startling Cloud Peak, and everyone fell silent.","Everyone was stunned by Chu Yunfan’s aura.","Was he qualified to set rules?","Before this, no one thought that Chu Yunfan had the qualifications to do so. Even the true disciples only thought that if Chu Yunfan could speak up for them, at least not let these ancient prodigies swallow all the benefits.","As for those ancient prodigies, they didn’t even put Chu Yunfan in their eyes, thinking that he was just a junior Major Arcane.","It was indeed enough to crush all powerful enemies in this generation, but in front of them, it was still not enough.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so terrifying? He had severely injured Sima Longyun with a single punch. Although the two sides had not engaged in a large- scale battle, just this level of exchange had made them see how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","He was even stronger than Sima Longyun, who was second only to Huangfu Longhao. He could even be compared to Huangfu Longhao.","With such strength, Chu Yunfan was naturally qualified to set the rules.","At the thought of this, the expressions of many of the prodigies changed in an instant, and they gasped.","They wanted to know how Chu Yunfan had cultivated. Although they were all representatives of the younger generation, there were still differences between those in the younger generation. Chu Yunfan was not even a hundred years old. He had only cultivated for a few decades, yet he had already reached a level that they could reach after cultivating for a hundred years. He had even surpassed them and needed them to look up to him.","No matter how one looked at it, it was a miracle!","One had to know that they were not ordinary people. Any one of them they casually caught was a peerless prodigy that was one in a billion.","With their cultivation speed, they were naturally the best of their generation. Now, they had been slapped in the face by Chu Yunfan.","Not only was Chu Yunfan stronger than them now, but it also meant that Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed would only get faster and faster in the future, and his strength would only get stronger and stronger. “He’s comparable to Huangfu Longhao!”","Someone could not help but have such a thought.","With the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, wasn’t he comparable to Huangfu Longhao?","What made many people gasp was that the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed was undoubtedly not just that of a top-notch prodigy.","It was that of a Supreme Youth!","The Flying Celestials had another Supreme Youth after Huangfu Longhao!","The way everyone looked at Chu Yunfan completely changed. Although they were also elites and belonged to the minority, there were still hundreds of them over the years. However, a Supreme Youth was different. Over the years, only Huangfu Longhao had appeared.","Now, there was Chu Yunfan.","As for Chu Hongcai, his strength was still far from enough. Even his status as a Supreme Youth had yet to be fully acknowledged.","Any Supreme Youth who could be recognized and widely known was not only because of his outstanding physique and shocking talent but also because he had fought many battles to obtain an invincible status.","It wasn’t created out of thin air!","At this moment, their expressions were extremely solemn and even a little excited. Although they were domineering, they were still disciples of the","Flying Celestials. Naturally, they understood what it meant for the Flying Celestials to have another Supreme Youth.","In the future, the one who could truly reach the peak was a Supreme Youth. With one more in the Flying Celestials, their future strength would also double.","Of course, the most important thing was that they couldn’t beat Chu Yunfan now. It was only natural that whoever fought would have the final say.","“You have the right to set the rules!” Sima Longyun stared at Chu Yunfan.","Others might not know, but he knew very well that Chu Yunfan was showing mercy. If it was a life-and-death battle, he might not even be able to withstand three moves and would be beaten to death by Chu Yunfan.","The difference in strength was too great.","In fact, he felt that the gap between him and Huangfu Longhao was even greater.","However, he threw this thought out of his mind. In his heart, Huangfu","Longhao was invincible. No one could match him. Chu Yunfan being able to stand on par with Huangfu Longhao was already a very impressive evaluation. As for surpassing Huangfu Longhao, that was simply impossible.","“In that case, I’ll set a rule. Starting today, each of you will get half of the resources. You must have enough resources to cultivate. In the future, you will compete with the heroes of the world. However, we, the current true disciples, also need enough resources to cultivate,” Chu Yunfan said, “Now that I have set this rule, who agrees and who objects?”","Who agreed? Who objected?","Everyone looked at each other. Facing Chu Yunfan who was so powerful, they naturally did not dare to say anything more. Although it was not the most satisfactory result, it was still an acceptable result.","“You can make the decisions, Senior Chu!” the true disciples all spoke up. What Chu Yunfan had fought for them was much better than what they had originally thought, so there was naturally nothing to be dissatisfied with.","“We have no objections either!”","Naturally, the ancient prodigies did not dare to make a fuss. After all, even Sima Longyun had lost an arm with a single punch. Just thinking about it now made them feel a chill down their spines.","“In that case, let’s disperse and go cultivate. A storm is about to come. The real world of great competition has just begun!” Chu Yunfan waved.","Following that, the ancient prodigies left one after another. However, their expressions were dark. After all, they had come in high spirits and returned in disappointment.","The true disciples left excitedly.","This battle had undoubtedly made them feel extremely proud and elated. It was an unprecedented feeling.","After sending everyone off, Chu Yunfan announced that he was going to seal off Startling Cloud Peak. This was because he had to seize the time to break through to the Major Arcana Stage.","Just as he said earlier, he had sensed that a storm was brewing. The battle between the old and the new was essentially a battle of interests, and the battle of interests was the real thing that could be adjusted. There were only so many resources in the world. The more you got, the less others got. It was as simple as that.","It was impossible for the current factions to give in to the problem of survival, and the ancient factions would have to establish themselves in the current era and develop again. The resources needed were astronomical.","The internal competition of the Flying Celestials was just the tip of the iceberg. It was just a small competition.","When the time came, everything would explode, and it would even cause the major factions in the world to reshuffle.","Chu Yunfan had to have the strength to protect himself before things got out of hand.","Although the Flying Celestials were powerful and had a deep foundation, they had become the target of public criticism. They had to make preparations early.."]},{"number":2222,"title":"Chapter 2222: A Year, a Storm Is Coming","paragraphs":["Chapter 2222: A Year, a Storm Is Coming","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan announced that he would seal the mountain and keep a low profile. He was prepared to break through to a higher stage while guiding Chu Hongcai to break through.","However, the storm that he had just caused had just started. The battle between Chu Yunfan and Sima Longyun shocked everyone on the ground.","Before this, although Chu Yunfan had returned, under the contrast of the glory of many ancient prodigies, he naturally did not shine as brightly as before.","In the eyes of many people, no matter how powerful he was, he was just one of the many prodigies.","He was no longer as trustworthy as before.","However, no one expected that Chu Yunfan would first defeat Wu Wenbin in one battle, and then severely injure Sima Longyun in another battle.","According to the speculations of those who had their eyes on him, he was at least a peak Major Arcane.","Thinking back to when he first entered the sect more than 20 years ago, he was only an ordinary inner disciple. His strength soared like a rocket.","“What is this meteoric rise? He’s practically soaring to the heavens in one step!” someone said in surprise.","“l thought that Chu Hongcai was already incredible, the first on the Prodigy List. Who knew that Chu Yunfan would be so terrifying!","“But that’s true. Chu Hongcai is his disciple. If his disciple is already so powerful, then wouldn’t he be even more terrifying?”","After such a long time, everyone also knew that above prodigies and top-notch prodigies, there were the Supreme Youths.","However, the Flying Celestials originally only had Huangfu Longhao, and now there was another Chu Yunfan.","“So Senior Chu is actually a Supreme Youth. No wonder his cultivation speed is so terrifying!’","“That’s right. A Supreme Youth is a seedling emperor. These people can become emperors in the future!”","“l heard that there were some ancient prodigies who came looking for Senior Huangfu, but they were chased out by him. Senior Huangfu is broad-minded and talented. Naturally, he doesn’t agree to take all our resources. That’s like","draining the pond to catch the fish.”","Everyone was discussing animatedly, but at least they found a reliable explanation for Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed. Supreme Youths were indeed extraordinary—a super prodigy that could not be found in several eras.","However, after Chu Yunfan stood up, the originally hostile atmosphere between the two sides subsided. The interests and resources were divided equally, and each had their dividing line. They no longer suppressed each other.","In addition, Huangfu Longhao unexpectedly chose to support Chu Yunfan’s opinion, so that both sides would restrain themselves and not harass each other.","This disappointed many people who had ulterior motives and hoped that the two Supreme Youths would collide.","However, the upper echelons of the Flying Celestials heaved a sigh of relief at this peaceful situation. Just as many people had thought, the speculation of the upper echelons that they had left this matter alone was not entirely correct.","Although the upper echelons of the Flying Celestials had a headache over these ancient prodigies, they did not completely ignore them.","However, they were too busy taking care of themselves. After the return of the ancient factions, the various factions could be said to be in turmoil. Under the protection of the Flying Celestials, many true disciples and ancient prodigies did not feel the huge pressure from the outside. They still had the mood to compete for various benefits.","However, the higher-ups of the Flying Celestials felt immense pressure. A storm was brewing.","As one of the top ten forces, the Flying Celestials naturally occupied one of the best and most resource-rich places in the world. And now, because of this, they naturally became the target of public criticism.","All of this made them unable to take care of themselves. The various elders went to various places to resist the invasion of the ancient forces.","The Flying Celestials’ actions were just a miniature of the chaos happening throughout the world.","For an entire year, all the forces in the world that could make a move began to mobilize their troops.","All the troops of Grand Xia canceled their holidays and entered a state of war alert. Experts from all sides appeared, and the experts of the Imperial Court were sent to various places.","Even the top ten sects were on high alert. The other small and medium-sized forces were on high alert. If there was any movement, they would immediately seal the mountain to protect themselves.","Outside of Grand Xia, the Hus, barbarians, demons, marine folks, and many other ancient races had also returned. In fact, an extremely cruel war for the throne had erupted.","There were also a large number of experts who chose to seal themselves.","Similarly, bloody battles were inevitable.","Faced with the current world’s three major powers, the ancient powers were also constantly taking action. All kinds of conflicts were endless, and it looked like they were about to erupt into a full-scale conflict.","Everyone was prepared for the battle. The ordinary people were even more worried. However, they had no right to speak in this place. They could only wait passively.","Within Grand Xia, all sorts of opinions were getting more and more unyielding by the day.","“Grand Xia is not afraid of any challenge. Anyone who tries to challenge the order of the world will be suppressed by the Grand Xia Army!” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia spoke first as if he was warning these ancient powers.","After the Grand Commandant of Grand Xia, the king sent out an unprecedented invitation, requesting that all the ancient powers of the Central Plains send representatives to the capital to discuss the future of the world.","For a time, the world’s attention was focused.","At the gathering, all eyes in the world were focused on the Imperial Capital.","Faced with the kings almost command-like request, some of the ancient forces were watching, some were disdainful, and at the same time, some sent representatives to the capital.","Among them, the powerful ones did not care about the orders of the current king. Among them, there were many forces from the previous dynasty who were ambitious and wanted to restore the rule of the previous dynasty.","Naturally, they did not like the current king and saw him as a great enemy.","There were also some people who took a wait-and-see attitude toward the kings orders. They did not believe in the kings credibility, while the other small forces headed to the Imperial City as soon as possible.","Although they were all ancient forces, they were clearly divided into strong and weak forces, and each of them had different requirements.","The major factions in the world were also asked to send representatives to the Imperial Capital in person to discuss and resolve the issue of the factions’ demands.","For a time, the situation that was originally filled with smoke and was about to erupt into a shocking battle was completely suppressed by a single sentence from the king.","At this time, everyone once again realized that in the nine regions, the real number one in the world was not the Destiny Sect, but the Grand Xia imperial family. It was just that the imperial family usually did not do things in a high-profile manner and hid behind Grand Xia, so many people ignored them.","They were the true rulers of this world, the true rulers of Grand Xia.","Rain was coming, and the wind was blowing!"]},{"number":2223,"title":"Chapter 2223: Breakthrough, Major Arcana Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2223: Breakthrough, Major Arcana Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Outside, a storm was brewing. At the same time, Chu Yunfan’s breakthrough had reached the most critical moment.","This breakthrough was not easy for Chu Yunfan. If he only wanted to break through, then it would be very easy for Chu Yunfan.","To him, breaking through to the Major Arcana Stage wasn’t difficult at all.","What was truly difficult was to deduce his battle prowess to a deeper level.","It was enough to fight against a Major Arcane and above expert, a Divine Treasure, which came between Domainians.","An expert who cultivated to this realm had completely excavated their potential, and they themselves were a precious divine treasure.","A person was a small universe, a small world.","Cultivators at this level were extremely terrifying. If it was said that a Major Arcane would still learn how to borrow the powers of the world to cultivate, then an expert at the Divine Treasure Stage was a completely different matter. By fusing the powers of the world into their bodies, they were no longer borrowing power.","On the contrary, it was completely turning the power of heaven and earth into their power.","This was a further concept. To fight against such a powerful being, it was impossible for a Major Arcane to do so under normal circumstances.","One was to turn the power of heaven and earth into one’s power, while the other was to borrow the power of heaven and earth. There was a difference between the two in essence.","The difference between this and the previous cultivation was that before, one was digging out one’s own potential. Now, after the potential was dug out to the limit, they would use the power of heaven and earth to help themselves break through the limit and develop the treasures in their body.","This was something that could only be done after one had an extremely deep understanding of the power of heaven and earth.","Therefore, for a Major Arcane, it was undoubtedly an extremely difficult task to break through to the Divine Treasure Stage. And for Chu Yunfan, the difficulty of breaking through was ten times harder than that of an ordinary Major Arcane.","Even someone as powerful as Chu Yunfan had to think twice before breaking through.","Within the Mountain River Diagram, Chu Yunfan was sitting in the air, motionless.","In his mind, the godhead kept flashing with shocking light, deepening his understanding of the Great Dao.","At the same time, he began to draw the power of laws from heaven and earth into his body. The first to surge in were the law of lightning and the law of fire.","These laws were absorbed into Chu Yunfan’s body in a semi-transparent manner.","This was the biggest difference between the Divine Treasure Stage and the","Arcana Stage. Arcanes could only borrow the power of laws, while Divine Treasures could integrate the power of laws into their body. The more laws integrated into one’s body, the stronger one would be.","Generally speaking, as long as one could conclude a law, one would be considered to have stepped into the Divine Treasure Stage.","And the more laws that were induced, the more powerful the person was. Although they were both in the Divine Treasure Stage, some people had only induced one law, while others had induced hundreds or thousands of them. The difference between them was like heaven and earth.","The gap between them was perhaps even greater than the gap between the beginning of cultivation and the Divine Treasure Stage.","As for Chu Yunfan, he had already begun to summarize laws in the Arcana Stage. It was almost impossible to do. He didn’t even dare to think about it.","However, with the existence of his godhead, he was actually doing such a heaven-defying thing to the other Great Dao, which was far beyond the Major Arcana Stage, and even far beyond the ordinary Divine Treasure Stage.","His body contained three completely different emperor physiques at the same time, which were the source of his strength. At the core of a ball of lightning power and a ball of fire was a ball of golden law power that was forming. It was the law that evolved from his Imperial Physique.","Originally, Chu Yunfan wanted to master them one by one, but he realized that it was impossible because the three different emperor physiques had already fused together in his body and could not be separated.","It was impossible to condense laws one by one.","He could only condense three kinds of laws at the same time, and the combination of three kinds of laws was the most stable result. Only in this way could he start to integrate the laws into his body at the Arcana Stage.","This was something that no one had ever done since ancient times, so Chu Yunfan was very careful. Once he succeeded, he would create history and break the limits of cultivation, although no one might know about it in the future.","Suddenly, after an unknown period, the three balls of law power were sorted out in his body and evolved into three streaks of law power. Although these three streaks of law powers were still quite small, about the size of a thread.","However, these three threads intertwined with each other and fused into a brand new law.","The trinity was inseparable. The laws contained a terrifying power that could change the world.","“Hah!”","Chu Yunfan shouted, and the Mountain River Diagram began to fluctuate violently. In the distance, countless high-grade spirit stones flew over and turned into dust. The spirit energy in them poured into Chu Yunfan’s body.","At the same time, Chu Yunfan felt that the dry cells in his body began to recover at an amazing speed under the nourishment of the spirit energy. They kept breaking through their limits and reached an even more amazing level. ‘I’ve finally broken through to the Major Arcana Stage!’ Chu Yunfan thought.","That was right, he was only a Major Arcane. However, he had already condensed laws within his body, turning the laws of the world into something he could use.","Even though he was still a Major Arcane, his cultivation base was vastly different from a Major Arcane.","“No wonder they say that only those who have stepped into the Divine Treasure Stage and truly mastered their physical strength are truly accomplished experts! ”","Chu Yunfan finally understood what it meant to attain Dao. In his current state, he had attained Dao and obtained the Great Dao. Of course, he had only obtained a strand of the Great Dao.","However, his original state was completely different. This was another shocking leap in his life level. He had become a mythical creature and not an ordinary creature.","With his current combat strength, if he met Jun Tianci again, he could blow","Jun Tianci to death with a single breath.","This was how domineering and powerful he was!","Only those who had cultivated to the Divine Treasure Stage could be considered to have stepped into the ranks of the experts of the present age. They had advanced from the middle level to the upper level. Compared to ordinary experts who had just entered the Divine Treasure Stage, Chu Yunfan was several times stronger. It could be said that he could kill an ordinary expert who had just entered the Divine Treasure Stage with one punch.","Even if a Supreme Youth had stepped into the Divine Treasure Stage, they would not be Chu Yunfan’s match.","Every cell was bursting with terrifying power, so strong that it was explosive.."]},{"number":2224,"title":"Chapter 2224: The World Is Changing","paragraphs":["Chapter 2224: The World Is Changing","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“With this cultivation, I would’ve been conferred the title of marquis in ancient times!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","He knew from the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that in ancient times, the titles of marquis, king, and emperor weren’t like now. They were titles of nobility in the mortal world and proof of strength.","Below the Divine Treasure Stage, they were only ordinary people and were not qualified to leave their names in history. Only those who had cultivated to the Divine Treasure Stage were qualified to be conferred the title of marquis. With all kinds of titles, they could sweep across a region and become a marquis.","Above them were the kings who led these marquis. Each of them was a top-notch expert in the world.","Amongst these kings, there would usually only be a peerless emperor who could rule an era and truly stand at the peak.","Although Chu Yunfan was still far away from becoming an emperor, he had taken another step forward. Even in ancient times, when there were many powerful people, he could still be a marquis and rule a region.","At this level, he was even qualified to be the sect master of a behemoth like the Flying Celestials.","Even in the difficult times of the Flying Celestials, there were many cases where Divine Treasures succeeded the sect master. It was conceivable that such experts were not ordinary in the current Great Era.","What Chu Yunfan did not know was that while he was in seclusion, the world","had undergone earth-shaking changes.","The grudges between the ancient forces and the current forces were like fire and water. At this time, it was finally time to resolve them.","The representatives of countless forces entered the capital one after another. The Human King had finally called for the Grand Meeting of Heaven. This was a closed-door meeting, and no one knew the exact location of this meeting.","There were even rumors that this closed-door meeting was held in the endless starry sky.","This was because those attending the conference were all major figures of their respective regions. Once they erupted, the Central Plains would be plunged into misery and suffering.","All sorts of rumors spread. It was said that the various titans who had arrived had fought and destroyed several parts of the starry sky, shattering many stars. Even in the Central Plains, there were people who had seen dazzling stars suddenly explode in the middle of the night, then disappear in an extremely short time.","Many people had received the news that the various powerhouses were fighting. Their strength was terrifying. Later on, it was said that they had used many hidden trump cards, even the trump cards of emperors.","Only then did the stars explode.","This closed-door meeting lasted for three days and three nights before it finally ended. The experts from all sides returned one after another, but no one knew what the outcome of this closed-door meeting was.","The various forces were all filled with anger as if they did not get what they wanted.","“It’s said that in the end, it was the Human King who dominated the entire scene. His cultivation base was earth-shattering. There were always rumors that the Elder Princess was the number one expert of the current Grand Xia imperial family. But now, it seems that that’s impossible!”","“If the Human King didn’t have some skills, how could he suppress so many experts in the world? It’s just that no one expected the Human King to be so powerful. He fought a group of people alone and actually defeated those old antiques and monsters!”","“An old monster from the end of the ancient era said that the strength and talent of the Human King are extremely terrifying. If it was in the ancient era, there was even the possibility of him being an emperor!”","For a time, all kinds of news spread everywhere. Among the many news, it was not only about the tyranny of the ancient forces, although there were many extremely tyrannical old monsters among the ancient forces.","However, there were also a few invincible experts in the world.","The Elder Princess, the Human King, the Grand Xia Grand Commandant, the","Grand Xia Prime Minister, and other top experts all attacked together. Each of them was an existence that could fight a group of people. Each of them shocked the world.","It took several months for this war that could destroy the world to turn into a meeting.","As soon as Chu Yunfan came out of seclusion, he was summoned by Situ Xuan.","Although Chu Yunfan was a little puzzled, he still went to visit Situ Xuan immediately. However, he did not expect to see another tall man with an unfathomable aura beside Situ Xuan. Chu Yunfan looked at him and saw that it was Huangfu Longhao.","Obviously, Huangfu Longhao had also received Situ Xuan’s message and rushed over.","Since Situ Xuan hadn’t arrived yet, the two of them started chatting.","“Junior Chu, I’ve heard a lot about you!” Huangfu Longhao smiled. He didn’t seem to have any ill feelings from what happened with Sima Longyun.","Chu Yunfan had a good impression of Huangfu Longhao. Although Huangfu Longhao was extremely domineering to outsiders, as long as he recognized someone as one of his own, he would treat them with sincerity. Even Chu Yunfan was impressed.","“Senior Huangfu, I’ve heard a lot about you!” Chu Yunfan said.","“You are unfathomable, Junior Chu!” Huangfu Longhao looked at Chu Yunfan. He could feel that Chu Yunfan was only a Major Arcane. However, his instincts told him that Chu Yunfan was not that simple. In fact, he even felt threatened.","However, he soon understood what was going on. He knew how Sima Longyun had lost. Without a doubt, Sima Longyun was a peak Major Arcane, but Chu","Yunfan was still above him.","“Senior Huangfu, you flatter me. However, congratulations on your improvement!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Hahahaha, you saw through me!” Huangfu Longhao’s eyes flashed with surprise. “You are indeed strong, Junior Chu!”","Although he had broken through, he did not reveal a trace of his aura. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to tell with a glance.","He had indeed stepped into the Divine Treasure Stage and had already condensed his first law.","“Hahahahaha, I was lucky to see through it!” Chu Yunfan laughed. Huangfu Longhao’s aura was concealed very well. If he had not condensed his own laws, he would not have been able to see through the fluctuations of the laws.","He was not surprised by Huangfu Longhao’s breakthrough at all. Huangfu Longhao could have broken through long ago. If not for the fact that he had to stay in the Prodigy Battlefield and suppress his cultivation, he would have long broken through to a higher stage.","With his many years of foundation, breaking through was a matter of course.","It was not strange at all.","“It seems that you have also gained a lot, Junior Chu. From now on, the Flying Celestials will stillrely on you and me to protect it!” Huangfu Long laughed heartily. He wasn’t sure about Chu Yunfan’s strength, but he could tell that even he, who was in the Divine Treasure Stage, couldn’t see through Chu Yunfan’s cultivation. His cultivation had probably improved greatly, but he didn’t know what stage he had reached.","However, he was not jealous. He was very magnanimous.."]},{"number":2225,"title":"Chapter 2225: A Childish Decision","paragraphs":["Chapter 2225: A Childish Decision","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In Huangfu Longhao’s opinion, the stronger Chu Yunfan was, the better it would be for the Flying Celestials’ future.","As for the possibility that Chu Yunfan might become a threat to him in the future, Huangfu Longhao had never thought about it.","After all, he had received some information about Chu Yunfan. From the information, he could see that Chu Yunfan had no intention of fighting for power.","Huangfu Longhao had nothing to fear even if he was fighting for power. The person who could guide the future of the Flying Celestials must be the strongest among them. He was confident that he would be the strongest.","He was even known as a prodigy who could stand shoulder to shoulder with the Flying Celestials’ founder. Naturally, he wasn’t afraid of competition and comparison.","However, he did not know how powerful Chu Yunfan was. Even though he had already entered the Divine Treasure Stage, he was still no match for Chu","Yunfan.","Of course, Chu Yunfan didn’t say much.","“Senior Huangfu, do you know why the sect master has summoned us?” Chu Yunfan asked.","“It should be related to the return of those ancient forces!” Huangfu Longhao frowned. “At this moment, it can be said that a storm is coming. Those old fellows want to make a move!”","Chu Yunfan naturally knew that the old guys Huangfu Longhao was talking about were the experts behind the scenes of the ancient forces. They could not ?help but make a move.","Some time ago, many forces had been uprooted by them.","The forces that had been rooted in the area for hundreds or thousands of years were wiped out overnight. Then, they casually entered and opened their gates to recruit disciples wantonly. It seemed that they had the intention of developing again in the current era.","Although only a few radical forces did this, it was a very bad start. Many forces were eager to imitate them. After all, although these ancient forces were powerful and the experts behind them were stronger than one another, they were like rootless duckweed. Their original sects and forces had long been annihilated in the long river of history.","The remaining people were just the remnants of the surviving evil. If they were not careful, they would die and their sect would be destroyed.","This made these people have no choice but to be particularly radical.","Anyone with a little bit of consciousness could sense that an unprecedented storm of change was about to strike.","“l just don’t know what was discussed in this closed-door meeting!” Chu","Yunfan said.","Huangfu Longhao wasn’t sure about this either. The closed-door meeting was of such a high standard that even with the Flying Celestials’ massive strength, only three representatives could attend. If the other sects could send a representative, they would be considered as a first-rate force.","Even Chu Yunfan and Huangfu Longhao were not qualified to know what had happened. At this moment, the two of them represented the new and old disciples.","They were the head figures of the sect!","“You two don’t need to guess anymore!”","All of a sudden, there was a spatial fluctuation in the air. A figure appeared before the two of them. The two of them took a look and saw that it was Situ","Xuan.","“Greetings, Sect Master!” The two of them bowed.","Situ Xuan did not stand on ceremony with the two of them. He sat on the main seat and said, “l called the two of you here because it’s an urgent matter, so I did not inform you in advance! If the two of you have any questions, go ahead and ask them!”","“Sect Master, is this meeting related to the closed-door meeting?” Huangfu Longhao asked.","“Correct!” Situ Xuan said solemnly, “l called you here because of the closed-door meeting!’","As Situ Xuan explained, Chu Yunfan and Huangfu Longhao finally knew what had happened during the closed-door meeting. The representatives of various forces fought, and each of them was a top expert of the world. They even used forbidden methods. The more they fought, the more they lost control. In the end, they even exploded the stars. It was extremely terrifying.","In the end, if it wasn’t for the Human King making a move and stabilizing the situation, the old and new sides would probably have fought to the death.","But even so, the forces of the current era were able to gain some advantage, and in the end, they came a basic condition.","“Let the young prodigies decide who wins and who loses?” Huangfu Longhao’s eyes widened. “Isn’t that too childish?!”","Chu Yunfan was also a little stunned. From Situ Xuan’s words, it seemed that the closed-door meeting had only discussed one method, which was to let the young prodigies compete.","If the young prodigies of the ancient forces won, they could take over the territory and resources of the current forces. On the other hand, the ancient forces had to leave unconditionally and could not continue to pester them if defeated.","All the victories and defeats were placed on the younger generation.","Even Chu Yunfan was speechless when he heard this. He felt that this was really childish.","“Childish? Do you think this is child’s play?” Situ Xuan smiled bitterly. “But if not for this childish method, what should we do? Kill them until they die, blood flowing like rivers, and cause the end of the world?”","At this moment, the two of them finally understood why they had made such a seemingly childish decision in the end. It was because they had no choice.","Regardless of whether it was the new or old forces, they were all seeking development, not destroying the entire world.","At the end of the Ancient Zenith Age, the emperors attacked and destroyed the world. Even if it was only recorded in some ancient books, it was enough to make people shudder.","Therefore, they could not allow the situation in the world to develop in this direction.","“His Majesty is helpless. Grand Xia might seem powerful and occupy the wealthiest land in the Central Plains, but if you look around, to the west are the demi-humans, who are irreconcilable enemies of the humans. To the east are the marine folks, who live in the depths of the sea and have a unique civilization. To the north and south, there are barbarians and beasts, and there are even otherworldly demons eyeing us covetously. It can be said that danger lurks everywhere. If we fight until the heavens collapse and the earth shatter, who will benefit the most? In any case, the ones who will suffer the most in the end will definitely be us humans!” Situ Xuan was truly helpless.","Chu Yunfan and Huangfu Longhao both looked solemn, especially Chu","Yunfan. On Earth, all kinds of races were collectively referred to as humans. After the Great Calamity Era, although most of them were Chinese and people from other races survived, there was no longer any distinction between races.","But in the Central Plains, it was completely different. Although the Hus of the north and the barbarians of the south were humans, in the eyes of the people of Grand Xia, they were nothing more than beasts standing on two legs.."]},{"number":2226,"title":"Chapter 2226: Time Fragment Crystal","paragraphs":["Chapter 2226: Time Fragment Crystal","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","According to what Chu Yunfan knew, whether it was the Hus in the north or the barbarians in the south, they were all split from the humans of the Central Plains. They could even be traced back to the end of the ancient times. However, these humans believed in all kinds of evil gods and demon gods, developing their own unique civilization and completely separating themselves from the Central Plains.","In the eyes of the humans of the Central Plains, these people were no different from beasts.","Every year, large and small conflicts broke out at the border. The Hus and barbarian sent people deep into Grand Xia to kidnap women and children. The women were used as reproductive tools, and the children were brainwashed into followers.","The hatred between the two sides was irreconcilable, and it was a battle between civilization and barbarism.","Although they were barbaric, these two races that had split from the human race had developed a unique cultivation system. They were also the great enemies of mankind.","Grand Xia was usually unrivalled and was more than enough to deal with four powerful enemies at the same time. However, if they were to fall out with those ancient powers and fight to the death, it would only benefit the foreign races.","This was a helpless move!","This was because the strength of the major factions in the current era did not occupy an overwhelming advantage compared to those ancient factions. There were a terrifying number of old monsters among the ancient factions who had sealed themselves to the current era.","Even if there was a king in the world, an existence like the Elder Princess who could fight a group of people alone had no choice but to make concessions on this issue.","“Therefore, whether or not the Flying Celestials can maintain this foundation is all up to you!” Situ Xuan looked at the two of them. “Among them, there are already a few famous forces in ancient times who have made demands on the Flying Celestials. At that time, they will send their Supreme Youths. You two will face tough battles!”","Situ Xuan’s words made Chu Yunfan understand why Situ Xuan had summoned the two of them. It was because the two of them were considered the best of the Flying Celestials’ disciples, and the survival of the Flying Celestials now depended on them.","The forces that had proposed the foundation of the Flying Celestials were probably not ordinary people. The Flying Celestials had been established for many years, but in the long river of time, it was not too long.","Before this foundation fell into the hands of the Flying Celestials, there had been many masters. However, as time passed, those masters were all destroyed in the river of time.","And now, those masters had returned and demanded to reclaim the foundation that belonged to them. This was a great battle that could not be backed down.","Once they lost, according to the result of the negotiations, the Flying Celestials would have to give up their foundation and find another place to regroup.","This wasn’t as simple as changing locations. The Flying Celestials had been built over countless years. It could defend itself even when faced with an army’s attack. The sect had opened up countless spaces. There were also various formations, barriers, and spirit veins. All of these had been nurtured over countless years. It occupied more than half of the Flying Celestials’ strength.","Once they lost this foundation, even if all the records personnel were there, the losses would be enough to cause the Flying Celestials to suffer a great loss.","Who knew how long it would take for them to recover, let alone find another blessed land that was comparable to the Flying Celestials.","After all, all the sacred caves and blessed lands in the world had long been divided up. Such top-notch sacred caves and blessed lands had either long declined or were in the hands of a behemoth that was on par with the Flying Celestials.","It was not that easy to find another one. The final result would most likely be that the Flying Celestials would not be able to keep up with the resources and would decline from then on.","Huangfu Longhao’s expression was grave. The Flying Celestials was a powerful existence. Those forces that dared to attack the Flying Celestials must have a powerful background. In history, they might not be weaker than the Flying Celestials, or even stronger.","In terms of overall strength, the Flying Celestials had the upper hand. However, when the scope was narrowed down to the younger generation, the gap between the two sides was suddenly reduced to an extremely dangerous level.","Even if each of these forces only sent out one Supreme Youth, it would be enough to sweep away all the powerful enemies. This kind of condition was even more disadvantageous to the forces of the current era.","Being forced to agree to such conditions, one could imagine how dangerous the situation was during the closed door meeting.","“There’s still a month left before the battle. Everyone is making their preparations. It will definitely be a bloody battle, and everyone’s strength will be greatly improved!” Situ Xuan said, “I also know that the purpose of you sealing yourself in this life is for the hope of becoming a god. I don’t know if a godhead will appear in this life, but we have left some good things for you to accelerate your strength growth. Your strength is still too weak! ”","Situ Xuan looked at Huangfu Longhao and Chu Yunfan. The two of them were the last hope of the Flying Celestials. However, in Situ Xuan’s eyes, their strength was still far from enough. Although they could dominate the younger generation, they were still a little lacking in front of the many top-notch experts in the world. There was not much time left for them to grow, so they had to use some special methods.","“Yes, sir!” Huangfu Longhao’s expression was calm. He had already expected this. If they had relied on their natural cultivation, it would have taken them a long time to reach their current level of cultivation. The Prodigy Battlefield was such a fortuitous encounter.","With the Flying Celestials’ foundation and strength, they naturally had other trump cards that could allow them to grow rapidly.","“In the next month, the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm will be open to you!’","Situ Xuan said, “l hope you won’t let down the sect’s painstaking efforts!”","“The Flying Celestial Mystic Realm?” Huangfu Longhao’s eyes flashed with excitement as if he had heard something extraordinary.","Chu Yunfan was a little curious. What exactly was this Flying Celestial Mystic Realm? He had never heard of it.","Seeing Chu Yunfan’s puzzled look, Situ Xuan said, ‘Yunfan, you’ve only joined the sect for a short time, so it’s normal that you don’t know about the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm. It’s a cultivation mystic realm in the Flying Celestials base. There are time fragment crystals inside, so time is different from the outside world. The closer you are to the center of the mystic realm, the faster time flows. However, even in the outermost area of the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, a month in the outside world is equivalent to a year inside!”","“Time fragment crystals?” Chu Yunfan’s eyes widened. Although he didn’t know about the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, his familiarity with the secrets of heaven and earth was unparalleled.","After all, he had the memories of the Alchemy Emperor and the Mighty","Emperor Battle Book.."]},{"number":2227,"title":"Chapter 2227: Entering the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan knew about time fragment crystals. He had seen them once in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories. But even in the ancient times, time fragment crystals were extremely precious items.","Legend had it that when the world was first created, there was a huge explosion. Heaven and Earth were separated and formed in the chaos. Time and space were formed in it.","Most of them had fused with the world and turned into spacetime, but there were some that had formed fragments and crystals that remained in the world.","No one knew how many secrets there were. Even for experts at the level of the emperors, time was still a supreme secret. Among the emperors, there were more than one or two who studied time law in order to live forever. However, no one succeeded in the end. However, it could be seen that time and space were the most fundamental laws in the world.","Spatial fragments were relatively common, and many planes were formed in this way. Even the Mountain River Diagram in Chu Yunfan’s hand was a magic treasure refined by the Alchemy Emperor using spatial fragments, so it could block out all deductions and traces.","That was because it was equivalent to another small world. All the laws had taken shape and were completely different. Naturally, they could not be deduced.","Of course, this was only relative to the rare time fragment crystals. In ancient times, only emperors were qualified to obtain these treasures.","If it wasn’t for the fact that they were experts at the level of emperors, they would have been children with precious treasures in ancient times, and would have been killed.","However, in the current world, the Flying Celestials and other such giants would not be able to snatch it away.","It was not strange that cultivation mystic realms cultivated with time fragments were very common in ancient times. The ancient emperors became emperors in just a few decades. Could it be that their talents were much stronger than those of today?","Of course not. There were many people who had the physique of an emperor in this world. In terms of physique and talent, they were not inferior to the ancient emperors. The difference was the difference between various resources, especially the time fragments. Those emperors seemed to be only dozens of years old, but in fact, they had cultivated in the secret realm for countless years. Only then could they amaze the world in the shortest time.","“That’s right. Time fragment crystals. However, we don’t usually open the mystic realm because every time we open it, we need to spend an astronomical amount of resources and wealth. Even with the wealth of the Flying Celestials, we can’t use it as a regular method!” Situ Xuan said, “Every time it opens, a portion of the time fragment crystals will be consumed. Unless it’s absolutely necessary, we won’t open it. However, it’s different this time because it concerns the life and death of the Flying Celestials. Naturally, we can’t care so much!”","Chu Yunfan immediately nodded. A secret realm that involved time would definitely consume an astronomical amount of resources. Moreover, the more people entered, the more resources would be consumed, and the more time fragment crystals would be consumed.","“However, there will be some others who will also obtain the qualifications to enter the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm to cultivate besides you,” Situ Xuan said, “Other than you, there are also those ancient prodigies and a few prodigies that I have high hopes for. To you, your talent and physique are the best in the world. The Flying Celestials can provide you with cultivation resources, but what you lack the most is time. Now, I’ll make up for your last shortcoming!","“Don’t worry, sir. Those people are dreaming if they want to take away the foundation of the Flying Celestials!” Huangfu Longhao said.","“That’s for the best!” Situ Xuan said.","Soon, many prodigies, including the ancient prodigies, were secretly gathered in the depths of the Flying Celestials.","To Chu Yunfan’s surprise, other than him, there were three other people who had been selected for this secret training.","Other than him, there were also the current chief disciples, Yang Dengxian, Chu Hongcai, and Hua Xianyuan, who had joined the Flying Celestials with Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan immediately understood. The selection criteria for entering the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm should be an emperor physique. If one didn’t even have an emperor physique, then there was no need to waste resources.","If the same amount of resources were given to a normal prodigy and an emperor prodigy, the difference was like heaven and earth.","However, they were somewhat shocked. It was as if this was the first time they had heard that the Flying Celestials had such a mystic realm.","The few of them unconsciously moved closer to Chu Yunfan. Among these people, they only knew Chu Yunfan. In addition, the confrontation between the new and old disciples made them unconsciously unite around Chu Yunfan.","“Brother Fan, I didn’t expect that there would be such a good thing in the Flying Celestials!” Chu Hongcai said excitedly.","Yang Dengxian and Hua Xianyuan also looked excited. After the return of these ancient prodigies, all of their glory was taken away.","Under these prodigies, they had lost all their light. What they lacked was cultivation time. Now, they finally had the chance to make up for it.","The ancient prodigies were also excited. Clearly, they more or less understood what the opening of the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm meant.","“After we enter the mystic realm, follow me!” Chu Yunfan said.","“Yes!” Chu Hongcai nodded. Although he didn’t know why Chu Yunfan said that, he was used to listening to Chu Yunfan’s orders.","Chu Yunfan looked forward. In the boundless fog, a huge array appeared in front of his eyes. From the patterns of the array, Chu Yunfan could determine that it was a teleportation portal.","Without a doubt, the destination of this teleportation portal was the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm.","Suddenly, Sect Master Situ Xuan’s voice rang out from the sky.","“Prodigies, the opening of the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm is a rare opportunity for you. I hope you will seize this opportunity and work hard to cultivate to improve your cultivation. I won’t say anything more. You can go in now! ”","As soon as Situ Xuan finished speaking, the fog that enveloped everyone dissipated. Then, the portal appeared in front of everyone.","Immediately after, the patterns of the portal began to flash with light. In a short while, a light door formed in front of everyone.","“Let’s go!’","Someone shouted, and all of them streaked across the sky like meteors, turning into streaks of light and disappearing into this light door.","In just a moment, it had already disappeared without a trace.."]},{"number":2228,"title":"Chapter 2228: One Month","paragraphs":["Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As soon as he entered the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, Chu Yunfan discovered the difference in this mystic realm with the real world. Although it looked similar to the outside world, with beautiful mountains and rivers.","However, almost the moment he entered, he felt that time had been accelerated by ten times.","One had to know that ordinary people could not sense the passage of time. However, experts like them could clearly feel that the flow of time had changed the more profound their cultivation was.","Further away, the mountains and rivers were changing at an astonishing speed. The water was flowing at an even faster speed, almost like a flash flood.","However, it was not a flash flood, but a difference in the flow of time.","However, the flow of time was much slower where he was, so the flowing water there seemed like a torrent to Chu Yunfan.","Beside him, Chu Hongcai was already feeling uncomfortable. Among the people present, his cultivation was the lowest. He hadn’t even reached the Arcana Stage yet, but the time had suddenly sped up. The pressure on him was greater than the others, so he could only use his divine power to resist. On Chu Yunfan’s shoulder, the golden roc was also constantly looking left and right.","Almost everyone did not stop. They all headed deeper. This was because the flow of time was different. The faster the flow of time, the greater the pressure on their bodies.","If someone’s cultivation was not high enough or they did not have any tricks up their sleeves, they he would probably be crushed into pieces by the flow of time.","The most terrifying time fragment crystal that Chu Yunfan knew of had once caused an emperor to die of old age within three seconds.","Chu Yunfan couldn’t forget the scene he had seen. He took a deep breath. Although an emperor wasn’t a god and could live for a long time, his lifespan was still very long.","He died of old age within three seconds. One could imagine how many years that emperor had lived in that time fragment crystal.","Between life and death, there was great terror!","Although he saw it in the memory of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan still felt it deeply. If he hadn’t seen it with his own eyes, he wouldn’t have known that the flow of time could have such terrifying destructive power.","Once someone could grasp time law, then to others, it was an unsolvable existence. It was an existence that was even more terrifying than space law.","Among these people, Huangfu Longhao was naturally the one who had walked the furthest. His cultivation was not only the highest among them, but there was also a seal on his head that emitted waves of treasure light. It could be used to resist the passage of time and not be seriously injured.","The other young prodigies were similar. They each had their own methods that could resist the passage of time to different degrees.","The higher one’s cultivation was, the more shocking the time flow one could resist.","Huangfu Longhao’s current location was at least ten times faster than the outside world.","Every month could be used as a few years. The speed of time here could be imagined how shocking it was.","“Follow me!” As Chu Yunfan spoke, he grabbed Chu Hongcai and arrived at the depths of the mystic realm in a flash. He passed Huangfu Longhao and arrived at an area where time flowed at a hundred times the speed.","At the same time, above his head, the Mountain River Cauldron was emitting a faint light, protecting Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai, and the golden roc from being affected by the flow of time.","When Huangfu Longhao saw this scene from afar, he could not help but be surprised. Among the many young prodigies, his strength was the strongest. Therefore, he could walk the furthest. The others could not get close to where he was.","There was only one outcome if someone tried to get close, and that was to die without a burial place.","However, Chu Yunfan could bring people to an area where the flow rate was 100 times faster. Cultivating there for a month was equivalent to spending ten years in the outside world.","However, at the same time, he could completely imagine how shocking the pressure was to cultivate here. It was not something that ordinary people could withstand.","Clearly, this junior that he had recently found out about also had his own extraordinary methods that allowed him to withstand such cultivation.","After recovering from his shock, Huangfu Longhao did not hesitate. He focused his attention on himself and began to enter a frenzied state of cultivation.","Chu Hongcai was in a state of shock. Of course, he also understood how shocking the pressure was to cultivate here. However, seeing Chu Yunfan’s ease, he didn’t say anything more.","“Start cultivating here!” Chu Yunfan said to Chu Hongcai, “The time here is about a hundred times faster than outside. One month is equivalent to ten years. In these ten years, we must cultivate with all our strength!”","“Understood, Brother Fan!” Chu Hongcai nodded.","Outside the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, Situ Xuan, who was originally observing the many prodigies, saw that Chu Yunfan had entered the deepest part of the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm. He could not help but be a little stunned. One had to know that the deepest part of the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm was an area that even he could not reach at the moment.","It wasn’t that his cultivation wasn’t strong enough, but that he couldn’t resist the passage of time. He looked at the Mountain River Cauldron above Chu","Yunfan’s head for a while and knew that this must have a lot to do with the Mountain River Cauldron above Chu Yunfan’s head.","He was also a little surprised. This Mountain River Cauldron was not ordinary. However, he did not intend to get to the bottom of it. In the Flying Celestials, all the outstanding people had their own secrets.","Even the higher-ups of the sect could not force them to hand over these secrets, or else the world would be in chaos.","Time passed by minute by minute. To the outside world, a short month’s time could be said to pass in the blink of an eye for those who were working hard in cultivation.","With the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm as a cultivation platform, everyone’s cultivation was increasing at an astonishing speed.","Moreover, as the cultivation of these young prodigies continued to increase, the time they could withstand also increased. Naturally, the speed of their improvement was even more shocking.","This was a snowballing process. The stronger one’s cultivation was, the more shocking the time flow one could withstand.","During this month, the entire world seemed to have fallen into a strange calm. Whether it was the new or old forces, they were all seizing this last moment to crazily improve themselves.","After the closed-door meeting, the seemingly childish decision was finally announced to the world. For a time, the world was in an uproar.","To many people, they had never expected that after the shocking battles that erupted at the closed-door meeting, such a trifling outcome would be achieved.."]},{"number":2229,"title":"Chapter 2229: A Prodigy Arrives at the Doorstep","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","However, there were still many smart people in the world. Soon, many people figured out the reason behind this. Whether it was the Human King, the Elder Princess, or the many masters of the current era, they did not have an overwhelming advantage when facing these ancient masters who had returned.","To not destroy the world, they had no choice but to choose this method.","Many sects in the Central Plains had received the letter of challenge, and for a time, the world was in an uproar.","Countless people were watching from afar outside the gates of the sects that had received the challenge. Today’s battle would determine whether the various sects could protect their own sects.","Especially outside the top ten forces, there was a sea of people. They were hiding in the dark and did not show themselves.","Everyone knew that with the strength and foundation of the ten great forces, the vast majority of the top prodigies in the world came from these ten great forces.","Since it was decided by the younger generation, then the ten great forces were still the best among them.","World- shaking battles were bound to happen here.","At the same time, it would also force out the foundations of the various large factions. They would only be rumors and had never seen the top prodigies before. They would even be legendary Supreme Youths.","Each of them was enough to shake the entire world.","Many people had never seen a prodigy in their lives, let alone a Supreme","Youth. In many people’s eyes, this was an opportunity to see those Supreme Youths up close.","Outside the mountain gate of the Flying Celestials, a loud bang suddenly sounded. The barrier above the mountain gate of the Flying Celestials began to shake crazily, and an incomparably huge stage descended from the sky to the north of the Flying Celestials.","“What should have come has come!”","An ancient voice from the Flying Celestials sighed.","At this moment, tens of thousands of figures rose up from the Flying Celestials and headed north. Although not everyone was qualified to participate in this battle, everyone knew that this was the key to whether the Flying Celestials could protect this ancestral foundation.","Behind this figure, a figure shrouded in golden light strode over. A terrifying","pressure raged out. Wherever it passed, the experts hidden in the void could not help but want to kneel down. Some even knelt down involuntarily.","“Who’s that? How is he so terrifying?” a Major Arcane exclaimed.","An expert like him was the top combat strength of a first-rate sect. However, when facing this figure, he was completely not a match.","It was almost impossible for him to have any thoughts of resistance just by relying on his aura.","“The Divine Treasure Stage! It must be a Divine Treasure! There’s no way a Major Arcane would have such power!” someone exclaimed, “Has someone in the younger generation cultivated to the Divine Treasure Stage? How many years had they cultivated? As expected of a peerless expert selected from the river of time over countless years!”","“Even an ordinary Divine Treasure wouldn’t be so terrifying. At the very least, he must be a Divine Treasure cultivated by a top prodigy!’","An old monster of the Divine Treasure Stage in the crowd looked at the figure wrapped in golden light before him, and he almost couldn’t breathe.","They were both in the Divine Treasure Stage, but he could feel how terrifying the figure in front of him was.","“He’s here. Clearly, he’s a prodigy from ancient times. He’s here to challenge","us!”","Someone revealed the purpose of this figure.","At this moment, this figure arrived on the stage. His face was handsome and resolute, and his figure was tall and straight. He was like a spear that soared into the sky. His figure was majestic, and his entire body was wrapped in golden light. He looked very terrifying.","“Where are the representatives of the Flying Celestials? Come out and fight. If you don’t, I’ll take it that you’ve conceded!”","This figure was extremely cold and powerful. Just the aura he emitted made people feel as if the sky was collapsing.","His gaze swept into the interior of the Flying Celestials. Although it was isolated by the barrier of the Flying Celestials, he still had a domineering aura.","However, there were many Flying Celestial disciples present, but none of them dared to go out to fight. No one dared to go out to fight. If they weren’t in the Divine Treasure Stage, they would be courting death.","The Divine Treasure Stage was the top of the world. Even in the Flying Celestials, only some old monsters in the grand elder group had reached this stage.","However, this was a battle between the younger disciples. They could not interfere. Once they did, it would be equivalent to wasting all their previous efforts.","“No one will come to fight? How laughable! The Flying Celestials has such a great reputation, but it seems that you’ve been a monkey claiming to be king when there’s no tiger in the mountain. In this modern era, how could a weak sect like you occupy this territory? It’s simply wishful thinking!’","The person burst into laughter. He felt that it was ridiculous and laughed at the Flying Celestials without any restraint.","Everyone in the Flying Celestials was burning with rage, but no one dared to go out. Just by hiding in the barrier of the Flying Celestials, they could feel the terror of such an expert. If they stood out, the consequences were obvious.","Everyone’s expressions turned extremely ugly.","“Our sect’s experts will be here soon. You don’t have to be so arrogant and despotic. How dare you humiliate our sect. Be careful that you won’t be able to walk out of here today!’","At this moment, an elder from the Flying Celestials said.","“Hahahaha, it’s good that you don’t dare to accept the challenge!’ This expert obviously didn’t put the Flying Celestials in his eyes.","“Let’s end this quickly. Today, l, Gu Haoyue, want the Flying Celestials’ foundation!”","His voice was like a blade, piercing into the hearts of the Flying Celestial disciples. Many of them were shocked. This expert named Gu Haoyue was clearly here to cause trouble. He had no intention of letting things rest.","He continuously provoked the Flying Celestials to attack!","After waiting for a while, there was still no one from the Flying Celestials. Gu Haoyue only sneered and said, “How boring. There isn’t even a single person with guts.”","“How arrogant! ”","At this moment, someone from the Flying Celestials, who was burning with rage, finally couldn’t hold it in any longer and flew out. It was a middle-aged man wearing a moon-white robe.","“It’s him! I’ve seen him before. He’s a famous prodigy from the Flying Celestials three hundred years ago. I’ve never heard of him recently. I didn’t expect to see him here!”","Everyone reacted one after another. The person who attacked was a young prodigy of the Flying Celestials. Now, as time passed, he became even more terrifying.","“Flying Celestial Palm Strike!”","In an instant, the middle-aged Flying Celestial disciple produced a gigantic palm. This palm descended from the sky and enveloped Gu Haoyue.","A majestic aura spread out in all directions.."]},{"number":2230,"title":"Chapter 2230: Who Gave You the Courage?","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Petty tricks. The Flying Celestial Palm Strike is nothing more than this!” Gu Haoyue didn’t even bother to look at him. He only slapped him.","Bam!","The terrifying attack spread out in all directions. Everyone saw Gu Haoyue’s palm strike disperse the attack of the middle-aged Flying Celestial disciple.","The slap did not slow down and landed directly on the disciple.","The disciple let out a blood-curdling scream and was instantly sent flying. He was heavily injured in an instant, and countless bones in his body were broken.","In an instant, the victor was decided.","“Hiss, how is he so terrifying?” Some people took in a breath of cold air. They felt their hair stand on end and their backs turn cold as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Although they knew that Gu Haoyue’s strength should be quite astonishing.","However, no one had expected him to be so terrifying. With just a casual blow, he had beaten an expert who had entered the Divine Treasure Stage into a state of death.","“What is his cultivation level? Could it be that he has already surpassed the Divine Treasure Stage?” someone asked.","“Not yet. He should have just stepped into the Divine Treasure Stage, and he’s not much better than the person he severely injured before. However, although their level is similar, the difference in strength is like heaven and earth. The difference between an ordinary prodigy and a top-notch prodigy is like the difference between heaven and earth!”","“Normal prodigies might not even have emperor physiques, but top prodigies are the cream of the crop. The difference between them is obvious!”","At this moment, the Divine Treasures hidden in the crowd couldn’t help but speak up. Gu Haoyue’s strength was terrifying to them.","They never imagined that it would be so terrifying.","At this moment, everyone was in an uproar. The Flying Celestials were even more furious. There were naturally people among them who could defeat Gu","Haoyue, but they couldn’t make a move. Otherwise, it would be too obvious if they were bullying the weak. This would break the agreement between the two sides and be equivalent to admitting defeat.","“Gu Haoyue, don’t be so arrogant! You’ve only just cultivated to the Divine","Treasure Stage. How dare you act so presumptuously in the Flying Celestials!”","At that moment, a saber light swept across the sky and headed straight for Gu Haoyue.","This slash was fast!","In the blink of an eye, it had already swept toward Gu Haoyue. This saber slashed at Gu Haoyue’s shoulder and then cut off one of his arms right then and there.","Blood was dripping.","Gu Haoyue hurriedly retreated. His eyes flickered with disbelief. He had not expected that he would be taught a lesson so soon after he had suppressed the entire Flying Celestials with his awe-inspiring might.","Everyone was shocked. Everything happened too quickly. In the next moment, they saw a figure flying out of the Flying Celestials and arriving before Gu Haoyue in an instant.","It was a figure with an imposing appearance. When everyone focused their eyes, they saw that it was the deputy alliance leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance, Sima Longyun.","It was he who had injured Gu Haoyue severely with just one move and knocked him off the pedestal.","“Sima Longyun!” Gu Haoyue was so angry that his lungs were about to explode when he saw who had attacked. He shouted, “You dare to hurt me?!”","“So what if I hurt you? I’m going to kill you today!” Sima Longyun looked coldly at Gu Haoyue. He was no stranger to Gu Haoyue. He had seen him before on the battlefield of the prodigies.","“Ahhhh, I’m going to kill you!” Gu Haoyue shouted.","His entire body seemed to have turned into a ball of flames as he threw a punch at Gu Haoyue.","“Did you just say that the Flying Celestial Palm Strike is only so-so?” Sima Longyun threw out a huge seal. It was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","However, compared to the middle-aged Flying Celestial disciple from before, Sima Longyun’s Flying Celestial Palm Strike was much more terrifying.","After Sima Longyun cast the Flying Celestial Palm Strike, he slapped Gu Haoyue into the ground of the ring.","Gu Haoyue screamed in pain. He was about to go mad from anger. When had he ever suffered such humiliation? In his era, he was invincible. There was no one in the younger generation who could match him.","Even on the battlefield, he was a Major Arcane being, one of the few top beings in the world.","But now, he was slapped to the ground by Sima Longyun’s Flying Celestial Palm Strike. One could imagine the rage in his heart.","“Sima Longyun, you’ve only cultivated a few more years than me. If my cultivation years were similar to yours, I definitely wouldn’t lose to you!’","Gu Haoyue struggled to get up, but he was smashed to the ground by Sima Longyun!s Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","Gu Haoyue had lost count of how many bones in his body had exploded. The power of Sima Longyun’s every attack was like a divine mountain smashing into him. It was truly terrifying to the extreme.","“So what? Haven’t you bullied anyone with your cultivation years and aptitude? The strong prey on the weak. This is a matter of course. Don’t you think it’s ridiculous that you’re talking to me about your cultivation year?” Sima Longyun swept him a glance, then casually threw out another Flying Celestial Palm Strike and smashed him onto the ring floor.","However, even after enduring such an attack, the ring did not tremble. One could imagine how high the quality was.","At this moment, everyone could see that Sima Longyun’s strength was far above Gu Haoyue’s. Right now, he was only humiliating Gu Haoyue to take revenge for the humiliation Gu Haoyue had brought to the Flying Celestials.","No one felt anything strange about it, because Gu Haoyue’s arrogance and despotism had been witnessed by everyone. Humiliating a sect was as serious as killing one’s parents, so Sima Longyun’s reaction was very normal.","“Sima Longyun, you bullied me. Someone will definitely come and take care of you!” Gu Haoyue roared.","“Then let them come!” Sima Longyun stomped Gu Haoyue’s head onto the ring floor with a loud bang.","“Do you think you’re qualified to be arrogant here? You’ve only condensed one law. Who gave you the courage?” Sima Longyun said with a cold smile, “Although you’re nothing much, I can use your head to tell those scoundrels that this is the Flying Celestials, not a place where you scumbags can be impudent! ”","In the blink of an eye, Sima Longyun seemed to have grown tired of it, and a shocking blade light flashed. This arrogant and lawless Gu Haoyue was beheaded.","Fresh blood splattered out and splattered all across the ring.","Everyone held their breaths and were almost scared to death. Sima Longyun was truly too powerful.","Even the current disciples were impressed.."]},{"number":2231,"title":"Chapter 2231: The Gap Between Heaven and Earth","paragraphs":["Chapter 2231: The Gap Between Heaven and Earth","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Previously, Sima Longyun had suffered a crushing defeat at Chu Yunfan’s hands. He couldn’t even withstand a single move before admitting defeat. In the eyes of many disciples who didn’t know the truth, Sima Longyun’s reputation was inferior to his appearance. He was just an empty title.","However, now that he had made his move, everyone realized how terrifying Sima Longyun was. He was actually so terrifying after stepping into the Divine Treasure Stage.","A casual strike was actually able to heavily injure Gu Haoyue and then suppress him. This was a great power.","Among Divine Treasures, Sima Longyun was not weak.","“l thought Sima Longyun wasn’t strong. After all, he was no match for Chu Yunfan. Now it seems that he was too naive. A man’s name is like a tree’s shadow. He has been the deputy leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance for so many years. How could he not be capable?” Someone shook his head and sighed. “This can only mean that Chu Yunfan is far more terrifying!’","“That’s right. This can only mean that Chu Yunfan is far more powerful. I wonder what cultivation level he has now! ”","“However, the more powerful Chu Yunfan is, the better it will be for our sect.","Now, we’re relying on these top prodigies to support us!”","“l heard that the benefits of the Divine Treasure Stage depend on how many laws one has condensed,” another person said, wonder how many laws Gu Haoyue and Sima Longyun have condensed.”","“Gu Haoyue has condensed only one law, yet he dares to act so impudently. It seems like he has been used by someone to test the waters!”","Some top-notch experts said this with certainty.","“In this kind of battlefield, condensing a law is only the first step to qualify to enter. It’s just a warm-up. The ones who enter later are the true experts!”","“l don’t think he’s been used. No matter what, Gu Haoyue is still a top-notch prodigy. How could he be so stupid? I think he was trying to stand out. If he could’ve made a name for himself today, he’d be able to reap great benefits in the future!” Some experts disagreed. “But he thought that it would be a warm-up match at the beginning. Who would have thought that he would attract an expert like Sima Longyun? He had only condensed one law, but this Sima Longyun had condensed at least a hundred laws to be so terrifying. He was completely suppressed!”","Many people gasped when they heard this. No wonder Gu Haoyue was completely defeated by Sima Longyun. Anyone could tell how terrifying it was the difference between condensing one law and a hundred laws!","“But I heard that the limit of the Divine Treasure Stage is ninety-nine laws?” someone asked in confusion.","Many people revealed puzzled expressions. In their understanding, the Divine Treasure Stage could only accommodate 99 laws at most. How could Sima Longyun be able to condense over 100 laws?","There were also experts who smiled faintly and said, “This limit is just for ordinary prodigies. It is very difficult for ordinary prodigies to condense 99 laws. However, for prodigies, condensing 99 laws is only a basic operation. Condensing more than 100 laws is everywhere, let alone a top prodigy like Sima Longyun. Condensing 100 laws is not difficult at all!","“Let alone Sima Longyun, even Gu Haoyue would have no difficulty condensing 100 laws if he had enough time. Don’t think that the difference between 100 and 99 laws is only one law. In reality, the difference between the two is like the difference between heaven and earth. With Sima Longyun’s strength, he could easily kill eight or ten existences at the limit of the Divine Treasure Stage who had condensed 99 laws!”","With the expert’s explanation, everyone finally came to a realization. Many people could not help but suck in a breath of cold air. Anyone who could cultivate to the Divine Treasure Stage was worthy of the title of a prodigy.","However, the gap between them and those prodigies could not be increased. The gap between them and those prodigies was even greater than any other realm in the past.","“Even for Sima Longyun, 100 laws shouldn’t be the limit. It’s just the beginning. He can still condense more laws. However, after that, the difficulty of condensing each law will be much more difficult than before. The number of laws that can be condensed will eventually differ for each top prodigy. However, the more laws they condense now, the more powerful they will be when they break through to a higher stage in the future. This is the foundation for becoming a king or emperor in the future!” that expert continued, “It’s said that those Supreme Youths are even more terrifying. They can casually condense more than 100 laws. I heard that their limit is 500 laws. If it’s a Supreme Youth at their limit, crushing Gu Haoyue would be a matter of a finger!’","“The difference is so great. Are they really all in the Divine Treasure Stage?","Why do I feel like I’m listening to some kind of myth?” someone said in shock.","It was only then that everyone realized that although they were all in the Divine Treasure Stage, they were strictly divided into different levels. The difference in the Great Dao made people despair, and they could not compete at all.","“But speaking of which, the true victor will still depend on the Supreme","V011thQ ”","Just as everyone was discussing, ten figures slowly walked out from afar. Everyone focused their eyes and saw that each of these figures was tall and majestic like a divine mountain as if they could crush the heavens.","These ten people walked very slowly, but each of them gave off the feeling that they were primordial godfiends.","“Ten Divine Treasures!”","After the battle just now, everyone understood what level these people were at. Every one of them was in the Divine Treasure Stage. Moreover, any one of them was far stronger than Gu Haoyue.","Each of them was not inferior to Sima Longyun.","When the ten of them joined forces and walked over, their terrifying auras crushed the world. Each of them was wrapped in an extremely terrifying light. Each of them cultivated different cultivation techniques and grasped different laws.","Any one of these experts would be enough to attract the attention of the Flying Celestials, let alone all ten of them.","Many people understood that even if these ten people had ulterior motives, their combat strength was probably more terrifying than a hundred ordinary Divine Treasures.","Countless people trembled. Many people couldn’t endure it, but they were unwilling to kneel. They all retreated hundreds of miles to avoid being forced to kneel by the aura.","These people wore clothes different from the modern era. They were clearly the top prodigies of the ancient times.","The disciples of the Flying Celestials were in despair. Although Sima Longyun was very strong, he was a single person. The ancient forces had produced so many experts in one go, and this might not be all of them.","The difference in numbers between the two sides was too great. They had the absolute advantage in terms of ordinary disciples, but there was a difference in the number of top-notch prodigies.."]},{"number":2232,"title":"Chapter 2232: You Aren’t Stepping All Over the Flying Celestials","paragraphs":["Chapter 2232: You Aren’t Stepping All Over the Flying Celestials","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people felt indignant. Wasn’t this bullying?","This was too much!","When they agreed to this condition during the closed-door meeting, it was obvious that the current forces were at a disadvantage and did not have the upper hand. Otherwise, they would not have agreed to such a completely disadvantageous condition.","Although it was to prevent the world from being destroyed, it was too disadvantageous.","Many of the Flying Celestial disciples felt powerless.","“Sima Longyun, from the moment you started killing people, peace was lost today!” a square-faced young man among the ten experts said.","His aura became even more terrifying. His entire body was hidden in the golden light. His gaze was like a knife as he stared at Sima Longyun.","“At this point, you still hope for peace?”","Sima Longyun was facing ten experts alone, but he wasn’t afraid. His expression was cold and stern. He knew these people too well. At this point, both sides were fighting to the death. There was no room for mercy.","They had enjoyed so many benefits from the Flying Celestials, and in terms of karma, this was the karma they owed. Today, they had to return the favor.","Even if it was a narrow escape, they had no other choice. Otherwise, there would be no place for them in the world.","“You knew that Gu Haoyue was a disciple of Elements, yet you still dared to kill him. You’re too bold. You won’t live past today!” the square-faced young man said.","“Humph! Since he stepped into the ring, he should have been prepared to die in the ring at any time. He wants to become famous by stepping on the Flying Celestials, so he should be prepared to die. He can’t step all over the Flying Celestials!” Sima Longyun said.","Sima Longyun understood Gu Haoyue’s goal all too well. Today, he had trampled on the Flying Celestials. Even if he was chased away, his name would still shake the world. After all, he was the first one to step out. However, Gu Haoyue never expected Sima Longyun to be so ruthless. He immediately killed Sima Longyun.","“Alright, in that case, don’t blame us for being impolite!” The square-faced youth sneered.","“Elements? I’ve read about this sect in ancient records. It’s said that their cultivation aligns with the power of the five elements, and it’s known as the Sect of the Five Elements. It was famous in the past, and it was just as powerful as the Flying Celestials. I didn’t expect Gu Haoyue and these people to be disciples of Elements!” a knowledgeable person exclaimed.","“l don’t know the origins of the others, but it’s obvious that they aren’t any weaker than Elements’ disciple. Otherwise, they wouldn’t dare to come out and fight for it. I’m afraid that the Flying Celestials won’t be able to escape this time!”","“The Flying Celestials’ foundation in this aspect is still a little lacking!’","Just as everyone was discussing, the square-faced young man made his move. Around him, the power of the five elements condensed. Metal, wood, water, fire, and earth. Five divine powers appeared, and they had an oppressive aura that could cause the world to collapse. He was an existence that had condensed at least a hundred laws. He wasn’t inferior to Sima Longyun.","Boom!","The square-faced young man instantly arrived before Sima Longyun. The power of the five elements condensed and swept out like a torrent.","Elements’ legacy was not inferior to any legacy in the current era. In fact, it was even better.","At the same time, Sima Longyun knew that this battle had to have a result.","The Flying Celestial Palm Strike formed in his hand and collided with the five elements power.","Boom!","The battle between the two of them caused the ring to tremble slightly. The battle between Sima Longyun and Gu Haoyue just now did not even cause the ring to change in the slightest. One could imagine how intense the battle between the two was now.","The battle between the two dazzled countless people. They could not see their movements clearly. They could only see some faint figures.","Fortunately, the fluctuations of the battle were sealed by the huge ring, so everyone was not seriously injured by the aftershocks.","However, at this moment, the remaining nine people could no longer sit still and began to move.","“Let’s attack together and kill Sima Longyun!’","These people’s eyes were cold and their expressions were incomparably cold. They did not care about the so-called rules. There were no rules in this ring today.","The winner was the king and the loser was the bandit. Only the winner had the right to enjoy everything in the end.","If they failed, the Flying Celestials would lose their ancestral inheritance and become a stray dog.","As for the other factions, they were stray dogs. If they could not obtain a stable foundation, they were probably not far from the destruction of the sect.","Therefore, no one cared about rules. They were all doing it for survival.","“Despicable! Shameless!”","The disciples of the Flying Celestials shouted one after another, but it was useless. Their voices could not stop the actions of the other nine people. “This is too much. Bullying the few with numbers. This is too much!”","At this moment, dozens of figures flew out from the Flying Celestials and directly flew into the ring.","They joined the battle.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was the ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials.","Many disciples of the Flying Celestials were in tears. Although the ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials were domineering before, when the Flying","Celestials was in danger of being destroyed, it was these people who stood up.","Moreover, these people were all outstanding prodigies of the Flying Celestials’ ancient times.","“The Flying Celestials sure is powerful. Each of these thirty-some people is a young prodigy, and each of them has condensed more than a hundred laws. Three of them can even stand shoulder to shoulder with Sima Longyun!’ someone praised as they clapped.","Everyone looked over and saw that these 30-odd young prodigies of the","Flying Celestials were extremely powerful. They were indeed very powerful. Each of them had condensed hundreds of laws, surpassing the limits of ordinary Divine Treasures.","After being forced to the extreme, Sima Longyun finally erupted with his true strength. It was not the 100 laws that many people had guessed before, but 200 laws.","There were even three powerful existences beside him who could stand shoulder-to-shoulder with him. Each of them had condensed 200 laws. It could be said that there was always someone stronger among the stronger.","However, their opponents, the ten terrifying existences, were also existences that had condensed 200 laws.","Four of them had easily blocked the remaining 30-odd young prodigies of the Flying Celestials. The difference between a top-notch prodigy who had condensed 200 laws and a prodigy who had condensed 100 laws was clear at a glance. It was no longer something that could be made up for with numbers.","The rest of the people began to attack Sima Longyun and the other three. Sima Longyun, as the deputy leader of the Flying Celestial Alliance, had to face the attack of three people alone.","For a time, the situation was extremely dangerous.."]},{"number":2233,"title":"Chapter 2233: Ten Years, Unparalleled Cultivation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2233: Ten Years, Unparalleled Cultivation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","At the same time, in the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm deep within the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan, Chu Hongcai, and the golden roc were cultivating crazily under the Mountain River Cauldron.","Only a month had passed in the outside world, but to the three of them, more than ten years had passed.","All three of them had undergone earth-shaking transformations. Among them, Chu Hongcai, who was the weakest, had undergone earth-shaking changes after more than ten years. He was not even in the Arcana Stage, but he had advanced by leaps and bounds and rushed into the Divine Treasure Stage. He had even condensed hundreds of laws in one go.","Hundreds of laws surrounded his body. Each law was like an astonishing sword. If it slashed out horizontally, the world would be shattered.","After more than ten years of development, Chu Hongcai was like Chu Yunfan in the past. He had left his peers far behind and had even caught up to Chu Yunfan and the others of his generation.","Condensing hundreds of laws had already surpassed the limit of an ordinary Divine Treasure and was comparable to a Divine Treasure prodigy.","Moreover, as time passed, his cultivation speed became faster and faster. In just a moment, he had already condensed 101 laws.","Only then did he stop. He looked around, and with a thought, he knew that a month in the outside world was up. He sighed. He hadn’t expected to reach such a level in such a short time.","It could even be said that with his youthful supreme physique, he only needed time to cultivate to the extreme of 500 laws.","Condensing the first law in the Divine Treasure Stage was the most difficult. However, everything would be much smoother after condensing the first law. It could be said that it was like copying a cat and drawing a tiger. It was like copying and sticking, continuously condensing more laws.","This was the fundamental reason why he had already condensed 101 laws in a","short time.","This was because he had spent too much time on the cultivation of the Arcana Stage. Otherwise, he would have condensed at least 400 or even 500 laws by now.","However, he was very content. In such a short time, he had made such shocking progress. It was already very shocking. No matter how chaotic the outside world was, with such cultivation, he could at least protect himself.","He even felt that he could break through to a higher stage at any time, but he suppressed it because he knew that the Divine Treasure Stage was the true foundation stage for kings and emperors.","In this stage, the more laws condensed, the stronger one’s future strength would be.","Breaking through with 101 laws or breaking through with the 500 laws of a Supreme Youth’s limit, the impact on the future was naturally completely different.","However, he wasn’t the only one who had an extremely fast cultivation speed.","Not far away from him, a golden roc floated in the air, its entire body immersed in a golden light. Countless laws were like small golden rocs revolving around him.","These were the intrinsic laws that he had condensed. It was different from the laws of the sword that he had continuously cultivated. The golden roc only needed to dig deep into its bloodline and use the Great Celestial Demon Art to purify its bloodline. It would be able to continuously awaken divine powers and continuously break through its limits.","In the past ten years, his progress was even greater than Chu Hongcai’s. He had already reached 499 laws. He was only one law away from reaching the perfection and limit of a Supreme Youth.","However, when Chu Hongcai looked at Chu Yunfan, his eyes could not help but flash with disbelief.","This was because he could sense how much Chu Yunfan had improved in the past ten years.","Ordinary prodigies, prodigies, top-notch prodigies, and Supreme Youths. Every time he thought that Chu Yunfan had reached the limit, Chu Yunfan would constantly break through to a new stage.","Now, Chu Yunfan actually had 999 laws. It was simply shocking and unheard of.","His knowledge was different from before. After all, he was the number one on the Prodigy List and was nurtured by the Flying Celestials as a core. He knew many secrets.","It was because of this that he felt that Chu Yunfan was terrifyingly powerful.","Although he had already cultivated 100 laws, he was afraid that he would not even be able to withstand one move from Chu Yunfan.","Right now, Chu Yunfan was still trying to break through to an even higher state. He was going to break through from the Major Arcana Stage state to the Divine Treasure Stage. At the same time, he was going to break through the limit of 999, reaching the true perfect 1,000 laws.","If it could really be done, then what kind of terrifying existence would be born in the world? It was simply unimaginable.","If it was someone else, Chu Hongcai might have felt a little afraid, but when this person was Chu Yunfan, he only felt extremely at ease.","Just as he was letting his imagination run wild, the golden light on the golden roes body dissipated. The laws that were like countless little rocs were all absorbed into his body.","“Hahahaha, I’ve finally cultivated to 500 laws!” The golden roc laughed. He felt as if every part of his body was filled with powerful strength.","He had never thought that he could reach such a level. If he hadn’t met his master, he would probably have been a Black-scaled Horned Eagle for the rest of his life. It seemed not bad, but compared to now, it was like the difference between cloud and mud.","At that time, he only knew how to find those prodigies to devour. He was simply a frog at the bottom of a well, sitting in the well and looking at the sky, not knowing the immensity of heaven and earth.","Now, he had truly jumped out of the well!","“Since you two have completed your breakthrough, go help Senior Huangfu. I’ll be there soon!” Chu Yunfan suddenly said.","Although he was still cultivating, he had sensed Huangfu Longhao’s fluctuation earlier. He had already left the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm and knew that the battle that would determine the life and death of the Flying Celestials had already begun.","However, he was not in a hurry because he knew that it was useless to be anxious. He was still waiting for the final breakthrough.","“Yes, Master! ”","Of course, the golden roc did not dare to disobey. Not to mention that his life was in Chu Yunfan’s hands, even without him, he would not dare to disobey him. Chu Yunfan’s terror, even if it was just the fluctuation of his aura, was enough to make him feel shocked. He could not resist at all.","999 laws. Even if he had awakened the memories of his bloodline, there was no such terrifying existence in the immemorial era.","Chu Yunfan was simply a monster!","Of course, he didn’t dare to criticize Chu Yunfan. He no longer had any resentment toward Chu Yunfan, only incomparable obedience.","“Alright, we’ll head out first, Brother Fan!”","A man and a bird left the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm on a streak of light.."]},{"number":2234,"title":"Chapter 2234: Arriving Just in Time","paragraphs":["Chapter 2234: Arriving Just in Time","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After the man and bird left the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, Chu Yunfan continued to cultivate. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for him.","He was already at the peak of the Major Arcana Stage.","His cultivation was earth- shattering and unprecedented compared to this realm.","No one had ever been able to condense 999 laws at this stage like him.","Even in the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, there was no one who could do it to this extent.","It could be said that this was something that no one had ever done before. Chu Yunfan didn’t know how far he could go, but he knew that every step he took was creating an unprecedented record.","Even a Supreme Youth in the Divine Treasure Stage could only condense 500.","As for 1,000, it was even more so for experts who had surpassed the Divine Treasure Stage and above.","One thousand was the mark of an expert who had surpassed the Divine Treasure Stage.","Chu Yunfan was about to condense the 1000th law and then rush into the Divine Treasure Stage.","It was a perfect ending to his ten years of cultivation.","And this last law was countless times more difficult than any of his previous law condensation.","In fact, he had already been condensing that law three years ago, but he had never succeeded until now. It could be said that he had already reached the final step.","He knew that he was going against the heavens, but the path of cultivation itself was going against the heavens. If outsiders knew about his current situation, they would probably be so shocked that their glasses would fall off.","But for Chu Yunfan himself, it was nothing, because he had created too many miracles. Every time he cultivated, he was creating a record that no one had ever seen before, and no one would ever see again. This was a very normal thing for him.","“Just give me a little more time. The thousandth law is coming!” Chu Yunfan knew that the match that would decide the life and death of the Flying Celestials had already begun.","However, he did not want to leave just like that. Although he knew that it was enough for him to come out of seclusion at this time, to him, whether he came out of seclusion with 999 laws or 1,000 laws was a completely different matter.","He didn’t want to waste all his efforts just like that. Several years of time would be wasted just like that.","“l hope Senior Huangfu can hold on until 1 come out of seclusion!”","At the same time, in the ring, the Flying Celestial group was retreating step by step even though they were able to contend with those top-notch prodigies.","There were just too few of them.","At this moment, the Flying Celestials were not fighting one-on-one. Instead, they were fighting against the most outstanding and powerful sect since ancient times.","It was already shocking enough for a family to have so many prodigies, but it was still not enough at this time.","“Sima Longyun, aren’t you very powerful? I’ll kill you now! ”","At this moment, the square-faced young man laughed loudly. His entire body flickered with the power of the five elements.","The power of the five elements was the most basic energy in the world. Now that he was using it, it could be said to be earth-shattering. Moreover, the five elements were balanced and had both offense and defense.","Whether it was offense or defense, it was all in his hands.","His cultivation was not inferior to Sima Longyun at all, let alone the fact that a few people were attacking Sima Longyun together.","Finally, a hole appeared in Sima Longyun’s defensive circle. The square-faced youth seized the opportunity and struck Sima Longyun in the chest with a","palm.","Spurt!","Sima Longyun spurted out a mouthful of blood. His entire chest had collapsed. His chest had been shattered by this palm strike. His protective energy shield had collapsed in an instant, and he had suffered a serious injury.","At this moment, two prodigies from another two ancient powers attacked. They attacked fiercely from the left and right, not giving Sima Longyun a chance to catch his breath. They were clearly planning to kill him at the critical moment.","“I’ll kill you!” Sima Longyun roared. The divine power in his entire body surged, forming an unimaginable storm that actually blocked the attack of these two experts.","However, many people became even more worried because they knew that","Sima Longyun was risking his life. But even so, facing the siege of three","experts of the same level, no matter how much Sima Longyun risked his life, it was useless.","Sure enough, it didn’t take long before the violent divine power on Sima Longyun’s body disappeared without a trace. He was on the verge of death. He was sent flying to a corner of the ring by the square-faced young man’s punch and crashed into the floor of the ring.","It looked like he was going to die in this ring.","“Kill them!”","The entire arena was filled with shouts. Many of the ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials wanted to go and support them, but they had no choice because they were easily intercepted by the ten ancient prodigies of the powerful ancient factions.","No one could break through the blockade. Many people felt despair. The","Flying Celestials were facing a desperate situation today.","Many disciples of the Flying Celestials felt that they were useless. They had no way to deal with a battle that would decide the life and death of the Flying Celestials.","Their cultivation was simply too weak. They weren’t even qualified to go up and participate in the competition. If they rushed up with their cultivation, they would probably be killed in one move.","This was especially true for the disciples of the Flying Celestials who were not prodigies. A few of them had already entered the Divine Treasure Stage, but they were too old and did not have the qualifications.","Even if they were qualified, they knew that with the 30 to 50 laws they had cultivated, there was no possibility of them participating in the chaotic battle in the ring at all. Going up would only mean death.","Only elites above the level of prodigy could possibly enter the Divine Treasure Stage at this age, and only then would they be qualified to participate in the war.","However, ordinary prodigies were equally powerless in this arena. Everyone could see that the ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials were more numerous, but they were intercepted by the prodigies of the ancient factions who were far fewer than them.","This was the reason why quantity could not compare to quality.","The square-faced young man laughed. His expression was ferocious as he conjured the power of the five elements in his hand and smashed it down on the dying Sima Longyun.","At that critical moment, a terrifying beam of light swept out from the Flying Celestials and instantly shattered the power of five elements in the hands of the square-faced youth. Immediately after, a rain of light fell from the sky and landed on Sima Longyun.","Sima Longyun, who was on the verge of death, recovered. Although he was still far from his peak, he was no longer on the verge of death.","“Who is it?!”"]},{"number":2235,"title":"Chapter 2235: Just One Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 2235: Just One Move","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The square-faced young man shouted in the direction of the Flying Celestials. His eyes immediately became solemn, and his expression was no longer as calm as before.","“How dare you act so impudently in my Flying Celestials! ”","Suddenly, at this moment, a figure appeared to be slow but was actually fast. In an instant, he had already arrived in the ring.","Everyone focused their eyes and saw that it was none other than Huangfu Longhao.","“Senior Huangfu is here!”","The morale of the Flying Celestial disciples was boosted. Everyone knew that Huangfu Longhao was probably the number one disciple of the Flying Celestials.","Although Chu Yunfan had a great reputation and was known as the number one disciple of the current era, in the eyes of many people, he was only the number one of the current era. He could not be counted as an ancient prodigy like Huangfu Longhao.","The situation just now had left many of the Flying Celestial disciples in despair.","However, they had no way to interfere. This concerned the life and death of the Flying Celestials, as well as their own lives. However, their lives were in the hands of others.","Now, a savior had finally arrived. Huangfu Longhao’s strength was naturally above Sima Longyun’s.","“It’s you!” The square-faced young man looked at Huangfu Longhao with a solemn expression, but he was not surprised.","Since they had come to challenge the Flying Celestials, they naturally had to be prepared. Everyone knew that if they wanted to defeat the Flying Celestials and seize their foundation. the first person they had to deal with was none other than Huangfu Longhao.","Huangfu Longhao was known as the number one disciple of the Flying Celestials. His cultivation base was unfathomable. Even many grand elders were not his match.","“That’s right, it’s me!”","Huangfu Longhao’s appearance immediately made the entire battlefield clear. The dozens of ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials broke away from their opponents and came behind Huangfu Longhao.","Although they were in a sorry state, their lives were not in danger. This was because the ancient prodigies of the ancient powers had already decided on a strategy. They clearly wanted to kill Sima Longyun first, then free up their hands to kill all these ancient prodigies of the Flying Celestials.","However, they didn’t expect Huangfu Longhao to come so quickly and save Sima Longyun at the critical moment.","“I’m sorry I wasn’t able to stop them, sir!” Sima Longyun looked at Huangfu Longhao with guilt.","Although he was unyielding, he admired and acknowledged Huangfu Longhao from the bottom of his heart. He naturally regarded Huangfu Longhao as the only hope for the Flying Celestials to rise.","“It’s fine. You’ve done very well. They’re just bullying you with numbers!” Huangfu Longhao waved.","Following that, Huangfu Longhao!s gaze swept toward the ten terrifying top-notch prodigies. Any one of them could sweep away an ordinary prodigy. In their bodies, they had condensed at least 200 laws, and their strength had reached a peak.","However, Huangfu Longhao’s expression did not look serious at all. On the contrary, he was a little relaxed. He said, “Why is it just the few of you? Do you think that the few of you can topple the Flying Celestials?” It’s better to find some more people. Just the few of you isn’t enough for me to kill!”","“Huangfu Longhao, aren’t you a little too arrogant? Who do you think you are? The gods in the sky? Even if it’s the gods in the sky, I’ll kill them for you to see!” The square-faced young man was infuriated by Huangfu Longhao’s frivolous attitude, Huangfu Longhao’s words clearly showed that he looked down on them. He thought that even if the ten of them joined forces, it would be useless.","“In front of me, your numbers are useless!” Huangfu Longhao’s gaze was deep as he looked into the distance. “Still not ????????? to come out? Then I’ll kill these people until you appear!’","Although Huangfu Longhao was in front of them, he did not take these top prodigies seriously. Immediately, these top prodigies were furious.","“Huangfu Longhao, I want to see how powerful the famous Flying Celestial","Alliance is! ”","The square-faced young man shouted. All the divine power in his body was mobilized, and the laws of the five elements turned into a terrifying wheel around him.","“Five Elements Wheel!”","With a loud shout, he punched out, and the five elements law wheel smashed down fiercely toward Huangfu Longhao.","Rumble!","The entire sky shook violently as if it was about to collapse in an instant. Then, everyone saw the five-element laws on Huangfu Longhao’s body.","“Senior Huangfu!”","Countless disciples of the Flying Celestials exclaimed.","Although many people were not interested in the ancient prodigies, Huangfu Longhao’s boldness and magnanimity allowed him to gain a lot of fans in the Flying Celestials in a short time.","Now that they saw Huangfu Longhao allowing his opponent’s attack to land on his body, they immediately turned pale with fright. There was no doubt about how terrifying the square-faced youth’s attack was. With just one palm, he had almost killed Sima Longyun.","However, before they could finish their words, Huangfu Longhao roared in the next moment. The Five Elements Wheel that enveloped him shattered inch by inch in front of everyone.","The terrifying scene left everyone dumbstruck, especially the square-faced young man.","He was scared out of his wits because he knew very well that he did not hold back in that attack just now. Who would have thought that Huangfu Longhao would break his attack with just a shout?","Then, he saw Huangfu Longhao conjure a seal. Countless spirit energy crazily condensed above his head, turning into a huge seal that spun. It was the Flying Celestial Palm Strike.","In the next moment, the Flying Celestial Palm Strike slammed down. The square-faced young man didn’t even have time to react before he was hit.","Bam!","His head exploded like a watermelon, and endless blood and brain matter burst out.","In an instant, the peerless prodigy of Elements had died at Huangfu Longhao’s hands.","“Can’t even withstand a single blow!” Huangfu Longhao sneered and looked at the other nine people.","The remaining nine people instantly felt a chill run down their backs as if they had seen a ghost.","“This is a Supreme Youth?”","These nine people only felt despair. Of course, they knew the power of a","Supreme Youth. In the Flying Celestial, the hierarchy was strict and clear.","However, they had thought that after entering the Divine Treasure Stage, they had cultivated 200 laws in one go and should have already caught up to or even surpassed those Supreme Youths.","Who would have thought that the gap between the two sides did not shrink, but instead widened?","Huangfu Longhao was able to easily kill a top prodigy of the Elements who was at the same cultivation level as him.","And he had done it in just one move!"]},{"number":2236,"title":"Chapter 2236: The Might of Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2236: The Might of Supreme Youths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only now did everyone truly realize how terrifying an ancient Supreme Youth was.","If it was said that prodigies only shone for a moment in a certain era, then the top prodigies were existences that dominated the top in this era without Supreme Youths around.","However, once a Supreme Youth appeared, they would be a terrifying figure who could suppress several eras.","Regardless of whether they were born earlier or later than them, under the divine might of the Supreme Youth, everyone had to submit.","A Supreme Youth was born blessed and different from others. To them, cultivation was as simple as eating and drinking. The same tempering allowed them to gain ten times more comprehension than ordinary top-notch geniuses.","As long as they didn’t die prematurely, they could at least be conferred the title of king. They could even peek into the Heavenly Dao and become emperors, becoming rulers for a long time.","It was just that there were too few Supreme Youths appearing, so few that many people simply did not understand how terrifying these Supreme Youths were.","Even many disciples of the Flying Celestials did not understand why the entire Flying Celestials placed all their hopes on Huangfu Longhao. It was because he was indeed qualified and capable.","“So strong. Is this a Supreme Youth? Compared to the Supreme Youth, what are ordinary people like us?” an expert said dejectedly. He was already an old monster and could be considered very famous in the current world. However, let alone Huangfu Longhao, even ordinary prodigies were not something he could compare to.","For ordinary prodigies, the Divine Treasure Stage was not their final destination. It was just the beginning of their cultivation. However, for him, he had already cultivated to the extreme and could not advance any further.","It took several years to condense a single law. Originally, he was very satisfied with such a position. Other than the top masters such as the Human King and the Elder Princess, and some old monsters among the Grand Elders of the top ten sects, he was already at the top.","He was usually awe-inspiring and was the ancestor of a sect.","However, after the Prodigy Battlefield appeared, everything changed. Rarely seen emperor physique possesser suddenly appeared beside them like wild grass.","When he saw the Supreme Youth make a move, he truly had a feeling. Previously, he felt good about himself, but in reality, it was just that there was no tiger in the mountain, and the monkey called itself king.","“Hold him back and wait for the lords to arrive!”","At this moment, the other nine people had already made their decisions. They could no longer fight on their own.","Originally, they belonged to different factions and each of them had their own ulterior motives. However, they now knew that they had no choice but to join forces under Huangfu Longhao’s deterrence.","“Join hands? Is it useful?” Huangfu Longhao smiled coldly. “What do you think a Supreme Youth is?”","The difference between king and emperor physiques was like the difference between heaven and earth.","Boom!","Huangfu Longhao stomped with his foot. Instantly, everyone felt as if he had stomped on their hearts, causing their breathing and rhythm to become chaotic.","Just as they were stunned, Huangfu Longhao attacked. His figure was like lightning as a sword appeared in his hand.","In the next moment, he appeared in front of a top-notch prodigy and slashed down with his sword.","This top-notch prodigy did not even have time to react. The protective energy shield around him was easily cut apart like a hot knife cutting through butter.","Slash!","This top-notch prodigy’s entire body was split into two halves and he died immediately. The laws in him erupted, causing a huge explosion.","It was in this short time that the other top geniuses reacted. The eight of them joined forces to form a large array. It was only a simple array, but in their hands, it erupted with a power that no one dared to underestimate. In an instant, it blocked Huangfu Longhao.","“Petty tricks! ”","Huangfu Longhao didn’t even look at it. He stabbed his sword into the array and instantly cut it apart.","Spurt!","These eight geniuses retreated one after another, and in an instant, they spat out blood. Their entire bodies screamed continuously. The grand array had been broken, and they naturally suffered a backlash.","Huangfu Longhao seized this opportunity and attacked continuously. After a few flashes, another four geniuses died at his hands and were split into two halves.","Huangfu Longhao’s attack did not have any technical content. It was not some shocking divine power martial art. It was just a simple attack, but it possessed great power.","This was to simplify the complex and comprehend martial arts to an extreme realm. It was nothing more than speed, accuracy, and ruthlessness.","The remaining four people’s attacks finally arrived. However, when their attacks landed on Huangfu Longhao’s body, a golden ancient bell flickered on Huangfu Longhao’s body, protecting him within.","When those attacks touched the ancient bell, they all turned into nothingness and dissipated into smoke, scattering in all directions like a rain of light.","Seeing this, the few of them finally understood how big the gap between them and a Supreme Youth was. There was simply no way to make up for it.","However, how could Huangfu Longhao let them go? Since he had the killing intent, there was no possibility of him stopping.","Huangfu Longhao transformed into a streak of light and chased after them. In just a moment, he had killed the remaining four people.","Blood flowed from the huge ring. In just a moment, it completely disappeared from the ring as if it had never existed.","Under the blazing sun, everyone was stunned. They looked at the scene in front of them in a daze. It was simply like a legend.","The ten top-notch prodigies who had beaten everyone to the brink of despair as if they were the revival of an archaic demonic god had been killed by Huangfu Longhao singlehandedly.","This was not a battle at all, but a one-sided massacre.","“They couldn’t even block it for a moment. Is this the legendary Supreme","Youth?”","“That’s right. This is the legendary Supreme Youth. He’s invincible and dominates his peers. Finally, he became an emperor!”","“A top genius has a top emperor physique. Facing a Supreme Youth is terrifying! ‘","“Just how many laws has Huangfu Longhao condensed? It’s too frightening!’","Many people were discussing animatedly. They had all been killed by Huangfu Longhao alone. Only now did some people understand why people had always said that the key to this battle was the Supreme Youths.","If he wasn’t even a Supreme Youth, then he was simply insignificant in this battle.","The disciples of the Flying Celestials revealed excited expressions. At this moment, Huangfu Longhao was like an invincible god in their eyes.","Boom!","Suddenly, at this moment, the sound of footsteps came from the sky.."]},{"number":2237,"title":"Chapter 2237: The Great Battle of the Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Before everyone could recover from the shock, they saw seven tall figures walking over step by step from afar.","Each figure carried a terrifying aura that could crush the world. Each figure was not inferior to Huangfu Longhao.","“They’re all Supreme Youths!” someone exclaimed.","Previously, top-notch geniuses were completely unable to withstand a single blow in front of Huangfu Longhao. This was enough to prove their fragility. The people who stepped into the ring at this time were definitely legendary Supreme Youths. Only they had the courage to step onto the battlefield.","On this ring, blood flowed like a river. Many people had never thought that they would be able to see so many Supreme Youths at the same time. Moreover, these Supreme Youths even wanted to kill each other.","At this moment, even Huangfu Longhao revealed a solemn expression. He looked at the seven Supreme Youths in front of him. There were more than he had expected. He had no choice but to avoid this battle.","Among the seven people, there were men and women. Each of them seemed to be born divine and had unimaginable power.","“Huangfu Longhao, you’re very powerful. You’ve actually killed a top prodigy of Elements. I’m here to seek your guidance!” a black-robed man stepped forward and said.","This black-robed man was none other than the Supreme Youth of Sect of the","Five Elements. Elements’ might back then was not inferior to the Flying Celestials of today. Naturally, a Supreme Youth had been born before, and the person in front of Huangfu Longhao was none other than a Supreme Youth.","However, this black-robed man looked to be about ten years old. He looked pink and cute, but his words were filled with incomparable coldness.","“Elements Kid, if you can do it, come and try. We fought a thousand years ago, but I wonder how much you’ve improved now!” Huangfu Longhao said.","He knew who this child-like Supreme Youth in front of him was.","Although there were top-notch prodigies everywhere on the Prodigy Battlefield, and prodigies were inferior to ants, the Supreme Youths were the outstanding ones.","There were only so many people in the circle. Although not everyone was familiar with each other, at least they knew each other’s identities.","The Elements Kid before him was the strongest prodigy in the history of Elements. He was born with the Divine Elements Physique, and there had once been an emperor with this kind of physique.","It could be said that although he looked like a child, no one dared to underestimate him.","After all, he was a Supreme Youth who had once shaken a region. Even though Elements had been destroyed, no one dared to underestimate him.","“As you wish!”","Elements Kid roared, and the power of the five elements danced crazily all over his body like five huge tails, making him look like a human-shaped monster.","Compared to the two elites of Elements, Elements Kid was much stronger.","The cultivation of the five elements emphasized on starting from any of the law powers of metal, wood, water, fire, or earth. Then, they would continuously derive other law powers through the relationship of mutual promotion and restriction, and finally become a complete set of the five elements.","However, Elements Kid was different. He was born with all five elements, and each of them was extremely rare. The five elements had formed an amazing balance in his body before he cultivated.","“Elements Kid, if you can do it, come and try. We fought a thousand years ago, but I wonder how much you’ve improved now!” Huangfu Longhao said.","The power of the five elements was like a sharp sword, turning into a terrifying attack that blasted toward Huangfu Longhao.","Huangfu Longhao sneered and blocked the attack with his backhand, easily shattering the attack of Elements Kid.","“Elements Kid, your improvement these years is too limited!” Huangfu Longhao said loudly.","“Very good, Huangfu Longhao. You’re indeed very powerful, but so what? I’m here too,’","At this moment, another Supreme Youth stepped forward. His entire person was like an extremely cold ice cellar, his entire body azure blue.","It was another extremely special physique, the Sacred Ice Physique. He was the Supreme Youth of the Ice Palace, a powerful sect that once ruled the icy plains in the extreme north.","“Icy War, since you’re here, let’s fight!” Huangfu Longhao burst into laughter.","The two Supreme Youths besieged Huangfu Longhao, but Huangfu Longhao was unflustered. His astonishing cultivation was vividly displayed.","Even the expressions of the two Supreme Youths turned ugly. They were both Supreme Youths at the same level, yet they were actually unable to do anything to Huangfu Longhao.","They had to admit that Huangfu Longhao was a little stronger than them. They had only condensed over 400 laws, but Huangfu Longhao had already condensed 500 laws.","Although they would reach this step sooner or later, since they were a step slower now, they were a step slower.","However, they were also top-notch Supreme Youths. They would not be killed so easily like those top-notch geniuses.","The two of them fought with Huangfu Longhao, and it was difficult to tell who was stronger.","The battle between the three of them caused the entire ring to tremble.","“Huangfu Longhao, can you stop the few of us? Today, we want the Flying Celestials’ foundation!”","At this moment, a woman in a red robe joined the battle. Her entire person was like a ball of fire, and in an instant, it burned the sky.","This woman’s cultivation base was a bit stronger than Icy War and Elements Kid, almost on par with Huangfu Longhao. How could he be able to deal with the three of them when they joined forces? He was hit and suffered hundreds of attacks in an instant.","Bam!","Huangfu Longhao’s protective energy shield was shattered by the attack. He retreated continuously and coughed up mouthfuls of blood.","If it wasn’t for the fact that his protective energy shield was extremely shocking, he would probably have been blasted to death by these hundred moves just now.","Huangfu Longhao suffered a great loss. Blood flowed from the corner of his mouth, and he kept coughing up blood.","However, no one dared to underestimate Huangfu Longhao. Even if he was defeated, his image in everyone’s hearts was not the slightest bit bad.","Everyone could see that Huangfu Longhao could contend against any existence in a one-on-one battle. It was just that there were too many people on the other side.","The three of them had joined forces to defeat Huangfu Longhao. They were also Supreme Youths. It was already not easy for him to persist to this step.","It was not his fault that he failed. He had even displayed his invincible might.","This time, the hearts of the Flying Celestials disciples once again fell to the bottom of the valley. What made them even more shocked was that only three of the seven terrifying Supreme Youths had attacked. The remaining four were watching the battle coldly.","Once the remaining four attacked together, no matter how powerful Huangfu Longhao was, it would be impossible for him to resist.."]},{"number":2238,"title":"Chapter 2238: Reinforcements","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It could be said that the defeat was already set in stone, and the Flying Celestials had no chance of turning the tables.","At the thought of this, countless disciples of the Flying Celestials were beside themselves. However, they had no other choice. They didn’t even have the qualifications to participate in the battle.","Even if they were not afraid of death, they were just cannon fodder in front of these Supreme Youths. It was completely meaningless.","“Huangfu Longhao, since you are a Supreme Youth, I can spare your life. If you leave now, you can live!” the woman in red said, “We don’t want to exterminate the entire Flying Celestials. We just want to gain a foothold. As the hope and successor of a sect, I think you should understand this desire!”","Huangfu Longhao took advantage of this time to recuperate. The seven Supreme Youths opposite him did not seem to care about his actions. In front of absolute strength, there was no difference between Huangfu Longhao recovering a little or recovering to his peak.","Huangfu Longhao would never have a chance to turn the tables.","Today, the Flying Celestials had been sentenced to death.","“What’s the difference?” Huangfu Longhao said, “Without this foundation, I’m afraid that the Flying Celestials will soon fall to the same level as you. In just a generation, we will decline to a point where no one will know us!”","Huangfu Longhao sneered, exposing the loophole in the woman’s words.","“If you want to seize the Flying Celestials’ foundation, you’ll have to step over me!” Huangfu Longhao said coldly, “And Fire Dance, do you think I’m the only one supporting my Flying Celestials? Then you’re too naive! ”","Huangfu Longhao knew the background of the red-dressed lady. Her name was Fire Dance, and she was once famous. She was born in the Blazing Mountain that dominated the world for a time. All the laws and Divine Powers cultivated in this sect were related to fire. Unlike Elements, this sect unleashed the divine power of fire to the extreme and cultivated it to the extreme. In terms of power, it was not inferior to Elements.","It was just that the path they had to take was different, and there was no difference in strength.","“Who else could there be?” At this moment, another two men spoke at the same time. Everyone looked over and saw that these two people looked exactly the same. They were about 20 years old and had handsome faces. Their faces were sharp and sharp, and their entire bodies emitted an extremely terrifying aura.","“The Yin Yang Twin Supremes!”","Someone recognized the two of them because they were too famous.","There were not many twins in the world, let alone the fact that they both had the physique of emperors. The two of them working together far surpassed the effect of one plus one equals two.","One on the left and one on the right, one Yin and one Yang. It could be said that the Yin Yang Twin Supremes, who grasped the power of Yin and Yang","Origin Source Laws, were definitely the two most terrifying among the many Supreme Youths. They could be said to be unfathomable.","The two of them looked at Huangfu Longhao with cold eyes. There was a hint of playfulness in their eyes as if they did not take Huangfu Longhao seriously at all.","“It’s us!”","Just as they finished speaking, two shocking figures flew out from the Flying Celestials.","A man and a bird arrived in the ring.","Everyone focused their eyes and revealed shocked expressions, especially at the young man. Wasn’t he the top of the prodigy roll of the Flying Celestials, Chu Hongcai?","“Why did Chu Hongcai go up? Isn’t he courting death if he went to such a battle?” someone exclaimed. In many people’s eyes, Chu Hongcai indeed had astonishing talent and strength, but that was only relative to his peers.","On the battlefield of the prodigies, such a person should not be rare, not to mention that his cultivation time was too short, almost less than a fraction of these Supreme Youths.","How could he possibly contend with these Supreme Youths?","Beside Chu Hongcai was a majestic and extraordinary divine bird. It was about the height of a man and looked extremely mighty.","Although many people could not tell what kind of divine bird it was, there was no doubt that the degree of terror of this divine bird was far beyond their imagination.","“So the trump card of the Flying Celestials is you guys?” The Yin Yang Twin Supremes sneered. A hint of contempt flashed in their eyes. They could naturally see that there were many laws in Chu Hongcai’s body. There were a total of 200 laws.","He was much more powerful than ordinary young prodigies, but compared to top-notch Supreme Youths like them, he was far inferior.","“You overestimate yourself. Is this a place where you can be impudent?” At this moment, a shocking sword intent swept over, turning into a terrifying sword intent torrent in the air and crashing down on Chu Hongcai.","This was one of the two remaining Supreme Youths. He held a sword in his hand and wore a simple robe. His entire body was filled with extremely terrifying sword essence fluctuations. He was a natural swordsman.","His swordsmanship cultivation could be said to be shocking. No one could imagine what his limit was.","“How dare you, Sword Saint!” Huangfu Longhao was both shocked and furious. He had not expected the swordsman to attack Chu Hongcai like this.","He knew this swordsman. It was said that he was a terrifying swordsman from a distant era. It could be said that he had no sect, and it was unknown where he had obtained an unfathomable sword technique inheritance.","Ever since Sword Saint’s debut, he had been unrivaled in the world. His swordsmanship cultivation could be said to be unprecedented, and he was known as the most talented existence in swordsmanship since ancient times.","There was no knowing how exaggerated this title was, but if his peers called him Sword Saint, one could imagine how amazing he was.","Even Huangfu Longhao felt that it was very troublesome, let alone Chu Hongcai.","Chu Hongcai was also a future pillar of the Flying Celestials that Huangfu Longhao had high hopes for. Chu Hongcai was not inferior to Chu Yunfan, so he naturally could not watch Chu Hongcai die like this.","However, before Huangfu Longhao could lend a helping hand, the last Supreme Youth finally made his move. The Supreme Youth held a halberd in his hand and wore a shocking iron armor as he Huangfu Longhao’s way.","This Supreme Youth had an astonishing cultivation base. At the same time, he flickered with the fluctuations of killing on the battlefield. This was clearly not an ordinary cultivator, but a peerless killing god on the battlefield. Just his killing intent alone was enough to stop Huangfu Longhao.","Boom!","Suddenly, at this moment, a similarly vast sword intent rose from Chu Hongcai’s body.","This sword intent was much weaker than the Sword Saint’s sword intent, but it did not retreat. It actually went straight for the sword intent.","In the end, the two sword intents collided in a shocking manner. The earth shook, the mountains shook, and the sky collapsed.."]},{"number":2239,"title":"Chapter 2239: The Golden Roc","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Both of them were top geniuses in the sword path. The collision of their sword wills caused the entire ring to shake.","In the end, it became a pure competition of sword intent. However, this competition only lasted for a short time before the winner was decided.","Chu Hongcai’s sword intent was broken. Although he was also a Supreme Youth and the quality of his sword intent was not inferior, his cultivation was far inferior to Sword Saint.","Sword Saint had condensed at least 400 laws, while Chu Hongcai had only condensed less than half of his opponent’s. If it wasn’t for the fact that his Indestructible Sword Physique was really strong, he would have been destroyed by Sword Saint with a single strike.","Boom!","The sword landed on the ring floor and left a deep mark on it. It was not that the sword was weak, but that the ring had been reinforced countless times. If it was in the outside world. this sword would be enough to turn a city into dust.","And Chu Hongcai was at the crucial moment, using the Prismatic Traveller to dodge this astonishing attack.","In these ten years, Chu Hongcai had received special guidance from Chu Yunfan. Not only did he give pointers on martial arts, but he also taught him some special divine powers and spells.","Although Chu Hongcai specialized in sword techniques and walked the path of breaking all techniques with the sword, the Prismatic Traveller was different. Whether it was chasing or retreating, it was a supreme technique.","This was the fundamental reason why Chu Hongcai dared to participate in this battle. Although there was still a considerable gap between his cultivation and a Supreme Youth of the same level, he could rely on the Prismatic Traveller movement technique to entangle others and not lose.","Unless the person’s cultivation had surpassed the Divine Treasure Stage, he would not be afraid of any Supreme Youth.","“Eh?” At this moment, Sword Saint looked at Chu Hongcai strangely as if he was surprised that this sword attack had failed to split Chu Hongcai in half.","With his cultivation, even a top prodigy in the Divine Treasure Stage would not be able to escape his sword and would be killed by him. However, Chu Hongcai was actually able to dodge this fatal blow.","This was something he had never expected!","“You didn’t die, but how many of my strikes can you block?”","Sword Saint looked at Chu Hongcai coldly the entire time. In his hand, the sword intent on his sword was boiling. It was growing at an astonishing speed every minute and every second as if he had transformed into an astonishing sword.","Every pore on Chu Hongcai!s body was spewing out sword light, turning into a torrent of sword light above his head.","Boom!","Two shocking sword wills collided, causing the air to tremble violently.","Suddenly, at this moment, the Supreme Youth in iron armor joined the battle and surrounded Chu Hongcai. At this time, they did not have any morality and justice. They wanted to end the battle quickly.","Their goal was to plunder the Flying Celestials’ foundation and the Flying Celestials’ nutrients as a foundation for their sect to rise again.","However, at this moment, a golden light flashed by. The Supreme Youth in iron amor was sent flying. Blood flowed from the corner of his mouth. In that instant of collision, he suffered a loss.","In front of him was a handsome divine bird that was as tall as a man.","“I’m your opponent!” The golden roc said. His eyes were proud and aloof as if he was the proudest existence in the world.","“You?” The Supreme Youth in iron armor looked at the golden roc coldly. It was obvious that he did not take the golden roc seriously.","However, in the next moment, the golden roc soared into the sky and flapped its wings fiercely. Countless golden feathers shot out in all directions as if countless shocking sword light had fallen, instantly enveloping the Supreme Youth in iron armor.","“Petty tricks! ”","The Supreme Youth in iron armor roared. He waved the halberd in his hand, and the world changed color, turning into a shocking blood curtain that blocked in front of him.","The countless golden sword rain rushed into the blood curtain and instantly shattered it.","Rumble!","A series of shocking explosions sounded. The Supreme Youth in iron armors took advantage of this opportunity to dodge. However, the place where he was standing had long been blasted into pieces.","“What divine bird is that? How is he so powerful that he can actually contend with a Supreme Youth?” someone said in disbelief.","He had never expected that this extremely handsome divine bird could contend with this Supreme Youth.","“From the looks of it, it seems to be very similar to the legendary golden roc,” someone said.","He recalled the golden roc recorded in the ancient books. It could be said that the golden roc recorded in the ancient books looked like this. However, its body was too small. It was not like what was recorded in the ancient books. It covered the sky and covered the earth. When its wings spread, it was as huge as the clouds in the sky.","However, that handsome appearance was definitely not wrong.","“It really is a golden roc. No wonder it can contend with a Supreme Youth and even gain the upper hand. The golden roc is one of the famous Ten Ferocities!”","“But why would the golden roc help the Flying Celestials?” someone said in surprise.","The golden roc was a myth from ancient times. At the end of the immemorial era, most of the Ten Ferocities had already fallen, and their bloodlines had mostly fused into the bodies of various living beings.","Many living beings had the bloodline of the immemorial Ten Ferocities, but the degree of atavism was different.","Clearly, even if this was not a pure-blooded golden roc, it was an extremely pure ancestral divine bird.","“I think I’ve seen this divine bird before. I’ve seen this divine bird on Senior Chu’s shoulder before!”","Some people suddenly remembered something. Many people remembered that they had seen a fist-sized divine bird on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder. It looked quite handsome, but compared to the one in front of them, the difference was too big.","Many people did not expect that this divine bird was the one on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder.","Many people suddenly understood why the golden roc would help the Flying Celestials. It was because Chu Yunfan had subdued it.","“He can even subdue a golden roc. Senior Chu is really amazing. He’s indeed my idol!” someone exclaimed.","“Just this golden roc is already so powerful. How powerful is Senior Chu?” “Senior Chu is nowhere to be seen. I wonder where he is.’","“The situation is critical now.. It would be great if Senior Chu were here!”"]},{"number":2240,"title":"Chapter 2240: Chaotic Battle, Chu Yunfan Finally Appears","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Initially, no one was optimistic about Chu Yunfan’s combat strength. They only felt that although he was powerful, he should not be able to compete with those ancient geniuses who had cultivated far more than him.","Now, with the appearance of the golden roc, everyone’s thoughts changed.","One had to know that a descendant of the Ten Ferocities like the golden roc must be extremely arrogant. To be able to make such a vicious bird submit to him, Chu Yunfan’s strength could not be inferior to the golden roc.","Some people vaguely knew that these ancient geniuses were cultivating in the Flying Celestial Mystic Realm, so they guessed that Chu Yunfan was probably still in seclusion.","They were looking forward to Chu Yunfan breaking out of seclusion and saving the world.","Rumble!","The huge ring was divided into several battlefields. Sword Saint and Chu Hongcai!s sword wills were constantly competing.","Although Sword Saint’s cultivation had surpassed Chu Hongcai’s, the Indestructible Sword Physique that Chu Hongcai had cultivated was closer to the sword path than Sword Saint’s physique.","Although his cultivation was far superior to Chu Hongcai’s, Sword Saint was unable to suppress Chu Hongcai.","Even if he managed to suppress Chu Hongcai, he would have to start all over again if Chu Hongcai dodged a little.","He gradually lost his patience and shouted, “Do you only know how to dodge?","Fight me if you have the ability!’","“Hahaha!” Chu Hongcai laughed. “You think you’re worthy of fighting me? If I had the same amount of cultivation time, 1 would kill you as easily as killing ants!”","Chu Hongcai didn’t choose to fight Sword Saint head-on. He knew the difference too well. The laws condensed by Sword Saint were almost twice as many as the ones condensed by him. The difference between them was like the difference between Heaven and Earth.","Although they were both Supreme Youths, if the difference in their cultivation was too great, there was no way for them to fight.","If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s Prismatic Traveller technique, Chu Hongcai would have been defeated long ago.","He was no match for Sword Saint, but he was unwilling to retreat either. Not only did he want to buy time for Huangfu Longhao and reduce the pressure on the latter, but more importantly, meeting a sword expert like Sword Saint made his blood boil.","He had never felt this way before!","Ever since his Indestructible Sword Physique had been completed, no one could compete with him in the sword path. For example, Chu Yunfan, although his cultivation was far stronger than his, Chu Hongcai was still above Chu Yunfan in the sword path.","The opponents he had encountered were all experts from various schools. There were very few swordsmen like Sword Saints who only used their swords to defeat their opponents.","Two completely different sword principles were clashing in the air. For him, this was a great opportunity to verify his own sword principles.","Usually, there was no such person who could make him attack at will!","On the other side, the battle between the iron-armored Supreme Youth and the golden roc had also entered a white-hot stage. The speed of the golden roc was too fast, and its entire body turned into rays of golden light that flickered on the stage. Even the iron-armored Supreme Youth had a hard time keeping up with the speed of the golden roc, let alone contending with it.","As the saying went, speed was the only thing that could not be broken in the world of martial arts. The golden roc’s speed was already extremely fast. In","addition, Chu Yunfan had taught him the Prismatic Traveller too. It could be said that in terms of speed, it was simply at the peak.","In the ring, there was no existence that could match him.","However, the iron-armored Supreme Youth was not someone easy to deal with. To be able to cultivate to this extent, this Supreme Youth’s strength was absolutely unquestionable. It was unimaginably tyrannical.","Even though he was unable to catch up to the golden roc in terms of speed, he did not give up. Around him, countless blood-colored battlefields formed, and countless armies covered the sky and covered the earth as they charged in all directions.","No matter where the golden roc appeared, it would face the slaughter of countless armies. This was not a battle that he was fighting alone. He could command thousands of troops to fight.","Moreover, he had already integrated the Killing Dao on the battlefield into his own martial arts and could activate it at any time. It could be said that his cultivation had reached a shocking level.","Even so, he was still very depressed. He had never been this down. No matter how he attacked, it was difficult for him to keep up with the speed of the golden roc.","“The mighty Flying Celestials actually relies on a feathered beast to maintain their dignity. Don’t you think it’s ridiculous?”","The iron-armored Supreme Youth tried to provoke the golden roc. However, the golden roc obviously didn’t care. In his heart, completing the task his master had given him was his top priority.","“Who do you think you are to criticize me?” Even so, the golden roc was still somewhat angry and could not help but increase the intensity of his encirclement.","On the other side, the remaining five people began to launch the final encirclement and suppression against Huangfu Longhao.","Although each of them had their ulterior motives, everyone understood that only by killing Huangfu Longhao and the other three Supreme Youths would their sects have a future.","Otherwise, even if they managed to snatch away the foundation of the Flying Celestials, there would still be a chance for them to turn the tables when the few Supreme Youths of the Flying Celestials grew up.","Supreme Youths were existences that could at least be conferred the title of king, or even emperor.","Even if only one of them grew up, it would be enough to pose a fatal threat to them, making them unable to sleep or eat in peace.","Thinking of this, these Supreme Youths emitted a fierce light. They couldn’t let these few Supreme Youths of the Flying Celestials grow.","They had to get rid of the root of the problem. They absolutely could not give them the slightest chance to counterattack.","Although Huangfu Longhao had taken a short break with the help of the golden roc and Chu Hongcai, he was not at his peak.","Right now, he was only barely holding his breath in battle, and the entire battle had fallen into a state of retreat.","“Hahaha, Huangfu Longhao, you’ve finally met your end. Your Flying Celestials has killed the successors of my Elements. Today, we’ll use your blood as a sacrifice!”","Elements Kid sensed Huangfu Longhao’s weakened state and immediately increased the strength of his attacks. All kinds of elemental power turned into terrifying torrents and attacked Huangfu Longhao fiercely.","Bam!","Finally, Huangfu Longhao coughed up a mouthful of blood under the fierce attacks. His entire body flew out like a kite with a broken string.","Just as Elements Kid and the others were about to kill him, a terrifying sword light flew over from the sky. In an instant, half of Elements Kid’s body was shattered.."]},{"number":2241,"title":"Chapter 2241: Like a God","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This terrifying turn of events shocked everyone present.","Everyone was stunned as if they had not expected such a change. ‘Did ab old monster of the Flying Celestials make a move?’ some people wondered.","After all, with the strength of Elements Kid, even if he hadn’t completely cultivated 500 laws, he was already approaching this limit. It could be said that it was not easy for even a top Supreme Youth who had cultivated 500 laws to defeat him.","A single strike was enough to destroy half of Elements Kid’s body. How terrifying was this strength? Even Huangfu Longhao, the publicly acknowledged Supreme Youth, could not do it.","Other than the old monsters of the Flying Celestials, who else could be so terrifying?","Many people could not help but think in the same direction.","They looked in the direction of the sword light and saw a person in a moon-white robe walking over step by step. He seemed slow but was actually fast. In an instant, he had already arrived in the ring.","The sunlight shone on his body, making him look extraordinary, like a god in the sky.","His appearance caused all the Flying Celestials disciples to look excited. It was a ray of hope that suddenly appeared when they were on the verge of failure, and it illuminated everything.","This was a young and delicate looking man. His moon-white robe swayed in the breeze, looking like a dream. “Senior Chu!”","Many people couldn’t help but cheer.","“It’s Senior Chu who has come out of seclusion!”","“There’s hope!’","Many people the burden on their shoulders lighten. At the most critical moment, they saw Chu Yunfan’s appearance. Without a doubt, it gave them hope again.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan looked extremely majestic. He had just appeared, but he had already dealt a heavy blow to Elements Kid. He made people feel like he was like an invincible mountain.","Many people were excited, and many disciples of the Flying Celestials couldn’t help tearing up.","Even Sima Longyun, who had a grudge with Chu Yunfan, was excited. Compared to the life and death of the Flying Celestials, his little conflict with Chu Yunfan was nothing.","Even the other Supreme Youths had no choice but to turn their heads. Their hearts skipped a beat. Their originally cold expressions and victory in their hands changed into fluster.","“Junior Chu, you’ve finally figured it out!” Huangfu Longhao said as he coughed up a mouthful of blood.","For some reason, when he saw Chu Yunfan, he could not help but feel relieved, even though he did not know Chu Yunfan’s true strength.","“Senior Huangfu, you’ve worked hard. You should heal well. Just sit back and watch me take care of these people!” Chu Yunfan said lightly.","Under the sunlight, he was like a god. Just by standing there, it seemed to illuminate everyone’s hearts.","“Senior Chu!”","“Senior Chu!”","“Senior Chu!”","At this moment, no one knew who shouted first, but everyone followed suit and cheered, their shouts shaking the sky.","At this moment of despair, they desperately needed someone to inspire them and stir up their last hope.","The seven powerful Supreme Youths looked at each other in dismay, especially Elements Kid, whose body had been blown off. He looked pained as he forcefully activated a secret technique to recover his injuries while staring at Chu Yunfan.","He knew that this person before him was extremely terrifying, even more terrifying than Huangfu Longhao.","Although he was caught off guard just now and half of his body was shattered, this was not something an ordinary person could do. It was enough to show how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","Chu Hongcai and the golden roc also shook off their opponents and stood behind Chu Yunfan.","This allowed everyone to recover some confidence. Although these ancient Supreme Youths were very terrifying and there were many of them, there were many Supreme Youths on their side. There were a total of four of them. They were not at a complete disadvantage in terms of numbers like before.","Even Huangfu Longhao could fight seven of them alone.","At this moment, the ice-cold Icy War asked, “Who are you? How should I address you?”","The seven people’s gazes were all focused on Chu Yunfan. They did not know how so many Supreme Youths had appeared in the Flying Celestials one after another.","Especially this last one, he had never heard of Chu Yunfan before and had never seen him on the Prodigy Battlefield.","They were a little puzzled. Most of these Supreme Youths had proven their strength and existence on the Prodigy Battlefield. There was basically no one who had never heard of them.","However, this person in front of them was truly unheard of.","“Chu Yunfan of the Flying Celestials,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","They looked at Chu Yunfan and were sure that they had never heard of this name before. However, from the looks of the Flying Celestials disciples, it was obvious that they had long heard of Chu Yunfan’s name.","He should not be some unknown person.","“Do you think that you alone can stop the seven of us?” the red-robed Fire Dance said. Her beautiful face carried a cold killing intent.","This matter was related to the revival of their Blazing Mountain. No one could stop it.","“We’ll know soon if I can stop you!” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “With me here, you have no chance of winning. If you leave now, I will spare your lives on account of the fact that your physiques are rare and even harder to cultivate. Otherwise, you will not be able to escape death!”","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, there was nothing to pity about these people. However, their physiques were rare and special. It could be said that they had seized the fortune of heaven and earth. It would be a pity to kill them.","The seven people’s expressions were a little ugly. They could hear the arrogance in Chu Yunfan’s words. He didn’t put them in his eyes at all.","It was as if he could kill them at any time, but he actually advised them to leave.","This completely angered these arrogant people. Chu Yunfan dared to be so arrogant. As a Supreme Youth, who could be stronger than the other? Moreover, they had an absolute advantage in numbers.","Even if Chu Hongcai was counted in, it would be at most three and a half, which was only half of theirs.","“How arrogant. I’ve never seen anyone more arrogant than me!”","At this moment, the iron-armored Supreme Youth made his move. His entire body was filled with fighting spirit. Suddenly, the world was filled with boundless fighting spirit. At this time, the halberd in his hand turned into a terrifying divine light, wanting to split Chu Yunfan in half.","This was his strongest attack. He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan or at least severely injure him.","The terrifying light covered the light of the sun and became the only source of light in the world.","Clang!","With a crisp sound, Chu Yunfan actually stretched out two fingers to catch this terrifying attack. Then, he broke this divine light into a rain of light.."]},{"number":2242,"title":"Chapter 2242: 500 Laws Isn’t the Limit","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","A terrifying battle was about to erupt. The iron-armored Supreme Youth attacked instantly, holding nothing back. After his attack failed, the others launched their assaults again.","Among the six Supreme Youths, except for Sword Saint, who had yet to make","a move, the others all acted. Thousands of multicolored lights descended one after another, painting the sky with vibrant colors. It was breathtakingly beautiful, yet contained an unimaginable, terrifying power, making it extremely dangerous and horrifying.","When the six of them attacked, they seemed to almost tear through heaven and earth, as if intent on creating a brand-new world.","Simultaneously, Sword Saint pointed his sword at Chu Hongcai. Chu Hongcai finally understood Sword Saint’s intention—it was a duel between two swordsmen, disrupted by Chu Yunfan’s earlier arrival and now set to continue. Despite the vast gap in their cultivation, Chu Hongcai’s fighting spirit burned fiercely, unwilling to yield.","The two of them ascended into the sky, leaving the ring to those battling below.","At that moment, Sima Longyun and the others were forced to retreat by the terrifying shockwave generated by the six combatants joining forces, rendering them unable to stand on the stage,","This was true terror—the combined power of these six individuals had surpassed all limits, instilling profound fear in those “itnessing it.","Only the golden roc and Huangfu Longhao managed to stabilize themselves in the ring, ready to engage in the unprecedented battle at any moment, despite being outnumbered.","Chu Yunfan, however, remained unperturbed. Unafraid of the six opponents, he clenched his fists, radiating a terrifying golden light.","Behind him, eight dragons materialized, their presence overwhelming the collapsing sky. These dragons nullified countless attacks upon landing, emanating a divine and vast power that stemmed from the Eight Astonishing Punches, a technique that had transcended mere techniques upon Chu Yunfan’s advancement into the Divine Treasure Stage.","The power was so immense that it stunned everyone present. As Chu Yunfan unleashed his Dao, it instantly overshadowed the Dao of the other Supreme Youths, leaving them feeling powerless and inferior. “How can one possess such overwhelming power?”","“He commands over 500 laws!”","“Even Huangfu Longhao pales in comparison!”","The ancient Supreme Youths were astonished by Chu Yunfan’s display of strength.","The distant spectators were further astounded, their shock bordering on sheer terror. Singlehandedly, he subdued the six Supreme Youths—what kind of extraordinary strength was this? It was as if he stood peerless in the entire world.","He reigned as the king among the Supreme Youths.","Chu Yunfan’s punch materialized into eight dragons, nearly compelling the six Supreme Youths to kneel in submission.","“Is the former number one prodigy truly that formidable? They used to say he could rival Jun Tianci in the future, but it seems those claims were misguided.","How could Jun Tianci even compare to his strength?”","Recollections emerged of how people once heralded Chu Yunfan as the next Jun Tianci. In hindsight, it seemed utterly absurd. After all, Jun Tianci’s prowess was at best on par with these Supreme Youths, whereas Chu Yunfan’s strength clearly transcended theirs.","Above, the eight dragons radiated an infinite brilliance, enveloped in the illumination of Dao and reason, their roars echoing ceaselessly.","“Let us unleash everything we have!”","One after another, the Supreme Youths bellowed, their bodies quivering under the strain. The formidable divine radiance threatened to shatter every cell in their beings, and their bones seemed on the verge of splintering.","“Kill them!”","Elements Kid was the first to mount a counteroffensive. The elemental forces around him coalesced into the forms of the five divine beasts: the Azure Dragon, White Tiger, Black Tortoise, Vermilion Bird, and the Qilin. Shielded by these divine guardians, he continued to stagger back, blood still staining his lips, in a desperate attempt to evade Chu Yunfan’s relentless assault.","Meanwhile, the others fought with unwavering determination, their lives hanging by a thread. In this critical moment, luck seemed to abandon them entirely. Each strike from Chu Yunfan rendered them feeling nearly invincible.","Against such a formidable opponent, resistance seemed futile. Acknowledging the insurmountable odds, they unleashed their abilities and retreated from the battlefield.","Boom!","The onslaught of the eight dragons struck the ring floor, shattering it and leaving a gaping hole in its wake.","Such an occurrence was unprecedented. Even the most formidable Supreme Youths had only managed to create minor cracks in the past, reaching the peak of their capabilities. Yet now, with a mere casual punch, Chu Yunfan had torn a significant hole through the entire ring.","The sheer magnitude of this feat was beyond imagination, leaving all witnesses utterly astounded.","“Junior Chu...” Huangfu Longhao found himself at a loss for words, his astonishment evident.","He realized that his cultivation level wasn’t vastly different from that of the Supreme Youths. Despite mastering 500 laws, in comparison to them, he was only slightly stronger.","Engaging in combat against one or two opponents was manageable for him. However, facing more than three could result in defeat, and confronting seven would undoubtedly lead to his demise.","Nevertheless, he had no alternative. He was willing to sacrifice everything for the sake of the Flying Celestials.","Yet, Chu Yunfan’s strength surpassed his wildest expectations. It was evident that it exceeded the confines of mastering 500 laws.","“500 laws, isn’t that the limit?” Huangfu Longhao’s shock deepened.","He had never entertained the idea of surpassing the threshold of 500 laws. Achieving that milestone alone had posed an immense challenge for him. Even for a Supreme Youth, attaining mastery of 500 laws to perfection was exceedingly arduous, let alone surpassing it.","Throughout history, emperors of similar caliber typically reached a maximum of 500 laws. Huangfu Longhao was confident in his ability to contend with any young emperor at his level.","However, Chu Yunfan’s displayed strength shattered this preconceived limitation, revealing an entirely new realm.","It became evident that, for Supreme Youths, 500 laws were not the ultimate boundary. There existed the potential to break through to even greater heights.","Having narrowly escaped Chu Yunfan’s onslaught, the Supreme Youths felt an overwhelming sense of fortune for preserving their lives.","As they gazed upon Chu Yunfan once more, they couldn’t help but see him as a formidable entity, reminiscent of how others had once viewed them.."]},{"number":2243,"title":"Chapter 2243: It’s Your Turn","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","As Huangfu Longhao realized that 500 laws were not the ultimate limit, the others came to the same understanding. However, they were at a loss as to how to break through to this higher realm. For them, 500 laws indeed represented the peak of their potential. Little did they know about the unique nature of Chu Yunfan’s cultivation.","Chu Yunfan possessed three distinct types of emperor physiques, a feat beyond the reach of ordinary individuals. Moreover, he benefitted from the godhead, the memories of Alchemy Emperors, and various other advantages that set him apart from typical Supreme Youths. Chu Yunfan had things that ordinary Supreme Youths did not have.","“To evade my attack is no small feat!” A faint twitch appeared at the corner of Chu Yunfan’s mouth as he regarded the Supreme Youths, his gaze akin to that of someone observing a dead person.","The chasm between mastering 500 laws and 1,000 laws was akin to the gulf between heaven and earth. Chu Yunfan’s capabilities far exceeded the expectations of these Supreme Youths; he surpassed the boundary of 500 laws.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan lifted his gaze toward Chu Hongcai and Sword Saint locked in combat in the void. Their clash transformed the sky into a realm of swordsmanship, with countless awe-inspiring sword techniques emanating from their movements.","Neither of them relied on any other techniques; their confrontation was solely a test of sword wills, techniques, movements, and energy—a pure showdown between two swordsmen.","Both had attained an exceptional understanding of the sword path. However, compared to Sword Saint, Chu Hongcai’s cultivation lagged far behind. In such a duel, he found himself entirely disadvantaged.","Yet, despite being repeatedly pushed back and enduring injuries that made him cough up blood, Chu Hongcai’s Indestructible Sword Physique gradually revealed its terrifying might. With each setback, the pace at which he condensed the laws hastened. In a remarkably short span, he progressed from having condensed 200 laws to achieving the 201st. Though only a single law, it propelled Chu Hongcai’s cultivation forward, enabling him to continually condense more laws.","True to expectation, the intensity of his advancement accelerated in the crucible of life-and-death combat.","Forced to the brink, Chu Hongcai remained wholly absorbed in the battle, refusing to let distraction creep in. Any lapse in focus could result in being cleaved in two by Sword Saint.","In such circumstances, his inherent potential and the formidable might of the Indestructible Sword Physique surged forth.","Yet, despite this, his predicament had reached a critical juncture. After all, the number of laws he had condensed amounted to less than half of his opponent’s. Simply surviving up to this point without succumbing to an easy death, as most top-tier geniuses would have, posed an immense challenge.","In a swift motion, Chu Yunfan extended his hand, transforming it into a colossal appendage that ensnared Sword Saint.","“Agh!” Sword Saint cried out as he was captured, his protective sword light proving futile against the grasp of the colossal hand.","Just as Sword Saint braced himself for what seemed like an imminent demise,","he was astonished to find that Chu Yunfan refrained from delivering a fatal blow.","“Chu Yunfan, you’re disrupting a fair duel between two swordsmen!” Sword Saint’s roar resonated as if he found it unforgivable to be interrupted in the final stages of the battle.","Indeed, this confrontation not only greatly benefited Chu Hongcai but also provided him with invaluable insights. Despite his inferior cultivation compared to Sword Saint, Chu Hongcai’s understanding of swordsmanship, guided by Chu Yunfan’s mentorship and his own comprehension, proved to be on par, if not superior.","To him, this presented a rare opportunity, a once-in-a-lifetime chance to unleash his attacks without fear of retaliation from Chu Hongcai.","“Fair? Your cultivation far surpasses his. How can this be considered fair? If fairness is what you seek, then let’s level the playing field!” Chu Yunfan remarked casually.","Before Sword Saint could grasp what had transpired, he sensed a stagnation in the divine power coursing through his body. Then, to his astonishment, he discovered that a substantial portion of his divine power had been sealed away. Half of his laws were now dormant, leaving him with a mere 200 or so. Though still slightly superior to Chu Hongcai, he no longer held an overwhelming advantage.","Instantly filled with dread, a shiver ran down his spine. Never before had he encountered such a formidable technique. Laws, born of personal comprehension, lacked physical form; they were the manifestation of martial will. The notion of sealing a law that one had already grasped was unheard of, yet Chu Yunfan had achieved it.","Only then did Sword Saint comprehend Chu Yunfan’s concept of a fair fight:","by sealing his cultivation, he elevated Chu Hongcai’s prowess","The intent behind this was glaringly apparent. It was clear that Chu Yunfan aimed to employ him as a whetstone for Chu Hongcai, refining his cultivation.","Enraged, he refused to be treated like an insignificant insect, preferring death over such disdain. Yet, the hand that had seized him dissolved into a shower of light and dispersed.","Chu Hongcai, too, discerned Chu Yunfan’s intent. Despite the insights gained from their previous battle, the risks were too great. However, with Sword Saint now only marginally superior, he saw an opportunity to refine his skills using him as a whetstone.","With determination, Chu Hongcai advanced swiftly, his sword unleashing a dazzling rainbow that closed in on Sword Saint in an instant.","Reacting swiftly, Sword Saint launched a counterattack. Though his power had been sealed, he remained a formidable adversary.","Thus began the intense clash between the two eminent swordsmen.","As Chu Yunfan’s gaze returned to the ring, a wave of terror swept over everyone, particularly as they witnessed his casual intervention in the battle between the two Supreme Youths.","He forcefully sealed one of the Supreme Youth’s powers and the laws he had grasped. The method behind this maneuver remained unknown, but it was clear that such a feat was beyond the capabilities of anyone present.","“When did the Flying Celestials acquire such a terrifying being?!”","“Have you forgotten that Chu Yunfan astounded an entire era over a decade ago? He defeated Li Qianyuan, the top prodigy of that time!”","“So he’s Chu Yunfan, but wasn’t he supposed to be dead?”","“Rumor has it that he perished at the hands of Jun Tianci. Who could have imagined that not only did he survive, but he also emerged with such astounding strength! ”","“Some speculated that he spent the past decade recuperating. Now, it appears he not only recovered but also dedicated himself to rigorous cultivation. How else could he possess such formidable power?” “It’s your turn!” Chu Yunfan addressed the crowd.."]},{"number":2244,"title":"Chapter 2244: Killing Supreme Youths Consecutively, Invincible","paragraphs":["Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s words resonated like a death knell, reverberating throughout the entire ring. The six remaining Supreme Youths wore expressions of utmost gravity.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan sprang into action. His fist clenched, he unleashed a powerful punch.","Boom!","An enormous explosion reverberated, unleashing a terrifying shockwave that rippled in all directions. Many were temporarily deafened by the thunderous noise, left reeling from its immense force.","Without the protective barrier of the ring, Chu Yunfan’s punch possessed enough destructive power to reduce a city to rubble. Yet, the impact was even more staggering. It seemed as though Chu Yunfan’s fist had pierced through the very fabric of the sky, causing even the stage’s barrier to tremble violently.","“Kill him!”","The desperate cries of the Supreme Youths filled the air as they faced imminent peril. The onslaught nearly brought them to their knees, their collective roar echoing as they pushed their divine power to its limits, their black hair billowing in the tumult. Despite their efforts, they remained unable to withstand the onslaught of the eight dragons unleashed by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","The eight celestial dragons materialized, subduing all manner of demons and monsters with their physical presence.","“Set up a barrier!”","Fire Dance’s resounding command spurred the Supreme Youths into action. They had never collaborated before as their individual pride and strength rendered cooperation unnecessary. Yet, in an instant, an unspoken understanding was forged among them. At their level, their motives often aligned, despite being adversaries.","With swift precision, the six of them combined their efforts to erect a barrier, albeit fleeting, before succumbing to the overwhelming pressure of the eight heavenly dragons.","“Aagh!’","The cries erupted from the six Supreme Youths as they spewed mouthfuls of blood, propelled backward by the force of their collision with Chu Yunfan.","As they cast their gaze upon Chu Yunfan once more, disbelief clouded their eyes. His displayed strength had surpassed all expectations, utterly overwhelming them. Even their combined might was futile against a single strike from him. In their perception, Chu Yunfan now stood as a fearsome entity, transcending even the Divine Treasure Stage.","Having broken through their joint assault, Chu Yunfan wasted no time, swiftly advancing toward the iron-armored Supreme Youth.","Reacting with remarkable speed, the iron-armored Supreme Youth unleashed a dazzling halberd light, rending reality asunder with its sheer force. Yet, Chu Yunfan remained undeterred, towering above as he slowly brought down his colossal hand. In a mesmerizing display of power, the formidable halberd light was steadily crushed, inch by inch.","“Go all out! All out!” The Supreme Youth’s continuous roar echoed futilely. Yet, in the next instant, he found himself smacked by Chu Yunfan with such force that his entire body exploded. Bones shattered, and he met a tragic end, his corpse swiftly drawn into the Mountain River Diagram by Chu Yunfan. The blood essence of a Supreme Youth in the Divine Treasure Stage held immense value for Chu Yunfan.","Against Chu Yunfan, this Supreme Youth was practically defenseless. Both were Supreme Youths, both in the Divine Treasure Stage. However, the gulf between mastering 500 laws and 1,000 laws was akin to the chasm between heaven and earth.","Indeed, in the final moment, Chu Yunfan had successfully cultivated the thousandth law, achieving perfection in the Divine Treasure Stage. Even without reaching 1,000 laws, the strength of 999 was more than enough to overwhelm these Supreme Youths. It was just that the journey wasn’t so straightforward.","Though the disparity between 500 and 999 laws wasn’t as vast as a Great Dao, the completion of the final law marked a qualitative shift. This transformation was starkly evident in combat prowess. With ease, Chu Yunfan thwarted the joint assault of the six Supreme Youths and dispatched them.","“A Supreme Youth has fallen!”","Some struggled to grasp the reality of witnessing the demise of such a revered figure. It was a truth difficult to digest.","These Supreme Youths had been hailed as prodigies for millions of years. Had they not chosen to be sealed till this era, they would have reigned as unrivaled titans, the pinnacle of power in their respective epochs.","Indeed, there were periods when no other Supreme Youth emerged for a millennium, making each one a singular sovereign.","Yet now, an unparalleled monarch had met a casual end at the hands of Chu Yunfan. The event shattered their perception of the world, leaving their beliefs and ideologies shattered in its wake.","Fear gripped the onlookers, especially those affiliated with ancient factions who observed from the shadows.","They beheld what seemed like the ascent of a supreme being, and even the six formidable Supreme Youths in the ring couldn’t help but feel a twinge of fear at the sight of Chu Yunfan’s ominous countenance, their bodies trembling involuntarily.","Yet, at this juncture, reconciliation between the two sides was out of the question. From the moment Chu Yunfan claimed his first victim among them, their fates were sealed.","While they remained shocked and indecisive, Chu Yunfan had already closed in on his next target. This individual happened to be Elements Kid, who bore the brunt of Chu Yunfan’s previous assault.","With a cultivation of only 490 laws, Elements Kid stood as the weakest among the Supreme Youths present. Moreover, the injuries inflicted by Chu Yunfan had left him severely pale.","Having endured severe injuries repeatedly, his efforts to mend himself had drained him of blood essence and divine power.","“Chu Yunfan, you think you can kill me? That’s impossible!” Elements Kid bellowed, his fury igniting a brutal aura that engulfed him, transforming him into a sinister specter from the depths of hell.","His entire being surged with divine power. coalescing into a Grand Elements","Array that spun with formidable speed. Harnessing the elemental forces of heaven and earth, it surged toward Chu Yunfan with devastating force.","Yet Chu Yunfan remained unfazed as if every move by Elements Kid had been anticipated. With a simple yet potent punch, he pierced through the very fabric of the sky, unleashing a power unmatched by any other in the world.","The Grand Elements Array shattered into oblivion upon impact.","Unyielding, Chu Yunfan’s fist continued its trajectory, tearing through heaven and earth until it pierced through the chest of Elements Kid.","“Omg!’","Elements Kid spat out blood, hurtling backward like a broken kite until he crashed to the ground below.","It was then that onlookers realized the gaping hole in his chest.","Elements Kid had met his demise.."]},{"number":2245,"title":"Chapter 2245: Extermination","paragraphs":["Chapter 2245: Extermination","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was an understatement!","When Chu Yunfan killed Elements Kid, it was not difficult.","Even the most ignorant person could see the gap between them at this moment!","The gap between Chu Yunfan and these Supreme Youths had already reached an astonishing level.","“Is he a monster? Why isn’t even a Supreme Youth his match?” someone said in disbelief.","In many people’s minds, the Supreme Youths should be the strongest batch of talents in the world. It was difficult to tell who was stronger among the emperors.","Every single Supreme Youth was an invincible existence. The six of them working together were enough to destroy everything.","However, nobody expected Chu Yunfan to beat them up so easily.","What they didn’t know was that even in ancient times, there was a difference in strength between emperors. There were differences between emperors.","The Emperor Supreme, the founder of the Extreme Emperor Technique that Chu Yunfan cultivated, was known as the strongest emperor. He could fight a group of people alone without any pressure.","Not to mention that Chu Yunfan also cultivated two different emperor physiques at the same time.","His cultivation was so strong that even the Emperor Supreme, who was in the same level as him, couldn’t defeat him.","These Supreme Youths rarely fought with each other, so they were not clear about it. However, this did not prevent them from noticing the huge gap between them and Chu Yunfan.","“Chu Yunfan, do you have to kill all of us before you stop?” Fire Dance’s expression was cold as she watched Chu Yunfan slowly take out the Mountain River Cauldron.","With the Mountain River Cauldron as the center, it transformed into a huge barrier that surrounded the entire arena. No matter how stupid they were, they understood Chu Yunfan’s meaning. He would not allow any of them to escape.","Thinking of this, they couldn’t help but be shocked and angry. Once upon a","time, they were so high-spirited. Who would have thought that they would be forced to a dead end by Chu Yunfan now?","Chu Yunfan’s actions made it clear that there was no possibility of reconciliation at all. One side was bound to fall.","“That’s right. Didn’t you want to kill us all before? I’m just copying everything you’ve done!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","He knew what these Supreme Youths were thinking. They were afraid that the elites and Supreme Youths of the Flying Celestials would seek revenge on them after they rose to power.","After all, they could not always be on guard against this.","Chu Yunfan was the same. Since he had already reached this step, there was no possibility of backing down. If they didn’t die, he would die.","As for offending the forces behind them?","That was not within Chu Yunfan’s consideration. They had already come knocking on his door. Both sides had long shed all pretense of cordiality and would not rest until one of them was dead.","If he lost this battle, the Flying Celestials would lose its foundation. At that time, the legacy of the Flying Celestials would probably be thrown into the bottomless abyss.","These Supreme Youths were shocked and furious at the same time, and their anger erupted to the extreme!","“Chu Yunfan, do you really think we can’t do anything to you?” At this moment, one of the remaining four powerful Supreme Youths tore a scroll in his hand.","Dazzling light burst out from the scroll, enveloping many Supreme Youths within it.","Under the illumination of this ball of light, these Supreme Youths condensed into one person.","It was an existence that was about ten feet tall and looked extremely tall. It was as majestic as an iron tower.","As soon as this person appeared, the pressure he brought stunned the entire scene. Many people were afraid that they could not feel it personally because of the barrier, but they could still see how shocking the pressure was.","“What method is that? Why did the Supreme Youths fuse into one?” someone exclaimed.","Everything that had happened was beyond their understanding.","First, Chu Yunfan appeared in a domineering manner and beat up those Supreme Youths like beating dogs. Then, these Supreme Youths were forced to the extreme and chose to fuse together.","“What a powerful technique!’","Of course, Chu Yunfan could tell that this burly man in front of him was the incarnation of those Supreme Youths.","His body contained several completely different auras, but they were balanced under the effect of a divine power.","Not only would it not be affected by this completely different divine power, but it would also be able to turn all of it into its own power.","Of course, he had heard of this kind of fusion method. It was just that he did not expect that it could actually reach this step.","It could be said that everyone’s strength was completely added together. This was not one plus one equals two, but one plus one was completely greater than two.","The Supreme Youth in front of them had more than 500 laws in his body. With the four of them working together, he actually condensed more than 900 laws. His entire body was emitting an extremely terrifying aura.","Just his aura alone could crush the heavens!","This was their true trump card for this trip. However, this trump card was originally only an insurance. None of them had thought that they would one day use this trump card.","Who would have thought that they would be beaten up by the newcomer Chu Yunfan? If they didn’t use this trump card, they would probably die.","“It’s over. Junior Chu is in danger. These people are really shameless. They can’t beat Junior Chu, so they actually used such a method!” Huangfu Longhao said anxiously. He did not expect that these enemies had so many trump cards. They had been forced to a dead end, yet they still had such a method.","The laws in this person’s body must have far exceeded the limit of 500. It even made Huangfu Longhao feel an unprecedented pressure. That feeling made people feel unprecedented fear.","“l didn’t expect you to have such a method!” Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but clap his hands and praise.","“That’s right, Chu Yunfan. We didn’t expect you to force us to this extent. You are very good!” the burly man said in a deep voice filled with hatred, “As a reward, we have decided to send you on your way!’","The burly man’s expression filled with confidence, Now that he had regained the high ground, he could stand high above Chu Yunfan and no longer put him in his eyes.","“Very good, but how long can you maintain this state? I’m afraid it won’t last long!” Chu Yunfan said.","“That’s right, but it’s long enough to kill you!” the burly man said arrogantly without denying it.","He knew that it was useless to deny it in front of Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan wouldn’t be fooled by such a petty trick.."]},{"number":2246,"title":"Chapter 2246: Who Gave You the Courage?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2246: Who Gave You the Courage?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was a very special divine power that could allow the power of these Supreme Youths to fuse into one and be used by them.","However, at the same time, this divine power had a short time limit. After all, they were forcefully fused together.","Chu Yunfan could tell that this kind of divine power should have been prepared for people who cultivated the same kind of divine power. In the memories of the Alchemy Emperor, Chu Yunfan had also discovered a similar divine power.","And the martial arts that these Supreme Youths cultivated naturally couldn’t be the same divine power and cultivation method. That was why there was that scroll that forcefully fused them into one.","It was an extremely amazing method!","However, it was impossible for them to forcefully fuse into one for too long. Otherwise, it would be too heaven-defying!","When everyone saw this method, they could not help but exclaim in admiration. They could even feel the terrifying aura erupting from this burly man.","It was simply despairing.","It was not something that an ordinary Supreme Youth could compare to. Even Huangfu Longhao’s face turned pale. This burly man was too terrifying.","The divine power on his body was surging, like the blazing sun between heaven and earth. It was dazzling and holy.","“Kill me? Hahahaha, who gave you this confidence? That Ningxia guy?” Chu Yunfan burst into laughter.","The others didn’t understand what Chu Yunfan meant. They were confused, but they could hear the mockery in Chu Yunfan’s tone.","“Are you courting death?” At this moment, the burly man stared at Chu Yunfan. “Then we’ll have to see if you can do it!”","Chu Yunfan smiled coldly.","The burly man attacked and arrived in front of Chu Yunfan in an instant.","Quick, quick, quick!","It was so fast that everyone’s eyes couldn’t keep up. Two afterimages tore through the sky. Everyone saw that the burly man was still standing in the same place, but in the next moment, he had appeared in front of Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","In an instant, the sky exploded.","This attack seemed to have surpassed the limit that the world could bear. This burly man’s attack had completely surpassed the Supreme Youth who had 500 laws. It was equivalent to a terrifying existence who had condensed at least 800 laws.","He had such confidence and such ability. A perfected Supreme Youth like Huangfu Longhao might not be able to block his punch. The difference between the two was too great.","It had already completed a qualitative change.","Clang!","The burly man’s attack was easily blocked by Chu Yunfan.","The terrifying divine light that burst out shattered the world.","“How is this possible?” The burly man did not expect Chu Yunfan to be able to block his attack so easily.","Could it be that Chu Yunfan was hiding his strength?","The burly man could not help but think so. The current Chu Yunfan was too terrifying.","“That’s all?” Chu Yunfan laughed coldly. The wind around him was like blades, blowing his clothes. He floated in the sky like a god above the nine heavens.","“Impossible!”","The burly man attacked again, and a terrifying aura covered the sky and earth. Behind him, it turned into a huge phantom. It was the embodiment of Dao, condensed from endless divine power, mixed with endless laws. It was all condensed into a big hand, and then suddenly grabbed toward Chu Yunfan.","The palm landed with supreme power, locking Chu Yunfan down completely, leaving him with no way to escape or dodge.","Chu Yunfan was even simpler. At his level, he didn’t care about what martial arts the opponent used. He grabbed at the air with his big hand, and a shocking sword will condensed. In an instant, it turned into a terrifying sword light that was thousands of feet long. Then, it suddenly slashed down at the big hand.","Boom!","There was another terrifying collision sound. The big hand was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s sword light, turning into a rain of light that scattered in all directions.","“What an astonishing sword intent!”","Outside the ring, the crowd could feel the terrifying tide formed by the collision. They stared at the sword in front of them with their mouths agape.","“I’ve never heard of Chu Yunfan being a swordsman. He actually has such an amazing understanding of sword intent! ”","“What’s so strange about that? You have to know that Chu Hongcai is equivalent to his disciple. Chu Hongcai once revealed that his cultivation was inherited from Chu Yunfan. If Chu Yunfan doesn’t understand the way of the sword, how can he teach Chu Hongcai, a top genius in the way of the sword?” someone immediately retorted.","When everyone heard this, it was very reasonable and they accepted it.","In the void, Chu Yunfan seemed to be playing around. The burly man in front of him was nothing to him, even though he had already cultivated 800 laws.","If he was facing Chu Yunfan, who only had 999 laws, he could still fight and cause some trouble for him.","After all, there was no fundamental difference between 800-plus laws and 999 laws. It was just a difference in quantity.","Although there was a difference, they were still on the same level.","However, it was different now. After Chu Yunfan cultivated the 1000th law, he had already been reborn. A quantitative change had led to a qualitative change,","They were not on the same level.","He only held a light sword formed from divine power in his hand and kept slashing down.","Bam!","Bam!","Bam!","Every time, it seemed like he wanted to kill this burly man.","The burly man seemed to have realized how terrifying Chu Yunfan was and no longer looked down on him like before.","He raised all the divine power in his body and formed a huge barrier in front of him to protect himself.","However, there was no way to defend against Chu Yunfan’s light sword. A casual sword attack could severely injure him.","It made him cough up blood and he kept retreating. He was beaten back step by step. He was completely no match for Chu Yunfan.","Around him, countless divine power collapsed, and countless divine powers were slashed apart by Chu Yunfan’s sword.","“Die! I’ll fight you to the death!” the burly man roared.","As a Supreme Youth, when had they ever been forced to such a state?","He could only roar repeatedly, raising his divine power and cultivation to the limit, and then shooting out a ball of flames.","The flames burned through heaven and earth as if they were going to melt","Chu Yunfan in the next moment.","This was the ability of Fire Dance’s Blazing Mountain. The cultivation of her fire divine art could be said to be earth-shattering.","However, what she didn’t expect was that Chu Yunfan actually opened his mouth and swallowed it.."]},{"number":2247,"title":"Chapter 2247: The Supreme Youth Team Is Destroyed","paragraphs":["Chapter 2247: The Supreme Youth Team Is Destroyed","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The burly man was stunned. He didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to deal with this destructive flame so simply and violently. Chu Yunfan simply swallowed the flames.","The burly man was instantly dumbfounded!","“You dare to be distracted while fighting me?” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Chu Yunfan grabbed a light sword and slashed down.","Before the burly man could react, he was almost split into two. At the critical moment, a Yin-Yang Barrier appeared in his body and blocked this shocking sword attack.","However, the barrier formed by the power of Yin and Yang could not stop Chu Yunfan!s sword. In an instant, it was cut into two by Chu Yunfan.","Immediately after, the momentum of this sword did not decrease as it slashed down toward the burly man.","However, this short time was enough for the burly man to react.","He dodged the fatal blow at the last moment.","Spurt!","The burly man spat out a mouthful of blood, and a huge crack appeared on his chest. It was caused by Chu Yunfan’s light sword.","If it were not for the barrier formed by the power of Yin and Yang, he would have been cut in half on the spot.","“Interesting. You have many tricks up your sleeve. but they are all","meaningless before me. Today, your only ending is death!” Chu Yunfan looked down at the burly man.","The burly man was furious. He knew that Chu Yunfan had overwhelming strength, but he was in no hurry to attack. Chu Yunfan was clearly toying with him.","However, there was nothing he could do.","He could only fight with his life!","At this point, how could they still have any hope of seizing the Flying Celestials’ foundation? In fact, it was already good enough for them to keep their lives.","His entire body was trembling and he looked as if he was looking at a monster!","They had never seen such a terrifying monster before. They knew very well how terrifying they were after they merged with each other. If it was the original them, it could be said that they would die within a few moves.","A quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change!","However, it was a different matter when it came to Chu Yunfan.","They had joined forces but were still suppressed by Chu Yunfan. If they hadn’t met him personally, they would never have thought that there was such a","terrifying existence.","‘How many laws has he cultivated? Eight hundred? 900?’","This question flashed through the burly man’s mind.","It was ridiculous that they couldn’t even see through Chu Yunfan!s cultivation level.","Just such a simple matter made them feel despair and unable to resist.","Chu Yunfan casually attacked without any restraint, but they were unable to stop him. They were all too clear about his attitude. This was how they had casually defeated the top-notch prodigies who were praised by countless people and feared by countless people.","“Your potential is only at this level. That’s it!”","Chu Yunfan seemed to have restrained the laziness on his face.","Everyone else was still in shock. They wondered how many laws Chu Yunfan had condensed to be so powerful.","However, they did not know how much time, experience, and effort Chu Yunfan had spent to be able to be so calm and graceful.","Swoosh!","In an instant, in front of Chu Yunfan, a sword light tore through the night sky like lightning. It was so dazzling that people couldn’t open their eyes. The speed of this sword was too fast, and in an instant, it had cut the burly man.","All the protective energy shield and barriers on the burly man’s body were so fragile that they were instantly shattered.","His entire body exploded in the air.","Four figures were slashed out by the sword. They were Fire Dance, the Yin Yang Twin Supremes, and Icy War.","The four figures fell out of the burly man’s body and spat out blood. Their faces were pale.","It was obvious that Chu Yunfan!s sword had severely injured them.","“Run!”","At this time, the four of them no longer had any thoughts of fighting Chu Yunfan. They had even used their last resort, but they still could not defeat the monster before them.","They could only wail in pain. It was not their fault for fighting!","The few of them turned into streaks of light and tried to break out of the barrier set up by Chu Yunfan. They all used their strongest power to break through the gap.","However, who would have thought that the entire barrier was so sturdy that it was impossible for them to make enough holes to escape.","Chu Yunfan caught up to them. He jumped up high and then stomped down.","“Nine Underworld Stomps!’","This kick brought up a sky full of netherworld water, corroding and devouring everything. This stomp seemed to be able to destroy the world as it ruthlessly landed on Fire Dance.","Spurt!","Fire Dance spat out a mouthful of blood, and she exploded in midair. However, this time, it was impossible for her to split into another person. Her body was truly crushed by Chu Yunfan’s stomp.","Then, her body was taken away by Chu Yunfan!","When many people saw this scene, they couldn’t help but feel pity. They felt that Chu Yunfan didn’t know how to cherish women. He didn’t even let go of a rare and beautiful young woman like Fire Dance. It was really a waste of heaven’s gift.","Countless of Fire Dance’s admirers were present, but at this moment, they could only watch helplessly as she died in the ring.","She died at Chu Yunfan’s hands!","Naturally, no one dared to seek revenge for Fire Dance. Without a doubt, that would be courting death.","Chu Yunfan naturally didn’t want to do that. To him, it didn’t matter whether Fire Dance was beautiful or ugly, because in his eyes, there were only friends and enemies.","After killing Fire Dance, Chu Yunfan immediately chased after Icy War. Icy War was already prepared. He blew out a breath of cold air and froze half the ring.","He tried to freeze Chu Yunfan to buy himself some time.","As for killing Chu Yunfan, that was something he didn’t even dare to think about because it was impossible.","However, how could he freeze Chu Yunfan? With the surge of energy and blood in Chu Yunfan’s body, the overwhelming cold air disappeared.","Then, Chu Yunfan easily removed Icy War’s head.","There was no difficulty at all.","“The two of you, since you’re here, don’t leave!” Chu Yunfan looked at the Yin Yang Twin Supremes and sneered.","The light sword in his hand slashed down, and the Yin-Yang Barrier appeared in front of the Yin Yang Twin Supremes. However, it was useless and was split into two by the sword.","The two Supreme Youths were unable to escape death under this sword. They were killed by this sword.."]},{"number":2248,"title":"Chapter 2248: A Domainian Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2248: A Domainian Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With the last Supreme Youth killed by Chu Yunfan, the battle for the Flying Celestials’ foundation finally came to an end.","In the end, the Flying Celestials won a complete victory, and all the ancient prodigies who came to invade were wiped out!","All the Flying Celestials disciples cheered in unison.","It wasn’t until the foundation was about to be taken away that they truly felt how important the Flying Celestials was to them.","They were on the same boat as the Flying Celestials.","If the Flying Celestials’ foundation was taken away, it was completely imaginable how miserable their future would be.","Only then did Chu Yunfan slowly put away the corpses of these Supreme Youths. These were all his spoils of war.","With the corpses of these Supreme Youths, Chu Yunfan could get the Brahma Tree to bear a few more fruits, which would help him advance further and breakthrough to a higher stage.","At this moment, a terrifying hand descended from the sky and slapped down on Chu Yunfan.","It was like a divine mountain that wanted to suppress Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","Almost no one had expected Chu Yunfan to be hit by this palm.","Thud, thud, thud!","Chu Yunfan took a few steps back before he managed to stabilize himself. He felt his blood and energy surging wildly, and he almost vomited blood from the palm.","His gaze was like a knife as he looked into the distant sky. He saw a man in black clothes hiding in the void. It was as if he was not in this world.","Although his figure was only a hundred miles away, in reality, it was completely beyond the countless layers of space. It was just an illusion.","Of course, this illusion could become reality at any time!","In the sky, a pair of cold eyes stared at Chu Yunfan.","“1000 laws? You actually condensed 1000 laws? It’s not wrong for them to be defeated by you!’","An extremely cold voice sounded from the void. There seemed to be some pity in the voice.","He knew that he would never have the chance to kill Chu Yunfan again.","As expected, at the same time, countless angry roars came from the Flying Celestials, accompanied by a terrifying aura that soared into the sky.","“How dare you break the rules! If you don’t leave something behind today, you won’t be able to escape death!” Situ Xuan, the sect master of the Flying Celestials, roared in anger.","Then, a huge hand grabbed out from the void and tore the void apart. Then, it grabbed at the person behind the layers of space.","This terrifying scene made everyone dumbfounded as if they were watching a legend.","Situ Xuan’s attack was actually so powerful.","However, the black-robed man seemed to be prepared. He took out a flag and disappeared from everyone’s sight. Situ Xuan’s angry attack did not hit him.","“Who is that person?” Many people wondered.","“One can tear space, and the other can hide in infinite space. They are definitely not in the Divine Treasure Stage!” Someone clicked their tongue in wonder.","“Of course it’s not the Divine Treasure Stage. It’s the too stage of the world!” someone added.","Many people could not help but be shocked when they heard that. the Domain Stage was a level that was above the Divine Treasure Stage.","It could be said to be the top of the world!","The ones stronger than the Domainians were Kings. However, Kings were few and far between, even though there were many King physique possessors.","However, a King physique possessor only a possibility of becoming a King. It didn’t mean that one would definitely be able to cultivate to the King Stage in the end.","Cultivation level, aptitude, resources, and techniques were all indispensable.","Every time a King was born, they could suppress an era. It could be said that they were the rulers of their era.","Above the King Stage was the Emperor Stage that no one had reached since ancient times.","That was now just a myth!","Kings weren’t as rare as Emperors, but they were still extremely ra_re. Even if there were Emperors in this world, many people would think that there were only five of them.","It could be said that they were the strongest in the world!","Below the Kings were the Domainians. At this level, they were the top experts in the world. This was because Kings rarely appeared, and the sect leaders of the 10 great sects were probably the top experts in the Domain Stage.","Only by cultivating to this stage could one be considered a true official. Once one cultivated to this realm, even in ancient times, they could be made an official and become an expert, second only to a King.","Now, they were almost invincible.","Sometimes, in an era where talent was scarce, even the Domainian officials were considered the best in the world.","At this stage, one could be said to be a big shot who could shake the entire world and stir up the world.","They were completely different from ordinary lifeforms.","To think that such a young Domainian had appeared. This undoubtedly shocked everyone. Although he could maintain his youthful appearance, everyone could still tell from his aura that he was indeed an extremely young expert.","“Could it be some ancient Supreme Youth?” someone wondered aloud, “l heard that some of the ancient Supreme Youths are too old and had been reborn too many times. Although they kept sealing themselves, they were still much older than the Supreme Youths who have been born now. They no longer have the qualifications to participate in this war. However, their strength is probably much stronger than the Supreme Youths now!”","Someone thought of a shocking possibility. Many people thought about it and felt that it was really possible.","To be a Domainian at such a young age, who else could it be other than those ancient prodigies? In fact, only the Supreme Youth prodigies of the ancient prodigies could achieve such a shocking level.","“But even so, they are too despicable. It is already too much for those Supreme Youths to bully others with numbers. He even sneaked an attack in secret. He is simply shameless!” someone said disdainfully.","“What’s so despicable about this? This is a crucial battle for the right to speak in the world in the future. Do you really think this is a fair battle? It’s just that they were all defeated by Chu Yunfan!”","There were people who had a different view. They did not think that there was anything wrong with these ancient Supreme Youths doing this.","“But no matter what, today’s battle is enough to make Chu Yunfan famous!”","“Not only famous, but unprecedented.. Didn’t you hear? That person said that","Chu Yunfan has cultivated a 1000 laws!”"]},{"number":2249,"title":"Chapter 2249: I’ll Remember This Palm Strike","paragraphs":["Chapter 2249: I’ll Remember This Palm Strike","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Hearing this, many people suddenly remembered what that person had said earlier. They were horrified when they thought about it. Chu Yunfan had actually cultivated more than 1,000 laws.","It was simply heaven-defying!","An ordinary prodigy would be considered to have reached perfection if they could condense a 100 laws. They had cultivated the Divine Treasure Stage to perfection.","And even for a Supreme Youth, being able to cultivate 500 laws could also be said to be at perfection.","Chu Yunfan had broken this record right from the start. He had reach 1000 laws at once. If that wasn’t a monster, what was it? He had twice as many as ordinary perfected Supreme Youths.","“No wonder he beat up those Supreme Youths like an adult beating up a child!”","Many people thought of the Supreme Youths who were beaten up by Chu","Yunfan and found it unbelievable.","Now that they knew that Chu Yunfan had actually condensed a thousand laws, they immediately felt that it was only natural.","A person who had condensed a thousand laws was unprecedented. It could be said that there was no one like him in the past or the future. To be able to have such an astonishing performance was naturally expected.","After all, everyone understood that a quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change. A person who condensed more than 1,000 laws was not just twice as strong as a person who condensed 500 laws. It was probably 10 times or even dozens of times stronger.","“Is he a monster? I heard that experts who have just entered the Domain Stage have only just condensed 1,000 laws!” someone said in horror.","The others were also shocked. There was no doubt about the power of Domainians. It could be said that there was no one stronger than them in the world.","That was an existence that no one could look up to. It was no different from a living demon god.","However, Chu Yunfan had cultivated as many laws as those Domainians.","This caused a great shock to everyone, and they were scared out of their wits.","“A thousand laws?” Even Huangfu Longhao was shocked when he heard this.","Originally, he thought that Chu Yunfan had only cultivated 700 to 800 laws. Even so, it was already very shocking. It was basically easy for him to defeat eight to ten existences like him.","However, he did not expect to Chu Yunfan to have cultivated 1,000.","Of course, he knew very well that 900 was the extreme number in the world. There was no doubt about the difficulty of cultivating from 991 to 1000.","It was enough to make most people despair, including him.","He felt that it was impossible to condense the 501st law. That exceeded his limits.","Even he was a little shocked. He wanted to know what kind of physique Chu Yunfan had that allowed him to cultivate like this.","Only the golden roc didn’t find it strange because he had already been shocked. When he first found out that Chu Yunfan had broken through 501 laws, he was almost scared to death.","However, he slowly got used to it!","To him, only such a legendary figure was worthy of being his master. He was one of the ten most ferocious golden rocs, and ordinary Supreme Youths were not his match.","He could feel that the bloodline in his body was not pure enough. If it was completely pure, he could at least break through to 600 to 700 laws, completely surpassing the limits of ordinary Supreme Youths.","However, this was normal. After all, the golden roc was one of the Ten Ferocities of the immemorial era. Many Emperors had to lower their heads in front of the golden roc.","“You’re courting death! ”","Situ Xuan’s figure instantly arrived beside Chu Yunfan. After confirming that Chu Yunfan was fine, he heaved a sigh of relief.","At this moment, his attitude toward Chu Yunfan had completely changed. Originally, he had only placed Chu Yunfan on par with Huangfu Longhao, but now it had completely changed. Chu Yunfan!s strength and potential were far above Huangfu Longhao,","If Huangfu Longhao’s complete rise could at most ensure that the Flying","Celestials would not decline, then Chu Yunfan’s rise could truly lead the Flying Celestials to rise.","This was a terrifying figure who could become invincible.","“Are you alright, Chu Yunfan?” Situ Xuan asked.","“I’m fine!” Chu Yunfan shook his head.","Chu Yunfan calmed his surging blood and energy.","The attack just now was too terrifying and so sudden. If it had not been weakened a little when he broke the enchantment of the Mountain River Cauldron, he would have vomited blood from this palm strike.","His expression was grim. This was like a slap to his face. Even to ordinary people, it was shocking that he could block the sneak attack of a Domainian without being injured.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t feel that it was an honor. Instead, he felt that it was a humiliation.","So what if the other party was a Domainian? He himself was extremely close to a Domainian. The number of laws he cultivated was comparable to a Domainian. The only difference between him and a Domainian was a single domain.","As the name implied, a Domainian was an expert who could condense his own domain around his body. Within this domain, it was a small world that they completely controlled.","If they wanted you to live, you would live. If they wanted to die, you would die!","It was as if they were the masters of the world. In that small world, they were the gods. The laws, rules, and everything in that small world were constructed by them.","Even the strongest Supreme Youth would not be able to defeat the weakest Domainian. It was not just the difference in the number of laws, but also the difference in quality.","When a Domainian used their domain, they were already in an invincible position. Even Supreme Youths could not defeat these Domainians.","It was truly a step that determined life and death, a step that determined who was superior, and a step that was like the difference between clouds and mud.","Only at this stage could one be considered a top expert in the world. Every Domainian was an existence that shook the world.","Among so many Divine Treasures, only one in a hundred could cultivate to the Domain Stage.","Out of a hundred people, there might not even be one who could break through to the Domain Stage. There might not even be one in a thousand ordinary prodigies who could break through to the Domain Stage.","As for ordinary people who weren’t even prodigies, those who were able to break through to the Domain Stage were basically just lucky. They had to have shocking fortuitous encounters to be able to do so.","The black-robed man who had attacked him earlier was clearly not an ordinary Domainian. He should be a Domainian Supreme Youth. Otherwise, with Chu Yunfan’s strength, he would be able to protect himself if he encountered an ordinary Domainian. He would not be afraid if he fought against an ordinary Domainian.","“I’ll remember this palm strike!”"]},{"number":2250,"title":"Chapter 2250: Sooner or Later, I Will Wipe All of You Out","paragraphs":["Chapter 2250: Sooner or Later, I Will Wipe All of You Out","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was slightly surprised by the other party’s decisiveness. In fact, if the other party had hesitated just now and had the thought of attacking Chu Yunfan again, he would not have been able to escape.","If his first attack failed, he had to escape immediately. Otherwise, he would definitely die in Situ Xuan’s hands.","In fact, Situ Xuan had been holding back for a long time. These ancient forces had been forcing their way to him, and he was already burning with anger.","If he wasn’t bound by the previous agreement, he would have attacked long ago.","If they wanted to usurp the Flying Celestials’ foundation, they would have to see if they had the ability.","However, Situ Xuan held it in because he knew that there was more than one","old monster watching in the void at this moment.","If he broke the rules first, then these old monsters would have an excuse to make a move. Although they were few in number, the inheritances and sects behind these old monsters had all left their names in history.","No one knew how many trump cards he had left behind!","However, he could imagine what kind of methods they had just based on the Flying Celestials.","This was because the Flying Celestials had trump cards and methods that could turn the world upside down. It was just that they would not use them unless it was an ordinary time.","Once it was used, it would definitely cause misery and countless deaths.","He did not believe that those ancient forces did not have any means. If they found an excuse to attack, the consequences would be unimaginable.","As someone who had participated in that battle, he knew how much effort the Human King and other top experts had put in to force those ancient forces to agree.","Therefore, even though Situ Xuan wanted to attack, he did not do so. He had been enduring.","“The Flying Celestials has won today’s battle. If you continue to pester me, don’t blame me for being ruthless!” Situ Xuan!s gaze swept into the endless void. He could see figures that ordinary people could not see. They were old monsters who had once shaken the world.","Each of them had a terrifying aura, and many of them were even overflowing with killing intent as they locked onto Chu Yunfan.","Even through the layers of void, one could feel the terrifying aura emitted by these people.","Situ Xuan stood in front of Chu Yunfan without batting an eyelid. If these old monsters dared to attack him, he wouldn’t mind fighting them on the spot and catching them all in one fell swoop.","This was the Flying Celestials’ base. Although they would have to pay a high price, it was all worth it.","“Humph!’","With a cold snort, an old monster’s figure disappeared into the void.","Then, other old monsters’ auras disappeared too.","Chu Yunfan breathed a sigh of relief. The aura of these old monsters had locked onto him, causing him great pressure.","Even though he wasn’t afraid of ordinary Domainians, these people were clearly not ordinary Domainians. These old monsters probably had emperor physiques when they were young. When they cultivated to their age, their strength was unfathomable.","He was even many times more terrifying than the Supreme Youth who had attacked previously.","This kind of foundation accumulated over many years of cultivation was not something that the current Chu Yunfan could compare to.","‘You’re all just a bunch of evil spirits and clowns. One day, I’ll wipe you out completely!’ Chu Yunfan thought with a cold gaze.","To him, these proud prodigies and those old monsters behind the scenes were the greatest source of chaos in the world.","Although these people might be able to bring glory to an era, behind this glory, countless lives were in misery. These people fought to advance, and to ordinary people, it was a disaster.","Especially when he could feel that some of the old monsters were looking at him with bone-deep killing intent. They obviously hated him to the core. It was just that they couldn’t make a move because of the rules. That rules had bound Situ Xuan, but they had also bound them.","Both sides had their fears and could not attack with their full strength.","However, he also knew that this was temporary. These people would not let this matter rest easily. It was fine if those ordinary prodigies and even top-notch prodigies were defeated or injured, but the deaths of those ancient Supreme Youths would probably hurt their bones and hearts.","Their hope of rising up had been snuffed out by Chu Yunfan. If it were him, he would not let it go so easily.","“At this moment, the only way is to advance my cultivation to the Domain Stage. Only with the Domain Stage cultivation can I be compared to these old monsters!” Chu Yunfan’s eyes flashed with a terrifying light. “At that time, it’s hard to say who will kill who!”","Perhaps even the most insane person would not have thought that Chu Yunfan was planning to capture all these old monsters in one fell swoop.","This was simply audacious!","These old monsters were all top-notch Domainians. They were not people that the younger generation could compare to.","Even if the Supreme Youths wanted to surpass them, they would need to spend a long time.","And now, Chu Yunfan was planning to capture all these old monsters in one fell swoop. This was really too shocking.","“Come with me!” Situ Xuan said to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan nodded and followed Situ Xuan into the depths of the Flying Celestials.","Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the golden roc also disappeared along with him. It was obvious that they had also received Situ Xuan’s invitation. However, for the others, it was only now that they realized that the battle that determined the survival of the Flying Celestials’ foundation could be considered to have come to an end.","In the end, not a single one of those powerful enemies managed to escape. Without a doubt, this greatly boosted the morale of the Flying Celestials, and also shocked the various forces and experts who wanted to fish in troubled waters.","The ancient powers had sent more than just these experts. However, most of the ancient powers’ successors were ordinary geniuses. At most, they were top-tier geniuses. Facing such a battle, they had no ability to interfere at all.","They had wanted to fish in troubled waters and try to gain some benefits, but who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s strength was so strong that he would defeat all the strong enemies. He did not give them a chance to fish in troubled waters at all.","“Chu Yunfan’s name will probably shake the world from this battle!”","“But isn’t it said that the Flying Celestials is ranked at the bottom of the ten great powers? Just slightly stronger than Medicinal Kings Valley, Divine","Talisman Sect, and the Holy Puppets? How can there be such a terrifying Supreme Youth?” someone asked in confusion.","According to the information they had received, the Flying Celestials was ranked at the bottom of the rankings, and many people had come for the","Flying Celestials.."]},{"number":2251,"title":"Chapter 2251: The Freak Among the Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2251: The Freak Among the Supreme Youths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people couldn’t understand either. According to the information they had gathered, the Flying Celestials should be relatively easy to deal with among the top ten forces.","Otherwise, there would not be so many top-notch geniuses and Supreme","Youths coming one after another. Behind them were at least 30 powerful sects.","Many of these sects could be compared to the Flying Celestials in their heyday, or even stronger!","Not to mention that there were many small and medium-sized ancient factions that had yet to make a move and were only watching. This was a very large faction.","In the battle just now. if the Flying Celestials showed any signs of being defeated, they would probably appear like sharks that had smelled blood and divide the Flying Celestials.","Fortunately, Chu Yunfan had used his astonishing strength to defeat all the powerful enemies and put an end to this possibility.","“Are the forces of the current era so powerful? And this is only the legendary Flying Celestials, which is ranked at the bottom. If we were to talk about the first-ranked Destiny Sect and the second-ranked Virtuous Academy, how powerful would they be?”","Many people were dumbstruck as they thought of many things. To them, the Flying Celestials alone was already so powerful, not to mention the other ten great powers. It was likely that they would really end the hope and efforts of these ancient powers.","“No, you’re thinking too much. The Flying Celestials is an accident. The truly powerful one isn’t the Flying Celestials, but Chu Yunfan. He’ s a monster.","Otherwise, even if all the Supreme Youths of the Flying Celestials were added up, there would only be four of them. Logically speaking, it’s only a matter of time before they retreat. The truly terrifying one is Chu Yunfan who has cultivated 1,000 laws!” someone immediately retorted.","In their eyes, the Flying Celestials wasn’t that powerful. It was about the same as what they had investigated. Although it was a little stronger than Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, and the golden roc, it was still not as powerful as they had expected.","However, the person who really turned the situation around was none other than Chu Yunfan.","Without Chu Yunfan, the Flying Celestials would have been doomed.","“One person can prosper a country. That’s the kind of person you’re talking about!” someone said emotionally.","“That’s right. Such a character might not appear for countless years. Even among the Supreme Youths, such an existence should be a freak among freaks!” someone said emotionally.","“I’ve received news that the Holy Puppets’ battle has been decided. The Holy Puppets has been defeated and has already packed up their things and left the base. We’ve won!” someone suddenly said.","Suddenly, all the experts of the ancient forces were like sharks that had smelled blood, and they began to move.","The Flying Celestials had already won. According to the initial agreement, they couldn’t attack the Flying Celestials, so there was no point in staying here any longer. Therefore, everyone instantly decided to rush to the battlefield of the Holy Puppets and participate in the upcoming divide of spoils.","“What? The Holy Puppets lost?” After the experts of the ancient forces left, the experts of the current era were shocked by this news.","The experts of the ancient forces didn’t care about the so-called top ten forces at all. After all, they didn’t live in this era. However, the experts of the current era were different. From the moment they were born, the top ten forces were high above and looked down on all living beings.","It could be said that they were the ten most powerful and terrifying forces in the entire world.","Every single power could easily shake all of Grand Xia with a single move of their fingers.","Previously, when they saw the Flying Celestials easily obtain victory, they thought that those ancient forces were only so-so. Although they could be considered very strong and there were many Supreme Youths from the ancient times, in reality, they should not be a match for the ten great forces.","However, who knew that the Flying Celestials was just an exception. The Holy Puppets was ranked second only to the Flying Celestials among the top ten forces. In terms of strength, it was not much weaker than the Flying Celestials.","Now that they had been defeated, the entire sect had to move out of their base. All their industries and resources had to be handed over.","Everyone could imagine that once they lost these assets and resources, even if they managed to retain their complete orthodoxy, it would be a huge blow to the Holy Puppets.","It might even cause them to be unable to recover.","After all, the cultivation of so many disciples of the Holy Puppets relied on all kinds of resources. Without the supply of so many industries and resources, the cultivation of the disciples of the Holy Puppets would probably fall far behind the other sects of the ten great factions.","If nothing unexpected happened, the decline of the Holy Puppets was just around the corner!","Many people couldn’t imagine that such a colossus, a colossus that they had heard of since they were young, would actually be defeated so easily.","When the disciples of the Flying Celestials heard the news, they were not in the mood to celebrate. As disciples of the ten major forces, the Flying","Celestials and the Holy Puppets naturally had to compete with each other.","However, at this moment, they felt a sense of sympathy for the fox when the rabbit died. They felt this was extremely fortunate. If it weren’t for Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, Chu Yunfan, and the others, they might not have ended up any better than the Holy Puppets.","Especially Chu Yunfan. If he hadn’t turned the tide at the end and reversed the situation, the Flying Celestials would have ended up the same as the Holy Puppets.","Thinking of this, many people felt a chill run down their spines. Just thinking about the consequences made them almost collapse.","As time passed, more and more people received accurate information, and","more details of the Holy Puppets’ defeat were spread.","It turned out that there were six Supreme Youths on the battlefield of the Holy Puppets. These six Supreme Youths had swept away all the powerful enemies. The Holy Puppets was indeed a force that was on par with the Flying Celestials in terms of strength. There was only one Supreme Youth guarding it.","Naturally, he was not a match for the six Supreme Youths. He was easily defeated and almost died tragically on the battlefield. In the end, it was the sect master of the Holy Puppets who rescued him. However, this also meant that the Holy Puppets had admitted defeat.","At this point, the Holy Puppets was defeated and their original foundation was handed over to someone else. For a moment, many disciples of the Flying Celestials were shocked.","Many of the Flying Celestials disciples realized how terrifying it would be if they were defeated. At this moment, they were even more glad that they had","Chu Yunfan.","“Fortunately, our Flying Celestials has Senior Chu, Senior Huangfu, and the others. Otherwise, the consequences would be unimaginable!”","“It’s not just Senior Chu and Senior Huangfu. Senior Chu Hongcai has also grown up. Didn’t you see how he killed Sword Saint? Senior Brother Chu","Hongcai became stronger and stronger as he fought.. In the end, he killed Sword Saint and beheaded him!”"]},{"number":2252,"title":"Chapter 2252: The Premonition of Turmoil","paragraphs":["Chapter 2252: The Premonition of Turmoil","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Most people had been attracted by Chu Yunfan’s battle, but some people had noticed the battle between Sword Saint and Chu Hongcai.","After being suppressed by Chu Yunfan until he was only slightly stronger than Chu Hongcai, Sword Saint naturally lost his initial advantage over Chu Hongcai.","He could not even unleash half of his strength!","However, Chu Hongcai was different. His strength was constantly improving and even becoming stronger.","In the end, Sword Saint failed to kill Chu Hongcai and was instead killed by him.","In fact, in the eyes of many people, the battle between Sword Saint and Chu Hongcai was the true battle between Supreme Youths.","The two pure swordsmen fought an exciting battle. All kinds of shocking sword moves and sword techniques were eye-opening to them.","Not only did the two of them have an extraordinary emperor physiques, but they also had shocking inheritances. They were the top existences of the world.","The confrontation between the two of them was a truly spectacular battle.","In contrast, Chu Yunfan’s invincible battle, although it looked extremely satisfying and enjoyable, was not exciting.","Many people couldn’t even tell what level of change there was. It was far less exciting than the battle between Chu Hongcai and Sword Saint.","“With Senior Huangfu, Senior Chu, Chu Hongcai, and that golden roc, our Flying Celestials will only grow stronger. Even in this chaotic Great Era, we should be able to protect ourselves!”","When many people thought of the defeated Holy Puppets, they could not help but rejoice. In such a chaotic world, it was already very difficult to protect themselves.","At the same time, the results of the battle at the Flying Celestials spread to the world at an astonishing speed.","In the depths of the Flying Celestials, there was a mystic realm with beautiful mountains and rivers. It looked like a peaceful grotto-heaven.","Situ Xuan and the others appeared in a courtyard in a flash.","“Sit wherever you want. This is where I usually go into seclusion!” Situ Xuan said.","“Thank you, Sect Master!”","The few of them did not stand on ceremony. Other than the golden roc that had transformed into a fist-sized bird and landed on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder, the others found a place to sit.","Even Situ Xuan couldn’t help but take a look at this golden roc. He didn’t pay attention to it before and thought that it was just an ordinary divine bird. Who knew that this golden roc could actually fight against the Supreme Youths today?","This was a very serious matter.","As the saying goes, if you don’t make a sound, then it’s fine. If you make a sound, then it’s fine. Not only the golden roc, but even Chu Yunfan gave him a great shock.","Even he felt that there was almost no hope, but who knew that Chu Yunfan would suddenly appear and beat those people to a pulp. In the end, he actually managed to protect the foundation of the Flying Celestials.","Looking at the four people in front of him, Situ Xuan couldn’t help but sigh with emotion. What was the saying of the Yangtze River’s new generation surpassing the previous one?","These four people were probably the Flying Celestials’ future hope of self-preservation in this chaotic world. At this moment, he no longer had the thought of letting the Flying Celestials rise. In this golden era, who knew how many geniuses would emerge, and many old monsters who had been hidden for many years would appear.","Perhaps later generations would judge this period of history as a golden era, but for those who lived in this era, it was a completely chaotic world.","It was better to be a man of prosperity than a dog of chaos. Even people with high status and power like them could be killed in the next second.","However, with these four people around, at least the Flying Celestials could maintain such a foundation. In this golden era, this was enough. With the foundation of the Flying Celestials, as long as they passed this period, they would still be able to dominate the world. It was one of the top inheritances in the world.","“On behalf of the Flying Celestials, I would like to thank the four of you for your hard work today!” Situ Xuan said.","He didn’t treat these four people like a high and mighty sect master. He treated them as equals. Because he knew that as long as these four people did not die prematurely, it was almost only a matter of time before they cultivated to his realm in the future.","It was even very possible that he would surpass him in the future.","It was naturally unnecessary to offend others with his status of sect master now.","“You’re too polite, sir. This is just what we should do!” Huangfu Longhao said.","“Senior Huangfu is right. We are disciples of the Flying Celestials after all, and we will stand together with the Flying Celestials!” Chu Yunfan nodded. He had encountered many dangers since he started cultivating. If it weren’t for the protection of the Flying Celestials, those old monsters would have attacked him.","This was also the fundamental difference between having an inheritance and not having one.","Situ Xuan said, “Today’s battle was very dangerous. I didn’t think we had much chance of winning either. As everyone knows, among the top ten forces, our Flying Celestials is almost ranked at the bottom. We’re only slightly better than the Holy Puppets, Medicine Kings Valley, and the Divine Talisman Sect. Those ancient forces chose to break our sects!”","Situ Xuan could not help but grit his teeth. These ancient factions were picking on the weak. The stronger the inheritance, the fewer people would challenge it. The weaker the inheritance, the more people would challenge it.","The Flying Celestials, one of the ten great forces, had now become a pushover. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan’s sudden emergence, the Flying Celestials would probably be in big trouble today.","“Now, there are already several sects who have won the challenge. Besides us, Destiny Sect and the Virtuous Academy have already won. There were only three Supreme Youths on the battlefield of the Virtuous Academy. The Destiny Sect only had two Supreme Youths challenge them, but they were defeated one after another. We actually has seven Supreme Youths come to challenge us!” Situ Xuan said coldly, “However, when they thought of us as pushovers, they probably didn’t expect that they would be defeated here!","“However, apart from that, the Holy Puppets has already been the first to be defeated. A total of six Supreme Youths from their side had challenged them and they were defeated in a single blow. The ancient geniuses of the Holy Puppets were beaten to the point of collapse and were almost completely wiped out!” Situ Xuan said. He even felt a little lucky. If it weren’t for Chu Yunfan, the Flying Celestials wouldn’t have ended up much better.","Chu Yunfan thought to himself that these ancient forces were really cunning.","“According to speculation, besides the Holy Puppets, the defeat of Medicine Kings Valley and the Divine Talisman Sect is only a matter of time!” Situ Xuan said, “The rest of the battle is still undecided, but it shouldn’t be long before the results are out. To our Flying Celestials, this battle is just the beginning. The situation will only get worse. We need you to speed up your cultivation.. You must at least reach the Domain Stage before you can stand on equal footing with those old monsters!”"]},{"number":2253,"title":"Chapter 2253: Construct a Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 2253: Construct a Domain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Yes, sir!”","Chu Yunfan, Huangfu Longhao, and the others nodded. With their cultivation and status, they naturally understood many truths and secrets that ordinary people in the world did not understand.","The Divine Treasure Stage was already considered an extremely rare cultivation. Even many prodigies could not enter the Divine Treasure Stage.","Some prodigies were already very old when they entered the Divine Treasure Stage.","Only those with emperor physiques could ensure that they could enter the","Divine Treasure Stage. Just this alone was enough to stop 99% of the living beings in the world from entering this door.","It could even be said that for many people, this was an existence that was beyond their reach.","However, even so, they were still not a true peerless figure in the world. Only by becoming a Domainian could one become a supreme figure in the world.","As for Emperors above the Domain Stage, even Chu Yunfan had only heard of them. He had never met one before.","There were even some people who guessed that the Human King or the Elder","Princess might have such cultivation, but no one could prove it.","No one had ever seen them fight, not even Chu Yunfan.","Hence, Domainians were basically the strongest existences. Situ Xuan was only a top expert among Domainians.","“Right now, the various forces are still in a chaotic battle. However, since we have already won the arena, we have nothing to fear. Next is the time to truly compete in our foundations. They won’t dare to come again. Otherwise, we will let them die without a burial place!” Situ Xuan said coldly, his eyes flickering with a terrifying light.","This time, it was already extremely absurd that they were forced to agree to let the Supreme Youths decide the victor. The outcome of the Holy Puppets had told the Flying Celestials what could have happened.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t appeared out of nowhere, none of them would have had it easy.","“But how confident are you guys in breaking through to the Domain Stage?”","Situ Xuan asked.","Huangfu Longhao fell silent when he heard this.","The reason why Domainians could become the top experts in the world was that the threshold alone had already blocked 90% of the Divine Treasures.","Starting from the Divine Treasure Stage, cultivators had transformed from borrowing the power of heaven and earth to developing the small world and universe of the body. Unlocking the treasures in one’s body was known as the Divine Treasure Stage.","At the Domain Stage, it was even more impressive. One had to construct a domain around themselves. In this absolute domain, one would be an absolutely invincible existence. This was because in this domain, no matter what kind of rules or laws were created by the cultivator themselves.","Therefore, they were invincible in such rules.","In the domain, one could construct all kinds of completely different laws. Even if the laws of the structure allowed water and fire to mix together and make water flow higher, it was completely possible.","In this small world, they were god-like existences, truly invincible existences.","However, it was precisely because of this that it was very difficult to construct such a domain. In fact, ordinary people could not even do it.","One needed to have a very deep understanding of the laws and then construct their domain bit by bit.","The more complete the domain was, the more powerful it would be. The power he could unleash would be more shocking.","And the time spent in between was an extremely long process.","Many experts in the Divine Treasure Stage had limited knowledge of laws, so they were unable to cultivate to the Domain Stage.","Generally speaking, the more laws one cultivated in the Divine Treasure Stage, the more astonishing the power of the domain constructed.","For someone like Chu Yunfan, who had already condensed thousands of laws when he was in the Divine Treasure Stage, once he constructed his domain, his power would also rise to an extremely shocking level.","In fact, there was no such thing as perfection or imperfection in the cultivation of the Divine Treasure Stage. Condensing one law was also the Divine Treasure Stage, and condensing 1,000 laws was also the Divine Treasure Stage.","However, if too few laws were condensed, it meant that the cultivator’s understanding of laws was too shallow. They did not have the qualifications to construct a domain.","This was because a domain was a small world, a simple and crude small world. Although it was full of loopholes, many domains were extreme domains that only existed in certain laws.","However, this was still a small world of its own, a small world with itself as the core.","If one’s comprehension of laws was not deep enough, it was naturally impossible to construct a domain.","Huangfu Longhao paused for a moment before he said, “I’m quite confident that I can reach the Domain Stage. However, I need time. I need quite a long period of time before I can do so!”","Huangfu Longhao’s words resonated with Chu Hongcai, and it was the same for him. He had not cultivated to perfection in the Divine Treasure Stage. He had to cultivate at least 500 laws before he could attempt to use these 500 laws to condense a domain that truly belonged to him.","At that time, he would be invincible throughout the world. The more perfect the domain was, the more rules it contained, and the more powerful the cultivator would be.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t comment. It was true that constructing a domain that belonged to him wasn’t that simple even for a Supreme Youth. Even though there were many handwritten notes left behind by his predecessors that could be used as a reference, he had to test every step himself. It could be said that he was crossing the river by feeling the stones. Naturally, it was not that simple.","However, he was different. With the memories left behind by the Alchemy Emperor, it was as if he had once entered such a domain. He was naturally completely different from the others.","To him, constructing a domain was not a difficult task. He just needed to follow the steps.","Of course, his path of cultivation was completely different from that of the","Alchemy Emperor since a long time ago. It was also different from the Emperor Supreme, who wrote the Mighty Emperor Battle Book. It was a brand new path, and the domain Chu Yunfan wanted to build was unprecedented. It was a law domain that no one had ever seen before or since.","However, there was already a pearl in front of him. He only needed to imitate it and he would succeed.","But even so, Chu Yunfan’s expression remained calm and did not show it. Because the Alchemy Emperor’s memory was the same as a godhead, it was the most precious secret in the depths of his memory. He could not tell anyone.","“l believe that you can do the normal structure of the domain step by step, but that’s too slow!” Situ Xuan shook his head.. “There’s a method that can help you construct your own domain in a short time!”"]},{"number":2254,"title":"Chapter 2254: Ancient Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2254: Ancient Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Situ Xuan’s words immediately attracted the attention of Chu Yunfan and the others. Even though Chu Yunfan had absolute confidence in building his own domain, he was still interested when he heard Situ Xuan’s words.","Huangfu Longhao and the others also revealed curious expressions.","Situ Xuan didn’t keep them in suspense and said, “Use other people’s domains as the basic framework!”","Huangfu Longhao and the others looked incredulous. Chu Yunfan ?asked, “Isn’t everyone’s domain unique to them? Moreover, it will dissipate with the death of the cultivator. How can we use it?”","Chu Yunfan also found Situ Xuan’s words inconceivable. Although a domain was a small world constructed by a cultivator with themselves as the core, it was not a physical existence in essence.","It was based on the cultivator’s cultivation. Once the cultivator died, the domain they constructed would dissipate.","After all, it was not a real world, and the various laws were not perfect. It could not truly evolve into a space and a world.","“Indeed, under normal circumstances, that’s the case, However, there’s one thing that’s different!” Situ Xuan explained, “In the world, there is a battlefield left behind from ancient times!","“This ancient battlefield was left behind by many experts in the ancient times who fought for godheads. Due to the chaotic laws in it, there are many incomplete domains left behind. If you can obtain one or two of them, you will undoubtedly be able to construct a law domain in a very short time!”","Situ Xuan’s words immediately shocked the few of them. They did not expect such a place to exist.","However, after thinking about it, they understood that a domain was a manifestation of a strong person’s will. It did not have a physical body, but the laws that formed the domain did exist. Under certain special circumstances, it might not be impossible to leave it behind.","There were too many mysteries in the world. Even an Emperor would not dare to say that he had seen through all the mysteries of the world, let alone a","Domainian.","Perhaps only gods above Emperors could do all of this.","Everything was illogical because they did not understand the underlying principles.","“Sir, could it be a battlefield left behind by an Emperor? If it’s that kind of battlefield, we’ll simply die if we go!” Chu Yunfan immediately said.","He knew how terrifying a battle between Emperors was. Even after so many years, the battlefield left behind by Emperors was still terrifying.","Experts of that level could easily distort and change the collision of laws.","These people were already very powerful in this world, but compared to the powerful Emperors, they were like dragons in the sky and ants on the ground.","Although saying this seemed to be a bit of a blow to his prestige, Chu Yunfan could tell from the memories of the Alchemy Emperor in his mind that this was definitely not a blow to his prestige. It was just an ordinary description.","“Of course not. Even I would die in the battlefield of Emperors!” Situ Xuan shook his head. “I’m talking about a battlefield left behind by a Domainian. Some people even found traces left behind by Kings!’","An King?","These four words made everyone’s spirits rise. To them, the Emperor Stage was undoubtedly too far away, but the King Stage was different.","They were all Supreme Youths with emperor physiques. If nothing unexpected happened, it was only a matter of time before they became Kings.","Under such circumstances, the word ‘Emperor” held a special attraction to them.","“That’s right, but it should only be a minority. If you are lucky and can obtain a domain left behind by a King, then your cultivation will improve by leaps and bounds in a short time. It might even be possible for you to be on equal footing with me!” Situ Xuan looked at the four people in front of him with a faint smile.","The four of them were indeed attracted by Situ Xuan’s description. Even Chu Yunfan, who was 100% confident, would not refuse to absorb the domain of other experts and use it for himself.","Speed up his growth!","After all, if he followed the usual method of cultivation, Chu Yunfan’s current strength might not even be one percent of his current strength.","“But will there be any hidden dangers after absorbing other people’s domains?” Huangfu Longhao suddenly thought of something.","With his talent, it was only a matter of time before he became a King, much less a Domainian.","To him, it was not a question of whether he could achieve it or not. It was only a question of when he could achieve it.","Under such circumstances, if this method had hidden dangers, it was really not worth it for him.","Although he was eager to break through, he was not so anxious that he needed to use the future to exchange for the current breakthrough.","“Don’t worry. Rules are just rules. They’re just tools. Although it’s someone else’s Dao, the owner of the domain has long fallen. It’s just an ownerless object. To you, it’s just a tool to help you break through. Don’t worry!” Situ Xuan said, “All of you are the future of the Flying Celestials, so I won’t harm you on this matter. Moreover, the opening of the ancient battlefield is not hosted by the Flying Celestials, but by the Imperial Court!’","“The Imperial Court?” Huangfu Longhao!s eyes widened. He didn’t expect that this matter would involve the powerful Imperial Court of Grand Xia.","Obviously, this wasn’t a sudden decision made by Situ Xuan. He had already made this decision a long time ago.","With the fastest speed, regardless of the price, they wanted to nurture these","Supreme Youths.","Could their target be those ancient forces?","Even Chu Yunfan couldn’t help but have such a thought. If that was really the case, the collision between Grand Xia and these ancient forces in the future would probably set off a storm.","This was just the prelude!","“That’s right. When the time comes, the Grand Commandant will personally help you open the space passage to the ancient battlefield!” Situ Xuan nodded.","Chu Yunfan suddenly thought of something and asked, “Is this battlefield not in the Central Plains?”","Situ Xuan revealed a look of admiration. “That’s right. This battlefield is in outer space, not in the Central Plains.. If you want to fly over, it’s almost impossible! “"]},{"number":2255,"title":"Chapter 2255: The Imperial Family Library","paragraphs":["Chapter 2255: The Imperial Family Library","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan and the others understood. It turned out that they were in the starry sky. No wonder they had to use the teleportation portal to reach it. Everyone knew how dangerous the starry sky was.","It wasn’t just the demons, the greatest enemy of all living beings in the Central Plains, who lived in outer space.","It was also because in the endless starry sky, it was an extremely dangerous place. There were all kinds of terrifying forbidden lands and all kinds of powerful ferocious beasts. Some ferocious beasts even covered the sky and were as big as a star.","The endless void was definitely a forbidden area for countless cultivators. Only a very small number of top-notch experts could cross the void and travel back and forth. They did not take the danger in their eyes.","For example, the owner of the Serene Immortal Mountain, the Elder Princess, had entered the endless starry sky many times to search for all kinds of heavenly and earthly treasures.","This was because, apart from the endless dangers in outer space, there were also endless opportunities. Many rare treasures that were rarely seen in the Central Plains were extremely common in outer space.","“Back then, the ancient cultivators moved this battlefield to the starry sky to prevent the Central Plains from collapsing. Later, this ancient battlefield was formed!” Situ Xuan explained.","Everyone came to a sudden realization. Those ancient cultivators had at least a bit of rationality and did not fight in the Central Plains. Otherwise, with their strength, they could easily destroy the entire Central Plains.","“This matter was organized by the Imperial Court. When the time comes, you will have to head to the Imperial Capital. Only through the Imperial Capital’s teleportation portal can you go to that ancient battlefield!” Situ Xuan said, “In addition, the imperial family will also open the imperial family library to you for a month. During this month, you can freely check the various cultivation materials you need. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity. If it weren’t for today, we wouldn’t have been able to enter the imperial family library!’","After saying this, Situ Xuan’s face revealed a hint of envy. This was because this opportunity was too rare. With his cultivation and status, he had made outstanding contributions to the world, but the number of times he was allowed to enter and read books could only be counted on five fingers.","Every time, he would have to make a great contribution to get such an opportunity.","Chu Yunfan, Huangfu Longhao, and the others had the opportunity to enter and read the books there. This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity.","Huangfu Longhao was extremely shocked because he knew what kind of amazing treatment it was to be able to enter the imperial family library.","“Don’t underestimate the imperial family library,” Situ Xuan said when he saw Chu Yunfan’s noncommittal look. “This is a place that all cultivators in the world hope to enter one day!","“Back then, the Great Ancestor started his army from the bottom and swept across the entire world. Who knows how many powers he pacified before he finally created the world of Grand Xia. During this process, he obtained countless books and records. Many of them even reached the level of King. I even heard that there are techniques that reach the level of Emperor!” Situ Xuan said, “In addition, over the years, the imperial family has been tirelessly collecting books and cultivation techniques from all over the world. It can be said that the largest and best library in the world is in the imperial family library. The Flying Celestial library is less than one-tenth of the imperial family library. It’s simply incomparable!”","“So many?” Chu Hongcai couldn’t help but be speechless.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was very calm because he had seen far more than this in the Federation.","He was one of the higher-ups in the Federation back then, an existence that could stand on equal footing with the Grand President. He had once held the authority of the human race.","Therefore, he knew very well how shocking it would be for a country to gather all kinds of ancient books with the strength of the entire country.","The books in the secret library of the Federation, apart from being lesser in numbers, were probably even more valuable than the books in the imperial family library of Grand Xia.","“That’s right. Many of them are from various sects and sects. There are even handwritten notes of the experiences of many of our Flying Celestial seniors who broke through to the Domain Stage. It should be very beneficial to your cultivation!” Situ Xuan said, “Everyone says that the Destiny Sect is the number one power in the world, but they don’t know that the real number one power in the world is the imperial family of Grand Xia!","“The imperial family’s descendants have been given the right to enter the imperial family library since they were young. It can be said that their knowledge is far beyond what other forces and sects can compare to!” Situ Xuan sighed.","“No wonder there are so many experts in the imperial family, just like the Human King and the Elder Princess!” Huangfu Longhao exclaimed in wonder. Although he enjoyed the best treatment, it was still a little inferior compared to the various treatments of the imperial family.","“You only have a month. After a month, the passage to the ancient battlefield will open. You must be extra careful in the ancient battlefield, especially Chu Hongcai. Among the few of you, you are the weakest. You must be careful and not be reckless!” Situ Xuan said.","“Yes, thank you for your concern, sir!” Chu Hongcai said.","Situ Xuan said, “And not only the Flying Celestials will be going. There will also be descendants from other sects and even those ancient inheritances. God knows how many of these forces dislike the Flying Celestials. You have to support each other. No one can go missing!’","“Yes, sir!”","Everyone said in unison.","However, Chu Yunfan was a little surprised. If the heirs of those ancient inheritances also appeared, it would overturn Chu Yunfan’s initial estimation.","This time, it was probably not aimed at the heirs of these ancient inheritances. At least, it was not mainly aimed at them.","There should be other reasons, but they didn’t know.","“Alright, all of you can go back. Make some preparations. We’ll set off for the Imperial Capital tomorrow!” Situ Xuan waved.","“Thank you, sir!”","The few of them cupped their hands and left on a streak of light.","Situ Xuan looked at their backs as they left. He could not help but mutter to himself, “l don’t know how many of them will survive in the end. I hope they won’t let us down!”","Situ Xuan looked at the blue sky with a deep gaze as if he could see through everything with his eyes and see a terrifying scene.","“The future is up to you!’"]},{"number":2256,"title":"Chapter 2256: Empowerment","paragraphs":["Chapter 2256: Empowerment","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","After Chu Yunfan and the other two left, they quickly went their separate ways. Huangfu Longhao left to prepare for tomorrow’s trip to the Imperial Capital, and Chu Hongcai was taken away by a grand elder. Only Chu Yunfan and the bird returned to Startling Cloud Peak.","At this moment, Startling Cloud Peak had become the focus of the entire Flying Celestials.","Today’s battle had broken too many things, especially the situation where everyone thought that the two heroes would stand side by side.","Huangfu Longhao and Chu Yunfan stood side by side. In fact, everyone thought that Huangfu Longhao would be stronger than Chu Yunfan, who had only cultivated for a short time.","However, who knew that an expert would know if he had it the moment he made his move? Chu Yunfan had completely surpassed Huangfu Longhao.","All kinds of legends about Chu Yunfan were spread out. Many busybodies had crowned Chu Yunfan as the strongest prodigy disciple in history. Many people wanted to see Chu Yunfan again, but ever since he entered Startling Cloud Peak, Chu Yunfan had declined all visitors.","Only now did many people remember that although the Flying Celestials was safe, the world was still in turmoil. Starting from the top ten forces, all the way down to the first-rate sects and second-rate sects were the targets of these ancient inheritances.","As for the lower level sects, they were not within their scope of targets. This was because the resources and area occupied by the lower level sects were the second-class of the second-class. Naturally, they would not be taken seriously by these once-glorious inheritances.","At this time, all kinds of news kept coming from all over the world. The winners and losers were gradually determined. In addition to the Flying Celestials, the Destiny Sect, the Virtuous Academy, and Great Change Faith, the Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and Medicinal Kings Valley were eliminated one after another.","While everyone sighed, they did not find it strange. After all, there was a special reason why these three sects could be ranked among the top ten sects, and they were not good at fighting.","There was only one Supreme Youth in eacg sect, and under the siege of the","ancient inheritance, it was impossible to defend.","In fact, the Flying Celestials, which many people had thought would be eliminated, had unexpectedly emerged victorious.","This was completely beyond the expectations of all the so-called people of insight.","After the Holy Puppets, the Divine Talisman Sect, and Medicinal Kings Valley were eliminated, the Divine Maidens, which was one of the top ten forces and was even stronger than the Flying Celestials, was also eliminated.","In this battle, the Divine Maidens had two Supreme Youths. They were both famous figures in history who had suppressed an era.","Later on, they chose to seal themselves to this era. However, the Divine","Maidens still failed in the end because the ones who surrounded the two Supreme Youths were five ancient Supreme Youths.","Even though many top-notch prodigies from the Divine Maidens had joined the battlefield at the same time, numbers were meaningless in front of the Supreme Youths.","Under the joint attack of the ancient Supreme Youths, the Divine Maidens quickly lost the battle.","After the Divine Maidens, the Black Sun Sect and the Cosmic Sword Sect, which were the last two sects, defeated their opponents and won.","In the end, four of the ten great sects lost in the battle and had no choice but to give up their base and various resources.","For a time, the entire world was in an uproar. If it wasn’t for the Flying Celestials’ sudden emergence, the various major powers in the world would have lost more than half of their forces in one go.","Half of the first and second-rate forces below the ten great sects were also defeated and forced to leave their bases.","These ancient inheritances obviously did not choose to attack separately. Instead, they gathered their strength and targeted the weakest among the various factions, forcefully snatching a large piece of fat meat from the current factions.","For a time, the conflict between the current forces and the ancient legacies became the hottest topic.","The world was facing all kinds of clean-up. Everyone understood that for a long time in the future, most of the forces in the world would be involved.","Some forces that seemed to have nothing to do with this matter could actually be traced back to the ten great sects. They were all subsidiary forces of the ten great sects, or subsidiary forces of subsidiary forces.","They were all inextricably linked.","The next day, when Chu Yunfan and Chu Hongcai met up, Chu Yunfan was surprised to find that Chu Hongcai’s cultivation had improved again in just","one night.","Moreover, this improvement was not ordinary. It actually directly reached the perfected Supreme Youth realm of 500 laws from the original 200-odd laws.","“What’s wrong with your cultivation?” Chu Yunfan asked curiously.","Chu Hongcai then explained to Chu Yunfan that the reason for this was because he had been taken away by a grand elder yesterday.","Just last night, he had received the enlightenment of all martial arts realms from a supreme elder before he died.","In just one night, it was as if Chu Hongcai had comprehended the Dao. His cultivation advanced by leaps and bounds, and it could almost be considered to have ascended during the day.","Chu Yunfan finally understood what was going on. If a supreme elder were to imbue his power into Chu Hongcai before his death, he would not be helping him, but harming him.","This was because the power that everyone cultivated was completely different. Forcefully instilling it into a person’s body would cause the receiver to die from the bloating.","Moreover, there would be a lot of power in one’s body that did not belong to them. It looked very powerful, but in fact, there were many dangers hidden in it.","Although the power one gained overnight was powerful, it cut off the possibility of further improvement in the future. They would not even achieve one-third of the combat strength that their cultivation should have.","This was because a powerful expert was not only powerful because of their amazing strength, but also because of their comprehension of the Great Dao and understanding of the laws. Only these were the methods to control this supreme strength.","However, it was a different story if he infused his experience and memories into the receiver.","Just like how Chu Yunfan obtained the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, this was undoubtedly a rare opportunity for Chu Hongcai. It was just that it was not as good as the Alchemy Emperor’s memories that Chu Yunfan had obtained. After all, there were not many people in the world who could stand shoulder to shoulder with the Alchemy Emperor.","“With that supereme elder’s memories and experience, I was able to condense 500 Sword Dao laws overnight!” Chu Hongcai said with a smile, but his expression was respectful.","He knew very well that this was the last time the supreme elder would shine. If he received these experiences and memories, the supreme elder would die a tragic death.","There was no other possibility!"]},{"number":2257,"title":"Chapter 2257: An Astonishingly Big Deal","paragraphs":["Chapter 2257: An Astonishingly Big Deal","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Moreover, this method of enlightenment required one to endure unimaginable pain before death. After all, one’s memories were stripped from one’s body, just like one’s entire head was emptied.","Therefore, even if he used this method of enlightenment, the chances of success were not high.","“That supreme elder is staking everything on me to inherit his legacy!” Chu Hongcai said.","Chu Yunfan was also filled with respect. Although he didn’t know the supreme elder, he understood why the supreme elder would do this.","Since he was going to perish anyway, he might as well pass down his experience. This was exactly the same as what the Alchemy Emperor did back then.","“You have to be careful. Even though you have inherited that senior’s legacy, that’s only his experience and memories. You have to walk your own path.","Otherwise, you’ll be stuck at the Domain Stage for the rest of your life!” Chu Yunfan warned Chu Hongcai.","For 99% of living beings, reaching the Domain Stage was something that was almost impossible to hope for.","However, Chu Yunfan had high hopes for Chu Hongcai. Not only did he teach him the Indestructible Sword Physique, but he also took care of him continuously.","In Chu Yunfan’s eyes, Chu Hongcai’s potential and future were far beyond just the Domain Stage .","“l understand!” Chu Hongcai nodded. “Before that senior died, he told me that no matter what, his memories and inheritance are only memories and experiences. I have to walk my own path, a unique path of the sword.","Otherwise, I will be trapped by his experiences and memories!”","Seeing that Chu Hongcai understood, Chu Yunfan did not say anything more.","Soon, Huangfu Longhao also appeared. The few of them immediately set off and rushed to the Imperial Capital.","After passing through the Flying Celestials’ teleportation portal, the few of them appeared in the teleportation portal in the Imperial Capital a moment later.","Soon, an attendant from the palace led them to a secret space.","The few of them went in to take a look and saw that this secret sub-space was already filled with people, and there were thousands of them.","Each of them was shining with a dazzling light. It was the light emitted by their extraordinary divine bodies.","As if they had sensed the extraordinary physiques of the others, their physiques were not willing to be outdone, and they continuously erupted waves of aura to resist each other.","“They’re all top-notch prodigies!” Huangfu Longhao was shocked by this astonishing generosity.","One had to know that even ordinary prodigies had king physiques. They were rare prodigies in the outside world, let alone top prodigies. They were the best among prodigies.","An ordinary person would spend their entire life hoping to see one, but now, they were like cabbages here, seen everywhere.","Not to mention that among these top prodigies, there were some people whose auras completely suppressed these top prodigies.","“There are actually so many Supreme Youths!”","Chu Hongcai was also slightly shocked. He looked around and saw that there were at least a hundred Supreme Youths.","Each of them carried an extremely terrifying aura. Although these Supreme","Youths were few in number, they completely suppressed those top prodigies.","The terrifying aura released from their bodies was far stronger than those top prodigies.","Chu Yunfan looked at this scene, but what surprised him was that many of these Supreme Youths were from the ancient forces. At least half of them were like this, and less than half of them belonged to the Supreme Youths of the current forces.","One could imagine how powerful these ancient Supreme Youths were.","This shocked Chu Yunfan. He had originally speculated that the imperial family was so generous to let them enter the imperial family library to look at it at will. Their purpose was to deal with the ancient forces.","But now, those disciples of the ancient forces had appeared here in a grand manner.","This was different from Chu Yunfan’s initial speculation. The purpose of the imperial family opening the imperial family library and the ancient battlefield was obviously not to target these ancient Supreme Youths.","The Human King allowed these ancient Supreme Youths to participate. The meaning behind this itself made Chu Yunfan feel that it was full of mystery. “If these ancient Supreme Youths are not the targets that the Human King","wants to deal with, then what is his real target?” Chu Yunfan was shocked.","If even the ancient forces wasn’t the Human Kings target, then the Human Kings scheme was clearly bigger, and the person he had to deal with was obviously more terrifying.","Could it be that they were targeting the monster, the Hus, the barbarians, or the marine folks?","Many thoughts flashed through Chu Yunfan’s mind in an instant, but he quickly followed Huangfu Longhao and the others to find Sima Yunlong and the others who had arrived earlier. Around Sima Yunlong and the others, other than the many top-notch prodigies of the Flying Celestials, there were also many top-notch prodigies from the forces that were dependent on the Flying Celestials.","In this unfamiliar environment, they instinctively gathered around the Flying Celestials for safety.","When Chu Yunfan and the others appeared, many eyes swept over.","“Are they the Supreme Youths of the Flying Celestials? I heard that they managed to stabilize the Flying Celestials in the battle yesterday and allowed the Flying Celestials win in the end.”","Some people were discussing carefully. They looked at Chu Yunfan with an incredulous expression as if they did not understand how Chu Yunfan and the others did it. Under the siege of the seven Supreme Youths, not only did they persevere, but they also swept all the way and killed their opponents.","“That’s right, they should be the few Supreme Youths from the Flying Celestials. Isn’t that Huangfu Longhao? I don’t need to talk about his cultivation, but I heard that the person who really made a great contribution this time wasn’t him, but Chu Yunfan!”","“I’ve also heard that this Chu Yunfan’s cultivation base can be said to be earth-shattering. He has swept away and crushed those ancient Supreme Youths. He has almost single-handedly supported the tottering Flying Celestials! ”","“It’s a pity that I wasn’t there yesterday. I heard that he’s invincible like a demon god in the sky. Now, some busybodies are praising him as the number one Supreme Youth in the world!”","“The number one Supreme Youth in the world? What a big tone. I think the people who supported him are probably praising him to death. The words ‘number one in the world’ will probably bring him a lot of trouble!”","“Hehe, who knows who’s behind this? I’m afraid there’s more than one. After all, it’s not that easy to spread the news overnight!” Someone laughed.."]},{"number":2258,"title":"Chapter 2258: Pm in a Rush, You Guys Should Attack Together","paragraphs":["Chapter 2258: Pm in a Rush, You Guys Should Attack Together","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan was not moved when he heard these words. His expression was calm as if he did not hear them.","He knew that many people present were paying attention to him, especially since these people were at least top-notch prodigies.","It could be said that they were all the top figures in the world in the coming years.","They did not seal themselves, but chose to be born in this world, so this would be an incomparably glorious great world.","Suddenly, a ball of black fog spread out. In the darkness, a figure appeared.","His spirit was soaring as if he was the king of the darkness.","In an instant, he arrived before Chu Yunfan.","His arrival immediately alerted the elites of the Flying Celestials.","“What do you want, Matchless Night?” Huangfu Longhao stepped forward.","His expression showed that he was very vigilant against Matchless Night. Matchless Night was like a king of darkness. Wherever he went, there would be a country of darkness.","“It’s very simple. I just want to meet this so-called number one Supreme Youth in the world and see how good he is!”","The figure spoke slowly. It was a young man in his early twenties. He was slender and wore a long black robe. His face was handsome, but his eyes were incomparably bright. His pitch-black eyes carried some mysteries of the universe.","“Junior Chu, this is Matchless Night, a very ancient prodigy. However, a long time ago, he had already withdrawn from the Prodigy Battlefield because he exceeded the age limit. It is said that he is a legendary Emperor, the successor of the Night Emperor. He cannot be underestimated!”","Huangfu Longhao’s voice sounded in Chu Yunfan’s ears.","“The inheritance of an emperor?” Chu Yunfan’s interest was piqued. No wonder Niatchless Night was so arrogant.","In his heart, he probably did not even put those Supreme Youths in his eyes, let alone some top-notch prodigies.","After all, not all Supreme Youths had emperor inheritances. Whether or not they had emperor inheritances was also divided into levels among the Supreme Youths.","This was because the vast majority of Supreme Youths only obtained king inheritances. Only a small portion of them could obtain emperor inheritances.","Most of them could only occasionally obtain one or two divine powers and martial arts inherited from Emperors, and they might not be completely compatible with themselves.","There was no doubt about the difference between an emperor martial art and a king martial art.","If both sides had cultivated 500 laws and their power was similar, the difference in the level of the martial arts they had learned would determine the outcome of the battle.","With an emperor inheritance, one was indeed able to look down on everyone.","“Interesting!’","At this moment, another cold snort was heard, and a figure strode over.","“l want his head!”","Chu Yuntan raised his head and saw a fiery-red expert striding over.","Although this figure didn’t look like a human, Chu Yunfan knew that it was indeed a human. It was just a special physique that had manifested to the extreme.","“Divine Physique of Fire?” Chu Yunfan instantly recognized the special constitution of this expert.","There had once been a Divine Lord of Fire who ruled over an era among the Emperors.","This was also a very powerful special physique!","“This person calls himself King of Fire. No one knows his real name, but he had a very good relationship with Elements Kid. I’m afraid he’s here to avenge Elements Kid’s death by your hands!” Huangfu Longhao secretly transmitted his voice to Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan suddenly understood. Compared to Matchless Night who came purely because of his reputation as the number one in the world, King of Fire wanted to kill him.","“It’s fine. Since you want to make a move, I’ll give you this opportunity!’","Matchless Night said indifferently, but his eyes were fixed on Chu Yunfan.","Seeing that a great battle was about to break out, everyone turned their gazes over. These thousands of people were all dragons and phoenixes among men, the cream of the crop among the cream of the crop. No one was afraid of trouble. On the contrary, they treated the conflict between them as a show to watch.","“King of Fire, are you courting death?” a clear voice suddenly said.","Everyone looked up and saw a woman in a fiery red dress walking over on a","beam of light.","“Princess Gushe Tang Siyu?”","Someone quickly remembered who this person was. Wasn’t it the famous Gushe Princess, Tang Siyu?","Even they had heard of the competition between the old and new Princess Gushes.","Later on, beyond everyone’s expectations, Tang Siyu reversed the situation and overturned the ancient Princess Gushe. In the end, she became the only owner of the title.","To them, a title was nothing. If many people wanted to, they could be Kings in other eras.","However, through this matter, they finally recognized Tang Siyu’s existence. She was indeed qualified to become a Supreme Youth.","King of Fire glanced at Tang Siyu and said provocatively to Chu Yunfan, “Chu","Yunfan, are you going to hide behind a woman for the rest of your life?”","“I haven’t said anything yet. Are you afraid that we’ll join forces?” Chu Yunfan looked at King of Fire with a half-smile,","How could Chu Yunfan not understand what he was thinking? He was clearly afraid that Chu Yunfan and Tang Siyu would join forces. In that case, even King of Fire would not have much chance of winning.","At the very least, he believed that he had an overwhelming chance of winning against Chu Yunfan.","“We don’t need to join forces to deal with trash like you,” Chu Yunfan said,","“There’s no need for you guys to do anything. I’ll deal with the two of them. However, there’s not much time left. The imperial family library is about to open. I don’t have the time to play with you. You guys can attack together!” Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s words shocked almost everyone. It was already very difficult to deal with just one person. It could even be said that there was no way to win.","Not to mention that Chu Yunfan claimed he could win against two Supreme Youths?","What was this? This was extreme arrogance.","“Is Chu Yunfan crazy? How can he win if the two of them attack together?”","“Although he’s one of the best among the Supreme Youths, none of these two people are inferior to him. How can he still have the slightest chance of winning! ‘","“This Chu Yunfan is too stupid. He was so agitated by King of Fire’s words that he doesn’t want anyone else’s help. He’s so stupid that he can’t be compared to him. Such a person can actually live until now and become a Supreme Youth? The heavens are blind!”","Someone shouted as he pounded his chest and stamped his feet. His eyes were filled with jealousy.."]},{"number":2259,"title":"Chapter 2259: Squeezing Matchless Night to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2259: Squeezing Matchless Night to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In their eyes, they were much smarter than Chu Yunfan, who had been goaded so easily. However, they did not have Emperor physiques and could not become Supreme Youths.","No matter how hard they tried, it was impossible for them to become Supreme","Youths.","The difference between their physiques determined everything.","Therefore, in their opinion, Chu Yunfan must have gone crazy or been blinded by his reputation.","The so-called number one Supreme Youth in the world was just a saying among some busybodies. It had not been recognized by the public.","There were so many Supreme Youths, and each of them had countless ultimate techniques. If they did not really fight, who would know who would win and who would lose? Why would someone want to lie on their heads?","This was the fundamental reason why most people were very hostile to Chu Yunfan from the beginning.","“Whether it’s Matchless Night or King of Fire, they’re both peerless figures.","None of them are inferior to him. He must be crazy to be so sure!”","“I don’t think so. This Chu Yunfan must have some ability. If a fool can cultivate to this level, wouldn’t that be the greatest irony to us?”","“That’s right. I also think that Chu Yunfan must have something to rely on. Moreover, he said that he would fight two people at once. If he can’t hold out, will the Flying Celestials just leave him alone?”","“Those people from the Flying Celestials aren’t to be trifled with. I wonder whose promise Matchless Night and the others received to come find trouble with Chu Yunfan.’","For a moment, everyone was discussing animatedly. They were divided into two factions. One faction thought that Chu Yunfan had gone crazy, and the other faction thought that Chu Yunfan had his trump card.","Only the disciples of the Flying Celestials were very calm. They were naturally very familiar with Chu Yunfan’s strength. The massacre of the Supreme Youths yesterday was still vivid in their minds.","They could never forget how Chu Yunfan had displayed his divine might and easily killed seven Supreme Youths.","Many people in the outside world thought that the Flying Celestials had defeated the seven Supreme Youths by relying on group cooperation. The","Flying Celestials themselves knew that there had been no group cooperation. It was Chu Yunfan who had suppressed the other party from the beginning to the end.","He had beaten the other party to death!","Chu Yunfan had single-handedly turned the tide of the battle.","In their hearts, Chu Yunfan, who had displayed such shocking strength, was called the number one in the world.","Was there anything more powerful and terrifying than him in the world?","“Who do you think you are? Can you kill the two of us?” Matchless Night said coldly. His eyes were filled with killing intent. “You’re too arrogant. No wonder so many people want to kill you!’","Chu Yunfan glanced at Matchless Night and said, ‘You’re so stupid. Countless people want to kill me. Why did you come out in the end and they didn’t dare to come out? Don’t you understand? You’re so stupid that you don’t even know that you’ve become someone else’s pawn. I really don’t know how you cultivated up to this point!”","Matchless Night was instantly angered. Although he felt that Chu Yunfan might be right, he had become someone’s pawn, to him, this was nothing short of a great humiliation.","“You run your mouth too much. Go to hell!” Matchless Night roared. Suddenly, his eyes turned profound. He stretched out his hands and punched out.","He acted before King of Fire. He had originally wanted to see King of Fire and Chu Yunfan fight so that he could figure out Chu Yunfan’s background. However, he had been angered by Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, as this punch was thrown, the world suddenly changed color and turned into darkness. Night fell.","There was no longer any light between heaven and earth, and the night covered everything.","This punch had boundless power as if it had condensed the endless night sky into this punch. It wanted to turn the entire world into a land of darkness, a domain of darkness.","“In the dark night, I am the true king. No one can survive in my Darkness Domain!” Matchless Night laughed.","Chu Yunfan’s entire body was enveloped by this punch, and it exploded crazily. Every explosion was enough to severely injure or even kill an ordinary Divine Treasure.","One could imagine how shocking such a punch was!","Matchless Night had truly reached the peak of the Supreme Youth’s 500 laws.","He was even stronger than Elements Kid and the others who had been defeated by Chu Yunfan. Although they too had 500 laws, the strength of the laws was different.","His punch was above ordinary martial arts and he was a true royal-rank martial art","The prodigies present widened their eyes. Although there was no light, they were people who had long cultivated divine powers. They could see clearly even if there was no light.","After all, this was a royal martial art. They were not willing to let go of such a good opportunity to observe a royal martial art at a close distance.","Suddenly, at this moment, endless flames rose from Chu Yunfan’s body and lit up the entire space. It was like the sun of discussion, tearing the darkness apart in an instant.","At this moment, everyone could clearly see that the terrifying punch had stopped three feet in front of Chu Yunfan and could not advance an inch.","It seemed to be blocked by a law and barrier.","Bam!","Everyone noticed that the punch was distorted by the power of a divine art and then shattered with a bang.","Spurt!","Matchless Night spat out a mouthful of blood and retreated a few steps. The attack that he had used all his strength for had been broken. He suffered a huge backlash and suffered a huge loss.","There was disbelief in his eyes. He had not held back at all. With his cultivation, an ordinary Divine Treasure could be killed by him with a single punch.","Even Supreme Youths would need to use all their strength to resist this punch of his.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan’s fist would be torn apart by a mysterious force after just taking a look.","“What divine power is this?” Matchless Night felt the power of disaster from it, but he could not see it. He could only feel it.","“A divine ability that will take your life!”","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan appeared before Matchless Night. He reached out and grabbed Matchless Night’s neck.","Matchless Night struggled for a moment, trying to break free from Chu","Yunfan’s big hand. Who would have thought that it was useless as if all the divine power in his body was suppressed.","Then, Chu Yunfan suddenly exerted force, and everyone heard a crisp sound of breaking. Matchless Night’s neck was broken.","Matchless Night was dead!"]},{"number":2260,"title":"Chapter 2260: Kill All the Obstacles","paragraphs":["Chapter 2260: Kill All the Obstacles","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was a light move!","These two words appeared in everyone’s minds!","Unlike what everyone had expected, Chu Yunfan killed Matchless Night effortlessly.","The battle phenomenon only lasted for an instant, and the victor had already been decided.","Even the boldest person had not expected the battle to turn out this way. It was a complete one-sided suppression.","They were both Supreme Youths, but the gap in strength between them had actually reached such a level. It simply did not feel like they were both Supreme Youths.","It felt like a Supreme Youth crushing an ordinary Divine Treasure.","Was this the number one Supreme Youth in the world?","Many people immediately recalled the so-called news that they had thought was a joke.","From the looks of it now, the rumors were probably not without reason. To be able to casually kill a Supreme Youth, Chu Yunfan was probably not far from being the number one.","Many of these people were prodigies who had once roamed the Prodigy Battlefield. They could be considered old opponents, so they naturally had some understanding of each other’s strength.","Among them, there was no existence that would completely destroy the balance. Moreover, from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, it was not only destroying the balance, it was simply not balanced.","It was like a bug that had suddenly appeared.","“Is this really a human? Or some kind of monster?”","“He must be a monster, right?”","“How can someone’s battle prowess reach such a level?”","Many people felt that it was unbelievable as if they had seen a monster. In many people’s eyes, they were the real monsters.","However, among the group of monsters, there was clearly one monster that was even more terrifying. It was a monster among monsters.","Under Chu Yunfan’s gaze, many people even felt their bodies turn cold.","King of Fire, in particular, felt a chill run down his spine. Chu Yunfan’s strength had far exceeded his imagination.","He originally wanted to avenge Elements Kid, but who would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s strength was so terrifying?","At this moment, he finally understood why Elements Kid could not save his life from Chu Yunfan’s hands even with his strength.","This was because he was not facing a human, but a monster.","“Chu Yunfan, how dare you kill people here. Aren’t you afraid of the Human Kings wrath?” King of Fire roared.","He noticed that Chu Yunfan was looking at him with an unfriendly expression as if he was looking at a dead man.","This kind of gaze made him very unhappy. It was like when he himself was looking at those weak people. However, now, the person who was being looked at like an animal was him and not anyone else.","“The Human King will be furious? Hahahaha!” Chu Yunfan laughed. “I think you guys have forgotten one thing. This is no longer your era. This is the era of Grand Xia, and I am Marquis Zhenyuan of Grand Xia. The two of you attempted to kill the nobles of the Imperial Court, and that is simply courting death!”","At this moment, King of Fire finally recalled that this person before him was a prodigy of the current era. He had an extremely deep connection to the Grand Xia Empire. There was no doubt that the Grand Xia Empire would side with him.","Anyway, Grand Xia definitely wouldn’t help him!","“It’s too late for regrets now!” Chu Yunfan sneered. “l know that many of you are not satisfied with my so-called number one Supreme Youth in the world. I don’t have any thoughts about this title, but since it’s on my head, it’s mine. Whoever wants it can come at me together to save time!”","Chu Yunfan’s gaze was like an eagle’s as he surveyed the crowd. Many of the prodigies had indignant expressions on their faces. Obviously, Chu Yunfan’s words were too aggressive in their eyes. His arrogant expression seemed to not put them in his eyes at all.","This made them angry. However, after Chu Yunfan easily crushed Matchless Night to death. thev did not dare to show themselves.","Even the Supreme Youth didn’t dare to step forward rashly. Even though some people speculated that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had erupted and that it was impossible for him to maintain such combat strength, no one was willing to test whether Chu Yunfan’s combat strength had suddenly erupted or whether he had such combat strength from the start.","It was obvious that Chu Yunfan’s strength had planted a seed in their hearts. Many people’s eyes were filled with hostility. It was not impossible for him to be surrounded by many experts.","“Junior Chu is being too unwise. He has offended everyone. With the pride of these Supreme Youths, I’m afraid they won’t let this matter rest so easily!’ Huangfu Longhao said worriedly.","He had been dealing with these Supreme Youths for a long time, so he naturally understood that the fact that these Supreme Youths did not say anything now did not mean that they were completely afraid of Chu Yunfan. Now, they recognized that Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was above theirs. At least in the Divine Treasure Stage, Chu Yunfan was almost invincible.","However, the Divine Treasure Stage was not the end. Above it was Domain Stage. Once someone broke through to Domain Stage first, the first person they would look for would be Chu Yunfan.","These Supreme Youths did not hold grudges. Usually, they would take revenge on the spot. There were very few enemies that could make these Supreme Youths hold grudges.","With their cultivation speed, even if the enemy was stronger than them, they would quickly surpass them.","“Even if he doesn’t express his stance, will those people be friendly to him?” Tang Siyu said, “This is the Golden Era. Everyone is fighting for it. I’m afraid there will be another emperor, or even a god. There will only be one person who will walk to the end. Whether Chhu Yunfan takes a stand or not, he will eventually walk on the opposite side, won’t he?”","Tang Siyu looked at Chu Yunfan, her clear and beautiful eyes flashing with a strange light. Chu Yunfan’s appearance reminded her of a long time ago. The first time she really liked Chu Yunfan, she looked down on the crowd like this.","He had the ambition to be invincible!","“That’s true!” Huangfu Longhao agreed, “This is the path of cultivation itself. Kill all the obstacles that block your path!’","At this moment, King of Fire had already slowly retreated, trying to get away from Chu Yunfan. However, Chu Yunfan was only paying attention to King of Fire’s movements. How could he let him escape?","Prismatic Traveller!","Chu Yunfan caught up with King of Fire in an instant and arrived in front of him. He looked down at King of Fire.."]},{"number":2261,"title":"Chapter 2261: Who Do You Think You Are?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2261: Who Do You Think You Are?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Didn’t you want to kill me just now? Why? Are you going to flee now? Where is your pride as a Supreme Youth? Where’s your self-esteem?” Chu Yunfan grinned and looked at King of Fire with a faint smile.","King of Fire’s expression was extremely ugly. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so persistent in his pursuit. He did not have any intention of letting him off.","However, if it were him, he would not let Chu Yunfan off easily. Even this time, he did not intend to let Chu Yunfan off!","However, what was different from what he had imagined was that the difference in strength was completely different. He had already gone from being the hunter to the prey.","As for pride and self-esteem, of course, he had them. However, these things were only useful if he lived on. Only the prodigies who lived were prodigies. Those who died were just a pile of bones on the road of cultivation.","King of Fire glared at Chu Yunfan and roared angrily, “Don’t go too far, Chu","Yunfan!”","“Go too far? Hahaha, isn’t it fun to bully people though?” Chu Yunfan grinned. “Although you have an emperor physique, you’re a bully. You are lucky to have cultivated until now. Now, I will end your luck!”","Seeing that Chu Yunfan had no intention of letting him go, King of Fire’s divine power boiled crazily. His entire body was like a ball of flames that instantly swept up.","“Chu Yunfan, for my sake, let him go!’","Suddenly, a young man in a blue robe strode out and came in front of Chu Yunfan. He stared at him with bright eyes.","“Who are you? Why do you want to save the person I want to kill?” Chu Yunfan said with a cold smile.","However, he immediately made a judgment from the mana fluctuations on this young man.","“You are a disciple of the Destiny Sect?”","This blue-robed youth was somewhat surprised. He had never revealed his identity. Even in the Prodigy Battlefield, not many people knew of his reputation. He was different from ordinary Supreme Youths. He was low-key in his actions.","But now, Chu Yunfan was able to call out his origin. Obviously, it was not because he knew his identity and origin from others. Otherwise, he would not only call out his origin.","Soon, he understood what had gone wrong. His mana fluctuations had been discovered. He often relied on this to determine the background of others.","But even so, not only did he not come to a realization, he was more shocked. He was sure that his mana fluctuations had been reduced to the lowest, but he was still seen through at a glance. It was enough to show how terrifying Chu Yunfan was.","“A disciple of Destiny Sect dares to come before me? It’s already good enough that I didn’t find trouble with you!” Chu Yunfan said coldly.","Many of the prodigies did not seem to understand. Chu Yunfan’s words had a hidden meaning, but some of the prodigies who knew the whole story began to explain.","Only then did everyone understand that 20 years ago, Chu Yunfan had almost died at the hands of a Supreme Youth of the current generation of the Destiny Sect.","Twenty years ago, Chu Yunfan’s name was known throughout the world. He was in high spirits and was a man of the hour. However, after Jun Tianci’s sneak attack, he had rested for twenty years and only reappeared recently.","They didn’t know that Chu Yunfan had transformed into Jian Wuchen. All they knew was some superficial information. However, just the superficial information made them understand why Chu Yunfan had an irreconcilable hatred for the Destiny Sect.","If it were them, they wouldn’t let it go if they were ambushed and almost died, even if the other party was a colossus like the Destiny Sect.","“Chu Yunfan, although you are Marquis Zhenyuan, I am also a marquis of the Imperial Court. My status is not lower than yours. The Imperial Court is now advocating for the peaceful co-existence of the ancient inheritances and our current inheritances, so that we can become the backbone of the human forces together. You are destroying the relationship between the two sides and the Imperial Court’s plan!” the blue-robed man said loudly, trying to use Grand Xia’s words to suppress Chu Yunfan.","After Chu Yunfan heard this, he sneered and said, “You are a marquis, but so am l. What right do you have to order me around? Whether it is beneficial to the overall situation of the court is up to me. If you are dissatisfied, go to the Grand Commandant and ask him to speak. Otherwise, get lost!”","Chu Yunfan rarely put on airs like this, let alone reprimand someone mercilessly. This made the blue-robed young man furious.","However, the blue-robed youth clearly remembered how Chu Yunfan had easily crushed Matchless Night. That scene was too terrifying. Even now, he still remembered it clearly.","“Chu Yunfan, vou will regret this!” the blue-robed vouth said.","“l never regret anything!” Chu Yunfan looked at the blue-robed young man with killing intent in his eyes.","As long as this blue-robed young man dared to stand in his way, he would kill him as well. The blue-robed youth’s sudden appearance confirmed Chu Yunfan!s guess. Whether it was Matchless Night or King of Fire, they were obviously instigated by someone. Just like what Chu Yunfan said, they were just chess pieces.","And this blue-robed youth was probably one of the chess players.","As expected, the Destiny Sect still wouldn’t let Chu Yunfan off easily. The feud between the Flying Celestials and the Destiny Sect hadn’t subsided over the years. Instead, it kept rising as time passed.","Matchless Night and King of Fire were just cannon fodder. This blue-robed youth probably didn’t expect them to be so vulnerable in front of Chu Yunfan.","The blue-robed youth felt Chu Yunfan’s killing intent. He instantly entered the Destiny Sect camp, not giving Chu Yunfan an excuse or motive to kill him.","“D*mned Chu Yunfan, I’ll let you off for now. Once I break through to the Domain Stage, I’ll kill you first!” The blue-robed youth’s eyes were malicious, and his heart was churning with anger.","On the other side, King of Fire made his move. While Chu Yunfan was talking, he launched a sneak attack.","“D*mned monster, who are you looking down on? Even if I die, I’ll take you with me!”","King of Fire was a Supreme Youth after all. When he was enraged, the strength he erupted with made many geniuses look at him.","“Fire Lotus of Annihilation. Fire is everything that is eternal!” King of Fire roared in rage as a huge fire lotus with a radius of several hundred meters appeared above his head.","The lotus aflame with fire spun around. With every revolution, the flames grew a little bigger, and soon formed a huge fire storm.."]},{"number":2262,"title":"Chapter 2262: Squeezing King of Fire to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2262: Squeezing King of Fire to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The endless flames transformed into a terrifying red lotus of annihilation.","The scorching flames seemed to be boiling the entire space around it.","The entire world seemed to have fallen into a destructive fire lotus.","This flame was not an ordinary flame, but the legendary Li Fire. Among many special flames, Li Fire was no ordinary flame.","For ordinary people, even if they were also Supreme Youths, they would not dare to take it head-on. However, it was obvious that Chu Yunfan was not an ordinary Supreme Youth.","He was the ancestor of playing with fire!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at the fire lotus and simply swallowed it whole.","“What?!” King of Fire was instantly shocked and retreated. His trump card was actually swallowed by Chu Yunfan in one bite. One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan’s strength was.","When Chu Yunfan had casually killed Matchless Night, he was already shocked. However, he did not expect that it was not Chu Yunfan’s true strength.","Judging from the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, his full strength was truly unfathomable.","However, before he could react, a large hand appeared in the air and grabbed King of Fire.","Boom!","King of Fire was crushed into a rain of blood in mid air. All the defensive magical equipment, barriers, and arrays on his body were crushed in an instant.","Chu Yunfan grabbed the blood rain that filled the sky. Half of it entered the Mountain River Diagram to water the Brahma Tree, while the other half entered Chu Yunfan!s eyes to feed his Disaster Star Eyes.","The power of the Disaster Star Eyes continued to rise, becoming more and more extraordinary. It was so quick!","It was too fast!","Before anyone could react, King of Fire had already been crushed to death by","Chu Yunfan.","It made everyone understand the gap between them and Chu Yunfan.","In fact, the gap between them was probably even greater than that between ordinary top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths.","“So... So strong!’","Some of the prodigies stuttered. They were shocked by Chu Yunfan’s fierce behavior.","It should even be said that he was frightened.","Chu Yunfan’s fighting style was simple and crude. He swallowed the fire lotus in one gulp and then crushed King of Fire.","This made them all suck in a breath of cold air as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","Although King of Fire had been casually crushed to death by Chu Yunfan, this did not mean that King of Fire was weak. On the contrary, King of Fire’s strength was probably at the top among them, not weaker than any of the Supreme Youths.","This could be felt from his earlier attack.","Therefore, the real problem wasn’t King of Fire, but Chu Yunfan!","He was too strong, so strong that he could easily crush a Supreme Youth of the same level to death as if he was crushing an ant.","“He’s indeed strong. Rumor has it that he has condensed 1,000 laws. I thought it was nonsense before, but now it seems that it’s true!”","“Is he a monster? How did he condense 1,000 laws?!”","“It’s unprecedented!”","Everyone was discussing animatedly. However, unlike before, many people were just watching the show. Now, they only felt that Chu Yunfan was sharp and threatening. It even made them feel a sense of danger.","Such a monster’s strength was simply unfathomable. It was already not something that a few or a dozen people could make up for.","What many people couldn’t understand was how Chu Yunfan managed to condense 1,000 laws. Logically speaking, that was impossible.","Even for a Supreme Youth, after condensing 500 laws, it was impossible to condense another one.","Just like how ordinary people wanted to fly to the sky, something that could not be done was not even a miracle. Miracles were things that had a small probability of happening. That was a myth. A myth was something that was impossible to do. That was why it was called a myth.","At this moment, they did not doubt that Chu Yunfan had condensed 1,000 laws. Now, it seemed that it was absolutely true.","At the same time, they also realized a terrifying thing. At least in the Divine Treasure Stage, no one could do anything to Chu Yunfan.","The difference between 1,000 laws and 500 laws was like the difference between Heaven and Earth. Even if thousands of them attacked Chu Yunfan together, even if Chu Yunfan couldn’t kill them all, he could still protect himself and retreat easily.","This was extremely terrifying. This meant that they simply could not deal with such an abnormal existence.","At the very least, there was nothing they could do!","Even those Supreme Youths thought this way. In front of Chu Yunfan,","numbers were meaningless. A quantitative change would lead to a qualitative change. Chu Yunfan’s essence had transcended and was completely on a different level from them.","How many of these Supreme Youths who had the ultimate goal of becoming an Emperor or even a god were willing to accept such an outcome?","After Chu Yunfan crushed King of Fire to death, he swept his cold gaze across the crowd. “Is there anyone else who wants to go with them?”","Everyone was silent out of fear. Even though they were all top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths, this time was different from before.","Previously, although Chu Yunfan seemed powerful to them, he was at most a little stronger than an ordinary Supreme Youth.","That was already very impressive. Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be able to defeat several Supreme Youths?","It made them tremble in fear. At this moment, how would they still dare to stand out as cannon fodder? Wouldn’t that be courting death?","Seeing that everyone was silent, Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction and returned to the Flying Celestials’ camp.","“You’re getting stronger and stronger, Junior Chu!” Huangfu Longhao looked at Chu Yunfan and sighed.","He could feel that Chu Yunfan was clearly stronger than yesterday when he was in the ring.","This shocked Huangfu Longhao greatly. Chu Yunfan’s improvement had reached a point where even he could easily sense it.","However, he didn’t notice that Chu Yunfan had a divine item like the godhead. Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the laws of Heaven and Earth could be said to be carried out almost at all times, and he basically had a huge harvest.","It could even be said that the current him and the next him were completely different in terms of enlightenment of cultivation level.","He was improving at a speed visible to the naked eye, This kind of Chu Yunfan was the most terrifying existence.","“They were just two clowns. They were nothing!” Chu Yunfan replied with a smile.","Many of the elites of the Flying Celestials were finally convinced. They regarded Chu Yunfan as the number one Supreme Youth of the Flying","Celestials.."]},{"number":2263,"title":"Chapter 2263: Destiny Sect’s Suspicion","paragraphs":["Chapter 2263: Destiny Sect’s Suspicion","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The Flying Celestials’ hope was on Chu Yunfan. If it was in another era, any one of them could bear the hope of the Flying Celestials rising to power and even become the sect master of the Flying Celestials.","It might even be possible for any one of them to become a king in the future,","However, in this Golden Era, top-notch geniuses were everywhere. In an era where ordinary geniuses were inferior to dogs, only Supreme Youths could stand out.","And Chu Yunfan was clearly one of the best among the Supreme Youths.","“However, your strength has probably attracted their attention. If I’m not wrong, they will think of ways to target yoruyou in the ancient battlefield. You have to be careful, Junior Chu!” Huangfu Longhao said.","“What are you afraid of? Those people aren’t strong enough for Senior Chu. He can crush them with one hand!” Chu Hongcai said.","At this moment, his face was still filled with excitement. He was even happier than he had won.","Tang Siyu, who was standing at the side, also had a smile on her face. It was obvious that she did not take Huangfu Longhao’s words to heart.","She had known Chu Yunfan for far too long, so she knew what kind of person he was. He was extremely daring, and there was nothing he didn’t dare to do. All the powerful enemies he had killed were once famous and were considered far more powerful than Chu Yunfan.","However, in the end, they lost to Chu Yunfan and became a member of the white bone road under his feet.","“It’s fine. Do you think 1 don’t know what they’re thinking? They definitely won’t dare to act rashly now. All they can think of is to wait until they break through to the Domain Stage before finding trouble with me!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","These Supreme Youths had not said a word when Chu Yunfan had interrogated them, but that did not mean that they had submitted to him. Chu Yunfan could see what they were thinking. They simply felt that Chu Yunfan must have had some fortuitous encounter to be so powerful in the Divine Treasure Stage.","Chu Yunfan was the strongest in the Divine Treasure Stage. However, once they broke through the Divine Treasure Stage and entered the Domain Stage, Chu Yunfan would be nothing.","The difference in strength between the two sides, which was originally like the difference between Heaven and Earth, would quickly be narrowed.","In the Divine Treasure Stage, it could be said that there was no one in history who could condense 1,000 laws.","However, 1,000 laws was only the lowest level in the Domain Stage. That was the basic operation.","At that time, Chu Yunfan would no longer be mysterious. With their talent, even if they were ordinary top geniuses, once they crossed the threshold of the Domain Stage, it would not be as simple as just 1,000 laws.","It was even normal to condense 2,000 or 3,000 laws in one breath, not to mention a Supreme Youth. Once they broke through, they would probably start with 3,000 laws.","At that time, Chu Yunfan, who only had 1,000 laws, would not be in their eyes.","They could then find an opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan.","The first to laugh might not have the last. The person who laughed last was the one who laughed the best.","However, since Chu Yunfan knew what they were thinking, how could he let them have their way? He wasn’t like what those people had guessed, that he had something else to be so powerful in the Divine Treasure Stage.","He was invincible in every level. Not to mention the Divine Treasure Stage, he could easily defeat a group of Supreme Youths of other levels.","It was just that Chu Yunfan’s strength was too unbelievable, so even they did not dare to think about it.","“You are indeed impressive to be able to condense 1,000 laws in the Divine","Treasure Stage, Junior Chu. However, it’s nothing in front of a Domainian!” Huangfu Longhao said, “When the time comes, you have to be careful of their siege!’","“Don’t worry, Senior Huangfu. Since I know what they’re thinking, how could I let them have their way?” Chu Yunfan nodded. “Besides, it’s uncertain who will reach the Domain Stage first. If they want to kill me, they’ll have to see if they have the ability to do so!”","Thinking about breaking through to the Domain Stage, even Chu Yunfan felt a little excited. This was because Domainians had a completely different status in the current world.","Once he broke through, with his deep foundation, Chu Yunfan would definitely become one of the best Domainians.","At that time, he would be equivalent to one of the best in the world.","Other than a few emperors who didn’t even know if they existed, he was already a top figure in the world. He could do whatever he wanted.","It could be said that at that time, even if he were to become enemies with the world, he would not be afraid.","At the same time, in the distance, in the Destiny Sect camp, the blue-robed young man’s expression was extremely ugly. It was not only because he had","been humiliated by Chu Yunfan, but also because he had seen Chu Yunfan’s current strength.","Chu Yunfan was clearly the best in the Divine Treasure Stage!","At this moment, he was even a little glad that he did not act on impulse. Instead, he let Matchless Night and King of Fire act as his chess pieces to test","Chu Yunfan’s strength.","Otherwise, he would have died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","He believed that his strength was above King of Fire and Matchless Night, but it was only a thin line. How could there be such a huge difference?","This meant that the gap between him and Chu Yunfan was about the same.","At this moment, a top prodigy from the Destiny Sect said with an ugly expression, “Senior Gongsun, we previously speculated that Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen were very likely to be the same person. Now, it seems that the possibility is even greater!”","Gongsun Hongs expression turned even more unsightly. During this time, the Destiny Sect had never given up on searching for Jian Wuchen. After all, he had killed two Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect and even more top-notch prodigies. This had caused the entire Destiny Sect to feel a deep pain in their hearts. How could they let this matter rest?","If it were any other sect, such a loss would be enough to cause a great loss to the strength of a top ten sect-level force.","Even with Destiny Sect’s strength, they found it difficult to bear such a price.","But who knew that even if they invited a mysterious senior from an archaic prediction sect to deduce the secrets, they could not find Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts. It was as if such a person had never existed.","The world had been deceived!","In fact, the person who had stunned the Mysteries Pavilion might even be stronger than the big shots of their organization.","Without the divination of the Mysteries Pavilion, it would be much more difficult for them to find someone. Even with their strength, it was impossible for the Destiny Sect to cover the sky with one hand.","At this moment, the information about Chu Yunfan was sent over to the Destiny Sect, and it made them realize that something was wrong.."]},{"number":2264,"title":"Chapter 2264: Undercurrent Surges, Conspiracy Appears","paragraphs":["Chapter 2264: Undercurrent Surges, Conspiracy Appears","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was because the records of Chu Yunfan and Jian Wuchen were somewhat similar. Jian Wuchen was an expert in the way of the sword, while Chu Yunfan did not seem to be a cultivator in the way of the sword. However, in the records of the early years, there were records of Chu Yunfan’s astonishing cultivation in the way of the sword.","From all the information, one could deduce the fact that Chu Yunfan had received the inheritance of the Violet Thunder Sword Sect.","In other words, Chu Yunfan should be a master of the sword, but his performance was not very obvious.","In addition, Jian Wuchen’s lightning divine power was similar to Chu","Yunfan’s.","Not to mention the fact that the time when the two appeared was related. After Jian Wuchen appeared, he killed many experts of the Destiny Sect, but no one in the Destiny Sect knew who Jian Wuchen was.","With such strength, it was impossible for no one to know about him. However, such a person that their Destiny Sect knew nothing about had appeared.","Even the ancient legacies that had been passed down since the end of the Antiquity Age didn’t know where Jian Wuchen came from, let alone the Destiny Sect.","This in itself was very strange. How could there be someone who appeared out of thin air? Even if their origin was unknown, it was unlikely that they had not entered the Prodigy Battlefield.","Even after the Destiny Sect’s inescapable search, they still couldn’t find Jian Wuchen’s whereabouts. But at that moment, Chu Yunfan appeared.","Although the martial arts displayed by the two sides were different, the aura they gave off was very similar. They were both powerful and invincible. In the eyes of the Destiny Sect, this was very suspicious.","Although they couldn’t say it out loud, even if it was just a little suspicious, it was already a reason for the Destiny Sect to kill Chu Yunfan.","It was better to kill the wrong person than to let them off!","Moreover, it wasn’t that there wasn’t any grudge between Chu Yunfan and the Destiny Sect. On the contrary, the grudge between them was extremely great!","Everyone knew that Jun Tianci had ambushed and killed Chu Yunfan. No one believed that Chu Yunfan would act as if nothing had happened.","Moreover, Chu Yunfan’s current strength was too amazing. Yesterday, he had single-handedly saved the Flying Celestials from defeat and shocked the entire Destiny Sect.","The night was silent, but the undercurrents behind it never stopped.","The strength of the Flying Celestials caused many of the plans of the Destiny Sect to fail. Although many people felt that the enmity between the current and ancient inheritances was inevitable, and it was inevitable for them to fight each other, to the Destiny Sect, as long as they protected their foundation, no matter who won or lost, they would eventually fall into the rules of Grand Xia.","As long as it was within the rules, then even an ancient legacy would become a legacy of the current era.","As long as they chose to integrate into the world, the outcome would be the same.","However, the Flying Celestials managed to hold on, but it messed up some of the Destiny Sect’s plans.","Their plans were in vain.","And the most important person was Chu Yunfan!","Any of these factors was enough to make the Destiny Sect want to eliminate Chu Yunfan.","“Regardless of whether it’s him or not, we must not let this Chu Yunfan off. Otherwise, he will become a great enemy of our sect in the future. On the contrary, Huangfu Longhao and the others are nothing. They’re just ordinary Supreme Youths!” Gongsun Hong said with an ugly expression.","In his eyes, Huangfu Longhao was nothing. He had fought with Huangfu Longhao many times. Although he was powerful, he was only an ordinary Supreme Youth, not much different from him.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. In the battle yesterday, Chu Yunfan had single-handedly destroyed seven Supreme Youths who were of similar strength to Gongsun Hong. This was what he had heard.","At that time, he felt that this was inconceivable. After all, they were seven Supreme Youths and not ordinary prodigies.","However, after seeing it today, he truly understood that the rumors yesterday were not false.","Chu Yunfan had the ability to slaughter Supreme Youths, although Gongsun Hong did not know how he cultivated to such an inhuman level.","However, it was clearly not an opponent that he could defeat.","At this moment, Gongsun Hong was somewhat glad that he did not rashly step forward. Instead, he used methods to make the others become cannon fodder.","Otherwise, King of Fire wouldn’t be the one being crushed by Chu Yunfan.","“He’s extremely dangerous right now. Once he breaks through to the Domain Stage, it’ll be difficult to find anyone in the world who can deal with him!” Gongsun Hong said coldly.","The Domain Stage was the pinnacle of cultivation in the world. Even the sect leaders of the ten great sects were only at this level.","Of course, those who had just entered the Domain Stage could not be compared to those old monsters who had cultivated for many years. However, they had already stepped into the ranks of the top in the world. If he wanted to target them again, it would be extremely difficult.","It was at least a hundred times more difficult than now!","After all, although the Divine Treasure Stage was strong, it was still manageable. However, the Domain Stage was extremely difficult to deal with.","Furthermore, it was the Domain Stage that a Supreme Youth had cultivated to. That was even more difficult.","“However, with the strength that Chu Yunfan has shown, I’m afraid that no one can fight him!” a prodigy from the Destiny Sect said in fear.","The strength that Chu Yunfan displayed frightened him. That was an existence that human strength could not compare to.","Unknowingly, even the prodigies, who were the best among the many living beings in the world, were frightened by Chu Yunfan.","Gongsun Hong glanced at this prodigy and understood what he was thinking. Killing people was not scary, even if the person he killed was a Supreme","Youth.","If Chu Yunfan had killed King of Fire and Matchless Night after a great battle, then even if it was shocking, it would not have come to this.","However, Chu Yunfan had easily killed two Supreme Youths. Not to mention these prodigies, even a Supreme Youth like him was scared out of his wits.","“Divine Treasures aren’t considered strong. Once we break through to the Domain Stage, killing him will be as easy as flipping our hands!” Gongsun Hong said through gritted teeth.","He didn’t have the guts to go after Chu Yunfan now. However, once he stepped into the Domain Stage, everything would be different. Chu Yunfan!s current advantage would disappear.","“Let’s wait a little longer. We must break through to the Domain Stage before he does. Before that, we can’t let him break through to the Domain Stage. We must think of a way to disrupt his cultivation!” Gongsun Hong thought of something, and he smiled coldly.."]},{"number":2265,"title":"Chapter 2265: A Huge Library","paragraphs":["Chapter 2265: A Huge Library","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Undercurrents surged.","Unknowingly, Chu Yunfan had become the target of public criticism, but he acted as if nothing had happened and did not care about these strange gazes.","It wasn’t that he didn’t know anything, it was just that he had absolute confidence in his strength!","All these people wanted was to reach the Domain Stage before him and then deal with him.","However, who would be the first to reach the Domain Stage would be a different story!","Ding, ding, ding!","The sound of a bell rang out as a figure slowly appeared in the sky. Everyone focused and saw that it was a tall, middle-aged man in a gorgeous robe.","This middle-aged man had a squarish face and a dignified expression. He had the aura of looking down on the world. Just by standing quietly in the sky, he had the might to suppress the geniuses.","“Greetings, Grand Commandant!”","The geniuses of the current factions stood up and bowed, and the geniuses of the ancient inheritances also bowed.","The person who had arrived was none other than the number one military officer of the Grand Xia Empire, the Grand Commandant.","With just one look, many of the geniuses felt a huge pressure. Only now did many people finally remember that the Grand Commandant was the number one person in the military in Grand Xia.","The Grand Commandant was definitely not what many people thought. He was very accomplished in the art of war, and he was definitely one of the strongest in the world.","Even the sect leaders of the ten great factions were no match for the Grand Commandant.","Chu Yunfan secretly tried to figure out the strength of the Grand","Commandant. In the past, the difference in strength between him and the Grand Commandant was too great. It was like Heaven and Earth. He could not detect the strength of the Grand Commandant at all.","The two sides were not on the same level at all.","However, it was different now. Although the gap between the two sides was still very large, it had narrowed.","At least Chu Yunfan could feel the strength of the Grand Commandant. In the past, Chu Yunfan could only feel that the Grand Commandant was as unfathomable as an abyss.","Based on Chu Yunfan’s senses, the Grand Commandant’s strength was far above Situ Xuan’s. He might already be a King. Even if he wasn’t, he was definitely at the peak Domain Stage.","Although both of them were at the peak, Situ Xuan’s potential was much weaker than the Grand Commandant. In other words, the Grand Commandant was most likely an emperor physique possessor and was once a Supreme","Youth.","It was just that the past was different from the present. At that time, Supreme Youths were undoubtedly rare, and it was not certain that one could be produced in an era.","In that case, in the eyes of everyone, the Supreme Youth was a part of the prodigies. It was just that this prodigy was a little too tyrannical.","It was only in this Great Era that there was more than one Supreme Youth. With their super strong strength, they were divided into another class. Only then did everyone understand that above the top prodigies, there was the Supreme Youths.","Above the king physiques were the emperor physiques.","However, Chu Yunfan’s current strength was too far from the Grand Commandant. Chu Yunfan guessed that he had to break through to the Domain Stage to be able to find out more.","The difference between the Divine Treasure Stage and the Domain Stage was evident from this.","All of these prodigies were the cream of the crop in the Divine Treasure Stage, but they were easily suppressed by the Grand Commandant.","However, Chu Yunfan was only a little curious. After all, he had a good relationship with the Grand Commandant and had been helped by the Grand Commandant several times.","Although it was to protect the dignity of the Imperial Court, it was already very precious to Chu Yunfan, who was still weak at that time.","Therefore, Chu Yunfan appreciated the Grand Commandant’s kindness. Of course, Chu Yunfan did not have the ability to return the favor yet, but he was confident that such a day would come in the future,","“Everyone, please excuse us!” The Grand Commandant of Grand Xia said calmly, “l know that everyone’s time is precious, so I won’t say anything more. This time, thanks to His Majesty’s grace, all of you have the opportunity to enter the imperial family library to take a look at the classics!","“l hope that you will cherish this opportunity. In order to exchange for this opportunity, the sects behind you have paid a considerable price! 1 hope you won’t let this opportunity go to waste!”","Only then did Chu Yunfan realize that there was such a deal behind the scenes. But after thinking about it, it made sense. If it wasn’t for the deal behind the scenes, why would the imperial family give them the opportunity to enter the library?","These were all treasures that Grand Xia had collected over countless years. To a power, these were undoubtedly the most precious things. The key to a power’s long-term legacy was the inheritance of the technique.","The prodigies understood, so they were not surprised.","Many of them had eager expressions on their faces, and there were even some provocative expressions. It was obvious that even the Grand Commandant, one of the top experts in the world, could not make these top-notch prodigies and Supreme Youths admit defeat.","To them, the gap between them and the Grand Commandant was only a matter of time. As long as they were given enough time, it was not impossible for them to be on par with the Grand Commandant in the future.","However, the Grand Commandant acted as if he did not see it. He turned a blind eye to the eagerness and even provocation of these prodigies, or he did not take them to heart at all.","“Alright, the next time the bell rings, it will be time for you to leave. Also, you must not damage any of the books in the library. Otherwise, you will pay the price!” the Grand Commandant warned.","“Yes, sir!” Everyone nodded.","Following that, the Grand Commandant waved and a huge gate of light appeared before everyone.","The door of light slowly opened, and a huge library appeared in front of everyone. The entire library was so huge that no one could see the bottom at a","glance as if it was blocked by some kind of array.","The rows of bookshelves within Chu Yunfan’s sight were like a long, endless dragon.","On the bookshelves, books were quietly displayed, separated by small barriers.","“What a huge library. It’s several times bigger than the library of our sect. It’s really amazing!” Chu Hongcai said in surprise.","Chu Hongcai had just been allowed to enter the Flying Celestials’s library to take a look.","Therefore, he understood the difference between the two libraries the most.","The Flying Celestials library was extremely shocking, but compared to the imperial family library of Grand Xia, it paled in comparison.","It couldn’t be compared at all. It actually filled an entire interdimensional","space.."]},{"number":2266,"title":"Chapter 2266: A Great Harvest","paragraphs":["Chapter 2266: A Great Harvest","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Only the heavens knew how many books were inside. Many of them were rare treasures that were rarely seen in the outside world. There were even some that had been lost in the outside world.","Seeing so many legacy classics, everyone’s eyes lit up. Even those Supreme Youths and top geniuses who had their eyes on the top of their heads felt their eyes light up.","This was a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity, especially for many Supreme Youths with ancient inheritances. Their inheritances had long been destroyed in the long river of time.","If it wasn’t for this opportunity, they wouldn’t have had such a good chance to read these classics.","There was no need to say anything. In a moment, all the Supreme Youths present disappeared without a trace.","In a flash, Chu Yunfan appeared in front of a bookshelf. To avoid conflict, the young geniuses and the Supreme Youths tacitly separated into different places.","There wasn’t much time, only a month. However, with the cultivation of the Supreme Youths, a month’s time was enough for them to see everything they wanted to see.","Chu Yunfan soon realized that the books on the bookshelf were all personal notes on cultivation and comprehension of the Domain Stage. There were no books on cultivation realms that were one level higher or one level lower.","This meant that these books should have been tidied up. Or rather, it was very likely that there were many books in this library, with books of different levels.","In this way, every time someone needed to read something here, he only needed to let them enter a different section of the library.","However, Chu Yunfan was shocked by the imperial familys collection of books.","The number of books a faction had reflected how powerful the faction was to a large extent.","If it was as Chu Yunfan had guessed, then the hidden strength of the Grand Xia imperial family was at an extremely shocking level.","However, Chu Yunfan thought about it and agreed. It had been many years since the founding of Grand Xia.","It was unknown how much wealth they had accumulated. Every year, a fixed portion of the world’s income would be filled into the this library, and these resources would also be transformed into the foundation of the imperial family.","No wonder there had always been rumors that the princes and princesses of the imperial family had many existences that could stand shoulder to shoulder with the geniuses on the prodigy list.","Every generation had many princes and princesses with such strength. After all these years of accumulation, they had reached an astonishing speed. It was simply unimaginable.","It was probably only with this kind of strength that they could suppress the current and ancient inheritances so that they would not cause trouble to the world.","Chu Yunfan took out a book from the bookshelf and started reading.","In an instant, countless information turned into a flood of information and fused into his mind.","After a long time, Chu Yunfan slowly opened his eyes. The author of this book was a Domainian from ancient times. He had written his entire life’s worth of insights into this book.","This was an extremely powerful Domainian. His comprehension of the Domain Stage had reached the peak.","Even though Chu Yunfan had the Alchemy Emperor’s memories and many records of the Domain Stage in the Mighty Emperor Battle Book as a foundation, he still felt that he had gained a lot.","“As expected, stones from other mountains can be used to polish jade. It’s not good to build a car behind closed doors!”","Chu Yunfan finally understood why a the Domainian’s books were in this library.","The reason was simple. This book collection had collected many Domainians’ manuals and notes that had been accumulated over countless years.","Other than the primordial era, everything was in a primitive state. Civilizations had not yet fully developed. After the ancient times, it was the competition between civilizations.","In the ancient era, countless Domainians were born. After that, there was the Middle Ages, the Modern Age, and then the current era.","Nobody knew how many years had passed since then and how many Domainians had been born. Niost of these experts might have died, but the manuals they left behind could still be preserved.","Even after experiencing the flames of war, there would still be a considerable portion left behind.","Just thinking about this made Chu Yunfan feel a sense of horror.","Chu Yunfan felt that he had gained a lot just by reading one book.","Chu Yunfan immediately flipped to the second book without any hesitation. Just like before, countless information currents surged into Chu Yunfan’s mind. In Chu Yunfan’s mind, a figure formed and was preaching to Chu Yunfan.","Yes, this figure was not preaching spells, but a deeper level of the Great Dao, something that belonged to the origin of the Great Dao.","When these Domainians recorded down the information, they didn’t just write it down. Instead, they infused their essence, energy, and spirit into the text.","When others saw these words, they would be able to instantly understand the essence.","This was why Chu Yunfan could instantly understand the characters of different eras even though he didn’t understand them.","The words were just a medium. What was truly important was the original intention.","After a long time, the figure finished explaining the contents of the book and disappeared.","Chu Yunfan opened his eyes after a while, feeling that he had gained a lot.","Just now, he had used the godhead. With the help of the godhead, the originally boring text had all been transformed into vivid preaching. In a short time, Chu Yunfan memorized all of it and was able to infer other things from one instance.","As Chu Yunfan read more and more books, many things that he didn’t understand about the Domain Stage were suddenly made known to him.","Chu Yunfan now understood many of the problems that could only be discovered after practice.","Moreover, with the help of the godhead, it was completely imprinted into his brain, and it was exactly the same as what he had comprehended.","This was the ability of intelligent creatures. It was like there was a big pit in front of you. You didn’t need to step on it to know that you couldn’t step in.","Before you stepped in it, you knew that you couldn’t step in it when you saw it.","This was a basic deduction ability.","Furthermore, those who could cultivate to the Domain Stage were all geniuses. Even if they didn’t have a king physique, their intelligence wasn’t something that could be limited by their physique.","Often, many of these ideas and methods made Chu Yunfan feel as if his horizons had been broadened.."]},{"number":2267,"title":"Chapter 2267: Is Chu Yunfan Crazy?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2267: Is Chu Yunfan Crazy?","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These geniuses had many different ways of constructing domains. Almost every one of them was completely different. It could be said that there were countless changes.","The more Chu Yunfan looked, the more he understood that the nature of the Great Dao involved in different fields was different.","The value of these things was not inferior to the treasured books of cultivation, and they were even more important.","As for the many young prodigies and Supreme Youths, they did not lack the treasured books they cultivated. What they lacked was these handwritten notes that could greatly expand their horizons.","From a higher level, he would guide them on how to cultivate and how to construct their own domain.","If it wasn’t for the fact that the Grand Xia imperial family had spent countless years collecting all of these books, no power would have been able to collect so many handwritten notes and scriptures.","If these handwritten letters were placed in the Flying Celestials, they would be absolute secrets and classics. Even in the Flying Celestials, 99% of the people would not be able to see any of them in their lifetime.","Not only did one have to be strong enough, but one also had to make many contributions to the Flying Celestials before they were allowed to enter and explore.","Many sects and forces had long been destroyed in the long river of time, but their classics and many cultivation methods had been left behind.","It became the key to the survival of the entire human civilization.","It could be said that after today, he would probably not have the chance to see so many classics and handwritten notes in the future.","Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate to open one book after another. After a while, he put down the book as if he had comprehended many of the experiences taught in it.","Then, he moved on to the next book. In just a short time, Chu Yunfan had read several books and classics on the bookshelf.","This unusual movement naturally alarmed the other Supreme Youths.","“This Chu Yunfan must be crazy. He can’t possibly be planning to finish reading so many classics and handwritten notes in a month’s time, right?” Many geniuses found this unbelievable.","These handwritten notes and classics seemed to exist in the form of books,","but in reality, the books were just a carrier. What was really important was the spiritual will of the author recorded in the books.","With their cultivation, having a photographic memory was a piece of cake. If they wanted to, they could even recall the scene when they were just born.","However, these books were not written in pure words. If they were written in pure words, they could have finished reading all of them in a month.","In fact, they could easily do it in ten days or even less.","Although there were many books in the library, that was only for ordinary people. The brains of these prodigies were like supercomputers. They had countless thoughts and calculations every second.","However, it was precisely because of this difference that they could not just finish reading it in a hurry. They had to think of a way to comprehend the spiritual will contained in it.","Just digesting the cultivation experience and laws of the Domain Stage recorded in one book would take at least a day before it could be completely memorized.","This was already very impressive because this was a cultivation manual left behind by a certain senior. There were many valuable experiences in it that could save them countless years of detours.","But even so, they only dared to look for manuals and classics that were similar or identical to their own laws.","Those who cultivated fire laws could only look for books that also recorded fire laws at the Domain Stage.","It was the same for the divine arts and laws of the other elements. Although they could not see through the contents of the books with their naked eyes, these books were engraved with the author’s will. Over time, they would appear with different luster.","The books that recorded the cultivation of fire laws and the structure of domains would also have a faint layer of flame on the surface, allowing them to easily discover it.","Chu Yunfan made no distinguishes though. He casually flipped through it and put it down after a while.","It looked very good. After all, he could see everything and broaden his horizons. In reality, it was just an ant trying to shake a tree.","It would take them a day just to comprehend the Great Dao recorded in any of the books, and this was even if these books had the imprint of the author themself. Otherwise, if it were just words, it would take at least a few months to a year to finish reading and understand them.","To bite off more than you can chew, these words seemed meaningless to Chu Yunfan though. It wasn’t necessarily a good thing to have so many different laws and domains. On the contrary, the more laws there were, the messier it would be. The difficulty of constructing a domain that contained so many laws and divine arts would increase exponentially. It was even possible that one would be guided by different laws for the rest of their lives, unable to break through.","This was very possible. Since ancient times, there had been countless people who claimed to be geniuses.","“He’s crazy. There are so many manuals and classics, but he only took a few glances. He’s clearly reading without any understanding. How can he cultivate a domain in that way?” someone asked in confusion.","“Perhaps he i s too ambitious and wants to have both the laws and techniques of the world. But he probably forgot how difficult it is to do so. Even the ancient emperors couldn’t do it!” A fat Supreme Youth sneered. “But he probably doesn’t understand. As the saying goes, a bird in the hand is better than a hundred birds in the forest. He has learned so much, but in the end, he can’t apply all of it. In addition, different laws conflict with each other. When the time comes, it will be a huge joke if he wants to construct a domain!”","Very soon, Gongsun Hong from the Destiny Sect received the news of Chu Yunfan’s method. He snorted coldly. “It’s great that he’s courting death like this. It’s probably because he’s invincible among the Supreme Youths that his heart has swelled and gone crazy. Even the most powerful genius from ancient times would not be able to read like him. It’s no different from not reading. No, he might as well not have studied!","“Without studying, he would at least be a blank piece of paper and could draw at will. But now that he has read so many classics and handwritten notes, it will cause conflicts between his different Daos. When that happens, he will be possessed by Qi deviation, and he will be dead for sure!” Gongsun Hong smile sniesterly. “l only dare to read the classics and notes that are similar to my cultivation path as a reference. I don’t even dare to look at the laws and divine arts of other types of cultivation for fear of affecting my heart. But he has read them all. That’s good.. Even if we don’t kill him, he won’t have any chance of improving!"]},{"number":2268,"title":"Chapter 2268: Battle Strength Soars in One Month","paragraphs":["Chapter 2268: Battle Strength Soars in One Month","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s actions caused quite a stir. Many people even thought that Chu Yunfan must have gone crazy, possessed, to read so many classics and handwritten notes.","Moreover, he was just casually looking flipping through them. Although these classics used words as a carrier, they were essentially projections of divine will.","With their talent and strength, it would take them more than a day to digest one book. In fact, they could not read many books in 30 days.","Chu Yunfan looked like he had seen a lot, but in their eyes, he was simply courting death.","The Great Dao was too vast. With their current cultivation and strength, it was impossible for them to explore everything. They did not have that much time either.","Didn’t they cultivate so hard to fight for time and live forever?","The only way to reach the peak was to walk down a path to death and to the end. On the contrary, people like Chu Yunfan would bite off more than they could chew.","However, after watching for a while, they lost interest. Chu Yunfan’s actions were exactly what they wanted.","They immediately seized the time and started reading.","Chu Yunfan didn’t care about everyone’s gazes. He just kept flipping through all kinds of books like before.","After a while, he would put down a book after having read through it. There were all kinds of methods and theories, and there were even many contradictory methods that broadened Chu Yunfan’s horizons.","He was shocked by the methods of the seniors who vwff0te these books. Many of their ideas were considered geniuses, and Chu Yunfan felt that his horizons had been broadened.","Many of their understandings of the Great Dao were different.","After all, even with the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao was more limited to a certain aspect. Even the Emperors weren’t omniscient.","Under such circumstances, Chu Yunfan gained a lot of knowledge that he could not obtain before. He simply could not stop. In the blink of an eye, a month had passed.","Ding!","A leisurely voice rang out, and everyone’s profound mind was shaken as they recovered from their reading.","Everyone’s faces revealed somewhat reluctant expressions. In this short month’s time, they did not read many books. Even the top prodigies had only read about 30 classics. The Supreme Youth had read 50 to 60 classics that were similar to the Great Dao they cultivated.","However, even if it was only to this extent, it was still an unimaginable","harvest for them.","It could be said that just the harvest of this month was enough to save them decades of groping.","They were all standing on the shoulders of giants!","Chu Yunfan put down the book in his hand.","He couldn’t help but feel a little emotional. In this short month, he had read more than half of the books in this library.","It could be said that his gains were huge. The combined gains of those","Supreme Youths and top-notch geniuses were not as great as his alone.","Chu Yunfan had gained a lot from the insights and methods of constructing his domain from the countless predecessors.","This saved him a lot of time. At the same time, after the integration of the godhead, Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the Great Dao had reached a higher level.","It was the same for his understanding of laws!","This caused his combat strength to undergo an earth- shattering transformation. Even though he had yet to attain the Domain Stage, his combat strength had increased by 50% from his original foundation.","This was not an increase in his cultivation or power. It was because his comprehension of the Great Dao had deepened that his combat strength had continuously soared.","He was enlightened about many things that he didn’t understand before. Many divine arts that he couldn’t unleash their full power before, he could now unleash their full power, or even stronger and better.","Although it was only a 50% increase in strength, if he were to face his original self, under the situation where his strength was about the same, he could easily defeat his original self.","Not to mention those other Supreme Youths and top-notch geniuses.","Although they had gained something, they were still far from Chu Yunfan.","They were on completely different levels.","The others probably didn’t expect that after a month, the gap between them and Chu Yunfan’s strength didn’t shrink. Instead, it widened.","If Chu Yunfan were to face Domainians, he was confident that he could protect himself. He was not afraid of the backlash from these people.","Ding, ding, ding!","The bell rang melodiously. Regardless of whether they were willing or unwilling, everyone stepped on the light and left the imperial family library.","Soon, when they came out, they were led by different attendants to the direction of the teleportation portal.","The ancient battlefield was located deep within the starry skies, not even in the Central Plains. Only teleportation portals could reach it.","For a moment, everyone gathered in the hall where the teleportation portal was located.","Many geniuses and Supreme Youths who had good relationships began to discuss their gains.","“The imperial family is the imperial family after all. Even the Flying Celestials is far from being able to match up to them!” Huangfu Longhao said emotionally, “I’ve gained a lot. My strength has increased by at least 50%. If I were to enter the ring again and was surrounded by seven people, I would be able to remain undefeated!”","Huangfu Longhao’s words were filled with confidence. This month had been very important to him.","Many of his doubts and incomprehensions about the Great Dao were answered in these scriptures.","Moreover, there were all kinds of answers. He even had the blissful trouble of not knowing how to choose because there were too many answers.","Although a month’s time was not enough for his cultivation to increase, it was just an eye-opener. After gaining more knowledge, his combat strength would undergo a world- shaking change.","If he were to go to the same ring and face his original opponents, even if he could not defeat them, he could still contend against them.","After all, a 50% increase in combat power wasn’t as simple as increasing half a person’s combat power.","The difference between them was simply a geometric multiple.","“Me too. I’ve gained so much. Now that I’ve completely absorbed the energy that senior gave me, 1 can definitely break through to the Domain Stage!” Chu","Hongcai said impatiently.","This time, he had also gained a lot.","Everyone else was also talking at the same time. Basically, all of these top-notch geniuses of the Flying Celestials had obtained huge benefits without exception, and their combat strength had undergone earth- shattering changes.","The feathers on the body of the golden roc were even more dazzling now. It looked as if it was made of gold.."]},{"number":2269,"title":"Chapter 2269: An Ominous Battlefield","paragraphs":["Chapter 2269: An Ominous Battlefield","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","It was obvious that the golden roc had gained a lot in this month. If it was a divine martial art, it would not be suitable for this golden roc. After all, the martial arts and divine arts invented by humans were tailor-made for humans.","Demons could not cultivate directly, but fortunately, these books and handwritten notes were all about the comprehension and understanding of the Great Dao.","When it came to the comprehension of the Great Dao, there was no longer any distinction between races. Different paths led to the same destination.","Humans and demons only had different starting points. The final result was the same.","“Junior Chu, you’ve become stronger again. I feel that you’ve become even more unfathomable!” Huangfu Longhao said in shock.","Chu Yunfan smiled and didn’t say anything. His improvement in the past month was probably several times stronger than Huangfu Longhao’s.","The two of them weren’t on the same level, but he didn’t say anything. Suddenly, a streak of light arrived. A figure in a fiery red dress stepped on the streak of light and arrived in front of everyone. It was Tang Siyu.","She was the only disciple of the Serene Immortal Mountain. After all, the foundation of the Serene Immortal Mountain was too weak. Even if the Elder Princess’s strength was unparalleled, it had only been established not long ago.","Tang Siyu was the only disciple that could be proud of.","Tang Siyu came to Chu Yunfan’s side. The two of them communicated with each other through their divine wills. When Tang Siyu learned that Chu Yunfan had gained so much, she could not help but be slightly shocked.","Chu Yunfan’s progress during this period was earth-shattering and shocking.","At this rate, he would be able to reach the Domain Stage in no time. Once he reached the Domain Stage, he would definitely be one of the best among Domainians.","It would be impossible for those people to plot against Chu Yunfan!","She heaved a sigh of relief. She no longer had to worry about Chu Yunfan.","However, when Chu Yunfan imparted some of his insights to Tang Siyu, even if it was only a short exchange, it still made Tang Siyu feel enlightened.","However, what made her feel strange was that Chu Yunfan seemed to be able to see through the problems she encountered in her cultivation. Even if she did not mention it, he could easily cure her with a single sentence.","“How did you know that I would encounter these problems? I don’t think I’ve mentioned it to you!” Tang Siyu asked in surprise.","“Don’t underestimate me. It’s easy for me to see through your problems!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","With the memory of the Alchemy Emperor and the help of the godhead, Chu Yunfan could easily understand Tang Siyu’s problem and crux.","Although Tang Siyu was surprised, since it was Chu Yunfan, she had nothing to say.","“Be careful. Some people might have their eyes on you. You must be careful when you enter the ancient battlefield!” Tang Siyu said, “l heard that the teleportation portal this time will randomly teleport people into the ancient battlefield. There’s no way to accurately locate where you will go, so everyone’s location is different!","“You have to be careful. You’re a thorn in their side. They definitely won’t let you off easily!” Tang Siyu said worriedly, “Although their strength might not be worth mentioning to you, they might invite their true foundation and methods to deal with you! After all, this isn’t the ring. They have restrained themselves and don’t dare to go overboard!”","Chu Yunfan thought for a moment and smiled. “Don’t worry. If they dare to provoke me, I’ll let them know that blood runs red. Hmph!’ Chu Yunfan had already thought of this, but he didn’t care.","They were just a bunch of rats!","All of a sudden, the teleportation portals opened one by one. Everyone queued up to enter the teleportation portals.","Every time a teleportation portal flashed, it could teleport dozens of people out of this hall. Chu Yunfan was slightly surprised. However, these teleportation portals were too small to be used on a large scale. Moreover, there was a certain degree of randomness. If they were used to teleport an army, they might have been teleported all over the world halfway and completely scattered.","Soon, it was Chu Yunfan’s turn.","When Chu Yunfan stepped into the teleportation portal, his vision blurred and he appeared in a completely unfamiliar world.","The spatial power of the teleportation portal dissipated on his body. His body swayed slightly and he soon stabilized his footing.","On his shoulder, the golden roc had teleported over with him.","As expected, Huangfu Longhao and the others were teleported to an unknown place.","At a glance, it was a blood-colored battlefield. It was as if even the sky was drowned by the color of blood. The blood-colored darkness looked extremely","oppressive.","Outside the blood-colored land was chaos. It was this chaos that surrounded the entire land.","Beyond the primal chaos, there was nothing. It was the true void of the universe. There was nothing but stars.","This battlefield was in this star field. To avoid turning the entire world into rubble, many experts in the antiquity era chose this battlefield.","Countless years had passed. In the void of the universe, which originally had nothing, under the joint effect of many laws, a blood-colored continent had strangely formed.","As soon as he arrived, Chu Yunfan could already feel a sense of oppression pressing down on him. He could even feel the resentment in the air.","Countless experts had fallen on this battlefield. They were all outstanding cultivators. There was no need to mention the resentment they felt when they died here. It was even more shocking than the resentment on the Prodigy Battlefield.","In addition, countless experts from the future had come to this ancient battlefield in search of shortcuts and methods to construct domains.","This caused the battlefield to be constantly in the flames of war. It had never been truly peaceful.","The terrifying resentment contained in it was shocking.","Suddenly, just as Chu Yunfan was lamenting about the strange and ominous nature of this land, a dense fog spread from all directions.","Miserable howls could be heard from within the fog.","Before he could see what had happened, countless blood-colored figures suddenly shuttled out of the mist. They were like thousands of sharp swords that were aimed at Chu Yunfan’s face.","It was as if they wanted to instantly kill Chu Yunfan.","Bam, bam, bam!","These blood-red figures were unable to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense and were blocked by Chu Yunfan’s protective energy shield.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally saw what those countless blood-red figures were!"]},{"number":2270,"title":"Chapter 2270: Innate Lifeforms","paragraphs":["Chapter 2270: Innate Lifeforms","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation| Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Those countless blood-colored figures were countless blood-colored fish.","These fish were completely blood-red in color and looked like sharp swords.","These blood-red swords swept over, tearing people apart!","Chu Yunfan discovered that wherever these blood fish passed, the sky was torn into pieces.","The space here wasn’t as stable as the space in the Central Plains. In the Central Plains, even Domainians could only cause the space to tremble. It was impossible for them to shatter the space.","But here, just a few blood fish could cut open space.","In other words, the world here was incomparably fragile, at least much more fragile than the Central Plains.","“l understand now why I’m looking for a way to construct a domain here!” Chu Yunfan!s eyes lit up.","Because this world was too fragile, many laws were not fixed. Therefore, relatively speaking, he could see the operation of many laws more clearly.","In essence, constructing a domain was constructing a small world. Wasn’t the most difficult part the construction of laws?","Thus, learning how to construct laws in this environment was a hundred times easier than in the Central Plains.","Although it was somewhat opportunistic, as long as the law could be constructed in the end, it would be good.","These young prodigies and Supreme Youths were more talented than the previous ones. Their understanding of all kinds of theories and knowledge far exceeded the imagination of ordinary people. They were even more powerful than ordinary Domainians.","What they lacked was real practice.","“Hmph, this is a great opportunity for me. It can save me a lot of time!” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. What he lacked the most right now was time. He wanted to raise his cultivation to the Domain Stage as soon as possible. By then, he would truly have the ability to protect himself.","No matter what kind of chaotic times or prosperous times it was, he was able to protect himself and feared no existence.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan waved and caught these blood fish and exploded them. These blood fish looked sharp, but in fact, there was nothing difficult to deal with. As long as one was careful, they were not difficult to deal with.","However, when Chu Yunfan caught these blood fish and exploded them, he discovered that there was a faint manifestation of the blood law in the bodies of these blood fish.","“They’re law creatures?” Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder.","The so-called law creatures referred to creatures that were born by the laws of Heaven and Earth. They were a little like creatures from the primordial era before the antiquity era.","The antiquity era was the beginning of the cultivation era. Since the antiquity era, cultivation methods had become extremely popular, truly establishing the fundamental Great Dao of this world and era.","However, before the antiquity era, it was the immemorial era. In the immemorial era, the ones who dominated the world were not cultivators or warriors, but some extremely powerful creatures.","For example, the Ten Ferocities were the best of the best. Each creature could be said to have seized the fortune of heaven and earth. This was not an exaggerated metaphor, but an objective description.","These creatures had a certain degree of laws circulating in their bloodlines. They were born with many divine powers, and these divine powers had risen to the level of the Great Dao.","This was especially true for the Ten Ferocities. Each of them was a powerful creature born from the laws of the world. As long as they continuously refined the laws in their bodies, they could easily cultivate to a terrifying level that later generations could not imagine.","It had nothing to do with innate talent or physique because there were laws in their bodies. The laws influenced these ferocious beasts day and night, allowing these ferocious beasts to naturally possess powerful strength.","These creatures were known as Innate Lifeforms in ancient times.","On the other hand, the Acquired Lifeforms that began to appear in the antiquity era were the descendants of the immemorial Innate Lifeforms. It was just that their bloodlines had slowly deteriorated and no longer contained laws, or the number of laws was very small and not enough for them to increase their strength just by comprehending laws.","And the cultivation system created on this foundation perfectly made up for this deficiency. Even Acquired Lifeforms who did not have any innate laws could cultivate and gradually become powerful existences that could be compared to Innate Lifeforms.","The most prosperous era was naturally the antiquity era, which was the Ancient Zenith Age confirmed by archaeology of the Federation.","In that era, emperors were everywhere. Domainians were as numerous as ants. There had been more than one emperor who had suppressed the world. This was something that was impossible in any era.","But in ancient times, this was a very normal thing!","This was because the antiquity era was a special era. It was an era where Innate Lifeforms and Acquired Lifeforms intersected. There were both Innate Lifeforms and Acquired Lifeforms.","Not all living beings had completely transformed into Acquired Lifeforms. There were still some living beings that were still Innate Lifeforms then.","Innate Lifeforms had laws within their bodies, and they could gain insights into the laws to cultivate. In addition, they had cultivated in the cultivation system of the antiquity era, so they had both.","Therefore, the living beings of the antiquity era were incomparably powerful, and there were many experts. They were not inferior to the innate powerful living beings of the immemorial era, and they were even stronger.","In fact, in the current world, those king and emperor physique possessors were simply atavism in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","The power of laws in their bloodlines that had gradually disappeared suddenly mutated in a certain generation, producing a phenomenon of atavism. The power of laws re-materialized in their bodies.","There were high and low law energies, strong and weak, which was why there was a difference between king and emperor physiques.","In a sense, many divine physique possessors in the world were indeed no longer Acquired Lifeforms. They belonged to the ranks of Innate Lifeforms, but their bloodlines were not as rich.","However, Chu Yunfan was different. His emperor physique was acquired through cultivation. He could be considered an Innate Lifeform now, not an Acquired Lifeform.","This was limited to these prodigies and Supreme Youths. In the countless years of history of the Central Plains, there were only a few people whose genes had mutated to give birth to the bodies of Kings and Emperors.","But these blood fish were similar lifeforms. How could Chu Yunfan not be shocked?","However, the laws in these blood fish were only a trace. They were far inferior to even prodigies who had condensed just one law.","However, although the degree of strength was completely different, in essence, these blood fish were the same as top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths like them.."]},{"number":2271,"title":"Chapter 2271: Finally Finding Something After Three Days","paragraphs":["Chapter 2271: Finally Finding Something After Three Days","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","These bloodfish were Innate Lifeforms as well!","However, Chu Yunfan soon understood why this was the case. It was precisely because this ancient battlefield was a world formed by the aftershocks of countless battles between experts and the laws of fate.","Because the world was extremely unstable, it was always on the verge of collapse.","The laws here were not like the stable heaven and earth, which were hidden between heaven and earth. Instead, they were revealed to a certain extent.","This environment was just like the era when the world was first created in the immemorial era. Many living beings in the immemorial era were born in this way, and many of them were even manifested by laws.","It was the embodiment of laws. It was not a fleshly life, but a pure life of laws.","They were pure Innate Demongods, but the Innate Lifeforms that came later were no longer like that. Instead, they began to produce flesh and blood, half-nomological, half-flesh, and blood lifeforms.","These blood fish, top-notch geniuses, and Supreme Youths were all this type of life form.","“In other words, this is a new world. Although it is a little small, broken, and unstable, it is still a new world!” Chu Yunfan clicked his tongue in wonder.","To be able to catch up with the beginning of a world, what kind of good scene was that? Even a pig could become a terrifying creature in this era, possessing unimaginable power.","Thinking of this, Chu Yunfan’s mood immediately improved.","The golden roc on Chu Yunfan’s shoulder flew out and transformed into a huge bird. His wings were more than ten meters long, and Chu Yunfan jumped onto it.","The golden roc immediately let out a cry and flapped his wings. In an instant, he turned into a golden light and left his original spot. In the next moment, he had already appeared hundreds of miles away.","Chu Yunfan noticed that the tip of the roes wings had torn a hole in the sky as if a piece of paper had been torn open.","“Let me try too!”","Chu Yunfan immediately punched out. The terrifying fist force surged into the space. The originally calm space began to tremble violently like boiling water. In the next moment, it cracked inch by inch in front of Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","“As expected, the space here is too fragile!” Chu Yunfan said.","He could see that on the other side of the space, it was chaos and not the endless void.","It was obvious that his punch had pierced through space.","The power of this punch could be seen from this.","“Although this environment is harsh, it is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity for cultivators like us. Unfortunately, this place is too far from the Central Plains. Even for an existence like me, it’s impossible to fly here!” Chu Yunfan sighed.","He knew how many dangers were hidden in the starry sky of the universe. He did not know how many terrifying ferocious beasts lived in this cold and dark universe. There were even the mortal enemies of all living beings in the universe, the astral demons.","That was the origin of the demonic path in the Central Plains. Countless years ago, the astral demons had sent down many experts and spread the demonic path into the Central Plains, causing many people to switch to the demonic path and become a hidden danger for many factions in the world.","It would take at least a year to fly, and they would have to pass through the territories of many terrifying creatures.","Even though Chu Yunfan was at the peak of the Divine Treasure Stage, if he flew over, he would still be dead. Even Domainians would be in great danger, and the probability of death was more than 80%.","Only emperors above the Domain Stage could cross the void and ignore these dangers.","Moreover, it was said that the surroundings of the ancient battlefield had long become a land of peril. Endless dangers surrounded the ancient battlefield, making it one of the few dangerous places in the universe.","Without the teleportation portal, Chu Yunfan would not have been able to come here.","“I’m afraid this is the only chance I have to come to this ancient battlefield in the short term. This is a once-in-a-lifetime opportunity!” Chu Yunfan said.","Chu Yunfan rode on the golden roc and wandered around the battlefield. In three days, Chu Yunfan did not see a single person.","During these three days, Chu Yunfan kept approaching the center of the battlefield. Along the way, other than the naturally formed dangerous places, there were many half-law and half-flesh creatures like the blood fishes that Chu Yunfan encountered at the beginning.","The closer Chu Yunfan and the golden roc got to the center of the ancient battlefield, the stronger these Innate Lifeforms became. There were even some who were equivalent to Divine Treasure Innate Lifeforms.","However, this wasn’t a problem for Chu Yunfan!","In a chaotic mountain range, Chu Yunfan and the golden roc were in a valley.","A pile of white bones fell into the valley. There were even some energy fluctuations on the white bones.","‘l don’t know if this battlefield has been around for hundreds of thousands of years, but this pile of white bones has not been eroded yet. Moreover, there is such a strong fluctuation of spirit energy!’ Chu Yunfan thought, ‘I’m afraid this pile of bones was from an extremely powerful expert when the person was alive. They should at least be a Domainian!”","Chu Yunfan deduced the strength of the owner of this pile of bones. It couldn’t be a King because Chu Yunfan knew that if the owner of this pile of bones was a King, then his bones should be golden as if they were cast from gold.","The laws of that kind of expert had seeped into their bones and began to transform themselves. They became more and more detached and extraordinary.","However, what surprised Chu Yunfan was that he found a domain around the pile of bones, although it was a broken domain.","This was still a huge surprise for Chu Yunfan, who had gained nothing in the past three days.","In these three days, he could not say that he had gained nothing. Just comprehending the faintly discernible laws had benefited Chu Yunfan greatly.","However, this improvement was not enough for Chu Yunfan. What he really needed was those domains. With those domains as a foundation, Chu Yunfan could break through to the Domain Stage in the shortest time possible.","“That was an easy find!” Chu Yunfan laughed. “The heavens are really helping me!”","However, just as Chu Yunfan was about to put the tangible domain into his spatial bag, a loud shout came from afar.","“Stop!’"]},{"number":2272,"title":"Chapter 2272: The Ancient Battlefield’s Forces","paragraphs":["Chapter 2272: The Ancient Battlefield’s Forces","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With a loud shout, a figure came from afar.","Chu Yunfan focused his eyes and saw that it was a huge black wolf. This black wolf’s entire body was black, like ink. Its body was huge, like a small mountain, and it looked extremely terrifying.","“A demon prodigy?” Chu Yunfan glanced at the black wolf. Not all demon experts liked to take human form.","Many demon experts liked to maintain their original appearance.","This black wolf was obviously one of them.","The black wolf stared at Chu Yunfan, and an extremely dangerous aura emanated from its body.","“That’s not right. You’re not a prodigy. You have an ordinary bloodline. It’s not easy for you to cultivate to this stage!” Chu Yunfan commented as he crossed his arms.","Chu Yunfan could tell at a glance that although this black wolf was in the Divine Treasure Stage, it was obviously not a prodigy, let alone a top-notch prodigy or a Supreme Youth.","Soon, Chu Yunfan remembered what Situ Xuan had mentioned before. Although this ancient battlefield was in the distant void, there had always been experts in the Divine Treasure Stage active in this battlefield.","To the Supreme Youths and top prodigies, breaking through to the Domain Stage was only a matter of time. Therefore, they did not necessarily have to come to this ancient battlefield.","However, for ordinary Divine Treasures, the difficulty of each step they took after reaching this stage of cultivation might be more difficult than all the problems they had encountered in their previous cultivation combined.","Ninety-nine percent of Divine Treasures could never reach the Domain Stage. Many of these experts had long left the Central Plains and entered the ancient battlefield.","It was to search for domains left behind by Domainians to increase their chances of reaching the Domain Stage.","And this black wolf should be one of them.","“How dare you, human!” the black wolf roared, and the terrifying tide it formed blew at Chu Yunfan.","This roar contained the wind laws.","If it was an ordinary Divine Treasure, they would probably feel a headache facing this black wolf that was as big as a small mountain.","But Chu Yunfan was different. He didn’t move. This gust of wind didn’t affect him at all.","“You dare to be impudent in front of me with your insignificant skills!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Immediately, the big black wolf felt an unprecedented sense of danger. He felt a chill on his back. His intuition told him that the human in front of him was extremely terrifying.","‘l have to run!’ the wolf thought.","The big black wolf ran extremely fast. It turned into a black light and was about to escape. Chu Yunfan sneered and turned into a huge hand that grabbed at the big black wolf.","“Rrraaagh!’","The big black wolf screamed and was caught by Chu Yunfan, almost killed by him.","Although this big black wolf didn’t have a king or emperor bloodline, to be able to cultivate to this level, it was an ancestor level expert in the demon region. Who knew how many fortuitous encounters it had to cultivate to this level.","But unfortunately, it couldn’t withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan.","“Great lord, please spare my life!”","Facing such a powerful Chu Yunfan, the big black wolf decisively admitted defeat.","He had already confirmed that he was no match for Chu Yunfan.","At this moment, his mind had already begun to clear up. He suddenly remembered something, and it was about a rumor that had been circulating recently.","A batch of top-notch young experts would soon enter the ancient battlefield. There were experts from all races, and the weakest among them were top-notch prodigies. All of them were unfathomable.","However, he did not take this matter to heart at first. The ancient battlefield was so huge, but there were only a few prodigies. In the past era, the number of top-notch prodigies could be counted on two hands.","The probability of encountering them was too small.","Who knew that he would encounter one? At this moment, if he did not understand that he had encountered a top-notch human prodigy, he would really be a fool.","However, he never expected that the person he encountered was not a top-notch human prodigy, but a Supreme Youth who was even more terrifying than a top-notch prodigy.","“It’s not difficult to spare your life, but you have to answer my questions,” Chu Yunfan said indifferently.","This big black wolf had just revealed its ferocity. Its body was filled with a ferocious aura that could even affect the minds of millions of people in a city. It could be said to be monstrous.","It was clear that it had killed countless living beings before it could form such a terrifying and brutal aura.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t really care. This kind of black wolf didn’t deserve his attention.","“Go ahead, sir. I will tell you everything I know!” the big black wolf said hurriedly.","Chu Yunfan let go of the big black wolf, but the big black wolf obediently prostrated in front of Chu Yunfan, not even daring to move.","“I’m new here, so I don’t understand the situation in the ancient battlefield","yet. I think you should know. Tell me about it!” Chu Yunfan said.","The big black wolf let out a sigh of relief. It didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to only ask him for some information.","The wolf told Chu Yunfan everything he knew. He didn’t dare to lie. He didn’t dare to play any tricks at this moment.","In the face of absolute strength, no matter what tricks he played, it would be useless. Once Chu Yunfan saw it, he would lose his life and die.","After the big black wolf’s explanation, Chu Yunfan learned that the ancient battlefield had developed over countless years and was slowly turning into a world.","Gradually, it had already taken on the appearance that a world should have!","It was no longer as chaotic as when the ancient battlefield had first formed. In fact, because there were many experts who had come to the ancient battlefield, various factions had even formed.","At the core of the entire ancient battlefield was an incomparably huge ruined city. It was the core region of the entire ancient battlefield. Back then, the most tragic battle had erupted there. The strongest experts had all died there, and a world within a world had even formed in the ancient battlefield.","For countless years, countless experts would head to the core area of the ancient battlefield.","Slowly, cities began to form in the core area of the ancient battlefield.","Of course, even though the city was huge, there were not many people. This was because those who could reach the ancient battlefield and survive here were at least in the Divine Treasure Stage.","If one was too weak, there was no way they could survive in the ancient battlefield.","As time passed, different factions were slowly divided.."]},{"number":2273,"title":"Chapter 2273: Secluded Cultivation to Understand the Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 2273: Secluded Cultivation to Understand the Domain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“You’re saying that there’s actually a Domainian in the ancient battlefield?”","Chu Yunfan asked in confusion.","This was because he had learned something else from the big black wolf, which surprised him. In the ancient battlefield, there were not only experts in the Divine Treasure Stage, but there were also experts in the Domain Stage. “Yes, my lord!” the big black wolf said obediently. He was as obedient as he could be, afraid that Chu Yunfan would kill him with a slap if he was unhappy.","“Divine Treasures came here to seek a way to enter the Domain Stage, so why are Domainians here?” Chu Yunfan asked.","The big black wolf smiled bitterly. “We Divine Treasures need the domains of Domainians to comprehend our domains and step into the Domain Stage. However, those Domainians also need these domains to deepen their comprehension of the Domain Stage!’","The big black wolf looked at Chu Yunfan. Obviously, in its eyes, Chu Yunfan was like a man who didn’t know how hungry he was.","Chu Yunfan paused for a moment, then immediately understood why.","He had never considered this problem before.","It was only a matter of time for ordinary geniuses to cultivate to the peak of the Domain Stage. It was not a matter of whether they could or not. It was just a matter of when. Not to mention the Supreme Youths. The Domain Stage wasn’t their limit. Even the King Stage wasn’t their limit.","Hence, they naturally did not need to consider using such a method to deepen their understanding of the Domain Stage. Unless they were in a rush, they would rather strengthen their cultivation and comprehension bit by bit.","However, for ordinary Domainians, they were lucky enough to be able to reach the Domain Stage.","If they wanted to take another step forward and reach a higher level in the Domain Stage, it would be extremely difficult.","In fact, it would be difficult for them to make any progress in their entire life.","Hence, they had no choice but to think of ways to improve themselves. The fastest and most effective way was to devour the domain of a Domainian and increase their understanding of the Domain Stage.","This was a more effective method.","Due to this reason, many Domainians who felt that they had no hope of breaking through would come here to search for the domain of a Domainian so that they could comprehend the various mysteries within the domain.","As time passed, more and more Domainians gathered here. It became a gathering place for Domainians.","The cities in the ancient battlefield became the territory of these Domainians.","Divine Treasure was considered ordinary in the ancient battlefield. Other than Chu Yunfan, who was an extremely terrifying existence, Divine Treasures could only be considered lucky in the ancient battlefield. If one was lucky enough, they could obtain the domain of a Domainian. There was even a chance that they could comprehend a thing or two and step into the Domain Stage.","If one was unlucky, they would not be able to step into the Domain Stage.","Ultimately, this was because the path of cultivation was too difficult.","Chu Yunfan was naturally able to step into the Domain Stage, and even the King Stage or Emperor Stage were not his limits. He did not feel the difficulty of ordinary people’s cultivation.","“l see!” Chu Yunfan said, “However, it be very difficult to find the domains of these Domainians now!”","The big black wolf nodded its head. “Sir, I’ve been wandering around the ancient battlefield for more than a hundred years. This is the first time I’ve seen a Domain left behind by a Domainian. That’s why I was so anxious to get into a conflict with you. 1 didn’t do it on purpose!”","The big black wolf spoke with fear in its voice, afraid that Chu Yunfan would think it was too domineering and kill it.","The wolf was extremely depressed. It thought that it was extremely lucky to have discovered the domain left behind by a Domainian. Who knew that it would encounter an even more terrifying fiend?","It even suspected that if it had been a little slower in begging for mercy just now, it would have been caught and exploded by this human expert.","Was this the so-called top prodigy?","The big black wolf did not dare to show it on its face, but it kept wailing in its heart. Its luck was really too bad, and these top-notch geniuses were too terrifying.","In the past, there were too few of such top-notch prodigies. The wolf had not seen many of them at all, let alone seen them fight. Therefore, it did not know that these top-notch prodigies could be so powerful among those of the same level.","However, it was precisely because of this that the wolf did not know that Chu Yunfan was a first-class tyrannical and invincible existence even among Supreme Youths.","Chu Yunfan nodded. The ancient battlefield had been open for so many years. No matter how many Domainians had left behind their domains, they were all gradually plundered by others.","Even if there were some left, they were in some remote places. It was naturally not that easy to find a complete domain.","No wonder this big black wolf had been wandering around for hundreds of years without finding a single one.","“Mm, you didn’t lie. Very good. Otherwise, you would have died in my hands!”","Chu Yunfan said.","“l wouldn’t dare.” The big black wolf quickly expressed his loyalty.","As long as Chu Yunfan didn’t kill him, everything would be fine.","“You can leave now. I’ll keep my word and let you live!” Chu Yunfan said. To him, this big black wolf was no threat. Killing or releasing it was just a thought of Chu Yunfan.","“Really?” The big black wolf’s eyes widened. Even he didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to let him go so easily.","“What? Do you want me to kill you?” Chu Yunfan grinned coldly.","“No, no! Thank you, my lord. I’ll take my leave!”","After saying that, the big black wolf seemed to have been pardoned. It stepped on a beam of light and disappeared into the sky at a speed that it had never seen before.","“l want to go into seclusion to comprehend this domain!” Chu Yunfan said, “Help me guard the place. Report to me immediately if there’s any movement! ”","“Yes, sir!” The golden roc flew off of Chu Yunfan’s shoulder and flew into the sky. It began to patrol the area and protect Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan reached out and grabbed the domain that had already taken shape. Just as Chu Yunfan put the domain into the Mountain River Diagram, he realized that the domain was slowly dissipating.","Chu Yunfan quickly pulled the domain out of the Mountain River Diagram, and the domain stabilized again.."]},{"number":2274,"title":"Chapter 2274: The Mastermind Behind the Scenes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2274: The Mastermind Behind the Scenes","Translator: Endless?antasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Looks like I can’t bring this domain out of this ancient battlefield!”","Chu Yunfan thought to himself and soon understood. The fact that these domains could materialize in the ancient battlefield was probably related to some rules in the ancient battlefield. And once they left the ancient battlefield, those laws would no longer be effective on those domains, causing them to dissipate.","“This is a little troublesome!” Chu Yunfan frowned slightly.","With the golden roc guarding him, three to five Divine Treasures would not be able to get close. However, it was still not as safe as being in the Mountain River Diagram. Chu Yunfan had placed all his hopes on this domain. It was the key to breaking through to 1,000 laws. Who said that one had to break through to the Domain Stage to obtain 1,000 laws? Chu Yunfan refused to believe it.","Anyway, ever since he started cultivating, he had already broken countless common sense of cultivation. He had done more than once what many people thought was impossible.","At this moment, the more solid his foundation was, the more laws he cultivated. In the future, when he constructed his own domain, the more powerful it would be.","At the same time, at the core of the ancient battlefield, an incomparably huge city stood tall. On the majestic city walls, mottled bloodstains could vaguely be seen on the cruel scenes of the great war back then.","In a mansion in the city, Gongsun Hong, the Supreme Youth of the Destiny Sect, sat opposite a figure.","“Senior, we’ll have to rely your strength. The sect needs your strength, but the","Destiny Sect can’t be involved in this. Otherwise, the Flying Celestials’ retaliation will be a headache!” Gongsun Hong said.","In front of him was a handsome middle-aged man. He was dressed in a luxurious robe, and his body carried an imposing aura.","If outsiders saw this, they would be shocked. This person was a famous itinerant cultivator, Sanjue.","Sanjue had made a name for himself in the Central Plains, but he had always been a loner, and no one had been able to recruit him.","However, no one expected Sanjue to have a relationship with the Destiny Sect.","Others might not know, but Gongsun Hong knew. Before coming to the ancient battlefield, he had been advised by the sect master about the powers he could borrow in the ancient battlefield.","Sanjue was one of them.","A Domainian would be a formidable expert even in the Central Plains, let alone in the ancient battlefield. It could be said that he was a decisive force.","Sanjue was one of the forces that the Destiny Sect had secretly nurtured. He specialized in helping the Destiny Sect deal with things that were inconvenient to deal with or things that they couldn’t face directly.","Sanjue glanced at Gongsun Hong and was not surprised. He seemed to be a loner on the surface, so no one knew what kind of inheritance he had.","In reality, he knew that he was secretly sponsored by the Destiny Sect. Otherwise, he would only be an itinerant cultivator. Even if he had some inheritance, if he wanted to cultivate to the Domain Stage and become one of the top experts in the world, he could even be on equal footing with the sect masters of the ten great factions.","It was almost impossible!","If it was so easy to become a itinerant cultivator, there wouldn’t be so many people fighting to join the top ten forces. Only the sects of the top ten forces could possibly nurture experts of this level.","It was because of the support of the Destiny Sect that he could cultivate to this stage. As a price, he had to help the Destiny Sect deal with some inconvenient matters.","“Sure, but I need resources that can last me for a hundred years!” Sanjue nodded. “From what you’ve said, this Chu Yunfan should be very important to the Flying Celestials. Once he’s killed, I’m afraid the Flying Celestials won’t let this matter go so easily. I need to find a place to hide!”","Sanjue was calm. He had a clear understanding of his own strength and did not feel that he was invincible.","In terms of strength, he was only one of the Domainians. He was not invincible at all. However, from a certain perspective, he was on equal footing with the Flying Celestials’ sect leader, Situ Xuan.","However, everyone, including himself, knew that the difference between him and Situ Xuan was not only in strength, but also in status.","If he didn’t leave after doing this, even he couldn’t say what Situ Xuan would do when he was furious.","He didn’t believe any nonsense about Situ Xuan being the head of the Flying Celestials and needing to consider influence or such. Only those ordinary first-rate or second-rate powers would care about such influence. When it came to behemoths like the Flying Celestials, what was influence? They themselves are the real influence, capable of shaking the entire world with their terrifying influence alone.","“No problem. I can even give you 200 years worth of resources!” Gongsun Hong generously offered. “As long as we can get rid of Chu Yunfan, these cultivation resources are nothing!’","Even though there were plenty of resources that were enough for a Domainian to cultivate alone for 200 years, it was not easy for the Destiny Sect to take them out even with their foundation.","However, Gongsun Hong believed that as long as Sanjue could kill Chu Yunfan, this price was nothing.","He wanted to kill Chu Yunfan not because of the grudge between Chu Yunfan and the Destiny Sect. There were countless people and forces in the world who had enmity with the Destiny Sect, just like the number of sand in the world. It was impossible to count them.","However, what really made him feel threatened was Chu Yunfan’s astonishing strength. Chu Yunfan had easily killed Matchless Night and King of Fire.","Once that kind of strength grew, it would definitely become a life-and-death enemy between him and the Destiny Sect.","“You are straightforward, Gongsun Hong!” Sanjue revealed a happy expression.","The Destiny Sect wasn’t good at anything else, but this was the best part. They were generous and never hesitated.","“However, how do you plan to find him? From what 1 know, he has the protection of a supreme treasure, so even the Mysteries Pavilion can’t deduce his whereabouts. Just finding him will take a lot of time. We have to kill him before he constructs his own domain and breaks through to the Domain Stage. If he breaks through to the Domain Stage, please forgive me for being blunt, you won’t be his match even if he has just entered the Domain Stage!’","Gongsun Hong revealed a somewhat anxious expression as he said this.."]},{"number":2275,"title":"Chapter 2275: Someone Wants to Kill Chu Yunfan!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2275: Someone Wants to Kill Chu Yunfan!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Although killing intent was boiling in his heart, Gongsun Hong did not deliberately belittle Chu Yunfan’s strength. In his opinion, Chu Yunfan was indeed a very powerful opponent.","When he was in the Divine Treasure Stage, he was practically invincible.","However, once he stepped into the Domain Stage, he was truly invincible.","It was because of this that he truly knew how terrifying Chu Yunfan was. If Chu Yunfan was allowed to grow like this, they would probably die in the end.","He didn’t have much respect for Sanjue. After all, if he didn’t rely on the resources of the Destiny Sect, Sanjue wouldn’t have been able to reach the Domain Stage.","There was a considerable gap between them and top-notch geniuses, let alone them, the Supreme Youths.","The difference between an ordinary person and a Supreme Youth was as huge as a galaxy. Let alone Chu Yunfan, even if he had stepped into the Domain Stage, his strength would be extremely shocking. It would not be difficult for him to defeat Sanjue.","Not to mention Chu Yunfan, who was far more powerful than him.","In his heart, as long as Chu Yunfan entered the Domain Stage first, everything would be over. They had no way of defeating such a powerful Chu Yunfan.","“There i s no need to worry about that!” Sanjue said confidently, “This ancient battlefield is my territory. My influence here far surpasses your imagination.","We can completely spread his threat. At that time, the entire world will probably search for him and kill him!”","Gongsun Hong nodded. If the others knew of the existence of such an expert, they would probably not let the matter rest so easily.","Based on Chu Yunfan’s cultivation speed, it would not be long before Chu Yunfan became a thorn in their side. He might even become a sharp blade that could fall on their heads at any time.","“According to what you said about Chu Yunfan, if what you said is true, it means that we are not the only ones who want to attack him. We don’t even need to do anything. As long as we announce the news, others will naturally be unable to hold back and attack. At that time, Chu Yunfan will die!” Sanjue said, “Moreover, it won’t be long before Chu Yunfan will walk right into the trap!’","“How do you know that he will walk right into our trap?” Gongsun Hong was a little puzzled.","“He will.” Sanjue smiled. “And the reason is very simple. There aren’t many materialized domains left in the ancient battlefield.","“After so many years of plundering, experts from all over the world have come to visit. No matter how intense the war was and how many top-notch experts were killed or injured, the plundering over so many years has long caused the domains nurtured in the unique environment of the ancient battlefield to dissipate!” Sanjue said explained, “Now, there are no more special domains in the outer region of the ancient battlefield. If Chu Yunfan wants to break through, he’ll have to enter the core region. The only place where we haven’t broken through is this city. We can only patrol the outer region of the city and look for an opportunity to break through the barrier of this city. This is the core of the entire ancient battlefield!”","“l understand now.” Gongsun Hong clapped. “In other words, as long as Chu Yunfan comes over, he’ll be walking right into our trap. With so many factions watching him, he won’t get away so easily. As soon as he appears, he’ll immediately become everyone’s target. If he doesn’t come, he won’t have a chance to enter the Domain Stage because he’s at the edge of the ancient battlefield. Even if he can enter the Domain Stage, without the help of the special domain in the ancient battlefield, his progress will be limited. He’ll be far behind us!”","“Your judgment is correct!” Sanjue nodded and praised.","In Sanjue’s opinion, no matter how Chu Yunfan planned to jump around, he would not be able to escape death in the end. This wasn’t a hidden conspiracy, because a hidden conspiracy could be avoided, but an open conspiracy was open and aboveboard. There was no way to avoid it. One could only choose yes or no.","“Very good. It seems that I made the right choice to come here!” Gongsun Hong said.","“Please forgive me for being blunt, Gongsun Hong. Although your talent is very shocking, and you are a Supreme Youth, a rare talent since ancient times.","You can’t put all your hopes on others. It’s been like this since ancient times. Only those who are strong themselves are truly strong!” Sanjue said.","If it was an ordinary person, they would have turned hostile because of Sanjue’s words.","However, Gongsun Hong was not a normal person. He merely nodded and said, “l understand. Killing Chu Yunfan is secondary to entering the ancient battlefield this time. The most important thing is for me to become stronger.”","“Although I don’t know what the elders of the Imperial Court and the Destiny Sect are thinking to be willing to pay such a huge price to send all of you to the ancient battlefield. However, I think there must be a reason. I hope that all of you can seize the time to cultivate. I have a domain here. Leave Chu Yunfan’s matter to me!” Sanjue said.","“Alright!’","Unknowingly, undercurrents began to appear in the entire ancient battlefield.","And the target of these undercurrents had unknowingly pointed to Chu","Yunfan.","If the previous arena battle had only made Chu Yunfan famous, then the fact that he had easily crushed Matchless Night and King of Fire in front of the imperial family library had completely confirmed the rumors of his strength.","It made him a thorn in the side of many forces.","Especially those Supreme Youths who had ambitions to be invincible in the future, they treated him as the first person they had to defeat.","“Someone wants to kill Chu Yunfan!”","A rumor began to spread. When all the top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths heard it, they could not help but pay attention to it. There were too many people who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, but nobody knew who they were!","More than half of them wanted to get rid of Chu Yunfan.","Along with this undercurrent, many of Chu Yunfan’s deeds began to spread in the ancient battlefield where experts were as common as clouds.","“What? He killed the seven Supreme Youths by himself?”","“His strength is unfathomable. It’s said that he has cultivated 1,000 laws. He can even fight against Domainians?”","“Incredible! The Flying Celestials has really produced an extraordinary figure! “"]},{"number":2276,"title":"Chapter 2276: One Year, Wind and Clouds Move","paragraphs":["Chapter 2276: One Year, Wind and Clouds Move","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","With one sentence, Chu Yunfan became famous. In the ancient battlefield where experts were as common as clouds, he became famous.","Originally, Chu Yunfan’s reputation was only spread among the top geniuses and Supreme Youths of the human race. However, now, even many foreign experts began to notice Chu Yunfan’s existence.","The ancient battlefield was not a sealed battlefield. Not only humans, but also the marine folks, the Hus, the barbarians, the demons, and many other foreign races would appear on this battlefield.","Above these Divine Treasures, there were also top-notch experts who had already stepped into the Domain Stage.","Any one of those Domainians could be considered a magnate of the Central","Plains.","Even itinerant cultivators here had unimaginable power.","In the ancient battlefield, where countless experts and prodigies roamed freely, Chu Yunfan could be considered to have taken the initiative and become famous first.","However, it was precisely because of this that he became a thorn in many people’s eyes.","Even though some masters who were on good terms with the Flying Celestials had stepped forward, they still could not stop Chu Yunfan from becoming the center of the storm.","It was because Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was too shocking.","Whether it was killing the seven Supreme Youths by himself or the legendary matter of cultivating 1,000 laws.","He became the target of public criticism!","“A thousand laws? That’s just human bragging. How can someone achieve a thousand laws to such an extent? I don’t believe it!”","“That’s right. Humans have always been cunning. How can we believe what they say?”","“But no matter what, since this person is a human, he is our mortal enemy.","We must not let him grow up properly!’","When the news spread more and more widely, and even the outsiders heard about it, the entire situation was out of control. It was not something that the Flying Celestials could control. In the ancient battlefield, the Flying Celestials was only one of the factions and did not have an overwhelming advantage.","For a time, many figures gathered outside the Flying Celestials’ base in the ancient battlefield. All of them were waiting for Chu Yunfan.","However, after waiting for half a month, they realized that there was no news of Chu Yunfan.","Then, everyone finally received the news that Chu Yunfan did not enter the Flying Celestials’ battlefield . Naturally, they could not find Chu Yunfan here.","In an instant, the entire ancient battlefield began to search for Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts!","Under the urging of many people, even many foreign experts joined in the search for Chu Yunfan.","They all wanted to kill Chu Yunfan before he reached his limit and broke through to the Domain Stage.","Slowly, this became a trend!","With the combined efforts of many experts in the ancient battlefield, Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts were discovered for the first time in less than a month.","Two experts of the Hus accidentally discovered the valley where Chu Yunfan was in seclusion.","A shocking battle erupted with the guardian golden roc. In the end, although the golden roc eliminated these two people, his whereabouts were exposed, and various experts came in droves.","The experts from all sides were like waves of tides that swept over continuously.","In the blink of an eye, another year passed.","It had been a year since Chu Yunfan and the other young geniuses and Supreme Youths entered the ancient battlefield.","In the past year or so, these ancient prodigies from the distant past had displayed earth-shattering talent.","This was the first time the experts who had been roaming the ancient battlefield understood what terror was.","As the ancient battlefield had been searched and plundered for many years, there were not many tangible domains left. These were the key points for the various factions to compete for.","Under such circumstances, a huge conflict erupted between these ancient prodigies and the current experts.","The experts of the current era were beaten back step by step. They were completely not a match for these ancient prodigies.","Those ancient prodigies who could reach the ancient battlefield were at least top-notch prodigies. There were even tyrannical Supreme Youths among them. Every one of them was an outstanding figure among those of the same level.","If both parties were in the Divine Treasure Stage, the Supreme Youths were invincible existences in the Divine Treasure Stage.","On the other hand, those experts of the current era were mostly ordinary geniuses and ordinary prodigies. There were not many of them who were even top-notch prodigies.","In the same level, how could they compete with these ancient prodigies?","This was especially so since each of these ancient prodigies was a terrifying existence that had once suppressed an era. Their attacks were ruthless and decisive. The current experts were not their match and were often defeated by them.","Even if their numbers were far greater than these ancient prodigies, they would still be defeated.","In the same level, three to five people were no match at all.","In the end, they would even go out in groups to search for treasures. They did not dare to go out alone, or they would be surrounded and killed by the ancient prodigies.","They had no strength to fight bac.","The arrogance of the ancient prodigies naturally aroused the indignation of the experts. However, it was useless. These ancient prodigies did what they wanted and would not hold back when they encountered a precious treasure.","The living space of the experts of the current era compressed again and again.","At this moment, they finally understood how blissful their previous lives were. They were completely no match for these ancient prodigies.","If it wasn’t for the fact that there were constant internal conflicts among the ancient prodigies, and that the various factions and races were different, the conflicts between them would have been even crueler. Otherwise, they would have been chased out long ago.","In the end, the Domainians from the ancient battlefield were alerted. These peerless experts appeared and defeated many ancient prodigies one after another. Only then did the arrogance of the ancient prodigies be suppressed.","However, everyone understood that this was only a temporary suppression of these ancient prodigies.","These ancient prodigies were generally only in the Divine Treasure Stage. No one had stepped into the Domain Stage yet, so the current experts could still suppress them and occupy a slight lead.","However, once these ancient prodigies entered the Domain Stage, things would be completely reversed.","It was impossible for these current experts to suppress these ancient prodigies. Instead, the current experts would be beaten until they knelt down and called the other party “father.”","This situation was evident from the experts of the Divine Treasure Stage.","Even so, there was nothing anyone could do. After all, the difference in talent was too great. If there were only three to five of these ancient experts, or even thirty to fifty of them, the experts of the ancient battlefield could join forces to encircle and annihilate them, nipping their threat in the bud.","However, there were too many of them!"]},{"number":2277,"title":"Chapter 2277: Shocking Transformation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2277: Shocking Transformation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","So many that even if they joined forces, they would not be able to do anything to them.","The difference in talent between the two sides was simply heaven and earth. They were not on the same level.","It was so big that even if they wanted to resist, they could not do anything. They could only sigh.","One had to know that they were top-notch geniuses among their peers, but they were completely powerless against these monsters.","In fact, the Supreme Youths among these ancient geniuses were even more troublesome to deal with. Some even used forbidden methods to heavily injure a Domainian who wanted to kill them before leaving arrogantly.","It made everyone see how terrifying these top geniuses were. They could not be resisted at all, and there was no way to restrict their growth.","Moreover, as time passed, these top-notch geniuses were still growing at an astonishing speed. More and more top-notch geniuses and Supreme Youths found the domains left behind by the ancient experts.","Through the comprehension of the domain, each and every top-notch prodigies and Supreme Youth was constantly breaking through their comprehension of the Great Dao.","As these domains could be comprehended by several people at the same time, these ancient prodigies could start comprehending in groups of three to five. At the same time, they could also advance in groups of three to five,","The organizations that had previously rampaged through the prodigy battlefield recovered at the fastest speed in the ancient battlefield.","They fought in groups of three to five, causing the experts of the current era","to be dumbfounded.","Although no one had broken through to the Domain Stage yet, they had indeed broken through their limits.","Originally, the limit of top-notch prodigies was 200 laws. However, after comprehending the structure of a domain, these top-notch prodigies broken through the limit of 200 laws.","They were even charging in the direction of 300, 400, and even 500.","What was even more terrifying was that after those Supreme Youths obtained the domains of those ancient experts and comprehended them, they broke through to 500 laws. There were even monsters who cultivated 600, 700, 800, and even 900 laws.","Such monsters might not even appear in an era or even in many eras. Now, they had all appeared in front of everyone.","Relying on the domains left behind by these ancient experts, the entire group of ancient prodigies underwent an unimaginable and shocking transformation.","They reached a level that shocked the experts of the current era. There were even examples of a Supreme Youth being able to rely on their strength to escape unscathed from the hands of Domainians.","In the past, this was almost impossible.","A year ago, when encountering a Domainian, a top-notch prodigy was almost certain to die. Even a Supreme Youth had to use all their trump cards or even one-time emergency methods to escape.","The gap between them was only a year, and many experts in the world could not understand it.","They even thought that these people were monsters.","In the resting area of a city in the ancient battlefield, many experts of the present age had just returned from the forbidden zone. Most of them still found nothing.","However, there were a few people who were lucky enough to obtain something. Too many experts had fallen in the ancient battlefield. Not only did they leave behind their domains, but they also left behind all kinds of treasures, medicinal pills, secret techniques, and so on. They were all extremely rare items in the outside world.","Those ancient experts were at least in the Divine Treasure Stage, and most of them were in the Domain Stage. Any one of them could create a first-rate force.","It was not difficult at all.","Now that these experts had fallen, the good things they left behind naturally benefited these future generations.","“These ancient prodigies are too strong. They’re simply monsters. This era is a golden era for them. But for us, it’s simply a dark apocalypse!” an expert said gloomily.","Experts like them were the rulers of any era and were high and mighty existences. However, in an era where countless monsters and freaks existed, they were simply like weeds on the roadside that could be trampled on by anyone. They could be forced to kneel at any time.","“That’s right. They’re all monsters. Usually, it’s already very impressive to have one or two in an era. Who knew that these old monsters would seal themselves until now? They’re really more terrifying than the one before!”","“Previously, I teamed up with a few old friends to ambush and kill an ancient prodigy. Who knew that he would kill us instead? I was the only one who manged to escape. Thinking back about it, it’s such a humiliation!” another old man said gloomily.","In the beginning, the current experts did not realize how terrifying these ancient prodigies were. There were many people who wanted to ambush and kill these ancient prodigies to obtain the inheritance of the distant era.","In fact, most people were tempted. After all, it was an inheritance from a distant era. If they could obtain it, it would be an unimaginable opportunity, especially for people like them who had almost reached the end of their cultivation and could not advance further.","However, they were all taught a lesson later on. Those ancient prodigies were experts of the present age with practical actions. What did it mean to not provoke them?","Other than Domainians, who else could sit still?","The elites of ancient times were arrogant, but the current experts were not any better. If they had not been taught a lesson too badly, who would be willing to let it go so easily?","During this process, the experts of the current era continued to die. Although there were ancient prodigies who were killed, compared to the number of casualties of the experts of the current era, it was extremely rare.","After countless deaths and injuries, the experts of the current era no longer had those thoughts.","“They’ve accumulated enough. They should be able to construct their own domains. However, they didn’t choose to construct their domains. It’s obvious that they want to break through their limits!” Someone sighed.","The others were even more dejected. They tried their best to construct their own domains, but it was still difficult. In fact, without the help of fortuitous encounters or domains left behind by predecessors, it was almost impossible for them to reach the Domain Stage.","On the other hand, these ancient prodigies could easily enter the Domain Stage. However, they chose not to do so. Instead, they chose to constantly strengthen their foundations. The more laws they condensed, the stronger","they would be once they broke through to the Domain Stage.","Everyone understood this logic. However, to them, it was already good enough to be able to construct a domain. How could they have so many to choose from?","“They’re already so terrifying now. Once they break through to the Domain Stage, I’m afraid even those lords won’t be able to suppress them!” someone said.","“Suppress them? At that time, believe it or not, those adults will definitely flee the ancient battlefield at the first possible moment. They have offended many people previously.. Are those ancient prodigies all good-tempered? They’re just enduring and waiting for a breakthrough!’"]},{"number":2278,"title":"Chapter 2278: Waiting for the Heroes of the World","paragraphs":["Chapter 2278: Waiting for the Heroes of the World","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Everyone understood that once the ancient geniuses could no longer hold back and started to break through, it would be the days of suffering for the Domainians who had once suppressed them.","Any one of the so-called top prodigies was at least in the top three of the current Prodigy List. Any one of them would be a top expert in the world if they grew up in another era.","A top-notch figure who could dominate an era.","Everyone knew how proud such a person was!","These people could be called the strongest of the countless living beings, but there was a group of such people. These ancient geniuses were unique and could even be the strongest.","Not to mention those Supreme Youths. In a normal era, as long as a Supreme Youth appeared, they would definitely be the strongest. There was no doubt about it.","Suppressing these people was already very difficult when their strength was still inferior, let alone when they were at the same cultivation level. These peerless geniuses would surpass their opponents at an astonishing speed and trample their opponents under their feet.","Their opponents were only each other.","At that time, those high and mighty figures that they had to look up to would probably be on the run.","“Is there anyone who dares to suppress these people now? Those lords have either stopped suppressing them or have already befriended these people.” Someone sighed. “Why would a godhead appear in this era?”","Suddenly, someone barged into the resting area and shouted, “Big news, big news!”","Everyone focused on him.","“What is it? Could it be that some big shot has personally come to this battlefield?” someone asked lazily.","“Of course not. It’s that disciple of the Flying Celestials, Chu Yunfan. He’s here. He’s on a mountain ten thousand miles away. He’s waiting for the heroes of the world to challenge him!”","“What?!”","Everyone felt their spirits lift. Even if they did not know Chu Yunfan at first, they had come to know him in this past year.","He was a legendary figure!","Over the past year, there were many people who had tried to stop Chu Yunfan. There were experts from the current era, as well as geniuses from the ancient times. There were all sorts of fierce battles. There were even people who had already stepped into the Domain Stage who tried to kill Chu Yunfan.","However, in the end, they were either killed by Chu Yunfan or forced to retreat. Slowly, more and more people began to chase after him.","In this one year of pursuit, Chu Yunfan’s strength had shocked these prodigies of the present age. No one knew whether he had reached the legendary 1,000 laws, but everyone knew that he had definitely surpassed the 500-law-limit of a Supreme Youth.","Just this alone was enough to make many people tremble in fear.","Even among the ancient prodigies, Chu Yunfan was the most outstanding. However, this situation was gradually turning around because these ancient prodigies were slowly breaking through their original limits.","The level that was originally thought to be the limit was broken by these ancient geniuses, constantly breaking the original record.","Originally, 1,000 laws seemed unattainable and almost impossible to achieve.","Now, it did not seem to be strange anymore. There were already several supreme Supreme Youths who claimed to have already cultivated 1,000 laws.","Even among the top prodigies, there were many who had cultivated 500 laws. Each one was stronger than the other, comparable to a Supreme Youth before they broke through.","Many people did not dare to imagine how terrifying it would be when this batch of ancient prodigies broke past the Divine Treasure Stage.","Because of this, Chu Yunfan, who was originally covered in layers of halos, didn’t look so outstanding anymore. He became mediocre.","Many Supreme Youths even treated him like a whetstone, declaring that they would kill Chu Yunfan and perfect their Great Dao.","It seemed that Chu Yunfan’s existence had become a standard, and only by defeating him could one reach the top.","However, they had never been able to find Chu Yunfan’s whereabouts. Even if they occasionally found traces of Chu Yunfan, it was difficult to keep him.","Everyone knew that not only was Chu Yunfan powerful, but the golden roc following him was also first-class. The golden roc was powerful enough to dominate among the Supreme Youths.","It was said that he was a pure-blooded descendant of the golden roc, one of the Ten Ferocities. His strength was unimaginable.","Now, after being hunted for a year, Chu Yunfan finally couldn’t help but come out of seclusion to fight against the heroes of the world.","Everyone’s interest was piqued, and they all stepped on the light and headed toward a mountain ten thousand miles away.","A distance of 10,000 miles was nothing to experts like them. In a moment, they had already arrived at the top of the mountain.","Chu Yunfan stood in the air with his hands behind his back. He looked like a god. On his shoulder, a small bird about the size of a fist attracted everyone’s attention.","It was the golden roc.","“It’s really him. In just a year, he has the confidence to fight against those prodigies who have improved so quickly?”","“The cultivation base that he used to dominate the world seems to be far from enough right now. I’m afraid it’s impossible for him to kill as many people as he did back then!”","“He’ll die today. There are too many people who want to kill him. Even those Domainians might make a move!”","However, while everyone was still in shock, the air was suddenly torn apart. Then, a huge beast claw tore out from the void and ruthlessly grabbed toward","Chu Yunfan.","Before Chu Yunfan made a move, the golden roc on his shoulder let out a cry. His entire body burst out with a shocking light, repelling the huge beast claw.","“What’s that?”","Everyone looked at the beast claw that was as huge as a small mountain and guessed what kind of terrifying beast was behind it. Immediately after, an incomparably huge figure slowly appeared behind the crack. Everyone discovered that it was an incomparably huge flood dragon.","This flood dragon was green and had a ferocious expression. It was thousands of meters long and was as huge as a mountain range. It was extremely terrifying.","“It’s the Green Flood Dragon!’","Some people recognized what this incomparably huge flood dragon was. It was a Green Flood Dragon.","The Green Flood Dragon was a branch of the Flood Dragon race. It was also one of the Flood Dragons that often appeared in front of everyone. This Green Flood Dragon was clearly an outstanding figure in this race.."]},{"number":2279,"title":"Chapter 2279: Roasted Green Flood Dragon!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2279: Roasted Green Flood Dragon!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Many people knew that this race was a major race among the monsters in the distant past. Once a Green Flood Dragon was born, even those of the lowest level would be a genius. The outstanding ones among them could even reach the top.","At the same time, dragons were lewd by nature and liked to spread their bloodline everywhere. Therefore, the number of people in this race was not as small as other powerful races.","Often, when monsters fought humans, the flood dragons could act as the main force. They were the monsters that were the most troublesome for humans.","“So, it’s a big green snake. With your bloodline, you dare to appear in front of me. It seems that my reputation has been ruined in the past year. Even a beast like you dares to find trouble with me!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The Green Flood Dragon was only at the level of a top prodigy. It had only condensed 500 laws, which was not much different from those Supreme Youths more than a year ago.","It seemed to be not bad, but more than a year ago, even those Supreme Youths did not dare to be impudent before Chu Yunfan. Now, in just over a year, many ancient prodigies had obtained a huge breakthrough, and their cultivation had advanced by leaps and bounds. Now, even such a Green Flood Dragon dared to find trouble with him.","“You’re courting death! ”","The Green Flood Dragon’s huge eyes flashed with a shocking fierce light. He had dominated the world and rarely met a match among his peers. When had he ever been looked down upon by others like this?","Moreover, he had the dragons behind him. They were stronger than the Destiny Sect of Grand Xia. Who would dare to look down on him?","Boom, boom, boom!","The Green Flood Dragon slowly walked out of the crack. Every step he took shook the world, almost causing the world to shake.","“Roar!”","The Green Flood Dragon let out a loud roar. Countless gales suddenly blew up, and terrifying energy emerged from his body, turning into an incomparably huge ball of light.","This ball of light flickered with an extremely terrifying light, and endless energy was shaking.","Many of the spectating experts retreated. They felt that this was too terrifying. Just this Green Flood Dragon alone could wipe them out.","The huge ball of light quickly grew to the size of a small mountain. In an instant, it swept out and formed a terrifying beam of light.","Wherever the light beam passed, the world changed color, and a huge hole was created in the air.","The space in the ancient battlefield was too fragile, so fragile that it could be easily torn apart by a Divine Treasure.","The pillar of light instantly engulfed Chu Yunfan.","Everyone widened their eyes, trying to see Chu Yunfan’s figure.","“Although we know that Chu Yunfan isn’t weak, I’m afraid he won’t come out of this unscathed!”","When the light beam dissipated, it was completely different from what everyone thought. Not only was Chu Yunfan unharms, but the light beam could not even break his protective energy shield.","Chu Yunfan stood there and took the terrifying blow head-on that made their expressions change,","“Is this all you can do? You dare to find trouble with me in this state? You really don’t know the immensity of heaven and earth!” Chu Yunfan sneered.","Even the Supreme Youths from a year ago couldn’t ignore this kind of strength, but it was still far from Chu Yunfan’s.","“Die!” the Green Flood Dragon roared.","He disappeared from its original spot. With a degree of agility that completely did not match his huge body, he appeared in before Chu Yunfan, and then clawed at Chu Yunfan.","A huge crack was torn in the void, and it fell in Chu Yunfan’s direction.","Bam!","Before the attack could land, Chu Yunfan raised his hand and blocked the terrifying fatal attack.","Everyone looked at the scene in horror. Chu Yunfan was too powerful.","If Chu Yunfan could block or even defeat the Green Flood Dragon, it would not be beyond their expectations. However, what really shocked them was that","Chu Yunfan handled it so nonchalantly.","It was as if he was doing done something insignificant.","“Humph!” Chu Yunfan didn’t hesitate. He clenched his fist and threw a simple punch.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan’s punch didn’t emit any light, but it pierced through the air and hit the Green Flood Dragon in the head.","Splat!","Immediately after, everyone saw a terrifying scene. The head of the incomparably huge Green Flood Dragon was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch. Blood and brain matter scattered everywhere.","This huge Green Flood Dragon’s body was then grabbed by a large hand, and using a divine power, it was returned to its original size of several meters.","“A flood dragon is only so-so. I haven’t eaten flood dragon meat before though. It’s said that the meat of a dragon in the sky is the meat of a donkey on the ground. Although this flood dragon isn’t a true dragon, it shouldn’t be too bad!”","Chu Yunfan grinned and started to set up a fire, washing and preparing the Green Flood Dragon’s body. Then, he placed the meat on the fire rack and began to roast them.","Originally, with the cultivation of this Green Flood Dragon, even if he died, ordinary flames would not be able to roast him. However, Chu Yunfan was naturally not an ordinary person. In just a moment, this Green Flood Dragon had been roasted, and an alluring fragrance pervaded the air.","The thick oil kept dripping into the firewood, making crackling sounds from time to time.","Everyone stared at the scene in front of them with their mouths agape. They watched as Chu Yunfan killed the Green Flood Dragon with a single punch and then roasted it on the fire rack.","What was this? It was too brutal!","Many people suddenly felt a chill run down their spines, especially the monster experts. They felt as if they had fallen into an ice cave.","However, their noses couldn’t help but twitch. The smell was just too fragrant!","Many people gulped when they saw Chu Yunfan tear off a leg and throw it to the golden roc, then tear off another leg and eat it heartily.","The body of this Green Flood Dragon contained spirit energy that had been cultivated for many years. Just eating a bite could be of great help to one’s cultivation.","After a while, everyone stared blankly at Chu Yunfan swallowing the Green Flood Dragon, leaving only some bones behind. He burped indifferently.","“It tastes good. Flood dragon meat is really delicious. It’s a first-class ingredient. Just a casual roast can produce such a taste. Next time, I’ll kill a few more and cook them. It’s simply delicious!” Chu Yunfan said with a smile.","His genes as a citizen of the foodie empire had awakened at this moment, and his words immediately caused many of the monster experts to be so frightened that they turned and ran.","Such brutality from a human was unnatural.."]},{"number":2280,"title":"Chapter 2280: Why Do You Have to Come to Die?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2280: Why Do You Have to Come to Die?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan’s savagery frightened many of the monster experts. A powerful Green Flood Dragon was killed by Chu Yunfan in a few moves, then cleaned and roasted.","They had seen savage ones, but they had never seen one as savage as this!","Even the monster experts who were used to eating people had never seen such a ferocious guy.","“Chu Yunfan is still as strong as ever. Even if his strength is no longer so outstanding, completely pulling apart the other Supreme Youths by several levels, it is obvious that he is not someone that only the top prodigy Green Flood Dragon can deal with.” Someone concluded.","Only then did many people put away their thoughts of underestimating Chu Yunfan. Obviously, even if Chu Yunfan did not improve an inch, he was probably not inferior to those Supreme Youths.","His strength was also earth-shattering!","It was just that many people had felt that many other Supreme Youths had broken through their limits and reached an unprecedented level. Therefore, Chu Yunfan was no longer so outstanding, but was not much different from the other Supreme Youths.","However, even if he was not much different from the other Supreme Youths, he was still one step ahead among the ancient prodigies. After all, even among the top prodigies, the Supreme Youth was still only a minority among the minority.","“I’m afraid only the Supreme Youth can suppress him. It’s impossible for anyone else!” someone said.","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing performance also made some people with ulterior motives have no choice but to restrain some of their thoughts.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan was not a pushover that they could deal with.","“Chu Yunfan, come and die!”","Suddenly, at this moment, another loud shout was heard.","The sound of horse hooves could be heard from afar. Immediately after, everyone saw a figure riding on a precious horse. In an instant, he arrived in front of everyone.","Everyone raised their heads and saw a tall and burly man wearing animal skin clothes. He had a rough face and was riding a snow-white horse.","To everyone’s surprise, not only was this rough-looking man, but even the horse he was riding on was also in the Divine Treasure Stage. Its cultivation was also earth-shattering.","Even some top geniuses suspected that they might not be able to defeat this horse.","Not to mention the ordinary experts of the Divine Treasure Stage. They felt that even if a group of them attacked together, they might not be a match for this horse. And the person who could subdue this horse naturally shocked them even more.","“Another one is here to die!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","He noted the rough man and recognized his attire. It was the unique attire of the Northern Hus.","The Hus was located at the back of the Central Plains, and the northernmost part of their territory was covered in snow all year round. The people there dressed very differently from the people of the Central Plains.","However, this man did not seem to be an ordinary Hu. He was definitely a rare","Supreme Youth among the Hus. His cultivation had surpassed the limits of a Supreme Youth and had actually reached the level of more than 800 laws.","Compared to those Supreme Youths who had joined hands to form a body, he was not the slightest bit inferior. In fact, he was only stronger and not weaker.","“You’re an expert of the Hus. You’re from one of the four royal clans? Or a shaman expert?” Chu Yunfan said indifferently in the face of the aggressive man.","The Hus had wreaked havoc in the Central Plains in the north, and could be considered an old rival of Grand Xia. There were many records of the Hus in the north in Grand Xia.","Chu Yunfan was no stranger to the Northern Hus. Unlike Grand Xia in the Central Plains, the Northern Hus was divided into four royal clans and ruled the four directions. They were the most powerful among the Hus. They produced many experts and had a deep foundation.","It could be said that he held the military and political power of the entire Hus.","Other than the four royal clans of the Hus, the Hus also had a religion, Shamanism. Shamanism had a Holy Seer, and there were also many experts in it. Countless experts were born from the enlightenment of Shamanism. In terms of strength, they were probably not inferior to the Destiny Sect.","It could be said that the status of these five major powers in the Northern Hus was equivalent to the ten major powers of Grand Xia.","The experts in Grand Xia might not be from the ten great powers, but in the Northern Hus, all the experts that appeared must belong to one of the five great powers.","That was why Chu Yunfan had asked him which force he was from.","It wasn’t that he wanted to get any information out of him, because at his level, it was meaningless to get any information.","“You’re quite knowledgeable, you Southern pest. I’m the prince of the Boljijin clan, one of the four great royal clans, Boljijin Shaq!” The man smiled coldly. “So, it’s one of the four great royal clans of the Hus, the Boljijin clan!” Chu","Yunfan nodded.","The Boljijins were one of the four great royal clans of the Hu Clan. It was unknown how many years it had been passed down. There were countless experts in the clan. It could be said that there were as many experts as clouds.","However, Boljijin Shaq was clearly not the prince of this generation. He should be a prince from a certain generation many years ago. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan would have some impression of him.","After all, his Zhenyuan City was the intersection of the four forces and had many dealings with the Hus in the north.","“I heard that someone praised you as the number one among the prodigies. I think it’s just a monkey claiming to be king when there’s no tiger in the mountain!” Boljijin Shaq said calmly.","“Someone wants your head and has placed a huge bounty on it. Now is the perfect time. Wait for me to kill you and exchange it for the bounty!” Boljijin Shaq’s face was filled with excitement. He did not put Chu Yunfan in his eyes, and his tone was filled with a cold aura.","Chu Yunfan looked at Boljijin Shaq and said, “Why bother? You’ve cultivated for many years in the Northern Hus. Coming here is just a sudden death!”","No one expected Chu Yunfan to say such words in front of Boljijin Shaq. He didn’t even put Shaq in his eyes.","“Chu Yunfan is being too careless. Boljijin Shaq is not an ordinary person. I","was born not too long after him, and I’ve heard of his legend. In his era, he was invincible. Even those who were a generation older than him were beaten by him until they couldn’t even raise their heads. They were not his match at all!” an ancient prodigy said.","He thought of the rumors he had heard about Boljijin Shaq. He had suppressed the other top prodigies by himself. He was not an ordinary","person.."]},{"number":2281,"title":"Chapter 2281: The Might of the Disaster Star Eyes","paragraphs":["Chapter 2281: The Might of the Disaster Star Eyes","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Clearly, compared to the Green Flood Dragon, Boljijin Shaq was much stronger.","“You really don’t know life and death. Just you?” Boljijin Shaq said coldly, “It seems that you thought you were invincible after killing Elements Kid and the others. Now, I’ll let you wake up. Do you think this is still your era?”","At this moment, Boljijin Shaq moved. The horse under him let out a long neigh as if it was a terrifying beast roaring. Its four hooves tore through the sky, turning into a ray of light and charging straight at Chu Yunfan.","Many people felt a chill run down their spines. Everything was just as they had guessed. Boljijin Shaq’s warhorse was much more powerful than most of the people present.","Other than a small number of Supreme Youths, who else could stop such a warhorse?","Just the warhorse he was riding had condensed at least 500 laws, which was simply beyond everyone’s imagination.","When such a terrifying horse charged forward, it was like a mountain charging forward.","In an instant, the horse was already in front of Chu Yunfan.","Fast, fast, fast!","It was simply extremely fast.","Boljijin Shaq made his move. In an instant, an incomparably huge spiked club appeared in his hand. The spiked club danced, shattering the space between heaven and earth. Then, it suddenly smashed fiercely toward Chu Yunfan.","If the club had hit him, many people would have thought that Chu Yunfan’s head would have been smashed, just like how he had dealt with the Green Flood Dragon just now. The same bad luck would have befallen Chu Yunfan.","However, at this moment, Chu Yunfan moved. His eyes emitted an extremely terrifying light, and endless power of disaster was released from his eyes.","In an instant, the world seemed to have turned into an apocalypse. Volcanic eruptions, tsunamis, earthquakes, meteorites hitting the ground, all kinds of natural disasters were happening.","Chu Yunfan’s eyes erupted with a terrifying power of disaster, turning the entire world into a disaster zone. Boljijin Shaq’s spiked club seemed to have sunk into a swamp when it was about to hit Chu Yunfan, and its progress was slow.","What was even more terrifying was that there was a terrifying force acting on this spiked club. This spiked club actually shattered inch by inch.","Boom!","After a loud explosion, the powerful spiked club that could smash a mountain shattered.","In an instant, it turned into fragments that filled the sky and shot in all directions.","Many people immediately raised their defensive barriers in front of them to avoid being hit by the fragments of the spiked club.","It was too terrifying. Even if it was just a fragment, it could actually destroy many defensive barriers.","Many of them felt extremely fortunate that they had reacted quickly. Otherwise, their protective shield might not even be able to do anything to the fragments of the spiked club.","“What kind of special physique is that?”","Many people looked at Chu Yunfan. The power of disaster that erupted from his eyes was very obvious. It was obviously not an ordinary divine power. It should be a shocking physique that only a special physique could possess.","“This is the Disaster Star Eyes, right? I’ve seen a pair of eyes like this before, but that person died a long, long time ago!’","Someone thought for a moment and immediately realized what those eyes were. They all remembered that this was the once famous Disaster Star Eyes. This pair of eyes could bring disaster to the world.","It was just that such eyes were too rare throughout history, so though many people had heard of them, few had seen them.","This was the first time they were seeing the Disaster Star Eyes.","“Why isn’t there any information about him having such a constitution?” someone said.","Only then did many people remember that there was no information about Chu Yunfan possessing the Disaster Star Eyes.","“He has hidden himself too well. I can’t believe he has such a technique. But wasn’t it said that he has another special physique? How could he also have the Disaster Star Eye? How did he do it?” someone asked in confusion.","There was no doubt that the Disaster Star Eyes was an emperor physique. In their opinion, how could Chu Yunfan have several special physiques?","“Unless he forcefully took someone else’s bloodline for himself! ”","Someone thought of a terrifying guess. If that was the case, then Chu Yunfan would probably become a thorn in their side.","After all, even when Jun Tianci was cultivating the Disaster Star Eyes, he had to secretly collect the heart blood of those special physiques.","Because even he knew that once this news was exposed, he would immediately become the target of public criticism.","Those with king physiques would immediately feel as if there was a knife on their back. However, these people weren’t peak experts and were the future hope of the sect.","The power that they could mobilize, even the current Jun Tianci would not be able to withstand a single blow from such a terrifying existence.","They only had some guesses now, but for many people, just this kind of brush was enough.","“l heard that Jun Tianci of the Destiny Sect had this physique. Later on, he died, and Chu Yunfan and Jun Tianci had a life and death feud. From the looks","Many people’s imaginations were wide open as they thought of an astonishing thing. What they didn’t know was that their guesses were very close to the truth.","“Impossible. Chu Yunfan should have still been recovering from his injuries.","Moreover, according to the Destiny Sect, Jun Tianci died at the hands of Jian Wuchen. Even if the Disaster Star Eye was left outside, it shouldn’t be in Chu Yunfan’s hands!” someone immediately retorted.","However, in front of Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes, this explanation was too weak, especially when many of the disciples who were related to the Destiny Sect looked at Chu Yunfan with terrifying killing intent.","Whether it was Chu Yunfan or not, it didn’t make any difference to them. They would rather kill the wrong person than let him go.","They couldn’t let others look down on Jun Tianici because of this.","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan made his move. He clenched his five fingers into a fist and punched out.","This punch pierced through the sky and instantly arrived in front of Boljijin Shaq.","Spurt!","Boljijin Shaq spat out a mouthful of blood, and he was sent flying..."]},{"number":2282,"title":"Chapter 2282: Stomping Boljijin Shaq to Death","paragraphs":["Chapter 2282: Stomping Boljijin Shaq to Death","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The fist was like a rainbow that pierced through the air and shattered the vacuum. Boljijin Shaq could not block this punch. Chu Yunfan’s punch sent him flying.","The crowd saw the law on Boljijin Shaqs body appear, and then it was shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“Ouch!” Many people gasped. Chu Yunfan’s punch was able to shatter the law of void-ification.","This was the level of materialization!","And materialization was a level that only Domainians could reach.","The ability to freely switch between reality and illusion was a characteristic of Domainians.","This was because a Domainian didn’t exist in the first place. The ability to transform illusory power into real power was something that Domainians possessed.","The ability to break through the barrier between reality and illusion and break laws was enough to shock everyone.","“He can attack the laws. If I were to be punched by him, what would happen?”","Many people thought of a terrifying point. If Chu Yunfan attacked, even if he didn’t kill them, he could easily shatter the laws in their bodies and turn them into cripples. Without the laws condensed in their bodies, their cultivation would probably plummet to an astonishing degree.","Just like Boljijin Shaq, their aura would weaken in an instant.","Because the laws in one’s body would be shattered by Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“Too weak! ”","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at Boljijin Shaq. He stepped into the sky and stomped down.","Boom!","This step pierced through the sky and landed heavily on Boljijin Shaq’s body.","Boljijin Shaq fell to the ground. Before he could react, he saw a big foot stomping him into the ground.","Chu Yunfan stomped on the ground and created a huge pit with a radius of hundreds of meters.","Boljijin Shaq, who was under Chu Yunfan’s foot, had clearly been trampled to death.","“How terrifying. Is this the strength of the legendary number one person in the world?” someone said in shock.","If there were people who were not convinced by Chu Yunfan’s strength, then after this incident, they would not dare to be convinced. It was because Chu Yunfan was too strong. Boljijin Shaq had condensed at least 800 laws, and his cultivation had reached the peak. Ordinary Divine Treasures could not even withstand a punch from Boljijin Shaq, but now, he could not withstand a punch from Chu Yunfan.","“What level has his strength reached? Has he really reached the stage where he is invincible?”","“Impossible. I don’t believe it. Even if he has 1,000 laws, it’s impossible for him to have such a crushing advantage!’","“Invincible! Nobody can stop him!”","Many people were discussing animatedly. However, the faces of many experts of the other races had turned ugly. After all, no matter how they looked at it, it was undoubtedly not a good thing for the humans to have such an expert.","After Chu Yunfan killed Boljijin Shaq, he absorbed the latter’s flesh and blood into his Disaster Star Eyes.","At this point, he was no longer afraid. With his current cultivation, when he left the ancient battlefield, he would definitely have constructed a domain that belonged to him. He would be a top-notch existence in the world.","At that time, there was nothing to be afraid of even if he faced the Destiny Sect.","Even if he exposed his identity and let the Destiny Sect know, so what?","Could they do anything to him?","Jun Tianci had tried to kill him once, and now that he had defeated Jun Tianci and stolen his Disaster Star Eyes, it was payback for payback.","After absorbing Boljijin Shaq’s flesh and blood, Chu Yunfan felt that his Disaster Star Eyes had become even stronger.","Chu Yunfan finally understood why Jun Tianci would keep killing those Kings.","If he wanted the Disaster Star Eye to grow quickly, other than studying it, the fastest way was to kill these special physique possessors and use their flesh and blood.","Chu Yunfan was only one of Jun Tianci’s targets.","However, for Chu Yunfan, this was just a means for him to advance.","However, Boljijin Shaq’s horse was not killed by Chu Yunfan. Instead, it was controlled by him and sealed into the Mountain River Diagram.","Chu Yunfan still had a use for it.","“Anyone else? Come out and fight,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“Is he really going to challenge the heroes of the world?”","“There are so many experts in the world. There are definitely more than one or two of them. Can he really defeat all of them?”","“l seem to be witnessing the birth of an incredible existence!”","In the midst of everyone’s shock, only the experts from the Destiny Sect had cold expressions. If the Destiny Sect had only suspected that Chu Yunfan was very likely Jian Wuchen and that he had killed Jun Tianci and the other two Supreme Youths of the Destiny Sect, then it would have been impossible.","Now, it was almost certain that Chu Yunfan was Jian Wuchen. There was no other possibility. Chu Yunfan’s Disaster Star Eyes must have been stolen from Jun Tianci.","Without a doubt, this was a slap to the face of the Destiny Sect, and they had no choice.","The man in front of them was too strong. He was so strong that even if they swarmed up together, they had no chance of winning.","At this moment, a dark cloud rolled over from the distant sky. A group of figures then appeared in front of everyone.","Each of these people was as muscular as a small giant. Their muscles bulged and they wore barbarian clothes, but they looked like they could break through an army.","“Southern Barbarians?” Chu Yunfan looked at this group of people. There was no doubt that these people were dressed and looked like the legendary Southern Barbarians.","Like the Hus in the north, the Southern Barbarians were originally humans. Later, for various reasons, they were either abducted or moved south into the Shiwan Mountains in the south, worshipping the evil gods in the Shiwan Mountains.","From then on, they no longer regarded themselves as humans and formed a brand new race, the Southern Barbarians.","Ever since then, the Southern Barbarians would go up north to seize the pass. The threat they posed to Grand Xia was not any less than that of the Hus in the north.","It was another extremely powerful race. However, unlike the Northern Hus, which was divided into four royal clans and five major factions along with","Shamanism, the Southern Barbarians were divided into seventy-two tribes. Each tribe was an extremely powerful faction.","Other than the seventy-two tribes, there were countless other tribes that formed the powerful Barbarian race.."]},{"number":2283,"title":"Chapter 2283: Overestimating Themselves and Underestimating Chu Yunfan","paragraphs":["Chapter 2283: Overestimating Themselves and Underestimating Chu Yunfan","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The arrival of these Southern Barbarians instantly raised the animosity of the people present. Although they were in the ancient battlefield, the hatred between the races did not decrease because of this. Instead, it increased because of various conflicts of interest.","Because of the population problem, the Southern Barbarians would capture and abduct children in the southern border all year round, then brainwash them into a new generation of barbarians. They would also use these brainwashed barbarians as cannon fodder to continuously attack the defense line of Grand Xia.","It could be said that this was a problem that gave Grand Xia a headache. Many people did not have a good impression of these Southern Barbarians.","Although they were humans, they believed in the evil gods of the Shiwan Mountains. They did not treat themselves as a human at all. They were monsters and cultivated the evil techniques passed down by the evil gods.","“Chu Yunfan?”","A figure walked out from the crowd of Southern Barbarians. It was a tall young man with a rough face, wearing a fiery red animal skin. He was obviously the leader of these Southern Barbarians, so everyone followed behind him to protect him.","“That’s right, I’m Chu Yunfan. Which tribe are you from? Tell me your name! You have the right to let me know your names,” Chu Yunfan said slowly.","“Hahaha, what a joke. What an arrogant person!” The barbarian youth burst into laughter, his laughter shaking the entire sky. “l didn’t expect the so-called number one in the world to be this kind of trash. I’m disappointed. It’s good for me to tell you my name, so that you will who killed you when you go to hell!","“I’m the eighty-third young master of the Fire Cloud Tribe, Wei Yunlian!” The barbarian youth grinned, his face filled with malevolence.","Although Wei Yunlian looked like a resident of the Central Plains, he was omnous1Y a monster.","It proved that his ancestors were once from the Central Plains. There were many such people among the Southern Barbarians, so it was not strange,","“Wei Yunliao? Interesting!” Chu Yunfan grinned as he looked at the young man and the people he had brought.","These people were clearly the best of the best in the Fire Cloud Tribe of the","Southern Barbarians. Any one of them was a Divine Treasure, especially Wei","Yunliao. His cultivation was even more terrifying. He was much stronger than Boljijin Shaq, who Chu Yunfan had just killed. He had already condensed more than nine hundred laws.","Although it was well hidden, it obviously couldn’t hide from Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","Such strength was indeed enough to run amok among his peers. No wonder he didn’t put Chu Yunfan in his eyes.","Put aside whether Chu Yunfan had cultivated 1,000 laws as rumored.","Even if Chu Yunfan cultivated 1,000 laws, Wei Yunliao 900 laws might not be too bad.","If it were Chu Yunfan himself, he might also have the intention to compete.","“Since you want to die, come at me together. There’s no need to waste time,” Chu Yunfan said nonchalantly.","“Such arrogance! You are the most arrogant Central Plainsman I have ever met!” Wei Yunliao said with a sinister smile.","As for Chu Yunfan’s so-called number one title in the world, of course, he didn’t care about it. As the saying goes, only when there is no hero can a boy become famous. In his eyes, he was a hero, and Chu Yunfan was just a boy.","As for the claim that Chu Yunfan had cultivated 1,000 laws, he did not believe it at all. With his talent, coupled with the support of the Southern Barbarians Fire Cloud Tribe at all costs, and with the help of the domain he had comprehended in the ancient battlefield, he had broken through his limit and slowly approached the legendary limit of 1,000 laws.","How could Chu Yunfan be so far ahead of them? This was just a rumor spread by someone with ulterior motives.","But even if it was just a rumor, he didn’t care because he only wanted Chu Yunfan’s head. As long as he had Chu Yunfan’s head, he could use that sum of money to exchange for a huge reward.","Even top-notch cultivators needed enough money and resources to cultivate.","“Arrogant? I’m just telling the truth. When did telling the truth become arrogant?” Chu Yunfan said flatly.","“Kill him!” Wei Yunliao roared.","The Divine Treasures from the Fire Cloud Tribe attacked. These Divine","Treasures either came from the battlefield of the prodigies like Wei Yunliao,","or they were the cream of the crop.","Each of them was an expert of the Divine Treasure Stage, but it was obvious that they were not comparable to experts of the same level.","Boom!","These experts burst out with astonishing auras and rushed toward Chu","Yunfan like a tsunami.","In front of this terrifying aura, Chu Yunfan was like a small boat that could be destroyed at any time in front of this monstrous wave.","Many people widened their eyes, not knowing if these Southern Barbarians could touch Chu Yunfan’s bottom line. There was no doubt that although Chu Yunfan had displayed amazing strength and easily killed the Green Flood Dragon and Boljijin Shaq, it was not his true strength.","To put it simply, the previous two experts did not even have the ability to make Chu Yunfan use his full strength.","Now, many people had raised Chu Yunfan’s importance to an astonishing level.","They even silently regarded Chu Yunfan as a great enemy. Now, they wanted to see what Chu Yunfan’s bottom line was.","However, the Southern Barbarians had overestimated themselves and underestimated Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan moved. The blood in his body surged, forming a terrifying blood tide that spread in all directions. He was not at a disadvantage in the confrontation with these Southern Barbarians.","Rumble!","All kinds of attacks rained down on Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan, on the other hand, was not flustered. He closed his eyes and opened them. Endless power of disaster spread out from them and wrapped him up.","In an instant, all the attacks missed. With the help of the power of disaster, Chu Yunfan seemed to be in another space.","These attacks could not break the boundary between illusion and reality. They could not hurt him.","From afar, Chu Yunfan’s body was slowly enveloped by golden light, like a god cast in gold.","Even those Southern Barbarians could not do anything to him. Chu Yunfan’s aura had transformed from a small boat to a huge steel warship. Even if there were stormy waves, they could not do anything to a steel warship.","Boom!","Chu Yunfan clenched his fist and punched out. In an instant, it shattered everything and landed on the bodies of these Southern Barbarians.","These Southern Barbarians spat out blood and exploded into clouds of blood mist in the air.."]},{"number":2284,"title":"Chapter 2284: Coming Prepared","paragraphs":["Chapter 2284: Coming Prepared","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","The entire team was wiped out!","Chu Yunfan easily wiped out a group of experts from the Fire Cloud Tribe of the Southern Barbarians with lightning speed.","After Wei Yunliao’s tragic death, the experts from the Fire Cloud Tribe he brought with him were unable to withstand Chu Yunfan’s punch.","“The number one Supreme Youth in the world is indeed extraordinary!’ Someone sighed. After seeing it today, he finally understood what it meant to be the number one in the world.","“No wonder he could become the number one in the world among so many Supreme Youths! ”","“His strength is probably extraordinary. He has truly reached the peak of the Divine Treasure Stage!’","Many people exclaimed in shock. Such brutal combat strength had frightened many people. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength was too brutal. He had easily killed Wei Yunliao, a genius whose name shook an era.","The title of number one in the world was well-deserved.","“Number one in the world? I don’t think so. It might be true that he was the number one in the world before, but it’s different now. 1 heard that there’s already a Supreme Youth who has also cultivated 1,000 laws. He’s no longer the most unique one.”","“A thousand laws? Could it really be possible to reach the limit of 1,000 laws?” someone exclaimed.","Many people had already doubted that Chu Yunfan had cultivated 1,000 laws.","One had to know that many experts who had just entered the Domain Stage had only cultivated 1,000 laws.","One could imagine how difficult it was to break through to 1,000 laws in the Divine Treasure Stage.","In fact, there had never been such a precedent since ancient times. Perhaps the emperors of ancient times had reached this level before, but that was something that happened in ancient times.","It had been many years since the ancient era, and no one knew what it was like back then.","Even if Chu Yunfan could achieve it, many people thought that there was a special reason. Normally, no one should not be able to achieve it. Who would have thought that other than Chu Yunfan, there were other Supreme Youths who had also cultivated 1,000 laws?","However, this information should still be considered top- secret information, and no one knew about it.","However, if Chu Yunfan was no longer a unique existence, then many people’s fear and respect for him would decrease. At least, they would not be as eager to kill him as before.","Those who were half a step ahead were geniuses, and those who were one step ahead were lunatics.","Obviously, Chu Yunfan was only half a step ahead in the eyes of many people, not one step ahead. This way, Chu Yunfan’s danger level was rapidly reduced.","However, no matter what, Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength was still not something that most people could compare to. Even among the Supreme Youths, only the legendary expert who had broken through 1,000 laws could compare to him.","After Chu Yunfan killed Wei Yunliao and saw that no one was coming, he sneered and sat down cross-legged. He began to cultivate in front of everyone as if he didn’t care about the heroes of the world who were coming here.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan was like a monster god in everyone’s eyes. His cultivation was unfathomable, and no one dared to disturb him. Many people even retreated hundreds of miles from where they were originally standing.","The scene of Chu Yunfan washing and roasting the Green Flood Dragon was still vivid in their minds. They couldn’t help but be afraid, especially those of the monster race. They looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was a plague.","Killing people was one thing, but eating them without saying a word was really a little too much!","After waiting for a long time, no one came again. Many people could not help but have some doubts.","“No other Supreme Youths have appeared. They must have been frightened by","Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength. Even an expert like Wei Yunliao was killed so easily. Chu Yunfan’s combat strength is a little too much!”","Just when everyone thought that the Supreme Youths had received the news and were frightened by Chu Yunfan’s brutal performance, they were shocked.","More and more news came, making everyone realize that this was just the beginning. It was far from the end that many people thought.","On the ancient battlefield, a mysterious expert stepped forward to stop the Flying Celestials’ reinforcements.","Among them, there was a Supreme Youth who made a move and fought with Huangfu Longhao. It was difficult to determine the victor.","Even Chu Hongcai was being watched and intercepted.","Other than that, someone saw the golden roc fighting with a powerful mutated beast. It was at the Supreme Youth level, not the slightest bit weaker than the golden roc.","On the other side, the successor of Serene Immortal Mountain, Tang Siyu, was also stopped by a female supreme martial artist.","“Wow, what a big deal!” Someone gasped.","Even the most foolish person could see that this was clearly aimed at Chu Yunfan. In order to stop Huangfu Longhao, Chu Hongcai, the golden roc, and Tang Siyu, at least four Supreme Youths had been mobilized.","Furthermore, there were other top-notch prodigies who might be able to fight against the Domainians of the Flying Celestials in the ancient battlefield.","Such a lineup would be enough to shock the ten great sects in the Central Plains, and now it was just to stop Chu Yunfan’s reinforcements.","Obviously, the person behind the scenes would not let this matter rest and would attack Chu Yunfan.","Before, Chu Yunfan was as slippery as a loach, and many people could not do anything to him. However, now that he had appeared, it was a great opportunity for many people to kill him. Obviously, this was just the beginning.","They came prepared!","Both sides had come prepared!","In an instant, this thought appeared in everyone’s mind. There was no doubt that both Chu Yunfan’s sudden appearance and the forces that killed him were prepared.","If Chu Yunfan hadn’t been prepared, he definitely wouldn’t have come out to die so rashly.","If the forces that killed Chu Yunfan had not been prepared, they would not have been able to block all of Chu Yunfan’s possible reinforcements so accurately.","Both sides had come prepared. It was only to see who had more trump cards.","Many people looked at the figure sitting cross-legged in the sky.","They wondered what kind of trump card Chu Yunfan had that he had the confidence to face the incoming storm.","Not long after, a streak of light swept over from the distance. A person stepped on a monstrous wave and appeared in front of everyone.","Everyone saw that it was a marine folk wearing a golden robe. He held a trident in his hand and stepped on the surging waves. From afar, he looked like a sea god.","“What a terrifying aura!”","Due to the close distance, many of the Divine Treasures present instinctively retreated to avoid the momentum that swept down like a tidal wave.."]},{"number":2285,"title":"Chapter 2285: 1,000 Laws?","paragraphs":["Chapter 2285: 1,000 Laws?","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Even though they were all Divine Treasures, they would not be able to contend against an expert of this level.","“He’s even stronger than Wei Yunliao. Has he’s already cultivated a thousand laws?” someone exclaimed.","Just now, someone had said that among the Supreme Youths, there were people who had cultivated 1,000 laws. Even when facing Chu Yunfan, they were equally matched and did not fall into a disadvantage. Now, it seemed that this Supreme Youth of the marine folks was very likely that person.","They sensed the aura of perfection from this Supreme Youth of the marine folks. Without a doubt, he had cultivated 1,000 laws and reached perfection.","“l know him. He’s a prince of the marine folks, the Sea Saint. It’s said that he was originally qualified to inherit the throne of the marine folks. Among his peers, there was no one who could stand shoulder to shoulder with him. However, he chose to seal himself!”","Someone slowly told everyone the origin of this Supreme Youth of the marine folks. His expression was extremely solemn. Clearly, his era was closer to this Supreme Youth of the marine folks. He had heard about this Supreme Youth of the marine folks before.","“He’s too strong. Almost no one in his generation can steal his limelight. Even in the Prodigy Battlefield, he’s an invincible existence. If it’s him, it’s not impossible for him to cultivate 1,000 laws!”","“That’s right. The laws on his body give people the feeling that they’re too perfect. If he’s already perfect, I don’t think it’s impossible!”","“He’s too strong. He’s even more terrifying than Chu Yunfan!”","“Chu Yunfan?” The Supreme Youth of the marine race glanced at Chu Yunfan and smiled sinisterly. “l heard that you are very special!”","When Chu Yunfan heard this, he slowly opened his eyes and looked at the Supreme Youth of the marine folks, the Sea Saint.","“But if you are considered special, then I’m very special!” The Sea Saint coldly glanced at Chu Yunfan. “Now I know why you’re so arrogant. It’s because 1,000 laws are indeed extraordinary. Ordinary Divine Treasures are no match for you at all. Even a Supreme Youth in the Divine Treasure Stage can’t withstand a single blow from you. You do have the capital to do so!”","The Supreme Youth of the marine folks seemed to have confirmed something.","“However, if you think that you can be unparalleled in the world just by relying on this, then you are gravely mistaken. What you can do, I can do too.","What you can’t do, I can do even more!”","“A thousand laws?” Chu Yunfan said slowly as he observed the Sea Saint.","He could almost feel the explosive power in the Sea Saint’s body as if it was going to flip the sky over.","It was as if there was a universe brewing inside, waiting for the moment of the big bang to completely release the terrifying power.","He had felt this way before. When he broke through from 999 laws to 1,000 laws, he had felt this way.","It was as if a huge universe was about to be created and released from his body.","That kind of powerful force that seemed to be the creation of the universe made him almost invincible. Even when facing experts of the same level, he was fearless.","Even a Supreme Youth of the same level was no different from an ordinary Divine Treasure to him.","“That’s right. I’ve also cultivated 1,000 laws. In this world, you’re not the only one who’s special. I’m especially special!” the Sea Saint said confidently.","The Sea Saint was completely confident that he would be able to prove his Dao and become a monarch in the future. He might even become a god that the other monarchs desired but could not become. It was with this thought in mind that he chose to seal himself and come to this era—an era where his talent could be completely released. Even among the many Supreme Youths of the same generation, he was the most tyrannical existence. He did not have any enemies on the prodigy battlefield. He was an invincible existence.","“So you are the trump card he prepared?” Chu Yunfan said after studying the Sea Saint for some time. “You alone can’t deal with me! You’d better wait a little longer!’","“What did you say?” The Sea Saint glared at Chu Yunfan. It was obvious that","Chu Yunfan looked down on him and thought that he couldn’t deal with him alone, so he had to ask for help from others.","“Then what if I’m included?”","At this moment, in the sky, it was as if a large cloud had swept over from afar. In an instant, it arrived beside the two of them.","At this moment, Chu Yunfan finally saw what it was. It was a huge monster that was more than ten thousand meters long.","Chu Yunfan could even feel that this was not the limit of his body. He had already used his divine power and magic power to suppress the size of his body.","It was a huge deep-sea beast. Its entire body was black, and its face was extremely ugly. It had a green face and sharp fangs, and its body was covered in faint black scales.","It looked like a dragon in the deep sea.","“It’s a Sea Dragon!” Chu Yunfan looked at the monster in front of him and could not help but feel a little surprised.","In the Alchemy Emperor’s memories, he had seen this kind of creature before. It was a kind of giant beast in the deep sea that once existed in the immemorial era, the overlord of the deep sea.","This creature was born to be the overlord of the sea. It could be said that the starting point of their birth was already the end point that most living beings could not reach in their lifetime.","This was an extremely terrifying beast!","The reason why it could attract Chu Yunfan!s attention was that Sea Dragons should have already gone extinct during the immemorial era. Even the","Alchemy Emperor only discovered a Sea Dragon that had survived by chance.","Only then did he confirm that the Sea Dragon in the immemorial myths and legends actually existed. However, ever since that Sea Dragon was killed by the emperors, he had never seen another Sea Dragon.","It was as if they had tacitly agreed that the Sea Dragons had already been destroyed.","Who would have thought that one would be seen here?","“You actually recognize my original body! ”","The Sea Dragon trembled, and his body actually turned into a ferocious beast that was only about 20 meters tall. Although he was still huge, compared to its earlier size , it was insignificant.","“Ever since I was born, you are the first human to recognize my race!”","The sea dragon stared at Chu Yunfan. He had dominated the world for so many years, but this was the first time someone had exposed his background. Even among the marine folks, which also dominated the deep sea, not many of them knew his background.","Most of this race had been destroyed during the immemorial era? It had been too long since then.."]},{"number":2286,"title":"Chapter 2286: I Want to See How Many People Are Coming to Die Today","paragraphs":["Chapter 2286: I Want to See How Many People Are Coming to Die Today","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In the immemorial era, there had been many ferocious and terrifying beasts. There were countless of them. It could be said that this was the era of beasts.","The Ten Ferocities were only the most terrifying ten among the many murderers. In fact, there were countless other terrifying ferocious beasts.","The Sea Dragons were the tyrants in the water at that time. They dominated an era when the marine folks did not exist.","However, ever since the end of the immemorial era, the ferocious beasts had either died or submitted to the later experts. The Sea Dragons were hunted down until they were almost extinct.","In the ancient times, one could still occasionally see Sea Dragons. However, after the end of the ancient times, no one knew about the existence of this race.","Even the experts of the marine folks would only think that he was some kind of powerful ferocious beast. After all, there were too many ferocious beasts in the sea. Although many of them were tamed by the marine folks, there were still many that were not under their control.","Among them, there were many powerful races that did not obey the control of the marine folks.","“What’s so strange about recognizing your original body? It’s not easy for your race to survive since the immemorial era. This is a sign from the heavens to cherish life. However, you don’t know how to cherish it and have come out to die!” Chu Yunfan said to the Sea Dragon before him.","The threat brought by the Sea Dragon could scare others, but it could not scare him.","“Human, you are very arrogant!”","The Sea Dragon looked at Chu Yunfan and opened its bloody mouth.","However, the killing intent on his body was almost tangible. The terrifying might of a ferocious beast filled the entire space. The space around him was actually like the surface of water, trembling violently.","Just his aura alone was enough to cause the surrounding space to tremble violently. One could imagine how earth- shattering his might would be once he attacked.","“This fierce beast has probably already condensed 1,000 laws!”","Some people were shocked. The aura of this Sea Dragon was clearly above Boljijin Shaqs, and the aura of perfection was exactly the same.","Clearly, the Sea Dragon had already condensed 1,000 laws!","Everyone was a little numb. It was rare to see geniuses who could condense 1,000 laws. Now, two of them had appeared.","It was as if everything was worthless!","“Arrogant? I don’t think so!” Chu Yunfan said lightly, “Just the two of you are far from enough. I want to see how many more people will come to die today!”","“Very well, Chu Yunfan!” The Sea Saint smiled coldly and looked at Chu Yunfan as if he was looking at a dead man.","His eyes were filled with incomparable pride. To him, the enemy was meaningless. Even if it was rumored that Chu Yunfan had cultivated 1,000 laws, he was absolutely confident that he could defeat Chu Yunfan. In the same level, the Sea Saint was an invincible existence.","He was completely fearless!","However, the Sea Saint was not in a hurry to make a move because he knew that he was not the only one who had come this time. There were many people who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, and there were even human forces among them. Internal strife was not new.","He didn’t want to become a knife in someone else’s hand. When the time came, he would fight with Chu Yunfan and both sides suffered.","After all, there were many people who wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","There were probably quite a few of them. He naturally could not let others benefit!","The Sea Dragon had the same thought. He was inferior to the Sea Saint. His race had been destroyed countless years ago. There was not even a single force that he could rely on.","Once he was targeted, he could only rely on himself.","Suddenly, a fierce roar came from afar. Then, everyone turned their heads and looked in the direction of the roar. They saw a mountain-like monster rushing toward Chu Yunfan at an astonishing speed that was completely different from its original body. It was like a comet hitting the ground.","Everyone looked at the mountain-like behemoth in shock. In the process of running, it even smashed into a huge crack in space. It looked extremely ferocious, like a wound in the sky. It looked extremely terrifying.","“Roar!”","After a loud roar, everyone finally saw what this huge creature was. It was a Golden Divine Hou that was completely cast from gold. It looked like a golden demon god.","“It’s a Golden Divine Hou!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the Golden Divine Hou in front of him and felt a little surprised. This race was famous in ancient times. Among the many demon races, it was a very powerful race. There was once an emperor-level Golden Divine Hou among their ancestors, but he was later killed.","The reason why Chu Yunfan knew so much was that the emperor-level Golden Divine Hou had died at the Emperor Supreme’s hands. He had been killed by the Emperor Supreme while it was invading the human’s territory.","The Emperor Supreme was just so ferocious. In terms of combat strength, it could basically be said that he could easily defeat the Alchemy Emperors.","Alchemy Emperors weren’t known for their combat strength. However, the Emperor Supreme was different. His combat strength was earth- shattering and invincible, It wasn’t difficult for him to fight against several Emperors of the same level.","Back then, he was the number one person among the many emperors in the world.","However, even though they had lost an emperor level Golden Divine Hou, this race was still a member of the demon’s royal family. Because they had once produced an emperor level expert, this race was able to firmly become a member of the royal family.","In Grand Xia’s previous battles with the monsters, the Golden Divine Hou had always appeared. Although there weren’t many of them, they could always turn the tides of the battle.","The arrival of the Golden Divine Hou lit up the battlefield. It seemed that the other two understood that this was their last reinforcement. The three Supreme Youths had joined forces to attack Chu Yunfan.","Even if Chu Yunfan had wings, it would be difficult for him to escape.","Although Chu Yunfan was infamous for killing two Supreme Youths and a group of top-notch geniuses, they were still nothing to them.","If it were them, they could also do it because they had also cultivated 1,000 laws!","Boom!","In an instant, the auras of the three people exploded, locking Chu Yunfan firmly. The three of them stood in a corner, not letting Chu Yunfan escape.","Chu Yunfan looked on coldly. First, it was a Northern Hu, then a Southern Barbarian, then a marine folk and a ferocious sea beast, and then a demon from the western demon region. It could be said that other than the humans, the other tribes had sent their top Supreme Youths to surround and kill Chu","Yunfan.."]},{"number":2287,"title":"Chapter 2287: Coping With It","paragraphs":["Chapter 2287: Coping With It","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","And didn’t the human forces target Chu Yunfan?","Chu Yunfan knew that there were still some. At the very least, the Destiny Sect would not let this matter go so easily. It was just that they would not show themselves easily.","After all, it would not be nice to say that they had joined forces with other races to deal with the prodigies of their own race!","However, looking at this lineup, there was no need for the others to make a move again!","Three Supreme Youths who had already cultivated 1,000 laws attacked. Who was a match for them?","The Golden Divine Hou roared and took the lead in launching an attack. It moved swiftly, causing the sky to tremble violently.","Under the terrifying attack, the sky seemed to be torn apart by some force.","In that instant, everything seemed to be drowned by the golden light.","In a thousandth of a second, it arrived before Chu Yunfan.","“Roar!”","The terrifying roar was accompanied by a terrifying tide that almost tore Chu Yunfan apart.","A flame and wind swept out in an instant. Just this wind alone was enough to blow a top-notch expert’s bones and flesh into pieces.","The Golden Divine Hou r s attack had surpassed the limits of the Divine Treasure Stage. It was just like how Chu Yunfan had easily killed the seven Supreme Youths when he attacked.","There was almost no difference!","Boom!","These terrifying attacks kept tearing at Chu Yunfan’s body, trying to rip him apart, but they were unable to break through Chu Yunfan’s defense.","A look of disbelief flashed across the eyes of the Golden Divine Hou as if it had seen a ghost.","Although he didn’t use any divine power, he used his own laws. In terms of power, it should be stronger.","Who knew that Chu Yunfan would not move, allowing the Golden Divine Hows laws to wreak havoc on his body, but the laws on his body could not do anything to Chu Yunfan.","“Annihilate Heaven and Earth!”","The Golden Divine Hou roared and opened its bloody mouth. Then, it spat out endless flames that instantly drowned Chu Yunfan.","Everyone saw the flames burn a massive hole in the world. Even though this was the ancient battlefield, it was far more fragile than the world of the Central Plains.","However, this kind of power was enough to make many people feel shocked.","However, in the next second, everyone saw that the flames that filled the sky disappeared without a trace. Some sharp-eyed people saw that the flames didn’t disappear into thin air. On the contrary, they were absorbed by every pore on Chu Yunfan!s body. In an instant, they were digested.","Not only was Chu Yunfan not injured by such an attack, but he had even become stronger because of it.","“What kind of physique does he have? Why can’t even the flames spat out by a Golden Divine Hou do anything to him?” Someone gasped.","Although theoretically speaking, flames were a type of energy, no different from spirit energy, this was only a theoretical statement. In reality, it could not be seen in this way.","Although flames were energy, they were many times more violent than spirit energy.","Humans could absorb spirit energy to cultivate, but it was impossible to cultivate flames, let alone the Divine Fire cultivated by the Golden Divine Hou. It was an extremely special Divine Fire, and each Divine Fire had unimaginable power.","Unless one had a physique that was especially close to fire, it was possible!","Countless physiques like this had appeared since ancient times, but no one knew which one Chu Yunfan belonged to.","“At the very least, he has an emperor physique. Otherwise, he wouldn’t have such power! ”","Someone raised his opinion.","“Who is this Chu Yunfan? Why hasn’t anyone figured out what kind of physique he has? He seems to be able to control fire and lightning. He’s also a top genius in the sword!”","Over the past year, as Chu Yunfan’s reputation became more and more famous, more and more information about him became available. Everyone knew a little about him, but from the surface information, they could not tell what Chu Yunfan’s background was. He was so terrifying.","Suddenly, just as everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan reached out and grabbed the Golden Divine Hou that was like a small mountain.","The Golden Divine Hou r s attack failed. It roared angrily and clawed at Chu Yunfan with its huge claws.","Just that sharp claw alone was much bigger than Chu Yunfan’s body.","Chu Yunfan only stretched out one finger.","Stab!","The finger was like a diamond, easily poking a bloody hole in the sharp claw.","The Golden Divine Hou was in pain and kept retreating. There was a look of horror in his eyes. The power of Chu Yunfan’s finger was terrifying. With the power of his palm, it could be said that even a heavenly treasure as hard as a rock could be easily cut apart.","But now, Chu Yunfan had easily poked a bloody hole in the Golden Divine Hou.","One could imagine how powerful Chu Yunfan’s attack was.","Suddenly, the attacks of the other two arrived. The Sea Saint and the Sea Dragon waved their hands and created a huge wave that was hundreds of meters tall. In an instant, they wanted to tear everything apart.","This water was not ordinary water. Any drop of it was heavier than an entire lake. The power of this surging wave could be imagined.","Boom!","In the next moment, the terrifying waves drowned Chu Yunfan. The entire ground shook violently as if it had been hit by a comet.","Even the Golden Divine Hou couldn’t help but retreat frantically, its eyes flickering with a terrifying killing intent.","Whether it was the Sea Saint or the Sea Dragon, they both wanted to kill Chu Yunfan.","Even if he was hit by that attack, he would probably be severely injured.","Just the weight of the raging waves was enough to crush him.","Although the three of them had joined forces to deal with Chu Yunfan, it did not mean that they were on the same side. On the contrary, they were not on the same side. They wanted to eliminate each other.","Just like how he was trying of get rid of Chu Yunfan.","However, in the next moment, before the Divine Golden Hou could think about it, he saw a large hand grab out from the shocking waves and rush toward him.","The Golden Divine Hou was both shocked and furious. It retreated repeatedly, trying to send the hand flying. However, it realized that it was impossible. It was actually caught in the hand.."]},{"number":2288,"title":"Chapter 2288: Beating up Three Great Supreme Youths","paragraphs":["Chapter 2288: Beating up Three Great Supreme Youths","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This huge hand was terrifying. It grabbed the Golden Divine Hou easily. The Golden Divine Hou roared repeatedly. The flame law on his body kept flickering with a terrifying light. His body even turned into elements in an instant, turning into a ball of flames.","Flames had no form, so it was impossible for people to catch them.","This was the ultimate technique he had always used to save his life.","Who knew that such an ultimate technique would be useless against Chu Yunfan’s big hand?","Chu Yunfan’s big hand seemed to be able to break through the boundary between illusion and reality, and it caught the fire element body that was about to scatter.","“What kind of method is this?” The Golden Divine Hou looked as if it had seen a ghost, and alarm bells rang in his head","However, in the next moment, he was caught by Chu Yunfan and could not fight back.","The light of his 1,000 laws flickered crazily. It was as if the chaos of heaven and earth was surging around him, but no matter what, it could not break through Chu Yunfan’s big hand.","Boom!","In the next moment, the Golden Divine Hou was slammed to the ground. The entire ground shook violently, and a huge crack that was dozens of kilometers long suddenly appeared before everyone.","At the bottom of the crack was the Golden Divine Hou that had been thrown to the ground.","The Golden Divine Hou roared in pain. It struggled continuously to tear open the huge crack, which grew bigger and bigger.","However, he was unable to break free from that huge hand.","Chu Yunfan was high and mighty, like a god. He pressed down on the Golden Divine Hou with one hand.","This shocking combat strength immediately frightened many people as if they had seen a ghost.","“This is... How is this possible?” someone, wide-eyed, said in disbelief..","“Even if Chu Yunfan has cultivated 1,000 laws, he should be on par with them!”","“Chu Yunfan only cultivated for a year earlier. What’s the difference?”","“This is too far off. The Golden Divine Hou is completely restrained!”","At the same time, the Sea Saint and the Sea Dragon arrived before Chu Yunfan. It wasn’t that they didn’t see how the Golden Divine Hou was pinned to the ground by Chu Yunfan with one hand.","But the time was too short. With their speed, they had already reached Chu Yunfan.","Before they could react or retreat, they were already facing Chu Yunfan.","“Let’s go all out. I don’t believe that he has the ability to fight us while suppressing the Golden Divine Hou!”","At the crucial moment, both of them chose to fight.","After all, the two of them were top-notch Supreme Youths. Although they had borrowed the domain left behind by a Domainian, being able to cultivate 1,000 laws before the other Supreme Youths was already enough to prove how impressive they were,","They were the cream of the crop among the cream of the crop. Any one of them was destined to shine for an entire era.","How could they be willing to retreat?","The Sea Saint brandished the trident in his hand, and the entire world was torn apart. In an instant, it turned into a blue light of creation that smashed fiercely toward Chu Yunfan.","On the other side, the Sea Dragon kept roaring, and countless torrents turned into huge cannonballs that kept bombarding Chu Yunfan.","These torrents were not ordinary water currents, but real water laws. These water laws continuously erupted with earth-shattering power.","Any one of them was as powerful as a nuclear explosion and could flatten a city.","Rumble!","Countless attacks turned the world into chaos and exploded around Chu Yunfan.","This chaos only lasted for a while. Another huge hand broke through the chaos and grabbed at the Sea Dragon.","The Sea Dragon instantly felt as if the entire world was collapsing toward him.","He finally understood why the Golden Divine Hou looked so weak when facing Chu Yunfan.","In fact, it was so weak that it was easily caught by Chu Yunfan.","It wasn’t that the Golden Divine Hou was too weak. The Golden Divine Hou r s strength wasn’t any weaker than his. However, Chu Yunfan was too abnormal. Chu Yunfan suppressed the Golden Divine Hou forcefully.","Yes, it was a complete suppression!","Chu Yunfan didn’t even need to use any law power. He simply relied on his strength to suppress them.","It was laughable that they had thought that the three of them would be more than enough to deal with Chu Yunfan. Even though Chu Yunfan had already killed seven Supreme Youths by himself, they still did not take him seriously.","Those people did not know that Chu Yunfan had already cultivated 1,000 laws, so they suffered a huge loss at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","However, they had also cultivated 1,000 laws, so they thought they would not be at a disadvantage when facing Chu Yunfan.","But now, they finally understood how ridiculous this idea was.","Chu Yunfan was too strong. He was so strong that he could easily defeat them.","However, they didn’t understand why Chu Yunfan, who had also cultivated 1,000 laws, had become so terrifying. When they faced him, they were simply crushed.","They were in the same level, but there was such a huge difference in their combat strength. It was similar to the feeling they had when they faced ordinary Divine Treasures or even those who had cultivated to the Divine Treasure Stage by top-notch prodigies.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t give them much time to think. He grabbed them in an instant and pressed them into a mountain peak.","Boom!","The Sea Dragon crashed into the mountain peak, turning the peak into dust that danced in the wind.","Immediately after, a huge crack appeared on the ground. The Sea Dragon was also pinned to the ground by Chu Yunfan. All of this happened easily, too easily.","The only one left was the Sea Saint.","The Sea Saint’s trident was still slashing at Chu Yunfan, but it was as if it had struck a piece of metal. Not only did it fail to break through Chu Yunfan!s defense, but it even produced a sound of metal clashing and sparks flying everywhere.","“What kind of physique is this?” The Sea Saint was dumbfounded. He had grown up in the deep sea. In the deep sea, even the ferocious beasts of the marine folks had extremely strong physiques, let alone the divine physiques of the marine folks.","However, he had never seen such a terrifying person who could receive his attacks with just their physical body.."]},{"number":2289,"title":"Chapter 2289: The Sea Saint Was Dead!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2289: The Sea Saint Was Dead!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This kind of physical strength was simply against the rules!","Even if Chu Yunfan hadn’t succeeded in cultivating a single law, he could still contend with these top-notch Supreme Youths with his astonishing physical body.","This was the legendary way of sanctifying the physical body. There was such a cultivation method in the legends, and it was the source of cultivation for so many ascetics in the world.","It was rumored that even if one did not comprehend heaven and earth or condense laws, one could treat oneself as a universe and a world to polish. In the end, one could walk a path of sanctification and form their own world.","However, that was only a legend. The Sea Saint had only heard of it. It was fine if he treated it as a myth. It was impossible for it to be true.","Looking at Chu Yunfan’s appearance now, he looked very much like an existence who had become a saint with his body.","Of course, the Sea Saint didn’t know if Chu Yunfan had taken that path. However, Chu Yunfan’s physical body was something he had never seen before.","His physique was very impressive among the marine folks. He was not at a disadvantage when he fought against those huge ferocious beasts in the sea, but it was impossible for him to cultivate to this level.","This was a foul level of power.","Of course, Chu Yunfan didn’t know that the Sea Saint had thought of so many things in an instant. After easily holding down a Supreme Youth with one hand, he could finally free up his hands to deal with the Sea Saint.","“Are you surprised? Why can’t you, who have also cultivated to 1,000 laws, defeat me?” Chu Yunfan grinned.","“That’s right. With our aptitude, we also have 1,000 laws. Even if we’re slightly weaker than you, it’s impossible for the difference to be so shocking!”","The Sea Saint was furious, but he wasn’t stupid. He kept retreating, trying to avoid Chu Yunfan’s attack.","“A dead person doesn’t need to know so much!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","The Sea Saint was almost angered to death by Chu Yunfan. He thought that Chu Yunfan would give him an explanation, but who knew that Chu Yunfan wouldn’t explain anything.","There were two kinds of people who were the most hateful in the world. The first kind was those who said half of their words and left them half-true.","It was simply forcing one to die of curiosity.","“Do you think you can escape?” Chu Yunfan’s body swayed slightly, and in the next moment, he caught up with the Sea Saint.","Although the Sea Saint was very fast, the law he grasped was the law of water. His speed wasn’t slow, but it wasn’t top-notch either. In front of Chu Yunfan’s law of lightning, competing in speed was like showing off one’s skills in front of an expert.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan had already blocked the Sea Saint’s escape route.","“Since I can’t escape, I’ll fight you to the death. I don’t believe that you’ve already surpassed our level!”","The Sea Saint roared, and the space around him twisted violently like a gust of wind blowing through the water. Then, in the next moment, he rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, he shattered the heavens and the earth. It was as if a huge star had crashed over with the power to destroy the heavens and the earth.","The trident in his hand was like a long dragon, aiming straight for Chu Yunfan’s face.","Chu Yunfan’s expression remained the same. He clenched his fist and threw a punch.","Boom!","This punch swept across the sky, bringing with it a shocking light like a comet. It was the light of the thunder law. It shattered the long dragon that was heading straight for his face. In the next moment, it had already swept in front of the Sea Saint.","Bam!","The Sea Saint grunted and he flew backward like a broken kite. He landed on the ground and tore a huge crack in the ground.","The entire ground was riddled with holes.","In the distance, countless people were dumbstruck. They were scared to death by Chu Yunfan’s astonishing combat strength. This was probably the reason why the ancient battlefield existed.","Just the Divine Treasure Stage was already so terrifying. If those Domainians, who were much more terrifying than Divine Treasures, were to attack, the entire Central Plains would probably be shattered.","Just like the battle of the emperors back then, it had ended an era.","However, Chu Yunfan!s combat strength was terrifying. It far exceeded the strength that a Divine Treasure should have.","This was probably the most terrifying Divine Treasure they had ever seen.","Many of the people watching the battle from the periphery were top geniuses from various eras. They had witnessed all kinds of experts from various eras, and the Divine Treasures were naturally not a problem.","However, even they had to admit that Chu Yunfan was probably the most terrifying existence in the Divine Treasure Stage since ancient times.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was about to kill the Sea Saint, the members of the marine folks could no longer stand still. In this chaotic ancient battlefield, there were many marine folk experts. After many prodigies of the marine folks came here to train, more experts secretly came to the ancient battlefield.","It was all to secretly protect these peerless experts that were rare in a thousand years.","However, Chu Yunfan!s actions were too fast. He had already severely injured the Sea Saint at the critical moment.","At this moment, how could they hold it in? They appeared one after another and rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","Even though they weren’t on the same side as the Sea Saint, they stood up for the benefit of the marine folks.","After all, although the marine folks occupied the vast sea, they were still at a","disadvantage compared to humans. No invincible expert should die like this.","More than 20 top Divine Treasure marine folks rushed out, their auras soaring into the sky, trying to stop Chu Yunfan.","“Clowns. You overestimate yourself!” Chu Yunfan sneered and raised his hand high up.","In an instant, the originally clear sky was covered with dark clouds. Countless lightning dragons flickered within. These lightning dragons were not ordinary lightning dragons, but the thunder laws surged within them.","With Chu Yunfan’s original strength, it would have taken him some time to prepare for such a large-scale attack before he entered the Divine Treasure Stage. However, he had completed it in an instant.","As Chu Yunfan lowered his arm, countless lightning dragons rushed toward these Divine Treasures like bloodthirsty wolves.","How fast was the power of lightning?","The crowd saw that the marine folks were all hit in an instant. Their bodies exploded in the air. They could not even withstand Chu Yunfan’s casual attack","The entire team was wiped out!","It was just one move!","Under the light of the lightning, Chu Yunfan looked like a thunder god who was active in the world. His black hair fluttered in the wind and his gaze was cold.","In the next moment, Chu Yunfan turned his gaze to the Sea Saint, who was in the crack in the ground. Then, countless lightning dragons rushed into the crack.","In an instant, endless lightning covered everything.","The people in the distance were shocked. They could no longer sense the Sea","Saint’s aura.","The Sea Saint was dead!"]},{"number":2290,"title":"Chapter 2290: One Death, One Subjugation","paragraphs":["Chapter 2290: One Death, One Subjugation","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","This was the first time Chu Yunfan had truly displayed his astonishing strength in thunder divine powers.","It was the Ten Thousand Dragons Return to the Nest!","Back then, Chu Yunfan had used up a lot of energy to execute this move. It could be said that he had used up all his divine power to execute it. However, now, he could easily execute it anytime and anywhere. Its power was many times stronger than before.","He had killed the Sea Saint with a single blow.","Silence. Deathly silence!","Even everyone’s breathing hitched. It was an instinctive reaction as if an ordinary person had encountered a ferocious beast and had even forgotten to breathe.","Seeing Chu Yunfan kill the Sea Saint so easily, many people felt as if they had seen a ghost. They were both Supreme Youths, but how could there be such a huge difference in combat strength?","Chu Yunfan’s two hands were able to suppress the two Supreme Youths, and then he killed the Sea Saint with a backhand attack.","This kind of strength clearly far surpassed these few Supreme Youths, even if these few Supreme Youths were already the best among many Supreme","Youths.","“After him, the prodigies in the world will be divided into a new class. He will be in one class, and the other Supreme Youths will be in another class!” someone exclaimed.","If this was any other time, people would find it funny. No one would agree with this point of view.","The Supreme Youths were outstanding figures among the many prodigies.","Any one of them could suppress an entire era. Even if there was a gap between them, it was impossible for them to reach another level.","That was simply a joke.","However, Chu Yunfan had used his astonishing performance to fight to another level. Just when everyone thought that some of the Supreme Youths had already caught up to him, and that it was only a matter of time before the others caught up to him, Chu Yunfan gave everyone a hard slap.","He told them that he was their daddy and would always be their daddy!","“If it’s Chu Yunfan, I’m afraid that a whole new era will be opened!”","“No, 1 don’t think so. After all, the competition among these Supreme Youths is not over yet. It’s just the beginning. The current lead doesn’t mean that it will last forever!”","Some people disagreed, but they still admitted that Chu Yunfan’s power was indeed incomparable to others.","“Not good, Chu Yunfan is attacking without any scruples. I’m afraid that the Golden Divine Hou and the Sea Dragon won’t be able to escape!” Someone immediately realized what was going to happen next, and his expression changed drastically.","“This Chu Yunfan is simply lawless. Along the way, he has killed so many Supreme Youths. He’s simply killing people like they’re ants. He’s a murderous devil!” someone said angrily, but no one agreed. They even looked at this person with disdain and contempt.","If these people could surround and kill Chu Yunfan, would they not allow Chu Yunfan to counterattack?","No one felt that there was a problem with this, but Chu Yunfan’s reckless approach made many people feel terrified.","It seemed that the rules between ordinary people had lost their effect on Chu","Yunfan.","No rules were meaningful to Chu Yunfan. No rules could restrain him.","It was nothing more than a tooth for a tooth, an eye for an eye, and blood for blood. It was that simple.","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan looked at the Sea Dragon and the Golden Divine Hou, who were both suppressed by a huge hand.","“Submit to me and I will spare your lives. Otherwise, die!”","Chu Yunfan looked at the two beasts and felt a little regretful.","After all, be it the Golden Divine Hou or the Sea Dragon, they were both peerless divine beasts that were hard to come by.","Those who could become Supreme Youths were already very few in number, let alone being able to cultivate 1,000 laws before other Supreme Youths. This was very difficult.","If such a person grew up, their future would be limitless. It could be said that they were the good fortune of heaven and earth. If he could not kill them, Chu Yunfan didn’t want to.","Of course, the prerequisite was that they were willing to submit to him, just like the Golden Roc.","Once these two grew up, they could become important helpers for him in the future. In the future, he might even have an emperor level fighter. This was very important for Chu Yunfan, who was currently alone.","“You want me to surrender? Impossible!”","The Golden Divine Hou kept roaring and trying to break free from Chu Yunfan’s hand. However, it could not break free from Chu Yunfan’s hand and was firmly pinned down.","“Since you don’t want to surrender, then die!”","Chu Yunfan’s expression was unusually cold. He waved his hand, and a shocking sword light swept across the sky, cutting off the head of the Golden Divine Hou.","The endless blood quickly dyed the land, and it flickered with a divine light.","Everyone was stunned. They hadn’t expected Chu Yunfan to attack without any mercy. If it were them, they would definitely pester the Golden Divine Hou and try to make it submit to them.","This might be the best opportunity to make a future emperor submit to them.","However, Chu Yunfan didn’t seem to care. He killed the Golden Divine Hou just like that. In terms of decisiveness, it shocked everyone.","On the other side, the Sea Dragon’s huge eyes flashed with a hint of humiliation and fear.","Chu Yunfan had killed the Golden Divine Hou without any pity. It was obvious that these Supreme Youths had no place in Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","When he thought of all this, he was even more shocked.","He knew that with his talent and strength, no matter which clan or power it was, they would have to treat him with courtesy and satisfy his requirements. Then, they would try to rope in an extremely rare young supreme from among the itinerant cultivators like him.","His race had been destroyed for too many years, and they did not even have a Dao Protector. It was impossible for them to form their own faction.","Who would have thought that Chu Yunfan would be so rude? With his pride, he was naturally shocked and angry.","Chu Yunfan looked at the Sea Dragon and asked, “Now it’s your turn. Do you want to submit or die?”","“I am willing to submit!” The Sea Dragon admitted defeat decisively.","This was the first time in countless years that he had done this. However, it was not that he was too weak, but that Chu Yunfan was too strong. Chu Yunfan had pinned him to the ground with a backhand attack and did whatever he wanted. Chu Yunfan could beat him up as he pleased.","The Sea Dragon had never encountered such a terrifying existence before.","“Wise choice!” Chu Yunfan nodded in satisfaction.."]},{"number":2291,"title":"Chapter 2291: Domainian Slaughter","paragraphs":["Chapter 2291: Domainian Slaughter","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Chu Yunfan saw that the Sea Dragon was very tactful and nodded. Although there were some among these Supreme Youths who would rather die than submit, when it came to their lives, many people had to think carefully about whether they could be harder than Chu Yunfan’s knife.","In fact, if Chu Yunfan was willing to spend more time, he might have been able to subdue that Golden Divine Hou. However, Chu Yunfan was not too interested.","To Chu Yunfan, all of this was meaningless. He wanted to subdue the Sea Dragon and the Golden Divine Hou on a whim. It would be good if they agreed, but if they didn’t, Chu Yunfan wouldn’t lose anything.","“Release your soul restriction!” Chu Yunfan said.","The Sea Dragon struggled for a moment, but it knew that it could not break free from Chu Yunfan’s grasp. It could only obediently open its primordial spirit restriction and let Chu Yunfan brand its primordial spirit.","From then on, he was subdued by Chu Yunfan. As long as Chu Yunfan wanted to, he would die. His primordial spirit would explode and kill him.","This was a supreme beast taming technique, but Chu Yunfan rarely used it. After all, there weren’t many people that he could use. Not everyone was qualified to be chosen by Chu Yunfan.","After branding the Sea Dragon’s primordial spirit with his own, Chu Yunfan nodded and then released the suppression of the Sea Dragon.","The Sea Dragon didn’t dare to mess around. It stood there obediently and waited for Chu Yunfan’s punishment. Although it was still a little unwilling, when it saw the head of the Golden Divine Hou rolling to the side, all the unwillingness in its heart disappeared without a trace.","No matter what, it was much better than losing his head.","“The Golden Divine Hou is dead?” someone said with their mouth agape. “As far as I know, this clan is the most protective of their members. I’m afraid Chu Yunfan has caused a huge disaster this time!”","“Exactly. There aren’t many Golden Divine Hous, and each of them is an incomparably precious resource. Now, one has died here, especially one of the best among the race. He was able to cultivate 1,000 laws in the Divine Treasure Stage. His talent is unimaginable!”","“l can already imagine that this race is going to go crazy. Even for a behemoth like the Golden Divine Hou, it’s probably very rare to be able to cultivate 1,000 laws in the Divine Treasure Stage!’","Some people could not imagine how crazy the Golden Divine Hous would be,","Many humans began to worry. The demons were in the demon region not far from the humans. Usually, they would cause a commotion, not to mention that the peerless genius of the Golden Divine Hous had died at Chu Yunfan’s hands.","Apart from the Golden Divine Hou, the Green Flood Dragon that Chu Yunfan had killed, skinned, and eaten was also a well-known member of the demon royalty.","Now, the clansmen they had placed their hopes on had all died in Chu Yunfan’s hands. If they did not take any action, it would be impossible.","Even they couldn’t believe it.","Once these two races started to take revenge, how many shocking resources could they mobilize to take revenge on the human race?","By then, the border would be plunged into misery again. Countless creatures and soldiers would die under the claws of the demons.","All of this was brought about by Chu Yunfan, but they could not hold him accountable. Chu Yunfan was not under their control. Moreover, Chu Yunfan had easily defeated the foreign experts in a fair and square battle, His reputation would probably reach an astonishing level.","It was not something that they could suppress. When they thought of this terrifying future, many people felt their legs hurt.","“Not only the Golden Divine Hou, but that Sea Dragon is also a source of trouble. Although the Sea Dragons were destroyed countless years ago, I heard that there were a few supreme figures among the sea beasts. These supreme figures joined forces to form the Sea Beast Alliance. This alliance only recruits talented sea beasts to become their members. There is no doubt that this Sea Dragon is one of them, but now it has been subdued by Chu Yunfan as a slave. This is a greater humiliation than killing him!” someone said an even more terrifying fact.","Those sea beasts that seemed to be a plate of loose sand were actually not a plate of loose sand at all. There was a huge monster behind them. It was just that this huge monster would not usually appear, so it was not known to everyone.","“He’s in big trouble. The demons and the Sea Beast Alliance won’t let him off easily!” someone said worriedly.","“What’s there to worry about? We’ll deal with whatever comes our way. Should we have just allowed them to surround and kill Chu Yunfan?” some humans said unhappily.","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan did not care about what others thought of him. To him, taming the Sea Dragon was more like hiding from a helper.","Moreover, the Sea Dragon was different from the Golden Divine Hou. The","Golden Divine Hou had its own powerful race, and there were many of them.","One or two casualties were not enough to exterminate the Golden Divine Hous.","However, the Sea Dragon was different. There might only be one Sea Dragon in the entire world. Once it went extinct, it would be difficult to find another.","Since the Sea Dragon was willing to surrender, Chu Yunfan would not make things difficult for him.","Suddenly, at this moment, when everyone was immersed in Chu Yunfan’s immeasurable terrifying strength...","A terrifying aura came from all directions. In an instant, it swept in front of Chu Yunfan and locked him firmly.","“It’s a Domainian!” someone exclaimed. He could clearly sense the aura of a Domainian.","This was especially so when this Domainian covered the entire area with their domain. It made many people feel as if their perception of the world had been stripped away.","It was as if someone had taken away their right to use the laws of heaven and earth.","Only Domainians could do this because they had comprehended then laws.","It could be said that the power of laws was used by experts of the Divine Treasure Stage to absorb the power of heaven and earth for cultivation and battle.","However, Domainians were completely different. Turning a world into one’s own world was equivalent to writing a new code, allowing one’s authority to cover the authority of the laws of the world. In an instant, one would gain control over the entire world.","One was borrowed, while the other was originally there. There was no doubt about the difference between them.."]},{"number":2292,"title":"Chapter 2292: Chu Yunfan! Come and Die!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2292: Chu Yunfan! Come and Die!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","In a few breaths, a figure arrived on the battlefield. An incomparably terrifying aura soared into the sky. A figure seemed to reach the nine heavens and touch the underworld. He stood tall between heaven and earth.","It was a middle-aged man. His energy and blood surged as if he wanted to tear the world apart.","This was a terrifying existence who had suppressed the entire scene with his own strength.","The Domain Stage!","This was a terrifying level. Even the leaders of the ten great sects were only at this level. They were already invincible in the world.","Even though there was a huge difference in strength between the Divine Treasure Stage and Domain Stage, after stepping into this level, one could be considered to have stepped into the peak of the world.","Other than the 10 great sects, the key criteria to distinguish a first-rate sect from a second-rate sect was whether they had a Domainian.","Only a faction with a Domainian could be considered a first-rate faction. The more Domainians there were, the stronger the faction would be.","As for factions without Domainians, no matter how prosperous they vvere, they could only be considered second-rate.","This was a huge watershed.","One could imagine how important Domainians were in this world. Even in the ancient battlefield where experts were as common as clouds, they were still able to rule over everything.","The entire world trembled as the middle-aged man stood there. His entire body was emitting a faint light of laws.","In the beginning, many experts who came to watch the battle could still resist, but later on, they could not help but retreat. The aura released from this middle-aged man’s body became stronger and stronger, and the killing intent swept out like a tidal wave.","It was bone-chilling and filled with boundless killing intent. It even made them tremble slightly!","They could not believe it. They were all Divine Treasures, but they were forced back by the middle-aged man’s aura from such a distance.","Even some of the top geniuses among them had ugly expressions at this","moment.","Even though they would definitely be more powerful than the middle-aged man once they broke through.","However, no breakthrough was no breakthrough. There was no comparison at all.","The further one cultivated, the greater the gap. One step at a time, one would reach the heavens. This was not a joke, but a fact.","However, everyone realized that this person had come personally to deal with","Chu Yunfan.","“Those Supreme Youths from before weren’t the true trump cards. Looks like the true trump card is this Domainian!”","“It’s too late. Chu Yunfan might have been able to escape earlier, but now, he has no chance of escaping at all!”","“This is too ruthless. I even suspect that the person behind the scenes is using those Supreme Youths as bait. It would have been good if they could kill Chu Yunfan, but if they couldn’t, they could stall Chu Yunfan and wait for that person to arrive!”","Someone seemed to have thought of something. His words made everyone shudder. If that was really the case, then the person behind the scenes’ scheme was simply terrifying.","It could be said that they were linked together, leaving no chance for Chu Yunfan to escape.","First, it was a top-notch prodigy who probed, then it was the Supreme Youth who surrounded him. Even this failed. This was beyond everyone’s expectations. However, who knew that the person behind the scenes had a plan to deal with this? He had an even stronger backup plan.","Chu Yunfan’s black hair fluttered in the wind as he stood in the sky. His gaze was deep, and the power of disaster surged within them. His terrifying aura shook the sky.","Even when facing a Domainian, he did not give in.","The Sea Dragon beside Chu Yunfan had an ugly expression on its face. It was ready to escape at any moment, but judging from Chu Yunfan’s expression, it did not want to escape, so it could not escape either.","Even if he were to face a Domainian, he wasn’t confident that he could win. However, it was still better than being turned into ashes with a single thought from Chu Yunfan.","“l don’t know.” Chu Yunfan smiled faintly. “Guess if he’s here to kill me or if he’s planning to kill you guys as well!”","Chu Yunfan’s words made the Sea Dragon’s expression turn even more unsightly.","This was because he had thought of a terrifying possibility. Why had this Domainian suddenly appeared?","Now, other than him who had surrendered and survived, the rest of them had all died at Chu Yunfan’s hands. Therefore, it seemed that this Domainian was here to kill Chu Yunfan.","However, what if they were the ones who killed Chu Yunfan? Was this Domainian trying to ensure that nothing would go wrong, or was he planning to kill them as well?","This was not difficult to think of!","If he were in this Domainians shoes and had such a good opportunity to kill Chu Yunfan and the other Supreme Youths, he would not let go of such an opportunity.","At the thought of this, there was only one thought in his mind. They had all been fooled and successfully played by the person behind the scenes. They had become the knife in the mastermind’s hands.","What made the Sea Dragon most furious was that the person behind the scenes was likely planning to kill them as well.","Chu Yunfan’s words made everyone pause. They were smart people and thought of this possibility. After all, these top geniuses and Supreme Youths were all competitors.","Before reaching the summit, it was necessary to remove some weeds that might pose a threat to him.","It was even very possible!","It was precisely because of this that everyone was shocked by the ruthlessness of the person behind the scenes.","“I know that person. Isn’t he Sanjue?” Someone suddenly thought of something and pointed at the middle-aged man.","Everyone else also recalled that there were many experts in the ancient battlefield, but Domainians were still overlords. Even the weakest Domainian was far more powerful than a Divine Treasure.","They couldn’t help but notice.","Among these people, Sanjue was a famous itinerant cultivator. He didn’t participate in all kinds of battles normally, just like other itinerant cultivators.","After all, no matter how strong itinerant cultivators were, they could not be compared to those famous sects.","Now, they realized that Sanjue’s neutrality was probably not true. He might belong to a certain force behind him. It was just that he usually did not show his strength, so no one knew about it.","At this moment, Sanjue seemed to have realized that everyone was starting to doubt his position. Being a neutral itinerant cultivator was his protective cover, helping to cast off doubt from him countless times.","Seeing that Chu Yunfan was about to grab him, Sanjue’s expression turned cold.. He looked at Chu Yunfan and said coldly, “Chu Yunfan! Come and die!”"]},{"number":2293,"title":"Chapter 2293: The Expert Who Defied Common Sense","paragraphs":["Chapter 2293: The Expert Who Defied Common Sense","Translator: Endlessæantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Seeing that someone had already guessed the purpose of the person behind this, Sanjue started to get anxious.","He stopped Chu Yunfan from continuing.","Sanjue’s eyes shot out two beams of demonic light that pierced through Chu","Yunfan.","However, when the two demonic lights landed on Chu Yunfan, they disappeared into his body without a trace.","In the next moment, Sanjue launched an attack. A terrifying aura swept toward Chu Yunfan like a flood.","The terrifying strength of a Domainian instantly crushed down. Immediately after, a shocking sword light slashed down at Chu Yunfan.","This was one of the unique skills of Sanjue and also one of the origins of Sanjue.","When this sword light slashed out, it was as if a shocking galaxy had descended in an instant.","Boom!","This sword tore open a huge crack in the world, shattering everything. Divine light scattered in all directions, instantly blocking everyone’s vision.","Everyone was shaken by this shocking sword light and sent flying.","They felt as if this sword could destroy the world. Such strength was simply invincible.","Ordinary Divine Treasure Stage cultivators had no chance of winning against such an expert. They would certainly die.","It was only in this golden era that a group of abnormal Supreme Youths appeared out of nowhere. Only then did they have the possibility of escaping from the attacks of such a top-notch Domainian.","“Is that all Domainians can do?” Before the divine light dissipated, Chu Yunfan’s cold voice came from within. “If that’s all you’ve got, I’ll be able to kill you as easily as uprooting weeds if we were on the same level!”","Suddenly, everyone saw a figure standing in the divine light. He was like the only god of war in the world. He stood straight and his entire person was like an archaic divine mountain.","In the distance, the Sea Dragon had already escaped the attack range of this shocking sword. It was scared to death. Fortunately, Sanjue’s main target was Chu Yunfan and did not target him. Otherwise, he would have been killed by this sword.","Even if he used all his trump cards, he would only be able to stay alive. However, he would still be heavily injured and rendered useless.","However, what shocked him was that Chu Yunfan was completely fine under this sword. He could actually block this amazing sword.","At this moment, he realized that Chu Yunfan had not fully displayed his strength.","It could even be said that Chu Yunfan had not even displayed one-third of his strength.","Based on the strength that Chu Yunfan had displayed, it was impossible for him to withstand this shocking sword attack.","“He didn’t die?” Sanjue saw that he couldn’t kill Chu Yunfan with his sword and was a little confused.","However, he didn’t expect that his sword could kill Chu Yunfan so easily. After all, this was a peak existence that was ten times more terrifying than ordinary Supreme Youths.","Even if he was surrounded and attacked by a few Supreme Youths, he would be fine. On the contrary, he was an existence that could kill them.","Although he was now brazenly attacking Chu Yunfan, he was all too clear about what a Supreme Youth meant. If they were at the same level, just as Chu Yunfan had said, he was afraid that he would not even be able to block a single move from Chu Yunfan.","Even an ordinary top-notch prodigy could easily kill him.","In the same level, he was not a match for those ancient monsters who had survived since the distant times.","However, it was different now. His cultivation level was higher than Chu Yunfan’s. This was his last chance to kill Chu Yunfan. If he missed this opportunity, his first reaction would be to run away when he saw Chu Yunfan in the future. Otherwise, Chu Yunfan could easily crush him with a single finger.","The difference in strength between the two sides was already so great that it was not something that ordinary people could reverse.","At the thought of this, a cold expression flashed through his eyes. Before Chu Yunfan’s figure could appear, countless sword lights swept down.","Even for the top Supreme Youths, it was very difficult for them to launch such an attack when they were in the Divine Treasure Stage. They would need to expend all their strength to succeed.","But now, Sanjue could use it anytime and anywhere. One could imagine how big the gap between him and those Supreme Youths was.","Opposite him, Chu Yunfan did not dodge these attacks. On the contrary, it was as if his fighting spirit had been aroused. His strength surged crazily, like a pillar of energy that shot across the sky, emitting an invincible aura.","“Eight Astonishing Punches! ”","Chu Yunfan threw a punch that transformed into eight heavenly dragons. They rushed forward to meet the countless sword lights.","Rumble!","A terrifying collision erupted in the air, and astonishing divine light turned into a rain of light that scattered in all directions.","For a moment, everyone was blind. Although they had all opened their heavenly eyes, the attacks were too violent. The light from the various collisions was too terrifying, and it covered everything in an instant.","Everyone could only close their eyes and use their divine will to capture the movements of both parties.","They could clearly see that Chu Yunfan’s entire body was extremely powerful. Even if he used his body to resist these sword lights, he was not at a disadvantage at all.","“What kind of physical cultivation is that? Is he a physique cultivator?” someone said in shock.","The physique that Chu Yunfan had displayed was too shocking. The middle of his body was emitting golden light. On the left was a ball of fire, and on the right was a ball of lightning. His eyes burst with waves of disaster power. It was obvious that Chu Yunfan had used all means to resist these sword lights.","Although Chu Yunfan didn’t have an advantage in comparison, and even had a","slight disadvantage, he relied on his own body to withstand these attacks.","On the other hand, he was only in the Divine Treasure Stage. Opposite him was a Domainian. Sanjue was truly invincible and one of the top experts who ruled the world.","It was impossible for a Divine Treasure to challenge these top-notch Domainians. This was a legend that had been passed down since ancient times.","The reason why Domainians could become peerless experts was because of the huge difference in combat strength.","Even a Supreme Youth who had cultivated 1,000 laws would at most have some ability to protect themself. They could easily escape from a Domainian.","However, those were just ordinary Domainians. They weren’t considered","powerful. Even Supreme Youths would find it hard to escape from a truly powerful Domainian.","However, Chu Yunfan had completely broken all common sense!"]},{"number":2294,"title":"Chapter 2294: The Sanjue Domain","paragraphs":["Chapter 2294: The Sanjue Domain","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","To be able to cultivate to the Domain Stage or even stronger with a physique in the Divine Treasure Stage, how shocking was this?","It was almost impossible!","This was because on the path of cultivation, every step was a huge chasm. It was almost impossible to cross it.","However, Chu Yunfan had done it. This in itself was an incredible thing.","Although he didn’t know how Chu Yunfan did it, there was no doubt that this was an extraordinary existence.","On the other side, Sanjue became more and more shocked as he fought. He did not expect Chu Yunfan to be so powerful.","With his strength, he actually couldn’t take Chu Yunfan down!","No wonder Gongsun Hong would think of ways to get rid of Chu Yunfan, and the Destiny Sect behind him would also want to get rid of Chu Yunfan.","If it were him, he would also choose to eliminate Chu Yunfan. Once this person grew up, he would definitely be a threat to the Destiny Sect. He would completely surpass ordinary Supreme Youths.","A Supreme Youth was already the top genius that the Destiny Sect could produce. Even such a genius couldn’t withstand a single blow from Chu Yunfan. Once Chu Yunfan fully matured, he would be invincible among his peers. Who could contend against such an existence?","It would be fine if it was in normal times, because there would be experts appearing in almost every era. Even the Destiny Sect couldn’t occupy the top spot every time. There would always be geniuses who could suppress the others.","Endure it for a while and it would pass. The Destiny Sect had been passed down for countless years and had seen countless geniuses. They had seen the sect build tall buildings, feast guests, and collapse buildings.","Such things were not uncommon in the Destiny Sect.","However, in this great era, it was even related to the birth of the Emperors and the only chance to become a god. In thousands of years, there would not be a second chance.","Therefore, they would never give in.","Such a person must not be allowed to grow. He must not be allowed to break through to Domain Stage!","Otherwise, it would only be a threat to the Destiny Sect and to him.","Chu Yunfan was already this terrifying. If he cultivated to Domain Stage, he could probably crush him with a finger.","Thinking of this, Sanjue’s eyes flashed with a fierce light.","Countless demonic lights swept out and pierced through Chu Yunfan, but only the sound of clashing sparks could be heard. It was as if thousands of arrows had landed on Chu Yunfan’s body.","Boom!","In an instant, Sanjue rushed in front of Chu Yunfan, and a terrifying domain suddenly spread out around Chu Yunfan.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan seemed to have fallen into a swamp. Even his ordinary movements seemed to have slowed down all of a sudden. He felt the interference of some terrifying power.","It was as if he was in a swamp, and even breathing was difficult.","‘A Domain!’ Chu Yunfan immediately had this thought in his mind.","This was the characteristic of a domain, and he had already fallen into Sanjue’s domain.","In other people’s domains, life and death were in the hands of others. There was no room for choice.","Chu Yunfan looked around. This place was still in the ancient battlefield, but it was in Sanjue’s domain.","This was his little world!","The entire domain was neatly divided into three parts. On the leftmost side was endless sword light, and in the middle was a mass of pitch-black demonic energy. This demonic energy actually turned into terrifying demons that rushed over.","On the rightmost side of the domain was a ball of flames. These flames turned into Fire Lotuses of Annihilation that burned through the entire world.","This was the Three Absolutes Domain formed by the three divine powers of Sanjue.","In this Sanjue Domain, there were no extra laws. They were all sword path laws, demonic path laws, and fire laws. These three laws constituted the Sanjue Domain.","Chu Yunfan was now trapped in the Sanjue Domain and could not move.","“Chu Yunfan, you didn’t choose to escape. That is the biggest mistake of your life!” said Sanjue as he looked down at Chu Yunfan.","In this Sanjue Domain, he was the god who created the world. The rules of the entire domain were set by him. Here, he was an absolutely invincible existence.","Only laws could resist laws.","The only thing that could resist a domain was a domain.","If his opponent was a Domainian, he might still need to be careful. However, since Chu Yunfan was only in the Divine Treasure Stage and had fallen into his domain, everything was on the right track. No matter how much Chu Yunfan struggled, it was meaningless to him.","In a domain, the owner of the domain was an absolutely invincible existence with the authority to create the world.","“So this is your domain, a real active, flowing domain!”","Chu Yunfan could feel that the surrounding laws of the Sanjue Domain were faintly rejecting him. He could even feel that the entire world had deep malice toward him.","In the Origin World, this kind of person was usually the so-called child of misfortune. He was born with misfortune and bad luck. No matter what he did, he would fail, and his life would not be smooth at all.","In fact, they would often die early because such people were hated by heaven and earth and rejected by the rules. No matter what they did, they would definitely be punished with the worst results.","They had no ability to survive at all.","In contrast, it was naturally the so-called hot shots. No matter what these hot shots did, they would get twice the result with half the effort and easily obtain places that others could not obtain in their lifetime.","Among them, the best ones were even more amazing. They could find a very rare divine material to sit on when they went out. They could trip over a spirit stone when they walked, and they could have an amazing inheritance waiting for them when they fell off a cliff.","This kind of person would be accompanied by good luck wherever they went. All bad luck would automatically be resolved, and they could achieve extremely high achievements without doing anything.","As for these top-notch prodigies and Supreme Youths, in a sense, they were hot shots. The starting point of their birth was already a height that ordinary people could not reach in hundreds of lifetimes.","Casually cultivating could surpass those old monsters who had cultivated for many years. To them, cultivation was as simple as eating and drinking.","Everyone was the darling of an era, able to suppress an era, invincible!"]},{"number":2295,"title":"Chapter 2295: The Terror of Two Thousand Laws","paragraphs":["Chapter 2295: The Terror of Two Thousand Laws","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Basically, they could be said to be the main characters of each era.","It was just that they had chosen to seal themselves in this era. Under the contrast of the protagonists of various eras, they did not seem that outstanding.","If it was in their own era, they would definitely be the focus of countless people’s attention.","Each of them was a person with great luck.","Chu Yunfan could feel the rejection of the Sanjue Domain. If it could, the","Sanjue Domain would devour him.","“You will die today!’","Sanjue looked at Chu Yunfan coldly, his eyes flashing with a terrifying light.","He was already fantasizing about how much benefits he could get from the Destiny Sect after killing Chu Yunfan.","After all, it would be too much if the Destiny Sect didn’t give a reasonable reward for such a big matter.","He saw the laws of the Sanjue Domains continuously invade Chu Yunfan’s body, almost swallowing him up.","Sanjue’s face revealed a cold smile.","“That’s the power of a domain. The power we dream of!”","In the distance, many experts revealed greedy expressions. This was the power they dreamed of.","Even though Divine Treasures were considered experts, there was still a huge difference when compared to the Domain Stage. Only those who had stepped into Domain Stage could truly be considered the rulers of the world.","Any Domainian who had just entered Domain Stage, even in Grand Xia, would be treated with respect. The 10 great sects would open their doors for them.","Even if he was originally an itinerant cultivator, he could easily enter these sects that were originally not open to him.","An expert like this would obtain the status he deserved wherever he went. He was like heaven and earth compared to Divine Treasures.","Suddenly, Chu Yunfan’s body burst out with thousands of rays of light. Rays of light that belonged to the laws swept out, contending with the Sanjue Domain. A huge hole was blasted open in the Sanjue Domain by the light of the laws on Chu Yunfan’s body.","The Sanjue Domain was about to collapse. The people in the distance were shocked and amazed by Chu Yunfan’s amazing means. He could actually blast a hole in a domain.","“He wants to escape?” Someone suddenly reacted.","Just when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan was going to take advantage of this opportunity to escape, they saw that Chu Yunfan did not move. He did not have the slightest intention of escaping.","Sanjue repaired his domain. He was shocked. Fortunately, Chu Yunfan didn’t take advantage of the chaos to escape. Otherwise, it wouldn’t be so easy to envelop Chu Yunfan again.","After all, everyone understood the principle of learning from one’s mistakes. No one would suffer twice in a row.","“The Divine Treasure Stage is only the Divine Treasure Stage after all. No matter how special this Chu Yunfan is, he’s only at the Divine Treasure Stage!’","The hearts of many experts in the distance trembled. Chu Yunfan’s performance made them unable to help but mutter.","Although many of them wished for Chu Yunfan to die, they were all in the Divine Treasure Stage. They also wanted to see if a miracle would happen.","However, it seemed like a miracle was still a miracle. How could it be something that could be seen normally?","If someone in the Divine Treasure Stage could fight against a Domainian or even defeat one, the world would be in an uproar.","Although there were many Domainians, there were even more Divine Treasures, ten times more than them.","In everyone’s eyes, Chu Yunfan, who had not reacted in time to escape, stood still. His body flickered with the light of laws. Countless laws tore apart the Sanjue Domain like sharp swords, trying to resist the Sanjue Domain.","Similar to the Sanjue Domain, the laws on Chu Yunfan’s body were also divided into three parts. The golden laws were Chu Yunfan’s original laws— the law extended from the Imperial Physique, the thunder law extended from the Thunderclap Physique, and the fire law extended from the Immemorial Dark Phoenix bloodline.","With these three kinds of laws as the main ones, the other sword path laws, punch laws, and many other laws dazzled everyone.","This was the first time many people knew that Chu Yunfan had cultivated so many laws at the same time.","Any one of these laws could form a domain when cultivated to the extreme, let alone so many laws.","Moreover, judging from Chu Yunfan’s appearance, he did not cultivate casually. He actually condensed a large number of laws in each field. This meant that Chu Yunfan had a considerable degree of understanding and research in these fields, which was why he could do it.","This made many people in the ancient battlefield feel ashamed of their inferiority. This was because the laws that they had studied with all their might were only on par with the laws that Chu Yunfan had casually displayed.","“You actually cultivated 2,000 laws. No wonder the few of them aren’t your match at all!”","Sanjue looked at the law light that burst out from Chu Yunfan’s body, and his eyes were filled with madness.","Chu Yunfan’s body had too much law light.","The first one...The hundredth...The 500th...The 1000th, and even the 2000th law light appeared on Chu Yunfan’s body.","It was the limit for an ordinary Supreme Youth to be able to cultivate 500 laws. With the help of the domain of the ancient cultivators who had comprehended the ancient battlefield, breaking through to 1,000 laws was already shocking.","Chu Yunfan had actually broken through this limit and cultivated 2,000 laws.","He was simply a monster!","No wonder those Supreme Youths were not his match. How could 1,000 laws be compared to 2,000 laws? It was simply the difference between heaven and earth.","One had to know that he had only cultivated 2,000 laws after attaining the Domain Stage for quite some time.","Chu Yunfan, who had yet to enter Domain Stage, had cultivated the same laws as him. Was there anything crazier than this?","Everyone present also went crazy. This was 2,000 laws!","No one knew how he cultivated it, but they finally understood why those Supreme Youths were so vulnerable when facing Chu Yunfan.","An existence that was not on the same level at all was completely different!","Many people jumped up as if they had seen a ghost.","The Sea Dragon in the distance had an extremely crazy expression. He finally knew why he had been defeated so miserably and had no strength to retaliate.","Chu Yunfan pinned him to the ground with one hand and easily beat him up. He had no strength to fight back.","“There’s too many. It’s not easy for me to cultivate three laws at the same time and become famous because of it. You cultivate so many laws at the same time, and you want to construct a domain? What a joke!” said Sanjue after coming back to his senses.."]},{"number":2296,"title":"Chapter 2296: He’s a Monster!","paragraphs":["Chapter 2296: He’s a Monster!","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","He did not believe that Chu Yunfan could construct a domain. Even the Sanjue Domain he cultivated was cultivated by a combination of factors.","It could be said that he was lucky to be able to cultivate successfully. This was the disadvantage of being an itinerant cultivator. Before he cultivated to this stage, no one told him that there was a problem with this kind of cultivation.","The difference between an itinerant cultivator and an expert with an inheritance was like the difference between heaven and earth. It might not be obvious normally, but in some key areas, it was obvious whether there was an inheritance or not.","The more types of laws one cultivated, the more difficult it would be to construct a domain. This was because there would be more law equilibrium involved. It was already very difficult for a person to cultivate three laws at the same time.","Ever since he cultivated to the Domain Stage, it was very difficult for him to improve further.","This was the reason why he had only cultivated 2,000 laws despite being famous for so many years. Although 2,000 laws could be said to be shocking and invincible in the Divine Treasure Stage, it was still not enough.","However, to a Domainian, 2,000 laws were just the beginning. After all, the threshold to enter the Domain Stage was 1,000 laws.","2,000 laws was not a lot for a Domainian.","Chu Yunfan had ten times more laws than him, yet he still wanted to enter the Domain Stage?","It was simply whimsical and impossible.","When many prodigies saw this scene, they were greatly surprised. They had only cultivated one law, but they already felt that it was somewhat strenuous to cultivate until now.","After all, they might have cultivated a variety of laws before, but after cultivating the laws, they would often choose to cultivate one of them in order to cultivate to a higher level in the shortest amount of time.","After all, everyone knew how difficult cultivation was. One could not bite off more than they could chew. One would only die of old age and not be able to reach a higher level.","Even peerless geniuses like them were no exception.","Chu Yunfan had cultivated so many laws at the same time, which was equivalent to destroying his future. Although once he succeeded in cultivating, his strength would definitely be more powerful than those who cultivated a single law. If he could not even breakthrough, it would be meaningless.","In an instant, Chu Yunfan had gone from being a great enemy to being insignificant.","Although Chu Yunfan seemed to be their mortal enemy, once they reached the Domain Stage, they would be able to quickly widen the gap between themselves and Chu Yunfan. At that time, this powerful enemy would become insignificant.","Although the Divine Treasure Stage was important, it was only a small level before reaching the top.","“You can do it!” Chu Yunfan sneered at Sanjue’s disdain. “Just because you can’t do it doesn’t mean I can’t do it! You’re just a frog at the bottom of a well. You think that the sky you see is the entire world!”","The laws on Chu Yunfan’s body kept shining with shocking light, resisting Sanjue’s domain around him.","“Looking at the sky from the bottom of a well?” Sanjue’s pupils contracted slightly. In an instant, he attacked. His killing intent surged, and cracks appeared in the sky. He rushed toward Chu Yunfan.","Chu Yunfan didn’t give in. Although it was difficult for him to move in the domain, he didn’t hold back. Lightning wings spread out from his back, and his movements instantly rose to a higher level.","In an instant, he caught up with Sanjue. He clenched his fist and turned into a terrifying torrent that rushed toward Sanjue.","Boom!","The entire sky was exploding. Everyone could see that all kinds of attacks landed on each other, almost tearing each other apart. However, when they landed on each other in the end, only sparks flew in all directions.","The two of them passed by each other. Sanjue was unharmed, and there was not even the slightest change. Chu Yunfan only took a few steps back and stabilized himself.","Everyone’s faces paled as they marveled at the Domainian’s methods. He was like a god in the world, invincible and divine.","At the same time, they were also amazed by Chu Yunfan’s strength. He was actually able to fight against a Domainian. Even though he was at a disadvantage, this was very shocking for a Divine Treasure.","“He must be a monster to be able to do this in the Divine Treasure Stage. I’m afraid that even an ordinary Domainian with only 1,000 laws who has just entered the Domain Stage might not be able to do anything to him in the end. They might even be on par!” someone said in shock.","An even more terrifying scene appeared in his mind. Chu Yunfan could truly fight against an ordinary Domainian.","Even though Chu Yunfan was at a disadvantage now, there were no signs of defeat.","“If he can construct a domain and break through to the Domain Stage, how powerful would he be? Even Sanjue might not be his match!” someone said with his mouth agape.","“That’s right, but it’s a pity that he won’t be able to break through again in this lifetime unless he cuts off his cultivation and cultivates all over again. However, in that case, he’ll be too far away from us. Moreover, if he doesn’t cultivate so many laws at the same time, he’ll be mediocre and won’t be able to compete with us!” Someone nodded as if he had seen through the essence.","If Chu Yunfan cut his cultivation and gave up so many laws to cultivate only one, he would seem to have improved rapidly, but in fact, he would be no different from them. He would only be an ordinary Supreme Youth.","Unknowingly, everyone’s thoughts had undergone a world-shaking change. Anyone who was evaluated as a Supreme Youth could be said to be the supreme evaluation.","From ancient times until now, there were not many people who could become","Supreme Youths. The real phoenix feathers and qilin horns were rare, but Chu Yunfan could only be evaluated as passable. It was a waste of his talent.","One could imagine how much shock and pressure Chu Yunfan had brought to them. Even the Supreme Youths had become nothing under Chu Yunfan’s contrast.","While everyone was discussing, the battle between Chu Yunfan and Sanjue had just begun. The two sides started a shocking battle in Sanjue’s domain.","In an instant, the two sides had exchanged dozens of blows, hundreds of times, and many collisions could even break Sanjue!s domain.","In the Sanjue domain, Sanjue’s strength soared, and he could casually display astonishing combat strength. Compared to Chu Yunfan, there was clearly a certain gap, but he had never avoided a collision.","Suddenly, someone exclaimed, attracting everyone’s attention.."]},{"number":2297,"title":"Chapter 2297: Breakthrough to the Domain Stage","paragraphs":["Chapter 2297: Breakthrough to the Domain Stage","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","“Chu Yunfan’s laws have changed!” someone exclaimed, and everyone turned their eyes over.","When their eyes fell on Chu Yunfan, they immediately realized that something was wrong. Although Chu Yunfan was still at a disadvantage and was sent flying every time they collided, the light of the laws on his body did not dim because of this. On the contrary, the light of the laws on his body was constantly emitting dazzling light.","Slowly, they began to form some organizations. They were not like the beginning, where they were almost a plate of loose sand.","Everyone here was the cream of the crop in their generation, so they naturally understood what this meant.","In fact, this meant that Chu Yunfan was constructing his domain.","The so-called domain structure was to construct a domain from the originally irregular and chaotic laws with a certain pattern.","All the laws in this domain were constructed by him, so he could easily unleash the full power of these laws.","They were far superior to experts without domains.","Thus, a domain was not something that could be comprehended, but something that could be constructed.","Everyone knew this, and Chu Yunfan was constructing the laws.","Everyone was dumbfounded. They didn’t expect Chu Yunfan to construct laws in such an intense battle.","This was no longer a question of whether it was difficult or not. This was basically multitasking. If he was not careful, he might be killed by Sanjue.","Even though Sanjue looked like he couldn’t do anything to Chu Yunfan, if he really attacked, Sanjue’s strength was enough to pose a fatal threat to Chu","Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan’s methods were extraordinary. In this situation, he could maintain a situation where he was at a disadvantage but was not defeated.","If it were them, they wouldn’t dare to be distracted at all. A single distraction might cause them to die immediately.","However, Chu Yunfan managed to do it. He was able to construct a domain while being distracted.","Although it was only a prototype, it was already an unimaginable miracle for them.","“Oh my god, he’s betting that he can construct a domain!” someone exclaimed. “I’ve seen many Domainians in my life. I’ve even seen a Domainian advance with my own eyes. However, I’ve never seen someone advance in such an intense battle!” a top genius said with his mouth agape.","Breaking through in battle sounded simple, but it was actually an extremely dangerous action. Because this was multitasking, one could be killed if not careful.","Therefore, even these top-notch geniuses had not tried such crazy actions many times.","It was too dangerous. Unless it was absolutely necessary, who would make such a choice?","Looking at Chu Yunfan, it was obvious that he had no choice. Judging from Chu Yunfan’s speed after spreading the lightning wings, they were 90% sure that Chu Yunfan could escape.","After all, Sanjue might not be able to capture Chu Yunfan in a short time. As long as Chu Yunfan was willing, as long as he had the heart, he could quickly escape.","In the end, Sanjue would usually give up.","But Chu Yunfan didn’t choose to do so. It was obvious that he was using Sanjue’s domain to temper himself.","“He’s using Sanjue as a whetstone. Letting Sanjue give him enough pressure to advance is too crazy!”","When everyone guessed Chu Yunfan’s motive, they thought that he was crazy. If he was not careful, he might lose his life.","However, they didn’t know that Chu Yunfan wasn’t joking with his life. With the help of the godhead, Chu Yunfan could continue to comprehend the laws even in an intense battle. He could multitask and become stronger.","This was where his advantage lay.","Chu Yunfan’s goal was naturally to use Sanjue to put enough pressure on himself. Otherwise, it would take him a long time to break through to the Domain Stage.","Undoubtedly, Sanjue, who was in the middle of the fierce battle, had heard everyone’s words. His face suddenly turned ashen. With his cultivation and status, even itinerant cultivators would not dare to look down on him. Now, he was being used as a whetstone.","This was simply going too far.","However, Chu Yunfan’s continuous attacks calmed him dovvn very quickly.","When he paid close attention to Chu Yunfan’s condition, he became more and more shocked as he fought. This was because he realized that the light of the laws on Chu Yunfan’s body was not dimmed by his domain. Instead, it became brighter as time passed.","This meant that Chu Yunfan’s understanding of the laws did not stop for a moment. On the contrary, as time passed, his understanding continued to grow.","“Is he a monster? Is it really possible for him to combine so many laws into one domain?” Sanjue said in shock, “Impossible. There are so many laws. No one can integrate them into a domain. I don’t believe it!”","Sanjue didn’t want to believe it, but Chu Yunfan’s aggressive attitude still made his killing intent boil. No matter whether Chu Yunfan could integrate so many laws and construct a powerful domain, he couldn’t let Chu Yunfan continue to grow.","“How dare you use me as a whetstone! Die!” Sanjue roared, and the laws all over his body burst out with shocking light. The domain shook violently, and three different laws interweaved into a terrifying domain, crazily attacking Chu Yunfan.","The torrents of laws that were attacking Chu Yunfan instantly drowned him. At the same time, Sanjue attacked. A shocking sword light appeared in his hand, turning into a terrifying sword light that slashed toward Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","An earth-shattering explosion occurred where Chu Yunfan was standing. The entire world was torn apart, and a huge crack appeared. Everything was exploding as if chaos was destroying the world.","“Is he dead?”","Everyone widened their eyes, trying to confirm whether Chu Yunfan was dead or not.","However, in the next second, a terrifying aura erupted from where Chu Yunfan had been standing. This aura washed away everything, and only then did everyone see clearly that it was a tall and straight figure.","It was Chu Yunfan!","Not only did Chu Yunfan not die under this terrifying attack, but on the contrary, the laws all over his body were shining with dazzling light.","However, it was different from before. The laws around him formed a huge domain in an orderly manner.."]},{"number":2298,"title":"Chapter 2298: Crushing Sanjue","paragraphs":["Chapter 2298: Crushing Sanjue","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Under the layers of pressure, Chu Yunfan was not killed. On the contrary, he used Sanjue’s pressure to complete the structure of his domain.","“As expected, it’s better to have a little pressure!” Chu Yunfan grinned.","Feeling the power that was constantly surging out of his body, after the structure of the domain was completed, his entire person had a huge change as if he was reborn.","After advancing from the Divine Treasure Stage to the Domain Stage, everything was completely different.","Chu Yunfan understood the feeling now. No wonder Domainians did not take Divine Treasures seriously at all.","This was because the two sides were not on the same level.","After Chu Yunfan constructed his domain, he easily opened up Sanjue’s domain.","In this domain, he was the true king, a true god. If he wanted water to flow higher, he could do so. If he wanted people to fly without wings, he could do so.","To put it simply, God said, let there be light, and so there was light!","This feeling was as magical as the first time he stepped into the Divine Ability Stage. Before the Divine Ability Stage, he could only be considered a mortal. Everything had to follow a certain principle.","However, after stepping into the Divine Ability Stage, one could do all sorts of completely unscientific things, such as walking on water and walking through","The biggest difference between the Divine Ability Stage and the Domain Stage was that doing all these things in the Divine Ability Stage was actually not scientific and defied common sense.","It was done to such an extent with incredible power, but in the Domain Stage, everything was reasonable. As long as Chu Yunfan wanted to, everything was naturally reasonable.","Naturally, it was not against common sense.","All common sense was overturned here. There was only one standard for everything, and that was Chu Yunfan’s standard.","Of course, all of this had to be within the scope of his laws. It was impossible to do it if it was not within the scope of the laws he comprehended.","But even so, it was already very shocking.","With this domain, Chu Yunfan truly possessed the ability to compete with Sanjue. It was not like before, where he could only barely resist.","“What? He actually constructed a domain?”","Some people couldn’t help but gasp. Just a moment ago, everyone had judged","that Chu Yunfan couldn’t construct a domain.","With him cultivating so many laws at the same time, he did not have the foundation to construct laws.","But now, in the blink of an eye, Chu Yunfan had slapped them in the face with the truth and made them understand how wrong their previous views were.","Not only did Chu Yunfan cultivate so many laws, but he was also the first to complete a breakthrough. He once again stood out among the many Supreme Youths and successfully broke through to the Domain Stage.","Many people gasped and retreated frantically. At this moment, the alarm bells in their hearts rang. Chu Yunfan’s threat level suddenly soared to a whole new level.","If Chu Yunfan had been extremely dangerous when he was only in the Divine Treasure Stage, then now that he had broken through to the Domain Stage, he made them feel even more threatened by death.","“He actually did it. This is crazy!’","“l understand now. He dared to cultivate so many laws at the same time not because he was ignorant and fearless. On the contrary, he dared to do so because he had absolute confidence!” someone said.","Many people understood this point at this time. Chu Yunfan was not ignorant, but he was absolutely confident.","“Can such a path actually work?”","Some of the top-notch geniuses could not believe it at all. They only felt that all of this was too crazy. It was completely beyond their imagination.","“Every expert’s path is unique. No one’s path is exactly the same. Perhaps this is the unique path that Chu Yunfan has taken?” someone said.","If it was before, no one would believe such words. But at this step, even if no one believed it before, it now had the power to make people believe it.","Otherwise, it would be impossible to explain why Chu Yunfan was so powerful.","While the surrounding people were completely shocked, Sanjue was scared out of his wits. He could feel a terrifying aura bursting out of Chu Yunfan’s body, instantly tearing apart his Sanjue Domain.","That power was extremely terrifying and sharp. It completely ignored his Sanjue Domain and tore open a brand new world.","He was familiar with this power. It was the power of a domain.","However, what he did not expect was that the power of this domain erupted from Chu Yunfan’s body.","After constructing the domain, Chu Yunfan’s strength underwent a complete change.","Although Sanjue had 2,000 laws, it was completely different.","It was like the difference between two thousand disorganized mobs and two thousand orderly elites. It was like the difference between heaven and earth.","It was completely different.","The domain that Chu Yunfan released could easily tear apart the Sanjue Domain.","Originally, the Sanjue Domain could firmly suppress Chu Yunfan, making him feel as if he was in a quagmire, unable to move.","But now, in front of Chu Yunfan’s new domain, his strength was unable to pose a threat to Chu Yunfan.","Boom!","In the next moment, the Sanjue Domain cracked inch by inch and collapsed.","Chu Yunfan’s domain was emitting colorful lights, attacking the city inch by inch, easily forcing Sanjue to retreat.","There was no way to resist such a powerful force!","In just a moment, the Sanjue Domain disappeared without a trace.","On the contrary, in the next moment, Chu Yunfan’s domain had enveloped Sanjue’s head.","This time, Sanjue was in an absolute crisis. His domain was crushed inch by inch by Chu Yunfan’s domain. He had no strength to fight back and was not Chu Yunfan’s match.","In an instant, it was as if he had entered a swamp. It was almost difficult to even move.","He instantly felt what Chu Yunfan felt just now, but he didn’t have Chu Yunfan’s means. He could forcefully fight his way out of an absolute disadvantage and hold on until the day he successfully constructed his domain.","“How can it be so terrifying? I’ll fight it out!”"]},{"number":2299,"title":"Chapter 2299: Killing Sanjue","paragraphs":["Chapter 2299: Killing Sanjue","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sanjue was forced into a dead end. He suddenly erupted with his maximum strength, and the blood essence in his body trembled violently.","The domain that had been crushed was rapidly reconstructed in order to resist Chu Yunfan’s terrifying pressure.","He had been arrogant all his life, but when had he ever suffered such a huge","loss!","Even though he was only an itinerant cultivator, he was still proud of himself for being able to cultivate all the way to the Domain Stage and become one of the top experts in the world.","Originally, it was not difficult to target Chu Yunfan.","After all, no matter how miraculous Chu Yunfan was, the Divine Treasure Stage was only the Divine Treasure Stage. He had even cultivated so many laws at the same time.","Cultivating so many laws at the same time made Chu Yunfan very powerful at this level, far surpassing his peers.","Even Supreme Youths of the same level would be beaten up by him and flee like rats.","However, in reality, he had crippled the possibility of further breakthroughs.","Who would have thought that when everyone thought that Chu Yunfan had absolutely no possibility of advancing further, Chu Yunfan would break through his limit and reach the Domain Stage?","He had just broken through to the Domain Stage. Although his laws had yet to increase, his aura was at least several times stronger than before.","This was just a breakthrough. If Chu Yunfan continued to grow, the consequences would be unimaginable.","Even though they were all at the Domain Stage, they were clearly divided into different levels. Even if the laws they cultivated were similar, there would still be a huge difference in their strength.","This was one of the results that everyone had speculated previously. After those Supreme Youths, top-notch prodigies, and even ordinary prodigies had all broken through, they must be outstanding people within those of the same level.","No matter how hard they worked, it was impossible for them to compete with these prodigies who had risen and broken through.","Now, Chu Yunfan’s astonishing performance verified many people’s guesses.","These Supreme Youths were indeed capable of breaking through, but breaking through was king tier, and no one could stop them.","Even so, Sanjue still refused to admit defeat and retreat. He wanted to fight to the death. Otherwise, he had no chance of winning. Even escaping would be very difficult.","Thinking of this, Sanjue went crazy. His body released three completely different law auras, forming a powerful storm. He fell straight down and turned into a sky full of flying dragons, crashing down on Chu Yunfan.","At this point, Sanjue didn’t hold back anymore, because if he continued to hold back, he would most likely die.","If it was just now, Chu Yunfan might have been seriously injured by this sudden move.","But now, Chu Yunfan wasn’t afraid at all. He simply grabbed out with his hand.","Boom!","In an instant, this huge hand grabbed the terrifying storm into nothingness.","Everything in the world seemed to have returned to normal. There was no sign of the terrifying attack that had just happened.","Everyone looked at Chu Yunfan. That was just an ordinary energy attack, but it had such amazing power. One could imagine how amazing Chu Yunfan’s cultivation was.","“Myriad Swords Return!”","At this moment, Sanjue went all out. He took out a silver-white long sword and waved it repeatedly. Sword light swept out for hundreds of miles.","Chu Yunfan didn’t even look at it. He reached out with one hand and tore the terrifying sword light apart.","Sanjue’s attacks were completely useless against him.","“Do you still not understand? From the moment I constructed my domain, you and I were no longer on the same level. All of your attacks were so laughable to me!” Chu Yunfan said coldly, “Trash is trash. Even after breaking through to the Domain Stage, you’re still trash!","“I’ll give you a chance. If you tell me who’s behind this, I’ll let you live today. Otherwise, you won’t be able to escape death today!” Chu Yunfan said indifferently, his gaze cold.","In fact, Sanjue might have been a threat to him. He could have injured him or even killed him.","However, he had now stepped into the Domain Stage. His foundation was 2,000 laws. His foundation was as deep as Sanjue’s.","The difference between their inheritances was like heaven and earth, so Sanjue was nothing to him.","Killing or letting go did not affect the overall situation at all. It could even be said that it did not matter at all.","What he wanted to know was who was the mastermind behind Sanjue!","“You want me to betray the person behind me? Impossible! Even if I die, that’s impossible! ”","Sanjue’s eyes were wide open with anger. Blood was flowing out of the corner of his mouth. He was forced into a corner and had to use a secret technique.","In an instant, he condensed the Sanjue Domain again.","This was a divine ability that he had specially cultivated. At a critical moment, he could borrow life force to increase his combat strength.","It was just that he would not normally use this move unless he was crazy.","However, at this point, he had no other choice but to fight head-on with Chu Yunfan. After all, if he exposed the Destiny Sect, he would have to face the pursuit of the Destiny Sect for the rest of his life.","He might as well take a gamble.","“Stubborn!”","Facing Sanjue, who was about to explode, Chu Yunfan did not show any mercy at all. He just slapped down with his backhand.","Boom!","The palm slammed into the huge domain. The Sanjue Domain, which was originally extremely powerful and seemed to be the ruler of this world, cracked inch by inch in an instant.","The domain that Sanjue had spent all his energy to condense was useless against Chu Yunfan. It was simply unable to withstand a single blow.","Spurt!","The Sanjue Domain was broken, and Sanjue suffered a terrible backlash. In an instant, he retreated crazily like a kite with a broken string, flying far away.","“How could this be!”","Sanjue felt despair. Chu Yunfan’s strength had far exceeded his initial expectations. Even the other Supreme Youths who had just entered the Domain Stage could not easily beat him to this extent.","“Since you don’t want to tell me, then go to hell!” Chu Yunfan said coldly. In the next moment, he appeared above Sanjue. “Nine Netherworld Sromps!’","Chu Yunfan stomped down and crushed Sanjue into pieces.."]},{"number":2300,"title":"Chapter 2300: Another Breakthrough, 2100 Laws","paragraphs":["Chapter 2300: Another Breakthrough, 2100 Laws","Translator: EndlessFantasy Translation Editor: EndlessFantasy Translation","Sanjue was dead!","It was straightforward and without any hesitation.","Chu Yunfan, who had just broken through, defeated and even killed Sanjue with lightning speed.","Chu Yunfan displayed an astonishing cultivation base of 2,000 laws. The","difference between Chu Yunfan’s strength and Sanjue’s was like the difference between heaven and earth.","‘Unrivalled! His strength is truly invincible!’","Such a thought could not help but appear in everyone’s minds.","Chu Yunfan, who was already invincible in the Divine Treasure Stage and had suppressed all the Supreme Youths, had now taken the lead and stepped into the Domain Stage, once again leading many Supreme Youths. He even left the other Supreme Youths behind by a whole yard.","They were not in the same world at all.","“How could this be? We’re almost at the same starting point. How could he be so much stronger than us?” many top geniuses said unwillingly.","Even when facing the Supreme Youths, they had never felt despair.","They constantly broke through their limits and could even break through to the level of the original Supreme Youth.","Although those Supreme Youths were strong, they were still within the scope of what they could see. However, the strength that Chu Yunfan displayed now made them not even qualified to look up to him.","When a person was stronger than the other, the weaker would feel envious and jealous. However, when a person was much stronger, the weaker wouldn’t have such thoughts.","The ants on the ground would not be jealous of the divine dragon in the sky because they were not in the same world.","In the past, they were the ones who made others feel despair, but now, they felt the despair of the gap between them and Chu Yunfan.","“We can’t continue to waste time like this. Otherwise, we’ll only be pulled further and further away from Chu Yunfan!”","However, these top geniuses quickly regained their senses. They were not ordinary people. Each of them was a proud genius. At the same time, they had experienced hundreds of battles and their hearts were like boulders.","How could it be so easy to shake these top figures? It could even be said that it was simply impossible.","It was just that Chu Yunfan’s performance was too stunning and broke their state of mind for a moment, causing them to reveal some flaws.","Many people made up their minds. They could not continue like this. They had to break through to the Domain Stage as soon as possible so that they could keep up with Chu Yunfan’s footsteps.","Although he was still not Chu Yunfan’s match, at least they were still in the same world, so the gap between them would not be too big.","“This Chu Yunfan is really terrifying. He’s leading and surpassing us step by step. Just when we thought our cultivation had caught up to Chu Yunfan, he would always burst out with even more shocking strength!’","“That’s right. Previously, I thought that 1,000 laws were his limit. Although he’s still very stunning, he’s no longer the only one who stands out. After all, although there aren’t many people who can cultivate 1,000 laws, there are still some. He’s no longer that special, but in the blink of an eye, he’s still the most special one!” someone agreed.","“Just when I thought that cultivating 2,000 laws was his limit, he actually successfully constructed a domain, turning the impossible into the possible!” another top genius said. Even though he had not lost his confidence, he had to admit that an existence like Chu Yunfan was truly a legend.","“Every step he’s taking now is creating history. He’s walking on a path that no one has ever walked before!”","“Such a person isn’t a lunatic. If he dies while cultivating, he’ll shine brilliantly and successfully break our limits. He’ll let us know that we can still cultivate to this extent!”","While everyone was discussing, Chu Yunfan opened his eyes. In front of him, Sanjue’s corpse turned into endless blood mist and rushed into Chu Yunfan’s eyes.","It was absorbed by the Disaster Star Eyes.","Sanjue’s domain was unexpectedly preserved and didn’t dissipate with its original owner’s death.","Chu Yunfan reacted immediately. The laws of the ancient battlefield were in effect. Under the effect of the laws of the ancient battlefield, the domain that should have dissipated successfully survived.","It was probably the same reason why many ancient domains had been preserved.","Chu Yunfan immediately absorbed the materialized Sanjue Domain into his domain.","Then, everyone saw that the Sanjue Domain left behind by Sanjue was completely devoured by Chu Yunfan in just a moment.","Apart from the demonic laws, the other two laws he left behind were naturally absorbed by Chu Yunfan.","Not a single bit was left behind. Chu Yunfan began to cultivate in front of everyone. In a very short time, the Sanjue Domain left behind by Sanjue was completely absorbed by Chu Yunfan.","It merged into Chu Yunfan’s laws, and at the same time, it caused Chu Yunfan’s entire domain to undergo a huge change. From the initial 2,000 laws, it suddenly jumped to 2,100 laws.","This was very important to Chu Yunfan because it meant that he had entered a period of rapid improvement in his strength. He would not be like before when he cultivated from the Divine Treasure Stage to the Domain Stage, where he was blocked by the threshold and had to rely on Sanjue’s strength to complete the breakthrough.","These additional 100 laws were none other than the laws of the demonic path.","Under the contrast of the demonic laws, Chu Yunfan was like a natural demon god.","At this moment, the Sea Dragon looked at Chu Yunfan as if he had seen a ghost. He had never thought that Chu Yunfan could be so strong.","Not only did Chu Yunfan defeat a super senior who was much older and stronger than them, but he also killed Sanjue and absorbed his flesh and blood. The domain Sanjue left behind was also absorbed by Chu Yunfan.","Sanjue had wanted to kill Chu Yunfan, but Chu Yunfan had easily killed him instead.","No one would think that Sanjue was too weak. After all, he was a Domainian.","There could only be one reason, and that was that Chu Yunfan was too strong.","He was so strong that he could ignore the threshold that they originally thought he had.","‘What kind of master did I get?’ the Sea Dragon wondered.","However, the more this was the case, the better he felt. He no longer felt haggard over the fact that he, a dignified Supreme Youth, had been subdued by Chu Yunfan.","However, Chu Yunfan obviously didn’t care about the Sea Dragon’s thoughts. The Sea Dragon wasn’t the first Supreme Youth to follow him, and he wouldn’t be the last either. The Sea Dragon wasn’t special.."]}]);
